window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3801,"title":"Chapter 3801: Boldness","paragraphs":["Chapter 3801: Boldness","However, who knew where Tang Yan was? He couldn’t just abandon him and go back by himself, right?","Yes, that was why he had to find Tang Yan first.","With the existence of the Galaxy Network, the news that they had yet to achieve victory and suffered a head-on attack had already spread back to the Imperial Capital. Under such circumstances, if they were still commanded to continue charging towards Golden Wealth Planet, Meng Yonghua would really be an idiot.","Now, he would be a hero if he could return alive.","A second thought flashed through Ling Han’s head. Now, everyone was thinking of fleeing back to the Moonlight Planet. Then, could he do the opposite and go to Golden Wealth Planet?","That was a resource planet. Usually, it would be heavily guarded by the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, but now... he might be able to make a small fortune.","All of a sudden, Ling Han was filled with anticipation.","En, en, en. He had best find Tang Yan first.","“Contact Tang Yan and ask him where he is,” Ling Han said to the large black dog.","“F*cking gay,” the large black dog said in disdain. At the same time, he connected to Galaxy Network and contacted Tang Yan.","“What, that guy is on Golden Wealth Planet?” After Ling Han heard the large black dog’s retelling, he couldn’t help but feel surprised.","As it turned out, this guy was on the only warship that had reached Golden Wealth Planet, but very unfortunately, the moment they landed, they were attacked by the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire. Fortunately, they had three Spirit Transformation True Lords on board, who just barely blocked the attack, gaining time for Tang Yan and the others to retreat.","However, everyone was separated now, scattered and hiding in the tall mountains and dense forests, waiting for rescue.","Tang Yan even specially instructed Ling Han to stay where he was. Practically all the troops of the expedition army this time round had been wiped out, and the news had already been reported. Not only was Meng Yonghua furious, even that old Venerate Tier was furious. It was said that he might personally charge over.","If the Venerate Tier at the fourth pinnacle level charged over, all the elites of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire that were present would be a piece of cake.","Because the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire didn’t have a Venerate Tier elite on standby, and the reason they dared to launch an invasion was because the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire’s old Venerate Tier was severely wounded, and thought that his battle prowess had already fallen from the Venerate Tier.","That’s right. This old Venerate Tier elite was indeed severely injured, and indeed did not want to make a move, but the Shadow Moon Empire Majestic Empire had gone too far this time. Not only had they occupied Golden Wealth Planet, they had also practically wiped out the entire expeditionary army. If the old Venerate Tier elite still did not make a resolute move to redeem the situation, then the empire of the Meng Clan would really be done for.","-There were too few elites at the level of Sect Master in the Meng Clan. There was only Meng Yonghua. Once the old Venerate Tier elite was gone, the Meng Clan would be worth nothing. Thus, the Venerate Tier elite from the Meng Clan definitely had to act this time. He had to let everyone know that he still existed in the Meng Clan, and that no one would be able to bully them!","Ling Han decided to go to Golden Wealth Planet. If he went to fish in troubled waters now, he should be able to gain a lot.","The problem was, how were they supposed to get there?","If they flew on a Tool, with so many people from the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire here, the moment they left, they would expose themselves. In this boundless galaxy, how could a Cauldron Forging Tier possibly outrun a warship?","He had it.","Ling Han looked at the warship at the foot of the mountain. Once he boarded it, wouldn’t he be able to hitchhike?","He grabbed the large black dog and the perverted pig. Under the cover of the Void Beast hide, he approached the warship.","When he arrived at the warship, he leaped onto the ship.","Xiu, a figure suddenly leaped out of the ship’s hold, and stood on the deck, a puzzled expression on his face, because he sensed that someone had leaped onto the deck, and the main troops had already been sent out. Those that could board at this time... must be people from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire.","However, there was actually no one on the deck, which naturally made him feel that it was strange.","Could it be that it was a misconception?","Ling Han gritted his teeth internally. This person was very strong, and he couldn’t see through the depths of his cultivation level at all. He reckoned that he was a True Self Tier elite, because if it was any higher, a Spirit Transformation True Lord would be able to see through the disguise of the Void Beast hide with a single glance.","The True Self Tier elite was truly powerful. With a single leap, he had actually alerted the other man.","“Lord Sun, what have you discovered?” Another thirteen elites walked out. This time, Ling Han could see clearly. They were all in the cultivation level of the Core Formation Tier.","The True Self Tier elite pondered for a moment before waving his hand and saying, “It’s fine.”","After saying this, he turned around and entered the ship’s hold. The 13 Core Formation Tier cultivators hurriedly followed him in.","Ling Han waited patiently, and only when a team returned did he follow behind these people and sneak into the ship’s hold.","With so many people, even the True Self Tier elite wouldn’t be able to sense anything strange.","About a day passed, and all the teams that had been sent out had returned. In the meantime, those Core Formation Tier cultivators had also left one after another. The search team should have encountered troublesome enemies, and needed these Core Formation Tier cultivators to","move out.","Because the moon was only so big, and most importantly, there was no place to hide. In just a day, the search team had completed their mission. The warship slowly set sail, flying towards Golden Wealth Planet.","Very soon, the warship landed, and everyone disembarked, one after another.","Ling Han waited for a very long time before moving. He was very careful. Who knew if there were elites standing guard outside? He didn’t even dare to release his divine sense.","Of course, if he really encountered a powerful enemy, worse come to worst, he could just summon the Heavenly Dao Flames. This was something that could burn even Venerate Tier","elites to death.","However, as the saying goes, the enemy of an enemy is a friend. Unless absolutely necessary, he did not want to make a move on the people of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire.","He disembarked from the warship, and observed carefully. He saw that this was a very large base, with tents erected everywhere.","If Ling Han were a loyal subject of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, he would definitely try to find the main tent and find an opportunity to investigate the military intelligence. Unfortunately, he wasn’t. Moreover, even if he ran over, what if he encountered a Spirit Transformation True Lord, or even a great Sect Master elite?","The hide of the Void Beast wasn’t safe at all.","Thus, Ling Han’s only thought was to run away and roam around the mines to earn some extra money. There were some precious metals that the Meng Clan couldn’t possibly sell, and they","couldn’t be bought even with money.","Yi?","After walking for a while, he discovered that there was a large expanse of empty land on his left side, and there were tents all around him.","Was this a training ground?","Ling Han grumbled internally, but immediately discovered that something was off, because","he discovered that the heaven and earth of this place had actually changed. Furthermore, it","was not just by a little bit, but was astonishingly huge.","This was a formation?","Ling Han activated his eye technique, and when he looked over again, he discovered even","more things.","Underneath this empty land, there were multiple black iron stakes buried, and in the centre,","there was a spear.","“Ah!” Ling Han humphed lightly, tears of blood already streaming from his eyes.","“Little Han!” The large black dog was shocked. They were clearly still wrapped in the Void Beast hide, and there was no sign that they had been exposed. Why had Ling Han’s eyes suddenly bled? Which supreme elite had made this move? But when a supreme elite made a move, would Ling Han only shed tears of blood?","“It’s fine.” Ling Han shook his head, but his heart throbbed greatly. That was because that spear was too terrifying. Merely a single look was enough to make his eyes bleed.","What level of precious tool was this?","More importantly, it was still inside the formation... was the formation used to suppress its","viciousness, or was it strengthening it?","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head, and he suddenly recalled the old Venerate Tier elite","from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire.","Hiss!"]},{"number":3802,"title":"Chapter 3802: Killing Trap?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3802: Killing Trap?","The Shadow Moon Majestic Empire dared to launch a large-scale invasion, so they definitely wouldn’t have failed to realize that the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire still had an old","Venerate Tier elite. Thus, could this spear be used to target that old Venerate Tier?","Ling Han thought about the whole matter, and suddenly had a feeling that this was a trap set up against the old Venerate Tier from the Meng Clan.","Under normal circumstances, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire wouldn’t be able to provoke the Venerate Tier elite into action, and if they directly charged toward the Moonlight Planet, that was the Meng Clan’s home ground.","But now, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire could easily set up arrangements on Golden Wealth Planet. On the other hand, the old Venerate from the Meng Clan had become an away","team.","Ling Han didn’t know what level of weapon that spear was. He only guessed that it might be able to kill Venerate Tier elites.","And there was also this formation. Though it had not been completely set up, from the distortion of the great power of heaven and earth, this was definitely no ordinary formation. Whether it was or not, only one point was needed to prove it.","Ling Han circled the surroundings for a short while, and soon found the Transfer Formation.","As expected.","He nodded internally. If that old Venerate Tier elite from the Meng Clan had charged over, he would definitely have come directly from the Transference Portal. With his strength, he was naturally unafraid of being ganged up on by Sect Master great elites, but if he had just appeared, and the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire activated the great formation and delivered a fatal blow with their supreme Spirit Tool?","The elite of an era could possibly be annihilated just like that.","However, what did this have to do with him?","Ling Han had absolutely no intention of sending the news back. The old Venerate Tier elite of the Meng Clan should be the one who had seized the throne of the Jin Clan, and had even suppressed Brother Monkey for more than two thousand years, and Ling Han was supposed to save this old b@stard?","What a joke.","If he died, he deserved it. He was considered lucky not to have died, but when Brother Monkey advanced into Venerate Tier and returned, the old b@stard would still be unable to flee death. Ling Han quietly left the camp. This was the main camp of the invasion of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire. There were too many elites gathered here, so it was too dangerous for him to stay here.","He had already made contact with Tang Yan, and knew where he was hiding. He travelled cautiously and slowly all the way, and only after he had left that base far behind did Ling Han fly on his Tool, and set out at full speed.","Xiu!","After flying for ten minutes, a cold light suddenly shot over from the ground, slashing towards Ling Han.","Ling Han turned around, dodging this cold light. However, xiu, xiu, xiu! Another cold light slashed out, intertwining to form a net.","Ling Han activated the Starlight Screen and blocked all of the attacks.","Immediately afterward, seven cultivators flew over from the ground on their Spirit Tools, each wielding a weapon.","“Surviving dregs, surrender yourself!” one of them shouted.","These were the soldiers of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire, but they were definitely not ordinary-level soldiers. Instead, they were elites of the Foundation Building Tier and the Cauldron Forging Tier – if any force could mobilize an army that was completely made up of Foundation Building Tiers, that would really be inconceivably powerful.","Even though there were billions of Foundation Building Tiers in the entire universe, on average, tens of thousands of Foundation Building Tiers was already a very large number for every planet.","Ling Han swept an eye over them, and said, “Move aside. I don’t want to kill anyone.”","“Hahahaha!” The seven people on the other side all laughed loudly.","Was this not hilarious? A mere fish that had slipped through the net actually dared to speak such conceited nonsense. He was really unbelievably stupid.","“He must be the young master of some so-called noble clan.”","“Kill him, kill him, I hate this kind of second-generation young master the most.”","Someone was the first to charge out. With a sweep of the sword, shua, Sword Qi was several kilometers long, entwined with high-level azure energy, covered densely with seals, as if even a high mountain could be sliced open with a single strike.","Ling Han frowned upon hearing this. He didn’t want to wound anyone, yet this attack was a deadly one. This made him extremely displeased.","“Humph!” He shot out a punch, very simple and down-to-earth.","However, the great dao was extremely simple. This punch shattered the Sword Qi, and the remaining power did not diminish. It was still rolling towards that person. Peng, the punch landed, and that person fell down from the skies.","“What!”","The remaining six people were all greatly shocked. How could this “second-generation young master” be so powerful? The might of a single punch had reached this level?","“This brat is powerful.”","“Don’t underestimate him in any way.”","“Die!”","A good few of them were exuding light from their bodies. That was because they were wearing armour. Once they were activated, multiple veined patterns lit up, looking very","majestic.","Obviously, there was also a very large gap between the wealth of these six people. Two of them did not have any armor, and seemed a little shabby.","After activating their armor, they naturally became even more courageous. They started to attack Ling Han again.","The six of them joined forces, and they were all at the Cauldron Forging Tier. Their might was extremely terrifying.","With a thought from Ling Han, a barrage of murderous aura immediately shot over, causing the six people to stagnate, and they all fell from the skies.","Five people directly fell onto the ground, and only one person’s divine sense was tenacious. After descending two thirds of the distance, he recovered, and once again flew on his Tool, saving him from the danger of a fall.","So what if they were Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators? Those six people had all broken bones from the fall, and this was still thanks to the fact that they were Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators. Otherwise, it was possible that they would have been directly smashed into mush. The remaining person was so scared that he flew to an extremely far place, his face still filled","with fear.","This was too terrifying. How could there be such a terrifying guy?","Ling Han didn’t give chase. Instead, he turned around and flew on his divine tool. Xiu! He","quickly disappeared into the horizon.","On the way, he had been sniped several times, but the strongest was only Cauldron Forging","Tier. This naturally could not possibly stop him.","Half a day later, Ling Han finally arrived at a dense forest.","This was the Giant Deer Forest, and Tang Yan was hiding inside.","The large black dog handed over Tang Yan’s latest coordinates, and Ling Han headed in that","direction.","After walking for another half an hour, he arrived at a small valley. The valley was very hidden, and was blocked by rocks. If he didn’t search carefully, it would really be difficult to","discover it.","With Tang Yan’s reminder, Ling Han naturally found the entrance very quickly, and strode in.","Shua!","He had just entered into the valley, when he saw a cold light slash over. It was incredibly fast, and extremely sharp.","“Stop!” someone shouted. However, it was already too late.","Ling Han raised his fist and shot out a punch. Ding, this ray of light immediately crumbled.","He was merely a Foundation Building cultivator, and he could easily suppress him with a casual raise of his hand.","“Haha, it’s actually you!” Amidst long laughter, a young man in embroidered robes walked over. It was as if he was surrounded by stars, and there were five people following behind him.","He was filled with arrogance.","Yi, Meng Yangcheng.","Ling Han was astonished. This world was far too small! He had actually come across Meng","Yangcheng here!","“Yi, Your Imperial Highness recognizes Ling Han?” Tang Yan also walked out. Previously, it was he who had shouted “stop” loudly.","“Of course.” Meng Yangcheng stared at Ling Han with a piercing killing intent in his eyes.","Previously, he had already found the ruins of the Buddhist Race’s inheritance. In the end, he had actually been forced to flee in panic by Ling Han. Not only had he failed to obtain the inheritance of the Buddhist Race, he had even lost a considerable number of his subordinates. “Old Cai, apprehend him!” he turned around and said to a subordinate behind him.","“Yes, Your Imperial Highness.” A middle-aged man immediately stepped out.","At first, he had curbed his aura, and was as careful as a servant, but now that his aura had","spread out, he instantly exuded an astonishing pressure.","This was a Cauldron Forging Tier elite.","-In Meng Yangcheng’s eyes, Ling Han was naturally only a Foundation Building Tier. Then,","even if you are the strongest Foundation Building Tier, how could you possibly match a Cauldron Forging Tier?"]},{"number":3803,"title":"Chapter 3803: You are the slave, and I am the master","paragraphs":["Chapter 3803: You are the slave, and I am the master","“Your Imperial Highness!” Tang Yan hurriedly stepped out to block him, spreading out his arms, “Ling Han is my friend. Is there some kind of misunderstanding between the two of you?”","“Your friend?” Meng Yangcheng’s eyes sharpened, and he couldn’t help but feel suspicious.","Previously, when Ling Han had snatched his fated opportunity, could it be that it had been commanded by Tang Yan?","Otherwise, how could a minor character that he had never heard of dare to oppose him? Furthermore, aside from a clan with a powerful background like the Tang Clan, how could they possibly find the historical site of the Buddhist Race?","“Tang Yan, how dare you make an enemy of the Imperial Family!” he said balefully.","Tang Yan was at a loss, “Your Imperial Highness, what is the meaning of this?”","“What is the meaning of this?” Meng Yangcheng sneered and waved his hand. “Take them all down!”","So what if he was a junior marquis? As long as he dared to oppose the Meng Clan, all of them would only be cannon fodder.","Ling Han shook his head with a smile, saying, “Tang Yan, this has nothing to do with you. Let me deal with it.”","Tang Yan really didn’t want to give up. It wasn’t that he didn’t believe in Ling Han’s strength, but it was precisely because he knew how strong Ling Han was that he wanted to stop him. Otherwise, once they got into a fight, Ling Han would definitely get into trouble. When the old Venerate Tier arrived, Meng Yangcheng would make a complaint, and what would happen then?","However, Ling Han gave him a light shove, so Tang Yan could only step aside.","That “Old Cai” took another step forwards, and as he walked, he released his own powerful aura. It was obvious that he wanted to use his Cauldron Forging Tier cultivation level to forcefully suppress Ling Han.","There were nine levels in Celestial Path, and there was a massive gap between each minor level of Celestial Path, what more when it was a major tier of Celestial Path.","I am superior to you in terms of level of being, crushing you. Who cares if you submit or not? Your only option would be to kneel.","Of course, he had miscalculated. To say nothing of suppressing Ling Han, as long as Ling Han summoned the Celestial Cauldron, he would only be trembling on his knees.","“Meng Yangcheng, are you seeking death?” Ling Han asked calmly.","Meng Yangcheng sneered, “Ignorance! Old Cai, what are you standing around for?”","Old Cai was slightly surprised. He had clearly released the unique aura of the Cauldron Forging Tier to suppress Ling Han, so why was Ling Han completely unresponsive?","However, with Meng Yangcheng’s urging, he didn’t have the time to investigate further. He immediately leaped forward and grabbed at Ling Han.","Peng!","He had just leaped over, when he saw Ling Han shoot out a kick. Old Cai was sent flying backwards at an even faster speed, and crashed heavily into the mountain rock. Ka, ka, ka! With him as the centre, the mountain wall was covered densely with fine cracks, and then shattered with a bang. His whole person had sunk in, about two feet deep.","Then, he leaned forward and fell to the ground, leaving behind a huge spherical groove behind him. There was a pool of blood in the center.","F***!","Upon seeing this, Meng Yangcheng and the others all wore expressions of disbelief.","This was actually a Foundation Building cultivator?","Absolutely impossible!","Meng Yangcheng stared at Ling Han for a while before saying with a sneer, “So you’ve advanced to the Cauldron Forging Tier!”","This explained Ling Han’s strength, but it was still shocking, because only a few months had passed, and Ling Han had already completed a leap of a major tier. This was inconceivable.","Ling Han remained silent and simply crooked a finger at Meng Yangcheng. This time, he wouldn’t give him another chance to escape.","“Old Chen, Old Yun, you guys attack together!” Meng Yangcheng said calmly.","So what if he defeated Old Cai? That was only the weakest Cauldron Forging Tier by his side, but Old Chen and Old Yun were both Earth Cauldrons. With the two of them working together, and added with the advantage of a minor cultivation level, how could it be that they would not be able to take down a Human Cauldron?","“Yes, Your Imperial Highness!”","Another two middle-aged men walked out. They were Meng Yangcheng’s true “wealth”. After all, Meng Yangcheng himself was only a Cauldron Forging Tier. His cultivation level wasn’t high enough, and the resources in his hands weren’t enough either. It was impossible for a Core Formation Tier elite to join him.","The two of them flanked Ling Han, one on the left and one on the right.","“Die!” The two of them attacked at the same time. One brandished a flaming saber, while the other wielded a lightning sword. High-level energy surged, and the surrounding mountain rocks crumbled.","Ling Han’s figure flashed. Xiu, he was as fast as lightning. He first kicked Old Chen away, then raised his foot and kicked Old Yun away as well.","Peng! Peng!","The two of them crashed into the groove that Old Cai had created previously, one after another, enlarging this groove quite a few times, and also a few feet deeper.","They collapsed onto Old Cai, one after another. The three men were stacked on top of one another, and no matter how one looked at it, it looked a little vulgar.","However, no one paid attention to Old Cai and the others. They were all looking at Ling Han in","shock.","“How is this possible!” Meng Yangcheng gritted his teeth. Why was there such a powerful Human Cauldron?","Could it be that Ling Han was invincible in Foundation Building Tier, and could also be like this in Cauldron Forging Tier?","Meng Yangcheng was filled with regret. If he had known that Ling Han was so powerful, he wouldn’t have sent Old Cai and the others up one by one. Instead, he would have them form a formation and funnel all the power into him. However, now that the three of them had lost consciousness, there were only two left. What was the point of forming a formation?","“Alright, you win!” He chose to temporarily bow his head. As long as his ancestor charged over, he would immediately make a complaint.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. “Meng Yangcheng, are you a three-year- old child? How can you be so childish? Do you think that I’ll let you go with just a single","word?”","“No matter what, we have to a$$-r@pe him!” the large black dog, the entity, interjected from the sidelines. He had not spoken for so long, and it was almost suffocating him to death. Ling Han was instantly rendered speechless. He turned around and said to the large black dog, “My aura was so strong just then, and now that you’re saying this, you’ve directly dragged me down to the same level as you. How am I supposed to continue?”","“Woof! Stop pretending, brat! Be careful of being struck by lightning!” The large black dog wore an expression that said, ‘I’ve already seen through you’.","Ling Han turned around and said to Meng Yangcheng, “Sorry, sorry. Where were we just","now?”","“Speaking of a$$-r@pe,” the large black dog continued to interrupt.","“Ling Han, have you had enough!” Meng Yangcheng roared. “You’re a subject, I’m a monarch,","you’re a slave, and I’m the master. If you dare to touch me, that would be treason!”","When these words fell, Tang Yan’s expression changed drastically.","In the eyes of the members of the Meng Clan, were subjects like them slaves?","Meng Yangcheng decided to take a gamble, and said to his two remaining subordinates,","“Attack with me!”","The two of them naturally could only walk the path of darkness with Meng Yangcheng. They","both nodded.","The three of them charged over together. With Meng Yangcheng taking the lead, their might","was considerably shocking.","Meng Yangcheng still had some confidence, because this was different from the battle that","had taken place in the ruins of the Buddhist Race. He had a great many powerful treasures that","he could use, and this was the true power of an imperial heir.","“Go!” he shouted loudly. His forehead split open, and a silver sword flew out, shooting","rapidly towards Ling Han.","Spiritual Power Spirit Tool!","In just an instant, it had accelerated to more than 20 times the speed of sound. There was no sound at all, because its speed had far surpassed the speed of sound.","Ling Han also had his own Spiritual Power Spirit Tool, so he naturally wouldn’t be careless.","He unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and streaks of Primal Chaos Qi descended, forming thousands of Dao Manifestations.","Peng, the silver sword hit, and blasted into the Primal Chaos Qi. Not only did it not manage to penetrate through, it was instead forcibly crushed onto the ground."]},{"number":3804,"title":"Chapter 3804: So be it if I kill him","paragraphs":["Chapter 3804: So be it if I kill him","Meng Yangcheng couldn’t imagine this. They were both precious tools, but why was the gap between them so wide?","It should be known that he was controlling a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool!","In a situation when their levels were equal, it was definitely the Spiritual Power Spirit Tool that was stronger. Otherwise, the ingredients for Spiritual Power materials wouldn’t be so expensive, and there would be no lack of buyers.","He had to be seeing things.","Yet Ling Han was slightly disappointed. This was too weak, wasn’t it? It couldn’t even block a flash of Primal Chaos Qi?","If he had known that this would be the extent of its might, he would have directly used his fists to attack. In fact, the Sword of Metal that he had nurtured in his abdomen was not inferior to this either.","“Sigh, I have really overestimated you!” He shook his head.","Peng, peng, peng! The attacks of Meng Yangcheng and the others arrived, yet not one of them managed to penetrate the Primal Chaos Qi.","Ling Han put away the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and said calmly, “Meng Yangcheng, if you want to deal with me, you can do it openly. I would have respected you, but you’re using underhanded methods. Hehe, I look down on you!”","“You found out?” Meng Yangcheng was surprised. He had done this very covertly, and with Ling Han’s identity and status, it should have been impossible for him to discover the tricks he was playing behind the scenes.","-Tang Yan!","He couldn’t help but think that if Tang Yan interfered, he should be able to find out about his existence.","Damn it, he was really too detestable.","Just wait. Once he saw his ancestor, he would definitely kill Ling Han, and Tang Yan, or even the Tang Clan, would not be able to stay out of this either.","“What one does, the heavens will see.” Ling Han shook his head, “You are truly hopeless. Even now, you are still thinking about how to snitch on me. Hehe, I can’t be bothered to waste my breath on you. You had best be on your way.”","His killing intent was on full display.","Meng Yangcheng was astonished, and he shouted, “You dare?!”","Tang Yan was also shocked. Ling Han wanted to kill Meng Yangcheng?","Hiss, this was really outrageously bold.","Once the news leaked out, it would only lead to death. In fact, it could even lead to the execution of his entire clan.","“Ling Han, don’t be rash!” Tang Yan hurriedly said. Regardless of any misunderstandings or enmity between the two of them, he, as a member of the Tang Clan, should still be able to resolve them.","However, once Meng Yangcheng was killed by Ling Han, Ling Han would become the mortal enemy of the Meng Clan.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “The members of the Meng Clan aren’t all that impressive. So be it if I kill them. What’s there to be afraid of?”","“That’s right, a$$-r@pe!” the large black dog shouted from the sidelines.","“Ling Han!” Tang Yan still wanted to persuade him further. This was really an inconceivable matter.","However, Ling Han didn’t give him another chance. With a punch, Meng Yangcheng was killed.","This time, he had no chance to escape.","Tang Yan hesitated slightly, then suddenly moved.","Of course, it was not targeting Ling Han, but rather killing all five of Meng Yang Cheng’s subordinates.","“What happened today never happened,” he said solemnly.","“Resolute!” The large black dog gestured with his paw.","Ling Han also nodded internally. He smiled, and asked, “You won’t blame me for dragging you down with me, right?”","Tang Yan shrugged, “Then what can be done?”","Ling Han patted his shoulder and said, “What would you think if I told you that it’s extremely likely that the Venerate Tier elite from the Meng Clan would be killed?”","“What?!” Tang Yan was astonished. That was a Venerate Tier elite! Just how powerful was he? It had already been close to ten million years since an Ancestral King had appeared in the universe. It could be claimed that Saints were the most powerful beings in battle prowess, but throughout the universe, how many Saints were there?","Thus, the value of Venerate Tier elites was naturally high, especially in this galaxy. They were definitely invincible.","If it weren’t for the fact that they were wary of the Venerate Tier from the Meng Clan, would the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s offensive be so “gentle”? Moreover, if it weren’t for the fact that the Venerate Tier from the Meng Clan was severely wounded, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire wouldn’t dare to mobilize troops at all, all right?","Now, Ling Han said that the Venerate of the Meng Clan could possibly be killed. How could he believe this?","“Just wait and see. I think the reason why the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire suddenly conquered Golden Wealth Planet was to lure the Venerate Tier from the Meng Clan to appear, and then kill him,” Ling Han continued, but didn’t say what he saw.","Tang looked at him solemnly, “Are you sure about that?”","“90%.” Ling Han nodded, but still left a sliver of leeway.","Tang Yan had no choice but to seriously consider this possibility. With the present age gap of the Meng Clan, once the old Venerate Tier from the Meng Clan died, there would be no need for the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire to launch an invasion at all, and the whole Empire would immediately collapse.","This was because the Meng Clan only had a single Sect Master elite. Meanwhile, other Sect Master-level forces had two or even three of such elites.","If that really happened, the Meng Clan would be finished, and such a “small matter” like Ling","Han","killing Meng Yangcheng would naturally not be pursued.","“I have to immediately inform the clan to prepare for any changes,” Tang Yan said seriously.","Ling Han nodded. The Tang Clan was the favorite subject of the Majestic Empire of the Meng Clan, but it was also because of this that once the Meng Clan collapsed, the Tang Clan would also bear the brunt of it, and suffer a huge blow.","Tang Yan sent a message to the clan through the Galaxy Network. As for what preparations the","clan would make, it was out of his reach.","“What do we do now?” he asked Ling Han.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before saying, “Let’s change locations and hide for a while. The battle just then might attract pursuers. In the future, we’ll have to see if that Venerate Tier from the Meng Clan can survive this tribulation.”","“I still don’t believe it. The Shadow Moon Majestic Empire actually has the guts to snipe a Venerate Tier elite!” Tang Yan was still a little dazed. “That is a Venerate Tier; just how powerful an existence is that? With a single palm strike, even Sect Master great elites would","die by the dozens.”","Ling Han smiled faintly and did not speak.","“Even if the Old Emperor is heavily injured, and his battle prowess has greatly decreased, a starving camel is still bigger than a horse. Even if he is not as powerful as he was all those years ago, it is definitely not difficult for him to break out of a Sect Master-level siege.” Tang Yan was still analyzing from the sidelines, and the more he thought about it, the more he felt that it was impossible.","“Let’s go. We’ll find out after waiting patiently for a few days.” Ling Han pulled Tang Yan along with him as he ran.","The two of them continued to hide in a different location to avoid their pursuers. However, after half a day, they were just resting with their eyes closed, when they suddenly felt the","world shake.","What was going on?","They came out from their hiding place, and saw light flickering in the distant skies. There was a figure that was indomitable, indescribably tall. His whole body was exuding golden light, like he was an Immortal, but blood was gushing out of his chest. Clearly, he had been severely","injured.","This person was really big, and probably not much smaller than Golden Wealth Planet. Around him, there were a great many smaller people that were ganging up on him. Spirit Tools of all shapes and sizes showed their might, and every one of them seemed capable of destroying the heavens and earth.","Ling Han and Tang Yan were both smart people, and immediately guessed that the incredibly tall figure was the old Venerate of the Meng Clan, Ling Han. He was presently being ganged up","on by the people of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire.","“The situation is far from good!” Tang Yan said with a frown. From his standpoint, he","naturally didn’t want the Meng Clan to fall.","But looking at how the old Venerate from the Meng Clan looked, he was obviously heavily injured again, and was in an extremely dangerous situation.","Meanwhile, Ling Han knew that the moment the old Venerate Tier elite from the Meng Clan","left the Transfer Formation, he must have suffered a head-on blow from that vicious spear. He must have also been hit, and that was why he was bleeding endlessly.","The problem now was, would this Venerate Tier from the Meng Clan be able to carve a path of blood out of this trap?"]},{"number":3805,"title":"Chapter 3805: Slaying a Venerate","paragraphs":["Chapter 3805: Slaying a Venerate","In the galaxy, bloody battles raged.","Even if a Venerate Tier elite had been severely wounded in the first place, and had been targeted by a sneak attack, and then severely wounded, his abilities were still frighteningly strong. He was like a dying lion, and was still not someone that could be bullied by a few wolves or dogs.","Boom, every punch and palm strike possessed the might to destroy the heavens and earth.","Right now, the Venerate Tier elite of the Meng Clan was as large as a planet. Thus, his power was naturally terrifyingly large. If it weren’t for the fact that he had been blocked by those Sect Master elites, perhaps this planet would have been obliterated in just a few exchanges. It was also because of this that this Venerate was able to struggle on at death’s door.","This was quite ironic. Golden Wealth Planet clearly belonged to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, but the old Venerate Tier from the Meng Clan actually threatened to destroy this planet, and those elites from the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire were continuously trying to save it, greatly reducing the pressure on him.","Both Ling Han and Tang Yan’s expressions were ugly, because if Golden Wealth Planet was really blown up, putting aside the question of whether they would be able to survive the force of the planet’s explosion, even if they could, they would be floating in the boundless universe, and it was very likely that they would die before they could even reach the next living planet.","From this aspect alone, they also hoped that the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire would win.","“This old b@stard is really willing to do anything just to save his own life!” Tang Yan couldn’t help but curse.","Previously, Meng Yangcheng had called him a servant, and now, seeing the old Venerate Tier from the Meng Clan completely disregarding the subjects of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire that were still on Golden Wealth Planet, he was finally extremely disappointed. -Didn’t they come here to work for the Meng Clan? But how did the Meng Clan treat them? This was bitterly disappointing. This was far too disappointing.","The bloody battle was still ongoing. Though the old Venerate Tier elite from the Meng Clan had temporarily relieved the pressure on him, his injuries were too heavy, after all. The longer the battle dragged on, the worse his situation would be.","He began to retreat.","How could the great elites of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire let him have his way?","Wasn’t the reason why they had gone to so much effort to lay out such a trap just to get rid of this person? Once the old Venerate of the Meng Clan died, the invasion of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire would no longer be obstructed.","These great elites all set off in pursuit, each using their own movement techniques. Their speed was astonishingly fast.","The old Venerate from the Meng Clan tore a rip into space. He wanted to create a wormhole and directly leap through it.","“Meng Jiuyao, your time is over!” a great elite shouted. A golden pestle appeared in his hand, exuding a majestic light that measured millions and millions of meters, which smashed towards the old Venerate from the Meng Clan.","These majestic lights condensed, and actually took the form of a Buddha. One hand was holding a flower, while the other formed a palm, which pressed down on the old Venerate Tier from the Meng Clan.","“The Buddhist Race?” the old Venerate Tier elite from the Meng Clan exclaimed in shock. “No wonder the puny Shadow Moon Majestic Empire dared to violate the law. As it turned out, there’s actually a shadow of the Buddhist Race behind this! Damn it, I couldn’t kill you all in the past, and actually made a comeback!”","“Amitabha Buddha!” the great elite chanted. “The inheritance of Dharma Buddha is in the hearts of the people, not in form. You’re at too much of a disadvantage!”","Boom!","The Buddha’s image shot out by this golden pestle had boundless might, blasting the old Venerate of the Meng Clan into a retreat of tens of thousands of kilometers. The action of tearing open space naturally stopped.","Those great elites charged over once more, and it was as if they were a pack of wolves swallowing a tiger.","The old Venerate from the Meng Clan was fighting with his life on the line. He didn’t want to die here. Boom! A purple aura rose from his body, and he could be seen clearly even from such a far distance.","“Old Geezer Meng is putting his life on the line.”","“Humph, even the great dao Purple Qi is burning. Old geezer Meng has completely given up the idea of becoming a Saint.”","“Continue to exert pressure. As long as we exhaust him of Purple Qi, he will be a dead crab.”","In the eyes of those great elites that were ganging up on him, the old Venerate from the Meng Clan was already at the end of his line.","However, the old Venerate from the Meng Clan was extremely resolute. The reason why he had expended the great dao Purple Qi wasn’t for the sake of putting his life on the line. Instead, he had formed a shield around himself, protecting him so that he could easily tear open a wormhole and take advantage of the opening to crawl in.","“Chase!”","How could those great elites bear to give up? After much difficulty, they had finally forced the old Venerate from the Meng Clan to the point of exhaustion. Hurriedly, they worked together to open that wormhole, and continued their pursuit.","Boom! The devastating shockwaves of energy continued to sweep over the surface of the Golden Wealth Planet. Large amounts of trees were shattered into dust, and some mountains were even flattened. The sea evaporated, transforming into a barren land.","This was truly astounding. Those elites were clearly battling outside the planet, yet just the shockwaves alone possessed such terrifying might. If they were targeted directly at Golden Wealth Planet, even if it was just a single shockwave, would Golden Wealth Planet immediately crumble?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel like he was extremely insignificant, as well as a strong sense of danger.","Without reaching the level of Sect Master, he would only be an ant, after all.","He had to increase his cultivation level as soon as possible. Otherwise, if he came across a conflict between two great elites, he could possibly become cannon fodder.","Half a day later, peace returned to the world.","Ling Han and Tang Yan hurriedly connected to the Galaxy Network and contacted their","families respectively.","Previously, they had not done so, because the energy of heaven and earth was chaotic, and the Galaxy Network couldn’t be connected at all.","Ling Han communicated with the empress and the others. Unexpectedly, they already knew about the Venerable Tier elite from the Meng Clan.","As it turned out, the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire had actually broadcasted this grand event of killing “Venerate Tier” live. On the Galaxy Network, who knew how many people had simultaneously witnessed this scene. Furthermore, the empress and the others knew even","more than Ling Han.","Because after the old Venerate from the Meng Clan tore open the wormhole and left, Ling Han and Tang Yan didn’t see what happened after that. However, the empress and the others could still see clearly through the live broadcast of the Galaxy Network.","...The great elites of the Shadow Moon Empire caught up to the old Venerate from the Meng Clan again, and a fierce battle ensued. The old Venerate from the Meng Clan had no choice but to unleash a forbidden technique, self-destructing his arms and one leg. Only then did he finally break out of the siege and escape with his life.","However, after this battle, the old Venerate Tier elite from the Meng Clan could be considered to have withdrawn from the ranks of elites. Even if he could still recover from his injuries, without two arms and one leg, how much of his battle prowess could he still retain? Moreover, he had been recuperating all this while, and it had already been tens of thousands of years, yet he still hadn’t recovered fully, what more now?","After this, this Venerate Tier elite would probably only be able to wait for death in some","corner of the universe.","“Don’t stay in the city any longer. Leave immediately and find a secluded place to stay. I will return as soon as possible,” Ling Han said.","It could be imagined that though the old Venerate Tier elite from the Meng Clan hadn’t died, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire would definitely launch a full-scale invasion and completely overthrow the Meng Clan’s rule.","Under such a massive change, the slightest carelessness would turn everyone into cannon","fodder.","Ling Han very much wanted to immediately return to Moonlight Planet, but unfortunately, he didn’t have a shuttle, nor could he use the Transference Portal, so he could only wait here.","Fortunately, the empress and the others weren’t weak either. Moreover, they still had the protection of seven children. Tang Yun’er even had a shuttle, and added together, it should be enough for them to protect themselves.","Ling Han suppressed his worries and forced himself to focus on other matters.","This was a resource planet. There was a large amount of precious metals, as well as a small","amount of Celestial medicine.","“Come, let’s go and plunder.” He called out to Tang Yan.","Tang Yan was slightly dazed. Such a powerful Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was actually","about to collapse, and the Tang Clan, which had flourished for a while, was also about to fall.","This was something he could not accept.","“You can create another golden age for the Tang Clan,” Ling Han encouraged him."]},{"number":3806,"title":"Chapter 3806: Azure Dragon Majestic Empire Destroyed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3806: Azure Dragon Majestic Empire Destroyed","With Ling Han’s encouragement, Tang Yan also pulled himself together.","The strength of a clan should not be based on their dependence on another force, but rather derived from their own strength.","The Tang Clan also had a Spirit Transformation True Lord. No matter where in the galaxy, this kind of strength was enough.","“In the future, I too want to become a Venerate Tier elite, and rule over a region,” Tang Yan said, clenching his fists.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. Why was this guy’s ambition so small?","But upon further thought, Ancestral Kings would only appear once every ten million years, so this was ruled out first. Furthermore, Saints were also as rare as phoenix feathers and unicorn horns. In a galaxy, it would be quite impressive if there was even one in a million years.","Thus, it was more practical to become a Venerate Tier.","“All right. You will become a Venerate Tier elite, and I will become an Ancestral King Tier elite,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Tang Yan rolled his eyes, “Why is it that when you become an Ancestral King, I can only become a Venerate Tier?”","“Wasn’t that what you said?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","The two of them took the initiative to move, beginning to search for valuable things.","When they arrived near the Transfer Formation, the two of them saw teams of troops passing through the Transfer Formation.","“They should have gone to the Moonlight Planet.” Tang Yan’s expression was livid.","Ling Han nodded, similarly very solemn.","If a war broke out, the ones who would suffer the most would definitely be the lower ranks. To them, no matter which side won, it would be a calamity.","“Let’s go.” Ling Han withdrew his emotions. At present, there was nothing he could do, and the only thing he could work hard on was to make himself stronger.","They walked through one mine after another, and also went to the more dangerous primitive forests. They were hunted by powerful Demonic Beasts, and there were also patrolling Shadow Moon Majestic Empire troops that discovered them, and battles broke out.","Half a month later, they all received the news.","The Azure Dragon Majestic Empire had been defeated and gone.","Following the large-scale invasion of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire, the forces that originally belonged to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire all switched sides. These were all Sect Master-level forces. Even the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire didn’t want to force them too far, so they naturally recruited them one by one.","Now that these elites had defected, what was left of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire?","Meng Yonghua abandoned his position and left. The clansmen of the Meng Clan shut down the formation that guarded the Imperial Capital, allowing the troops of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire to enter. They officially announced their surrender. From now onwards, Moonlight Planet was a subordinate planet of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire.","At the same time, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire also announced that the national religion was Buddhism, and the Majestic Empire would abide by the Buddhist Race’s teachings.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel emotional. 30,000 years ago, the Buddhist Race hadn’t been able to pass on their religion in the Azure Dragon Empire, but 30,000 years later, it was still the Buddhist Race that won.","The Buddhist Race did not have any specific bloodline. It was not a certain surname that had been passed down from generation to generation, but rather a kind of belief.","As long as one had the faith of Buddha, they would be a member of the Buddhist Race.","This was truly terrifying. At first glance, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire was the Majestic Empire of the Li Clan, but in truth? They all believed in Buddhism, and the Buddhist Race was the real leader.","-In fact, even the members of the Li Clan had to act according to the teachings of the Buddhist Race.","This kind of invasion was practically smooth and silent, yet pervasive at the same time. Even if the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire was finished in the future, whichever clan ascended the throne would still be under the control of the Buddhist Race.","It had to be admitted that the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire sniping the spread of the Buddhist Race was very prescient. Otherwise, after so many years, the entire Azure Dragon Empire, whether in terms of material or mentality, it would completely be adherent to the Buddhist Race.","From this, it could be seen just how terrifying the Ancestral King was.","The Four Directions Great Emperor of the Chang Clan founded the Galaxy Network, and to this day, it was also the one that had the most widespread influence. Furthermore, the teachings of the Buddhist Race had spread far and wide, and who knew how many people in the galaxy believed in Buddhism. The size of their force was unimaginable.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before coming to his senses.","There was no point thinking about these things. The most important thing was strength.","In these few days, he had just cultivated the first Celestial Cauldron into a three-legged Celestial Cauldron. His improvement could be considered quite astonishing. This was because The and Tang Yuan had found a few Celestial medicines.","He had alchemical poison in his body, so it was not appropriate for him to take any more alchemical pills. However, there was no problem with Celestial medicines. This was a gift from the heavens, and did not have the slightest side effect. Of course, if he directly ingested the Celestial medicine, he would not be able to fully activate the medicinal effects, and that would be a great waste.","However, there was nothing that could be done. Who asked Ling Han to not be able to take alchemical pills now?","So be it. Time was what was most valuable.","Following the destruction of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, Golden Wealth Planet’s level of alert also dropped. Everyone was the citizens of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire, so they naturally didn’t need to face their own citizens with weapons.","The Transfer Formation was once again open to the public, and could be used as long as one","paid.","Ling Han and Tang Yan were both eager to return. After putting on a disguise, they went to the Transfer Formation and paid the Transfer Formation fee. Xiu, amidst the surge of white light, they soon returned to the Moonlight Planet and arrived at the Imperial City.","The two of them split up first, both wanting to find their own family.","Ling Han exited the city, crossing many mountains and rivers, and arrived in a forest. After walking for more than 50km, he was greeted by a lake.","“Ling Han!” The empress, Hu Niu, and the others all came out to receive him.","Ling Han also ran over quickly, his left arm around the empress, his right arm around Hu Niu,","and planted a passionate kiss on their mouths.","“Yi, kissing would get you pregnant!” The seven babies all covered their eyes.","Tang Yun’er licked her candies, and muttered in displeasure, “Damn Handsome Brother","steals away Beautiful Sister!”","What made Ling Han feel gratified was the fact that the empress and Hu Niu’s improvement was very obvious. They were only a sliver away from forming Ultimate Dao Foundation.","They settled down in peace, far from the seat of power.","From the Azure Dragon Empire to the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire, this was a massive change for those in power. Many people went from high and mighty to ordinary overnight, but for normal people, there was not the slightest change.","He would continue to live as he had always lived.","Ling Han could still purchase ingredients and sell alchemical pills through Galaxy Network. The Chang Clan had a transcendent status, so they were completely unaffected.","To Ling Han’s surprise, someone actually made a comeback.","-Those people from the Political Hostage Manor had all ran out now, and those like Liu Xunyu, Zhao Xiao and the others all had Spirit Transformation True Lord-level, or even Sect Master-level forces behind them. Now that the Meng Clan had fallen, they naturally became arrogant, and began to look for Ling Han everywhere, wanting to kill him to avenge grudges.","Ling Han naturally didn’t care about such minor characters. However, since these clowns dared to be so arrogant, Ling Han planned to kill them if he had the chance to, lest they continue to blabber nonsense.","Day after day passed, and Ling Han’s cultivation level was also increasing day after day. There was also good news, and that was the alchemic poison in his body was about to completely","dissipate.","Afterwards, he would be able to take alchemical pills to cultivate, so that the improvement of his cultivation level could soar.","Three months had passed, and he had finally cultivated to the level of Heaven Cauldron. The two Celestial Cauldrons had already formed a complete three legs, and the third Celestial Cauldron had also grown a leg.","Right at this moment, a huge piece of news suddenly spread out on the Galaxy Network.","After cultivating in seclusion for 20,000 years, the Nine Suns Holy Land was planning to open","their doors to recruit disciples.","All of a sudden, the entire galaxy was shaken.","The Nine Suns Holy Land had naturally produced a Saint before. Otherwise, how could it be","called the Nine Suns Holy Land?","And that Nine Suns Saint was an incredibly fierce man. When he was young, he could almost be considered invincible among his peers, and had once had the possibility of becoming an Ancestral King, but in the end, all his efforts had come to nothing, and he had lost to the Ancestral King Lingtian."]},{"number":3807,"title":"Chapter 3807: Nine Suns Saint","paragraphs":["Chapter 3807: Nine Suns Saint","It was said that the Nine Suns Saint and the young Ancestral King Lingtian had battled countless times, and were old enemies, old rivals, and both had won and lost before.","From this, it was clear just how powerful the Nine Suns Saint had been in the past. Even a future Ancestral King had been unable to suppress him.","However, the Nine Suns Saint’s cultivation technique was far too powerful, and this left him with far too many wounds when he was young. It was because of this that he had lost to Ancestral King Lingtian on his path to becoming an Ancestral King. As such, he could only become a Saint.","In his later years, Nine Suns Saint kept an extremely low profile, but it was said that he was creating an extremely powerful technique. In fact, he had even simulated an Imperial Technique.","Now, the Nine Suns Holy Land had reopened their doors to recruit disciples. To say nothing of ordinary people, even the heirs of Imperial Clans were itching to give it a try.","Of course, it was definitely not just any random person that could enter into the Nine Suns Holy Land.","Firstly, it was the qualifications for registration. One only had to satisfy any one of the following three conditions.","Firstly, ranked in the top 10,000 on the Galaxy Network.","Secondly, Innate Divine Physique.","Thirdly, the Celestial Foundation, or Celestial Cauldron’s quality had reached Gold Grade. That’s right. There was also an implicit requirement for this registration, and that was only targeting those in the Foundation Building Tier and the Cauldron Forging Tier.","Ling Han wasn’t born with a Divine Physique, but he satisfied the first and third conditions.","But the problem was, he did not want to expose the secret that he was “Number One in the Galaxy”. Furthermore, his Celestial Cauldron was clearly of a higher grade than Gold grade, but in the eyes of outsiders, it seemed to be forged from stone.","How was he supposed to deal with this?","Ling Han took a look. The Nine Suns Holy Land’s gates would open for ten years, and a selection would be conducted every year. Ten years later, the gates would close again.","Thankfully, there was still a lot of time.","Ling Han planned to return to the Celestial Sea Planet. This was because he had already advanced to the Cauldron Forging Tier, and he didn’t have the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire to restrict his freedom. Thus, it was time for him to search for the second test that the Ancient Sun Saint had laid out.","Though the Turbid Heaven Scroll was not weak, it was still inferior to a Saint’s technique, after all.","Of course, if it was possible, Ling Han still wanted to cultivate the technique of a Great Emperor.","Regarding Ling Han’s decision, the empress and Hu Niu were naturally in full support. Thus, they boarded the shuttle and headed towards Celestial Sea Planet.","Ling Han contacted Lin Luo and the others. They naturally saw the notice from the Nine Suns Holy Land, and decided to set out in a few days.","Ling Han naturally believed in the strength and talent of Lin Luo and the others. Thus, after he dealt with the Ancient Sun Saint’s second trial ground, he would meet up with Lin Luo and the others.","Tang Yun’er finally advanced into the Foundation Building Tier, greatly improving her control over the shuttle. Thus, in just a month’s time, they returned to Celestial Sea Planet. Originally, the Celestial Sea Planet was subordinate to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Now that the Meng Clan had fallen, it was naturally subordinate to the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire.","Ling Han and his group had just entered into a city, when they saw tall structures rising from the ground, erected in the centre of the city. They had not been completely built yet.","This was a Buddhist temple, and it was said that there would be Buddhist Race monk settling here in the future, spreading the teachings of the Buddhist Race.","The invasion of the Buddhist Race had begun. This was not conquering a person physically, but rather from the spiritual level. Undoubtedly, this was even more terrifying.","Ling Han ignored this. They found an inn and settled down temporarily.","He wanted to analyze where the second test was.","On the Celestial Sea Planet, one couldn’t buy a completely corresponding map, because the Celestial Sea Planet had long since been destroyed.","Ling Han could only search for clues, and then make a comparison.","Hopefully, the entrance to the second testing ground was still on the Celestial Sea Planet. If it was a piece of the planet that had flown to some corner of the galaxy, that would be terrible.","Fortunately, this entrance was really on the Celestial Sea Planet.","After Ling Han compared the ancient map for a whole three days, he finally found the place.","“Let’s go.”","He brought the women, as well as the large black dog and the pervert pig, and set out towards their destination.","In just half a day’s time, they arrived at their destination. However, the world had changed, and after so many years, the entrance to the land of inheritance had long since been hidden underground. A town had been built here, and the location of the entrance that Ling Han was looking for was beneath the wealthiest family in the town.","If he wanted to enter into the land of inheritance, he would first have to destroy their family home.","If Ling Han were a tyrant, he would have directly demolished the building. However, firstly, he wasn’t that kind of person, and secondly, he didn’t want to cause too much commotion. Thus, he decided to buy this manor that occupied a large area.","He paid a visit, and slightly revealed the aura of an elite, and was immediately welcomed in.","“Dare I ask your name, Young Hero?” The head of this clan was a middle-aged man in his forties. His surname was Liu, and his name was Liu Gaoxi. Behind him was a yellow-robed young man. He was actually in the Foundation Building Tier.","It should be known that Celestial Sea Planet’s cultivation could be said to have started from scratch. Now, he actually saw a Foundation Building Tier cultivator in a small town. This was","naturally unusual.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, “My name is Han Lin.”","“So it’s Young Hero Han. Please, please, please.” Liu Gaoxi was very cordial. After inviting","Ling Han into the living room, he introduced the yellow-robed young man beside him, “This is my son, Liu Menglin. He is cultivating under the banner of the Primordial Sect.”","Primordial Sect?","Ling Han looked at the yellow-robed young man and nodded.","However, Liu Menglin was incredibly proud. In his eyes, he was the heir of one of the five great forces of Spiritual Transformation Tier on the Celestial Sea Planet, so he was naturally high and noble, having an incredibly strong feeling of superiority.","He ignored Ling Han, and sat down on his own.","Liu Gaoxi was slightly embarrassed. However, his son was far too powerful, so there was nothing he could do about this. Thus, he could only turn to Ling Han and say, “Young Hero Han, may I know why you’ve come today?”","Ling Han smiled, “I would like to ask Clan leader Liu to do me a favor, and sell this manor to","me.”","“Haha!” Liu Gaoxi had not even spoken, when Liu Menglin smirked coldly. He looked disdainfully at Ling Han, “This is the ancestral grounds of our Liu Clan. It is not for sale!”","Liu Gaoxi naturally didn’t want to sell either. However, he definitely wouldn’t offend others","like Liu Menglin had. Cold sweat formed on his forehead.","If Ling Han were to flip out, would his son be able to stop him?","Ling Han was naturally a little displeased as well. ‘I’m discussing nicely with you. Even if you","don’t agree, there’s no need for you to speak so harshly, right?’","This young man was clearly used to smooth sailing, so he was condescending, and spoke","without thinking.","Ling Han couldn’t be bothered to argue with this kind of person, and said, “I’ll offer 200 Dao","Stonesa|”","“Really!” Liu Menglin stood up before Ling Han could finish his words, his eyes shining.","Two hundred Dao Stones, this was an astonishing amount of wealth.","His natural talent was very high, and in the Primordial Sect, he could be considered a True","Disciple. However, he could only obtain two Dao Stones every month. With such a comparison, it was clear how valuable 200 Dao Stones were.","“We will sell!” Liu Menglin seemed to be afraid that Ling Han would regret it, and","immediately decided.","Liu Gaoxi: “ax|”","Just now, who had been so disdainful, and said that the ancestral grounds were not for sale,","but what was the result?","However, all the hopes of the Liu Clan rested on Liu Menglin. Thus, Liu Gaoxi would not undermine him either. He nodded slowly.","“Give us three days to move,” Liu Menglin said. However, he was sneering in his mind."]},{"number":3808,"title":"Chapter 3808: Greedy Villain","paragraphs":["Chapter 3808: Greedy Villain","There was a saying: don’t reveal your wealth.","Ling Han had revealed 200 Dao Stones at once. What did this signify?","He was rich, and extremely, extremely rich at that.","Who would not want to kill such a fat sheep when they saw it?","Liu Menglin did not want to sell his ancestral grounds. He only wanted to detain Ling Han, so that he could invite elites from the sect to suppress Ling Han.","He very much wanted to take it all for himself, but he could vaguely sense how strong Ling Han was, so he did not dare make a move rashly. Thus, just to be safe, he had best invite a few more Senior Brothers from his sect.","They couldn’t be too strong, or it was possible that they would turn on him.","En, he would just ask Senior Brother Yang, Senior Brother Zhang, Senior Brother Li, and Senior Sister Tian. Usually, the five of them had a good relationship, and had also explored ancient sites together, nurturing a certain level of tacit understanding.","He immediately sent out a message through the Galaxy Network, telling these four people to rush over at the first instant.","...","Ling Han returned to the inn, and the empress asked, “How was it?”","“It’s generally going quite smoothly. There might be some twists and turns,” Ling Han said with a smile. He didn’t know what Liu Menglin was planning, but the latter had changed his mind too quickly, making him feel that things weren’t as simple as he thought.","The empress only gave an ‘en’, and did not take it to heart at all.","That was the kind of prideful person she was,","Ling Han couldn’t help but be moved. He grabbed the empress and strode towards the bedroom.","“Niu wants to play too!” When Hu Niu saw this, she hurriedly sprinted in as well.","How could she miss out on something as fun as having children?","Time passed very quickly. Three days later, Ling Han went to receive the house. He brought the empress, Hu Niu and the other main troops.","“Please! Please!” The guard appeared cordial and polite, and invited Ling Han and his group into the living room. They saw that Liu Gaoxi and Liu Menglin were already waiting for them.","Ling Han waved a hand at the table, and a pile of Dao Stones appeared. He said calmly, “200 Dao Stones are here.”","Liu Menglin shook his head, “I’m really sorry. Someone has offered a higher price, so I won’t be selling this house.”","Hehe, was there really such a coincidence? Within three days, someone had taken a fancy to this place again?","Ling Han naturally didn’t believe him. He smiled slightly, and said, “Oh, are there other buyers?”","“Of course!” Amidst a loud laugh, four people walked out from the inner hall. They were three men and a woman respectively, and they were all very young.","“Han Lin, if you still want this manor, you can only increase your price,” Liu Menglin said with a shrug.","Ling Han ignored him. Instead, he looked at Liu Gaoxi, and asked, “Clan leader Liu, what do you say?”","Liu Menglin couldn’t help but show a hint of anger. Ling Han had skipped over him and directly asked his father. Wasn’t this clearly ignoring his existence?","Meanwhile, Liu Gaoxi was feeling extremely awkward. He wasn’t a greedy person, and from the very beginning, he didn’t want to sell his ancestral home at all. However, since his son had already agreed, he didn’t object anymore. After all, he later found out just how astonishingly valuable 200 Dao Stones were.","However, he had just found out that his son had actually gone back on his word and tricked Ling Han.","What could he say now?","“If you can’t afford it, then get lost!” Among the four people who had walked out previously, the only woman, Tian Lijing, said disdainfully.","Hehe, they were still acting?","Fine, I’ll play with you guys.","Ling Han swiped the table with his hand, and stored the Dao Stones on the table into his Spatial Tool. Then, he nodded at the empress and the others, indicating for them to stand up and leave.","“Hold it right there!” one of the men in red immediately shouted. His name was Yang Yuansi.","“You can leave, but leave your Spatial Spirit Tool behind,” the man in green said. He was Li Zhengping.","“Otherwise, you will also be leaving your life behind,” the man in blue, Zhang Yiyuan also said coldly.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Are you guys robbing me?”","“Cut the crap. Don’t you understand the logic of paying for your life?” Yang Yuansi said.","Ling Han’s expression was a little strange, and he asked, “You guys won’t regret it?” “Haha, in this world, there is no one that can make us regret it!” Liu Menglin interrupted. He had been holding back for a long time, and it was finally his turn to show off. “Alright, since this is your choice, I’ll send you on your way,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“No, let Niu have this!” Hu Niu hurriedly jumped out. As an extremely battle-thirsty person, after leaving the Genesis World, she had been cultivating every day for the past few years. It was really too boring.","Thus, how could she miss out on such a fun opportunity?","“Grandpa Dog wants one too,” the large black dog stepped out. His metallic underpants were blindingly bright.","“You want one too?” Ling Han looked at the pervert pig.","The perverted pig shook his head repeatedly. A battle idiot like him could only take a beating. “Haha, a woman and a dog.” Liu Menglin shook his head, appearing extremely disdainful. “Dog your uncle!” The large black dog immediately charged over. The Imminent Skyline was activated, and its speed was astonishingly quick. In a flash, it had already appeared in front of Liu Menglin, and swiped out a paw.","Although the large black dog wasn’t as freakish as Ling Han, he had cultivated the Saint Technique and the Great Overarching Heaven Technique, so his battle prowess could be said to be extremely impressive. Moreover, he was currently Heavenly Dao Foundation, but Liu Menglin was only Human Dao Foundation. Just how huge was the gap between them?","Pa! A claw slammed down, and Liu Menglin fell to the ground.","The large black dog stepped on Liu Menglin’s head, and said with an indifferent expression,","“How lonely is it to be invincible!”","How pretentious.","However, Li Yuansi and the others were all solemn.","The information wasn’t right. Wasn’t it said that there was only one Foundation Building cultivator? Why was there a freakish dog demon now? This was the cultivation level of Heavenly Dao Foundation, and it had knocked Liu Menglin down with a single strike. Its","battle prowess was too fierce.","“Who else is there?” The large black dog stood on his hind legs like a human, his two front paws crossed behind his back, his iron underwear flashing.","“Perverted demonic dog, don’t be too smug!” Zhang Yiyuan walked out. He was also","Heavenly Dao Foundation, and thought that he wouldn’t lose to the large black dog.","“Come!” The large black dog hooked his paw at him.","Zhang Yiyuan charged over, and shot out a punch.","The fist had just shot out, when he roared furiously, and forcibly withdrew it.","“Despicable!” he spat through gritted teeth. This was because the large black dog had","actually lifted Li Menglin up and used him as a shield.","“What? You’re saying Grandpa Dog is despicable?” The large black dog looked astonished.","“Can’t I scold you?” Zhang Yiyuan said angrily.","The large black dog suddenly laughed loudly, “Grandpa Dog is despicable, shameless, and vulgar. What can you do about it?” He turned around, and waved his behind at Zhang Yiyuan,","looking very vulgar.","F***, how could there be such a shameless Demonic Beast?","To say nothing of Zhang Yiyuan, even Yang Yuansi and the others had turned livid with anger.","“Do you think that I can’t do anything to you like this?” Zhang Yiyuan continued to attack. He was extremely furious. He was determined to capture the large black dog.","The large black dog was still the same. Using Liu Menglin as a shield, he forced Zhang Yiyuan","to cancel his own attack, while he continued to wave his paw.","In this way, Zhang Yiyuan was naturally at a complete disadvantage. His eyes sharpened, and when he delivered another attack, he clearly saw that Liu Menglin","had been raised as defence, but he had absolutely no intention of stopping, and continued his","attack."]},{"number":3809,"title":"Chapter 3809: Azure Cloud Mystery Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 3809: Azure Cloud Mystery Realm","Zhang Yiyuan knew very well that if he was tied up, he would never be able to defeat the large black dog.","Thus, he decided to cut his losses, and no longer held back.","On the other hand, Liu Menglin was only his Junior Brother. He wasn’t his father, nor was he his son.","Yang Yuansi, Li Zhengping, and the others actually didn’t open their mouths to stop him either. In their eyes, this was the best solution.","Only Liu Gaoxi was extremely nervous. The one being used as a shield was his son, so nothing could happen to him.","The large black dog shook his head, and said, “How vicious!” However, he didn’t hold back at all, using Liu Menglin as a shield. Peng, peng, peng! After a dozen or so exchanges, Liu Menglin was severely wounded.","“Don’t hit me anymore! Don’t hit me anymore! I don’t want this manor anymore. As long as you let my son go, we’ll leave immediately.” Tears streamed down Liu Gaoxi’s face. He was not that greedy. He only wanted his son to be fine.","“All right, I’ll return him to you!” The large black dog waved a paw, and tossed Liu Menglin out. In any case, he had already damaged this “shield”.","“Humph, die!” Zhang Yiyuan’s offensive instantly intensified.","Even if he did not fear hurting the hostage and attacked fully, he still didn’t dare to kill Liu Menglin. After all, they were Sect Brothers. If he killed Liu Menglin, he wouldn’t be able to escape responsibility either.","Thus, he had truly gone all out now.","He stimulated high-level energy, and there was a dark green light wrapped around his fist, causing the might of the fist technique to increase to another level.","“Do you think Grandpa Dog is afraid of you?” the large black dog roared. He also lashed out with his paw, clashing with Zhang Yiyuan.","Boom!","Fists and claws clashed, and Zhang Yi Yuan’s expression immediately changed drastically. His whole person was sent flying, blood spurting from his mouth.","What, even Zhang Yiyuan was no match for this freakish demonic dog?","Yang Yuansi and the others all felt their scalps go numb. Oh no, they had been screwed over by Liu Menglin. How was this group of people fat sheep? They were clearly ferocious tigers.","“Hehe, it’s a misunderstanding, it’s all a misunderstanding!” Yang Yuansi hurriedly played mediator.","“Do you want to fight with Niu? Come on then!” Hu Niu immediately leaped out and launched an attack at Yang Yuansi.","‘F*ck you!’","Yang Yuansi was extremely depressed. He was asking for peace, okay? Little girl, don’t you have ears? He glanced at Hu Niu. Though her face was covered by a thin veil, and her true appearance could not be seen clearly, he could vaguely see her excited expression.","F***, this was a battle-thirsty character.","He was helpless against Hu Niu, and could only passively accept the challenge. However, he had only parried one move, when he paled in shock, because Hu Niu was too strong.","This was probably Ultimate Dao Foundation, right? Otherwise, how could she be so powerful? In just a few moves, he was also beaten to the ground.","When Li Zhengping and Tian Lijing saw this, they no longer had any fighting spirit. Hurriedly, they turned around and fled.","Since they had already made their move, how could he allow them to flee?","Ling Han nodded at the seven babies. After getting his permission, the seven babies all rushed out excitedly.","They hadn’t advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier yet, but they were all born with a Divine Physique, so just how terrifying were their abilities?","Li Zhengping and Tian Lijiing were both beaten into pig heads.","“Little Han, kill them to keep the secret,” the large black dog said viciously, scaring Zhang Yiyuan and the others so much that they trembled.","“I’ll keep them alive for now. They might be useful.” Ling Han thought for a moment, and decided not to kill them for the moment.","He began to search for the entrance to the Mystery Realm, and naturally needed to dismantle the manor of the Liu Clan. After digging three feet into the ground, he found a stone pillar.","This was the one.","According to the information he had obtained in the Moon Occult Mystery Realm, he soon found the method to open it. He used his Spiritual Power to form a special seal and placed it on the stone pillar.","Ka, ka, ka! The stone pillar twisted, and then a platform rose up from the ground. Complex formation patterns were drawn on it.","“Let’s go.”","Ling Han beckoned the empress, the large black dog, and the others over. Even Liu Menglin, Zhang Yiyuan and the others were brought along. He activated the formation again. Weng! A brilliant light surged over, and everyone instantly disappeared from their original positions. Light flashed madly in front of their eyes, but very soon, it stopped, and they saw that they had appeared on a plain, and there was azure multicoloured light at the horizon.","This was the Azure Cloud Mystery Realm, the second trial grounds set up by the Ancient Sun Saint.","Liu Menglin and Yang Yuansi naturally understood why Ling Han wanted to buy the ancestral grounds of the Liu Clan. As it turned out, this was actually the entrance to a Mystery Realm. They were all anxious. Now that they knew such a big secret, would they still be able to leave alive?","“The multicolored light here is very nutritious,” Ling Han said. This was also the information he had obtained.","Why had he come here as soon as he had the chance after advancing into Cauldron Forging Tier? Aside from the inheritance of the Saint, this multi-colored light was also one of his","targets.","The large black dog immediately broke into a run and ran towards the horizon, “Little Han, Grandpa Dog will take my leave first.”","This damn dog!","Ling Han chuckled. This multi-colored light was not that easy to obtain, either.","“Come, let’s go to the Earth Mystery Palace first.”","The Earth Mystery Palace was the land of inheritance for the Saint, and it was also the keystone that controlled this Mystery Realm. If one wanted to obtain the multi-colored light, they would have to first obtain the Earth Mystery Palace.","“Hey, where are you guys going?” The large black dog ran for half a day, yet did not see Ling","Han and the others catch up to him. He then scrambled back, but when he saw that they were not heading towards the multicolored light at all, he couldn’t help but feel anxious. He hurriedly called out as he gave chase.","This Mystery Realm was much smaller than the Moon Occult Mystery Realm.","In truth, the Moon Occult Mystery Realm was used by the Ancient Sun Saint to select his heirs. Those who stood out were the candidates, and the remaining three Mystery Realms were used to examine whether they were worthy of being his heirs. After all, there were some people who were stunning for a while, but would soon disappear among the masses. Thus, the Ancient Sun Saint would rather have his Dao lost than to pass it on to a mediocre person, and bring dishonor to his name.","After walking for about 10 minutes, they arrived at the Earth Mystery Palace.","This place was very small. Rather than calling it a palace, it would be better to call it a larger","house.","Ling Han pushed open the doors and entered. He saw that there was a very wide aisle ahead of him. It was about three hundred meters in length, and there was a sword at the end. “That sword is the hub that controls this place,” Ling Han said. “In the past, the Ancient Sun Saint used the Spirit Tool when he was in Cauldron Forging Tier. After he became a Saint, he refined it again, and among Two Star Spirit Tools, it can be considered peak grade.” “Grandpa Dog just happens to be missing a Spirit Tool. This sword belongs to Grandpa Dog now,” the large black dog immediately said.","When these words fell into the ears of Liu Menglin and the others, their eyes lit up.","Control hub.","If they obtained this sword, then wouldn’t they be able to control this Mystery Realm? To say nothing of escaping, they could even turn the tables and become the Master instead.","Haha, these people were really arrogant. They actually didn’t restrict their cultivation level,","which really gave them great convenience.","The five of them looked at each other, and suddenly exploded in unison, charging towards the","end of the passage.","However, they had just taken a step, when they both stumbled, and almost tripped.","In this passageway, the gravity field was extraordinarily strong.","Not only that, but multiple figures also surfaced from the ground, instantly covering the entire passageway.","Shua! The person at the forefront immediately launched an attack at Liu Menglin and the","others."]},{"number":3810,"title":"Chapter 3810: Yin souls","paragraphs":["Chapter 3810: Yin souls","These figures were not solid, but rather semi-transparent, as if they were formed from light and shadow. The moment they appeared, they exuded a powerful chilling aura.","Liu Menglin and the others were instantly embroiled in a tough battle. They didn’t dare to retreat. If they fell into Ling Han’s hands again, would they still have a chance of survival?","Thus, they could only charge forward and obtain that treasured sword. They would then be able to control the entire Mystery Realm. Not only would they be able to turn the situation around, but they would even be able to obtain a great opportunity.","However, the battle prowess of those figures was really too strong, instantly blasting them to the point that they were groaning in pain.","“Little Han, is this the reason why you brought them in?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Am I that two-faced?”","“Yes!” The large black dog nodded with certainty, and the perverted pig beside him nodded even faster. It was all this b@stard’s fault for causing him to wander around everywhere, b@stard.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. He hadn’t planned to screw Liu Menglin and the others over, but for the sake of secrecy, he had brought the five of them with him. He hadn’t thought that they would insist on seeking death.","Of course, without sealing off their cultivation levels, Ling Han was actually indulging them, intentionally or otherwise.","“What the hell are these figures?” The large black dog naturally didn’t mind whether Ling Han was two-faced or not. In fact, it even expressed its delight at this. In a world where the strong ruled, what was the use of having nothing but righteousness? He couldn’t even protect himself, and still wanted to protect others?","Ling Han activated his ocular technique and looked closely, saying, “It should be a vengeful ghost.”","“Yin soul!” Second Baby continued.","“That’s right. The Celestial Sea Planet is the exit to a netherworld. At that time, they even caused the Ancient Sun Saint to die. Thus, it is very normal for the Ancient Sun Saint to capture some Yin souls here,” Eldest Eldest Baby also said.","Ling Han nodded. These were indeed not human figures that had evolved from formations. That eerie feeling was completely incompatible with normal living beings.","“When people die, will they really become Yin souls?” He suddenly became curious.","If that was really the case, then wouldn’t the people he had killed all be thinking about him in the Netherworld?","“The great elites of ancient times have studied it. It is said that after a living being dies, the yin soul would enter into the netherworld. This is a completely different place from our world. Theoretically, there should be absolutely no possibility of communication between the two worlds. Only in the instant of death, would the yin soul be able to penetrate the barrier between the two realms. But perhaps, the two worlds have existed for too long, causing some places to begin merging,” Second Baby said seriously.","Hearing a child say such words in such a serious manner, he felt an inexplicable urge to laugh. Ling Han tried his best to control himself. He looked at Liu Menglin and the others who were engaged in a tough battle, “Celestial Sea Planet are the point where the two Realms merge. At that time, the underworld opened up, and countless Yin souls surged in, causing a great calamity.”","“That’s right.” The seven babies nodded in unison.","As they conversed, Liu Menglin and the others could no longer hold on. They all wanted to charge back, but there was a terrifying gravity field on this path, which made it difficult for them to advance. More importantly, they had been determined to charge to the other side at that time. Furthermore, they had really charged out a distance, and now they actually wanted to charge back?","It would be difficult.","Ling Han and the others had no intention of helping. This was what the five of them had asked for.","It wasn’t long before the five of them were killed.","A strange scene appeared. With the deaths of these five people, those Yin souls actually began to kill each other, fighting extremely intensely.","However, in the end, five of the strongest Yin souls won and surged into the corpses of Liu Menglin and the others respectively. Then... they actually stood up shakily.","F***, they had come back to life!","“Liu Menglin” and the others soon set their eyes on Ling Han and the others. Their movements were no longer stiff. Xiu, xiu, xiu, they all pounced over, launching attacks at Ling Han and the others.","In this process, the Yin souls in the passageway did not make a move on them, as if they agreed that they were on the same side.","“This Yin soul can actually come back to life through a corpse?” Ling Han was shocked. No wonder when the doors to the netherworld opened, it would cause a great calamity. They were replacing a living person.","He charged out at the first instant, and shot out a punch. The Heavenly Dao Flames was burning fiercely, and the power of flames should be an extremely good weapon against Yin","souls.","Peng, peng, peng! After only five punches, Liu Menglin and the others were sent flying. Their bodies cracked, but they actually didn’t explode.","Ling Han was surprised. Though he had only done it casually, with his Cauldron Forging Tier- level power, even if it was just a sliver, it was enough to kill a Foundation Building cultivator. After being possessed by the Yin soul, these corpses actually underwent such a massive change.","“Hehehe,” Liu Menglin and the others all released strange sounds. The aura exuding from their bodies actually increased greatly, and all of a sudden, they had rushed up to the level of Cauldron Forging Tier, Human Cauldron, Earth Cauldron, Heaven Cauldron... they were still increasing, and had not advanced into the level of Core Formation Tier, but Ling Han was sure that it had reached four cauldrons, or even five cauldrons in fact.","Pa, pa, pa! More and more cracks appeared on the bodies of Liu Menglin and the others, and they became deeper and deeper. For example, one of Tian Lijing’s arms had even fallen off. The increase in aura of the five of them stopped at the same time. It was not that they could no longer be stronger, but rather their bodies could not bear it.","Hiss, the strength of those five Yin souls when they were alive must have far surpassed the Cauldron Forging Tier. Otherwise, it was impossible that a mere Yin soul would be able to increase the physical strength of the host so much.","Ling Han’s expression was solemn. This Yin soul was really terrifying. No wonder it had caused such a calamity in the past.","Moreover, even the Heavenly Dao Flames did not have much of a restraining effect on Yin souls. It was as if their bodies had become wet and tightly woven wood, and were extremely","hard to burn.","Then he’ll switch tactics.","Ling Han’s hands shook, and Destructive Energy wrapped around his fists at the same time.","In the past, he hadn’t been able to do so. This was because there were far too few Destructive Energy Particles. They could only wrap around one fist. Now, however, they could only wrap around two fists.","When Destructive Energy appeared, Liu Menglin and the others actually took a step back at the same time. There was obvious wariness on the zombies’ faces, as well as a strong sense of","disgust.","It was not just them. The Yin souls in the passage also seemed to have been angered, and became incredibly restless. If it was not for some kind of power restraining them, they would probably either charge towards Ling Han, or flee completely.","Yi, Destructive Energy was capable of restraining Yin souls?","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind, yet his figure charged out without hesitation.","He threw a punch, and Liu Menglin and the others didn’t dare to face it head-on. They","hurriedly retreated.","Ling Han used the Imminent Skyline Technique, and had already caught up to Zhang Yiyuan.","He threw a punch.","Zhang Yiyuan had no choice but to parry, and also threw a punch back at Ling Han.","Peng!","The two fists crashed into each other, and both of them trembled. In terms of power, they were actually evenly matched, but the Destructive Energy spread out through Zhang Yiyuan’s fist, instantly burning all over his body. Its speed was so fast that it was as if his body was","covered with wax.","In just an instant, Zhang Yiyuan was burnt to ashes, and the Yin soul that had entered his body also ran out in extreme terror. However, it was useless. It had already been ignited, and was continuously releasing divine sense-level howls, appearing to be in extreme pain.","In a short while, it too had been burnt into ashes."]},{"number":3811,"title":"Chapter 3811: Multicolored light nourishes the body","paragraphs":["Chapter 3811: Multicolored light nourishes the body","As expected, Destructive Energy was extremely effective against Yin souls.","Although the bodies of Liu Menglin and the others had been borrowed by the Yin souls, and all of them had zombie faces which were extremely numb, they were all wearing expressions of fear now.","In terms of power, they were not inferior to Ling Han. However, Ling Han’s black energy was too terrifying, and had an astonishing restraining effect on them.","They couldn’t fight.","The four of them leaped up at the same time, choosing to flee.","How could Ling Han possibly let them leave? Using the Imminent Skyline, he quickly caught up to one of them and threw a punch. Then, without even looking, he chased after the second person. He did the same thing. After four punches, he stopped, and saw that Liu Menglin and the others had all burnt to nothing, and so had the four yin souls.","The large black dog stuck out his tongue. Thankfully, he did not run out greedily. Otherwise, he would have probably become a Yin soul dog by now.","Ling Han strode into the passageway. With a shua, those Yin souls all retreated, squeezing together, showing a strong fear.","It wasn’t that they were afraid of him, but rather Destructive Energy.","Ling Han continued to advance, and these Yin souls continued to retreat, squeezing even harder.","When Ling Han was about to reach the end of the passageway, those Yin souls could no longer retreat, and were completely squeezed together.","They continuously released sharp whistles via divine sense, as if warning Ling Han not to come any closer. Otherwise, they would not hesitate to fight to the death.","How could Ling Han possibly give them any regard? He continued to advance.","A shocking scene appeared. These Yin souls actually began to kill each other again. Yi, had they been scared silly?","A few Yin souls were soon killed, and it could be clearly seen that the light particles that formed their bodies were shattered, absorbed by the other Yin souls, and these Yin souls immediately became larger.","Ling Han was surprised. Though this was killing each other, it was also a means to save themselves. They would devour their companions to strengthen themselves, and ultimately reach a level that could match Ling Han.","Die.","Ling Han wasn’t in the mood to see how strong they would become in the end. He charged out, swinging his fists repeatedly, and nothing could not be destroyed by Destructive Energy.","The Yin souls instantly withered away at a visible rate. In less than a minute, all the Yin souls were destroyed.","Ling Han strode out of the passageway, his hand gripping the hilt of his sword.","Instantly, a thought was sent over.","There was a considerable amount of information. There was the Cauldron Forging Tier chapter of the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll, the coordinates of the next test site and the method to open it, as well as some knowledge that the Ancient Sun Saint had about yin souls.","Ling Han’s eyeballs trembled rapidly. He was presently receiving information, and digesting","it.","After a few minutes, he released his grip.","“Come over here. There’s no more danger,” Ling Han said.","The large black dog rushed out with a woof, snatching the opportunity to pull out the sword, “This is Grandpa Dog’s!”","“All right, all right, all right. Here,” Ling Han said with a smile.","He had the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, so any Spirit Tool was nothing but dirt in his eyes.","“I’m about to begin receiving the rays of light. I’m ready,” Ling Han said. He then turned to the large black dog and said, “Bring me the sword first. I need to use it to control this Mystery Realm.”","The large black dog’s expression was filled with suspicion, “It can’t be that you want to embezzle Grandpa Dog’s treasure, right?”","“Get lost!”","Everyone sat down in a cross-legged position. Ling Han inserted the treasured sword again, and his intent instantly spread throughout the entire Mystery Realm through the treasured sword, as if he was an omnipotent god.","Azure light, come!","Xiu, xiu, xiu! On the horizon, multiple streaks of azure light shot over, circling around the empress, Hu Niu and the others.","The empress and the others channelled the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Multiple streaks of light were absorbed by them, turning into the most fundamental force, increasing their cultivation level and strengthening their Celestial Foundation.","“Grandpa Dog is about to break through!”","Not long after, the large black dog called out. At this moment, his aura was extremely strong and unstable.","The empress and Hu Niu had also reached the peak stage of Heavenly Dao Foundation, and were beginning to break through to the Ultimate Dao Foundation.","Ling Han dispersed the multi-colored light first. At present, the empress and the others’ cultivation levels differed considerably. He had to increase their cultivation levels first.","To the empress and the large black dog, breaking through to Ultimate Dao Foundation was naturally nothing too difficult. In less than half a day, they broke through one after another. Ling Han summoned the multi-colored light again, allowing them to continue cultivating. If they could charge up to the Cauldron Forging Tier in one go, that would be great. However, though this multi-colored light was very nutritious, there was also a level of saturation that one could reach, just like alchemical pills. Another half a day later, the empress and the others were no longer able to boost the advancement of their cultivation level by absorbing the multi-colored light.","Only then did Ling Han sit down in a cross-legged position. With the Cauldron Forging Tier chapter of the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll, he was recultivating the mystical power. Multiple rays of light were absorbed by him, helping his mystical power become purer. Otherwise, his cultivation level would definitely decline slightly.","When all the multicolored light disappeared, Ling Han’s cultivation level was also close to the peak stage of Heaven Cauldron Tier. The third leg of the cauldron was just a sliver away from","completion.","Ling Han was very pleased. Though his cultivation level hadn’t improved much, his mystical power had been purified considerably, so his battle prowess had naturally improved","considerably.","“Let’s go, it’s time to leave.”","The large black dog was slightly dissatisfied, and he said, “Are the benefits of a Mystery","Realm so measly?”","“Heh, this is only a stopover. If I truly want to reap great rewards, I’ll have to wait until the last Mystery Realm,” Ling Han said. It was still the examination stage for the Ancient Sun Saint, so being able to obtain nourishing multicolored light in addition to the cultivation technique, as well as a treasured sword, was already quite impressive.","“Sigh, what a miserly Saint,” the large black dog mocked.","“That’s right, too stingy.” Hu Niu also joined in agreement.","“Let’s go.”","They exited the Mystery Realm, and Ling Han had already erased all the relevant memories of the members of the Liu Clan. He headed directly to the Imperial City.","Ling Han first went to visit Xuanyuan Dingguo. Xuanyuan Dingguo had finally advanced into the Foundation Building Tier, but because of his natural talent, it was possible that he wouldn’t be able to break through to the Cauldron Forging Tier in the next one to two hundred years. Ling Han left a great many Foundation Dissolution Pills for Xuanyuan Dingguo, hoping to lend him a helping hand so he would have a chance to advance into the","Cauldron Forging Tier in the future.","Then, he went to see the princess of the Demon Race.","Princess Bixiao still stayed in the Imperial City. When she saw Ling Han, she immediately asked expectantly, “You are going to the Nine Suns Holy Land, right?”","“That’s right, what about it?” Ling Han countered.","“I was just worrying about not being able to go over. You came at the right time.”","True, with the help of Brother Monkey, Princess Bixiao awakened the power of her bloodline. By now, she could also be considered a Natural Divine Physique. This was in line with the","recruitment criteria of the Nine Suns Holy Land.","“Alright, then let’s go together.”","There wasn’t much to delay on the Celestial Sea Planet, and Ling Han didn’t visit Chen Fengyan either. After all, he was a Spiritual Transformation True Lord, so he was afraid that Chen Fengyan would be embarrassed if he saw him. Thus, it was best not to meet him.","Ling Han had Tang Yun’er take out the shuttle. They returned to the Moonlight Planet. There was a Transfer Formation there, which was much faster than the shuttle.","A month later, they arrived at the Moonlight Planet. Lin Luo and the others had long since set out. Ling Han did not stay idle either, and began his journey with the empress and the others. After taking seven consecutive Transfer Formations, they had no choice but to stop and find a place to stay."]},{"number":3812,"title":"Chapter 3812: Setting up a Tournament Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 3812: Setting up a Tournament Stage","Every time one used the Transfer Formation, it would cause a certain burden on his body. The farther the distance was, the greater this burden would be. As time accumulated, it would","cause extremely great damage.","Someone used Transfer Formation 17 times in a row, and when they came out for the last time, their whole person was torn to shreds by the power of Space.","Thus, after using Transfer Formation a few times, Ling Han decided to rest. They would set out again after they had completely recovered.","After staying here for a few days, they set out again.","And just like that, they stopped here and there. A month later, they finally arrived at the Nine Suns Planet.","The Nine Suns Planet was the planet where Nine Suns Holy Land was located. It didn’t have this name before, but the Nine Suns Saint was too famous. At the time, he was known as the number one elite in the universe, and it was only when the Ancestral King Lingtian became an Emperor that he was ranked second.","Calculating the time, this was something that had happened almost 100 million years ago.","There were no immortal beings in this world, and even those as powerful as Ancestral Kings could only live for tens of millions of years. Saints only had a lifespan of a million years, and this was under the condition that they lived for the fullest extent of their lifespan. In truth, there was practically no one that could live that long, unless they had obtained a Saintly medicine that could extend their lifespan.","Ling Han was very rueful. Even the strongest Ancestral King would have his lifespan end, and his lifetime of invincibility would ultimately come to an end.","From this aspect, wouldn’t it be better to live in the Genesis World?","He laughed in spite of himself. Unless the Divine Stone was indestructible, so the Genesis World would be able to exist eternally, but once it was destroyed, all the living beings inside would only die.","In this way, even if he could live for a few more epochs, so what? His life and death would still have to depend on the will of heaven.","His fate had to be grasped in his own hands.","Ling Han’s willpower became firm again, and he no longer worried about personal gains and losses.","The empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog and the others had already ranked in the top 10,000 on the Galaxy Network. Princess Bixiao had an Innate Divine Physique, so it was equivalent to her directly obtaining the qualifications to register. They only had to confirm it through the Galaxy Network when the time came.","Ling Han couldn’t do the same. He had to think of some other way to obtain the qualification to register.","The simplest method was to fight, and make a name for himself. Then, the Nine Suns Holy Land would naturally personally send him the qualifications to register.","He would do as he said.","Ling Han arrogantly set up a martial arts ring and raised a banner with the words “Cauldron Forging Tier’s number one elite” on it, beginning a round of mockery.","Some people were disdainful, and thought that Ling Han was merely grandstanding, deliberately attracting attention. However, some people were displeased, and issued a challenge to him. Naturally, they suffered a terrible defeat.","In these few days, Ling Han did not suffer a single defeat. Naturally, his reputation spread widely, which also attracted some truly powerful people.","However, it was useless no matter who challenged him. Ling Han easily won, displaying his invincibility.","This reputation naturally spread wider and wider, and also caused heated discussions on the Galaxy Network. Some people even called for elites ranked in the top ten thousand to suppress Ling Han. How could they allow a little-known brat to be so arrogant?","It wasn’t long before someone replied, wanting to meet Ling Han.","This person’s name was Lu Jianyun, and he was ranked in the 9000s on Galaxy Network. He was extremely impressive, and on a planet, he would definitely be one of the top elites. He was a true prodigy.","“With Brother Lu stepping out, haha, that guy’s good days would come to an end.”","“Ling Han, where did he pop out from?”","“It seems to be the Moonlight Planet.”","“What? A planet that hasn’t even produced a Saint before?”","“That’s right. He’s a country bumpkin from this kind of small place. He thinks that he’s","invincible in the world just because he defeated a few nobodies.”","“Hehe, those who are truly capable are all on the Galaxy Network.”","“When and where are they going to fight? I want to join in on the excitement.”","“Let’s go together.”","A great many people expressed their desire to go and watch the battle, and Lu Jianyun was also very generous, saying that he would give everyone time. He would only go and issue a challenge three days later, so that everyone would have enough time to rush over.","Of course, this was only for those who had already arrived at the Nine Suns Planet. It could not","be done for those who were still in some corner of the galaxy.","But it was all right. There would definitely be people who would broadcast it live through Galaxy Network.","Ling Han naturally heard about it as well, and couldn’t help but smile, not taking it to heart at","all.","Three days’ time passed very quickly. After Ling Han had finished cultivating, he went outside to set up a martial arts ring.","When it was almost noon, a great many streaks of light appeared in the horizon. Upon a closer look, this was a great many people flying on their respective Tools.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Multiple figures descended, and surrounded by people, a young man strode out. He was tall and slender, and his hair was black and thick. He had a kind of divine light of Dao, and would make anyone who saw him feel a pleasing feeling.","Lu Jianyun had come?","Ling Han only glanced at him for a moment before withdrawing his gaze. Who cared who he was? Even if Origin or Myriad Dao came, he wouldn’t be afraid of a battle.","That’s right, had those three fierce people come yet?","“So you are Ling Han?” The young man in the lead had already leaped onto the tournament stage, casting a disdainful sideways glance at Ling Han.","Ling Han scoffed, “If you weren’t an idiot, you wouldn’t have asked such a low-level","question.”","The young man’s expression changed drastically. However, before he could even open his mouth to speak, a wave of curses swept through the crowd.","“How arrogant! Who does he think he is? He actually dares to speak to Brother Lu like this!”","“Brother Lu is ranked 9632nd in the Cauldron Forging Tier of the Galaxy Network.”","“You’re wrong. That was yesterday’s ranking. Today, he’s already ranked 9629th.”","“Yi, he has improved again? Brother Lu really has boundless future prospects. He has advanced into the top 10,000, and can still maintain a steady rise in his ranking.”","“As expected of a super genius.”","“After entering Nine Suns Holy Land, Brother Lu’s ranking will definitely increase greatly.”","Lu Jianyun’s anger turned into pride. Did you hear that? Just what kind of existence was he? “What are you standing around for? Aren’t you going to make a move?” Ling Han shook his head, “What is it? Have you come to be a mascot?”","Lu Jianyun instantly exploded in fury. With a furious roar, he charged towards Ling Han.","He couldn’t hold himself back any longer. Who cared if he was gentlemanly or not, or if he was showing off? Right now, he only wanted to give Ling Han a good beating.","Being able to rank in the top 10,000 of the Galaxy Network, Lu Jianyun’s strength was indeed extraordinary. He used a celestial technique, and the image of a great mountain appeared above his head. As he charged out, the mountains also fell one after another towards Ling Han. They were incredibly real, as if they wanted to smash him to pieces. Without using the Spirit Tool, it was completely a display of one’s own strength.","Ling Han remained seated and unmoving. When the other’s attack arrived, he finally threw a","punch at Lu Jianyun.","This punch... how could it be described?","In Lu Jianyun’s eyes, this was like a planet had crashed down on him. In front of this kind of punch, he was as insignificant as an ant, feeling extremely helpless.","Boom, the punch landed, and Lu Jianyun was instantly sent flying, directly falling off the","tournament stage.","The cheers and shouts from below came to an abrupt stop. All of them were numb with shock.","It was only a single punch, and Lu Jianyun had already been defeated. Just how wide was the","gap in strength between them?","“Hiss, no matter what, this person has to be one of the top 9000 in Galaxy Network.” “That’s right. The gap between top 10,000 and top 9,000 is like the gap between heaven and","earth.”","“Since this Ling Han is so strong, why is he still fighting on the tournament stage? He can","directly obtain the qualification to register.” “Er, perhaps he is deliberately showing off.”"]},{"number":3813,"title":"Chapter 3813: Gathering of prodigies and beauties","paragraphs":["Chapter 3813: Gathering of prodigies and beauties","No matter how pretentious Ling Han was, it was a fact that he had defeated Lu Jianyun.","Thus, when Ling Han put away the tournament stage and was about to return, a great many people immediately gathered around him, wanting to befriend him.","Ling Han didn’t deliberately offend anyone. He said some pleasantries, but didn’t say anything substantial.","Just as Ling Han was about to return, he was stopped by an elder.","“This old man is from the Nine Suns Holy Land. Does young friend have time?” the old man asked.","Hadn’t Ling Han set up this martial arts ring to attract people from the Nine Suns Holy Land? He smiled, “Yes.”","“Hehe, then let’s chat as we walk,” the old man said with a smile.","The two of them walked forwards, but though the old man said that he wanted to chat, he did not speak the whole time.","Ling Han wasn’t in a hurry either. He simply acted as if the person beside him didn’t exist.","After a long while, the old man finally spoke, and asked, “Young friend, why have you set up such a tournament stage?”","Ling Han told the truth, “I have not fulfilled the registration conditions of the Holy Land, so I can only come up with this last resort. I hope that the Holy Land can open a back door and allow me to register.”","“Yi?” This answer was something that the old man had not expected. He looked at Ling Han, his expression filled with surprise. ‘You are already capable of sending Lu Jianyun flying with a single punch, and your Galaxy Network’s ranking is at least in the top 9000, and you still have not met the conditions?’","Ling Han smiled and said, “Because of some personal reasons, I didn’t participate in the ranking battles.”","So that was how i was.","The old man believed him, because there were indeed some great clans that did not allow their descendants to participate in the ranking battles. Some did so because they wanted to keep a low profile, while some wanted to amaze the world with a single feat. Though there were not many, there were indeed such cases.","“So that’s how it is.” The old man also smiled, “All right, this old man understands. In view of your situation, the Holy Land will indeed have special circumstances to deal with you. Where do you live? In a few days, this old man will apply for a permit to enter, and I will deliver it to you.”","“Then thank you very much.”","The old man left, and Ling Han returned to the inn. He had already achieved his goal, so there was naturally no need for him to set up another tournament stage.","However, when he stopped setting up the martial arts ring, it caused a heated discussion on the Galaxy Network.","Most people thought that Ling Han had cowered. Now that Lu Jianyun had lost, there would definitely be even stronger prodigies ranked in the top 9000 and top 8000 that would appear to challenge him, and Ling Han knew that he was outmatched, so he took the initiative to close up.","“What a sore loser.”","“What Cauldron Forging Tier elite? What a joke.”","“Coward.”","The Galaxy Network was filled with curses, which made the empress, Hu Niu, and Princess Bixiao extremely furious.","Yet Ling Han was unconcerned, and waited for the day of the test to arrive.","Only by satisfying one of the three conditions of the Nine Suns Holy Land, would one be qualified to register. Whether one could become an official disciple or not would still have to go through a formal selection process.","A few days later, the old man delivered the entry plaque to Ling Han, so that Ling Han would drip blood in front of him, completing the soul bond. Otherwise, merely the entry plaque could completely be gifted to another.","When the empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog went to register, they also received a permit to enter after their certifications were approved. Dripping blood on the plaque, the entry permit was completed.","There was only a month left, and the first opening of the Nine Suns Holy Land to recruit disciples would be held. If they missed it, they would have to wait until next year, and there would only be ten such chances. Ten years later, the Nine Suns Holy Land would close its doors again, and who knew when it would open again.","Ling Han cultivated diligently every day. After switching to cultivating the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll, his advancement speed increased slightly.","A month passed, and he had already completely cultivated the third leg of the Heaven Cauldron.","The Heaven Cauldron was the limit of the ordinary Cauldron Forging Tier. However, Ling Han naturally wouldn’t be satisfied with the Heaven Cauldron. He wanted to cultivate to the limit of Nine Cauldrons.","However, from Heaven Cauldron to Four Cauldrons, this step was difficult to take. Even Ling Han couldn’t break through just like that. Instead, he needed a certain amount of time to accumulate enough power.","After all, he had become a Heaven Cauldron the moment he broke through. This process was too fast. Even if he didn’t break through to Four Cauldrons, he still needed to stabilize his cultivation level.","At this time, the Nine Suns Holy Land officially began recruiting disciples.","It could be said that aside from places that were really too remote, the majority of the prodigies in the galaxy had all come. In fact, there was no shortage of descendants of Ancestral Kings and heirs of Great Emperors.","For celestial techniques like Saint-level and Great Emperor-level, no matter how much one learns, it would not be too much. That was unless one himself had reached Saint-level. By then, he would really begin to walk his own path, and attempt to become the Ancestral King that only one person in ten million years could reach.","Thus, exclamations of shock would occasionally erupt from the crowd. Who and who had come, a certain person had come, that person had arrived.","“Imperial Clan, Lin Qi. Though he is not the strongest successor, he is ranked 207th in the Galaxy Network. This is practically enough to scare anyone to death.”","“Look at his hair. It’s actually burning with energy flames. This is too terrifying.”","“This kind of person can insta-kill Heaven Cauldron with a single move, right?”","“That is necessary. It is said that Lin Qi has formed seven cauldrons. Who among the prodigies of this generation would be able to surpass him?”","“Seven! Cauldrons!”","“And over there, the Dao Child of the Eight Treasures Holy Land, Gan Ping, and ranked 188th","on the Galaxy Network.”","“Though he is not a descendant of a Great Emperor, and does not have the strongest bloodline, it is said that he is a Saint Physique!”","“Jie Yingqiu, the Holy Daughter of the Flower Rain Sect. Though she is only ranked in the 2000s, she is still one of the 100 great beauties of the universe. She is indeed breathtakingly","beautiful!”","“Tan Meng, the princess of the Golden Silk Moth Holy Land, and also a seductive beauty on the beauty roll.”","“Jiang Yifei, Holy Daughter of the Great Forest Sect, ranked seventy-second on the Beauty Leaderboard.”","“How beautiful. If I could marry such a beautiful wife, I would have no regrets in this life.”","“Heh, you’re overthinking things. Which of the top 100 beauties in the galaxy isn’t proud and arrogant? Even if they want to marry someone, they’ll have to marry someone who’s ranked in the top 100 in terms of abilities.”","In this place, elites with powerful abilities were certainly sought after, and exquisite beauties","were also attractive.","Hu Niu was instantly defiant, and said, “Niu is much better looking than them.”","Ling Han laughed loudly, wrapped his arms around her, and said, “Of course.” “Pfft.” The person beside him immediately laughed. He was really shameless. He actually","said that she was even more beautiful than Jie Yingqiu and Tan Meng. Where had his confidence come from?","Ling Han glared at him, and his aura spread out slightly. That person’s face immediately paled, and he could not make another sound.","This was only the first year of disciple recruitment. It was possible that some prodigies were too far away and hadn’t arrived yet. Some might be at a critical stage of their cultivation, while others might have been adventuring in an ancient site and hadn’t gotten the news. In short, among the people who had come now, there were about two thousand in the top ten thousand in the Cauldron Forging Tier of the Galaxy Network, and the majority ranged from one thousand to ten thousand. There were relatively few in the top few hundred.","The highest ranked person was Gan Ping, ranked 188th.","Meanwhile, eleven beauties from the Universal Exquisite Leaderboard had arrived. Tan Meng","was ranked fifty-third, and the most powerful beauty was Jie Yingqiu, ranked more than 2000th on the individual strength leaderboard.","In fact, there were also those who possessed both beauty and strength. For example, those in","the top ten of the Exquisite Leaderboard were all super geniuses ranked in the top 100 of","Galaxy Network.","“Cough, then the selections have officially begun.”"]},{"number":3814,"title":"Chapter 3814: Contesting for the position of captain","paragraphs":["Chapter 3814: Contesting for the position of captain","An old man walked out from the Holy Land. He looked to be in his sixties.","He was extremely powerful, and he had to be at least at the True Self Tier. He was like a sun as he stood there, attracting everyone’s attention.","“The test is very simple. You guys will be divided into groups first, with every ten people forming a team. Then, you’ll be sent to the Barbaric Star Xing. Ferocious beasts rampage there, and it’s an incomparably desolate land. You guys have ten days to hunt ferocious beasts and killing different ferocious beasts will gain you different points.”","“Points will be recorded for the team. Ten days later, the remaining people in the team will share their points evenly. Those ranked in the top hundred can become the disciples of the Holy Land.”","“Let me explain in detail.”","“Before you all enter into the Barbaric Planet, each of you will receive a special connection device. This was created by our Holy Land, and is only limited to the seven great planets in the territory of our Holy Land.”","“On the Barbaric Planet, you all cannot harm your competitors, but can plunder and destroy the connecting devices of your opponents.”","“Once you lose the connection device, it means that you have failed this selection.”","“Additionally, at least three members have to be retained on the team. Otherwise, no matter how high the score is, they would all be eliminated.”","“Additionally, the connecting devices can only communicate with the members of the small team at present, and ask for help from the Holy Land – if you encounter a ferocious beast that is too powerful, and endanger your lives, you can ask for help, but once you ask for help, you will be eliminated.”","“All right, let’s begin the grouping.”","The groupings were very simple. They were not drawing lots, but rather following the order in which they had previously obtained the entry plaque.","In this way, Ling Han would have to separate from the empress and the others, and the empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog, and the babies would have a high chance of being in the same group, if it was coincidental.","“You guys be careful. If you encounter danger, there’s no harm in asking for help. Safety first,” Ling Han said.","“En.” The empress and Hu Niu both nodded.","However, the Cauldron Forging Tier and Foundation Building Tier cultivators were screened separately. Though they were all entering the Barbaric Planet, Foundation Building Tier and Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators would definitely not be placed in the same group. Thus, even if Ling Han, the empress, and the others had gotten the entry plaque together at the time, there was still nothing that could be done.","The masses began to divide into groups, and very quickly, groups of ten were formed. The Foundation Building Tier cultivators and the Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators entered the Transfer Formation respectively. As the light surged, they immediately disappeared. Transfer was done in small teams, and the destination of each transfer was random. However, the Foundation Building Tier cultivators were all in the southern hemisphere, while the Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators were in the northern hemisphere. There were formations separating them, and it was definitely impossible for them to communicate with each other. Ling Han was ranked very far behind. He had finally reached his turn after waiting for about an hour, and he stepped into the Transfer Formation with his nine teammates. With a flash of light, they had already arrived on another planet.","The Barbaric Planet was a planet without a sea. Its surface was covered with an incredibly dense primitive forest, and the tall trees were even three thousand meters tall, taller than some mountains.","The group of ten appeared under a large tree. The ground was covered with thick fallen leaves, soft and limp. Even if they fell, they would not be injured.","“Let’s choose a captain first!” A young man in blue robes was the first to speak up, “My name is Luo Shan, and I am a Bright Moon Divine Physique. I hope that I can lead everyone into the top hundred.”","“Hehe, a mere fifth grade Divine Physique cultivator actually dares to be so confident?” a man in green said disdainfully. He raised his thumb and pointed at himself, “Ma Gang, Heaven Cauldron Tier, Golden Celestial Cauldron!”","“You guys had best stand aside!” Another person stepped out, “Huang Lingyun, ranked 8532nd on the Galaxy Network!”","Whatever Innate Divine Physique, Golden Celestial Cauldron were all empty words. Cultivation depended on abilities, and the ranking on the Galaxy Network was the best proof of that.","With Huang Lingyun’s words, the two people from before immediately shut up obediently. “Hehe, what a coincidence.” A young man with long flowing hair shook his head, “Mu Long, ranked 8366th in the Galaxy Network.”","Shua! Huang Lingyun immediately looked over, and said with a smile, “Then I’ll have to ask for some guidance.”","“Come!” Mu Long naturally would not cower. The two of them leaped out, and began a great battle.","Fighting here naturally meant having no scruples, but what was shocking was that those great trees were very, very sturdy. Furthermore, their leaves also had a very strong absorption effect. Thus, though a large portion of the surrounding trees had fallen, their destructive power was also contained in this area.","Otherwise, if two Cauldron Forging Tier elites battled fiercely, the surrounding mountains would all be flattened.","Ling Han yawned, and did not go and watch the battle between Huang Lingyun and Mu Long, because the strongest in the team was not them at all. In fact, they could not even be ranked in","the top three.","He looked towards a person. That was an astonishingly sturdy man. Sitting there, he was not much shorter than an ordinary person standing, like he was a small mountain, and from within his body, Ling Han could see an incredibly vigorous power. His whole person was like a furnace that could burn the heavens and destroy the earth.","Aside from this sturdy man, there was also a young man in purple robes. He was tall and slender, and had a graceful bearing, possessing a carefree air that was above the mortal world.","This person should not be weak either. The others were only so-so.","He was thinking about the rules created by the Nine Suns Holy Land. There were ten people in a group, yet in the end, they still had to share the points equally. What if more of them were burdens? Wouldn’t that implicate the entire team?","However, there was also another rule, and that was that even their own people could be kicked out. They only had to destroy the connection device of the other party.","Then could he directly suppress the number of team members to the lowest limit of three?","Unless it could be guaranteed that the connection devices of the three of them would not be lost, even if two of them could sweep aside all opposition and be invincible, they would still","be eliminated in the end.","Thus, this rule was quite interesting.","As he mulled over this, the battle between Huang Lingyun and Mu Long also came to a stop. After all, this was only a battle for the position of captain, and the right to have a say. There was no need for them to use their trump card.","Furthermore, more importantly, this was to probe the background of every member of the team. Whom they needed to rope in, and who they needed to give up, so as not to hold them","back.","After a short battle, Huang Lingyun and his opponent both acknowledged each other’s strength.","The victor was Mu Long.","“No one has any objections to me becoming the captain, right?” Mu Long asked calmly. He walked in front of Ma Gang, and asked, “Do you yield?”","Ma Gang’s expression changed. In the end, he still lowered his head, and said, “I concede.”","He had watched the battle between Huang Lingyun and Mu Long, and his battle prowess was indeed superior to his. He had no choice but to admit defeat.","“Do you yield?” Mu Long asked Luo Shan again.","“I concede.”","A satisfied smile appeared on Mu Long’s face, and he turned to the third person, “Do you","yield?”","“I concede.”","“Do you yield?”","“I concede.”","“a¤|”","It wasn’t long before five people in the team nodded in agreement. Taking into account the defeated Huang Lingyun, only Ling Han, the sturdy man, and the young man in purple were","left.","“Do you yield?” Mu Long arrived in front of the sturdy man.","“I do not.” The sturdy man raised his head. His hair was disheveled, and his face was covered","with stubble. He was also wearing animal hide, and looked like a wild man.","Mu Long was taken aback. He was not conceding?","“He, then I will make you concede defeat!” He stretched out a hand to grab the sturdy man."]},{"number":3815,"title":"Chapter 3815: Four Cauldrons!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3815: Four Cauldrons!","Mu Long’s palm strike arrived.","He was ranked in the 8000s on the Galaxy Network, and his abilities could be considered extremely terrifying. Even if he had not used his full power in this palm strike, it was still as if the heavens were collapsing and the earth was cracking.","The sturdy man moved. He stood up, and it was as if a small mountain had suddenly become a large mountain. Then, he delivered a palm strike at Mu Long.","There was no flash of light. This palm strike was extremely simple, but as the palm strike passed, peng, Mu Long was sent flying like a cannonball. He crashed heavily into a large tree, and directly created a human-shaped hole. Then, he broke through the large tree, and continued to crash backwards.","In a single stroke, he had crashed through eleven great trees, and only then did Mu Long finally stop. He collapsed onto the ground, unable to get back to his feet.","Hiss, it was only a single palm strike, and an elite in the 8000s on the Galaxy Network was directly sent flying?","This was too shocking.","This was something that no one had expected, and they all looked at this sturdy man in shock. As it turned out, this was the true elite that had hidden himself.","Even the young man in purple withdrew his absent-minded expression, and began to carefully examine the sturdy man.","“You-“The sturdy man pointed at Huang Lingyun, “Do you yield?”","Huang Lingyun couldn’t help but feel extremely vexed. Previously, it was Mu Long who had been strutting around, so why had he sought him out for revenge?","However, he had sent Mu Long flying with a single strike. This was indeed due to Mu Long’s carelessness. However, this sturdy man’s strength was definitely terrifyingly strong, enough to rank in the top eight thousand of the Galaxy Network.","After entering into the top 10,000, ordinarily, every difference of 1000 would be a crushing gap, and if one entered into the top 1000, there would be a huge gap every 100 places.","He lowered his head and did not speak. He still had his pride.","However, the sturdy man strode over, his massive figure casting a long shadow. “Do you yield?”","By the looks of it, he was about to deliver a palm strike.","Huang Lingyun could only open his mouth, and say, “I concede.”","Only then did the sturdy man break into a grin, and said to everyone, “My name is Wu Qiyuan. I am nineteen years old this year.”","Pu!","Quite a number of people spluttered. This burly, bearded man was actually only nineteen years old? Which mountain had this savage come from?","However, those who were laughing immediately withdrew their contemptuous expressions. This Wu Qiyuan was too strong, and possessed such strength. Who could underestimate him? “Little Brother Wu, let me experience your guidance!” The young man in purple finally stood up. He smiled slightly, and was extremely gentle, as if he was harmless, “My name is Yuwen Tian. I have not fought the Galaxy Network Level Battles yet, so I have no ranking. However, I should have formed a few more Celestial Cauldrons than all of you.”","When everyone heard this, they all scoffed. What kind of joke was this? Did he think that they were all Human Cauldrons or Earth Cauldrons? And he said he had cultivated a few more Celestial Cauldrons? Wasn’t he afraid that they would laugh themelves to death?","Yuwen Tian did not argue either, and showed his Celestial Cauldron, one at a time, hovering above his head.","One, two, three... four cauldrons!","F***, instantly, everyone was stunned. Four Cauldrons, it was actually Four Cauldrons.","It was common knowledge that the peak stage of the Cauldron Forging Tier was Heaven Cauldron, and one would only need to form three cauldrons, and forming four cauldrons would be breaking the limit.","Who could break through their limits?","A prodigy among prodigies.","Hiss, this Yuwen Tian was really too shocking. He had actually formed four cauldrons. Then, even in the Galaxy Network, he would be ranked in the top thousand, at least. In fact, he would be ranked in the top seven hundred.","Who would have thought that such a monster would actually appear among them?","Wu Qiyuan scratched his head with his long and thick fingers, and said in slight confusion, “Yi, you also have four Celestial Cauldrons, huh? My crippled Master that told me to cultivate lied, and said that there would not be a thousand such people in the whole universe.”","Pu!","Everyone spluttered again.","‘Did you hear what this guy said?’","“Also.”","Hiss, this guy also had four cauldrons?","At first, Yuwen Tian’s expression was one of showing off, but now, it immediately crumbled, appearing extremely depressed.","How was their group allocated?","There were actually two Four Cauldrons!","Being able to break through his limits and form four cauldrons, and even more in fact, there were at most a thousand of them in the galaxy at present, but merely participating in a competition to enter the Holy Land, there were actually two such existences in a team of ten. What kind of bullsh*t probability was that?","Wu Qiyuan had lied?","Yuwen Tian shook his head internally. One look, and he could tell that this guy was the honest type. It was already very inconceivable that he could lie, what more when he had to speak in","such a refreshing and natural manner.","Failing to show off, Yuwen Tian sighed.","Actually, he was a very secretive person, and that was why he had been suppressing himself all this while, waiting for the best chance to make a grand appearance. He had waited for this chance, but the effects had not reached his expectations, which made him feel really","depressed.","“All right, come fight me!” His fighting spirit blazed, his eyes bright.","Wu Qiyuan would not be reserved either. With a loud roar, he charged forwards. Like a wild bull, he just barged around like that.","Though there was nothing fancy about this, his physique was astonishing. With a single step, the whole ground would shake violently with a rumble, showing his terrifying power. If one was hit like this, it was guaranteed that any Cauldron Forging Tier would be in trouble. Yuwen Tian did not dare to take it head-on either. He turned the Celestial Cauldron around, and two streaks of white and black light descended, turning into multiple barriers, while he","retreated continuously.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Wu Qiyuan charged all the way, shattering those black and white barriers, one after another. His speed was practically unaffected.","“F***, are you forged from Divine Metal? You’re practically a freak!” Yuwen Tian couldn’t","help but complain.","Yet Wu Qiyuan did not make a sound. He had grown up in the primitive areas, and battled with powerful wild beasts every day. How could he open his mouth to speak when he was fighting desperately with the wild beasts? The slightest distraction would mean death.","His battle style was extremely primitive, and that was close-quarter combat. He would use his tough physique to take the attack head-on, and then use his violent power to kill his","opponent.","Faced with such a desperate stance, Yuwen Tian was extremely depressed. All techniques were","useless in front of such a barbaric style of fighting.","This was too barbaric, and too lacking in skill.","After exchanging a few more blows, his anger had also risen. He no longer dodged, but rather","greeted the incoming attack brazenly, “Do you really think that I am afraid of you?”","He formed his hands into palms, and clashed head-on with Wu Qiyuan.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","They exchanged a dozen over blows, and both of them were trembling madly.","Wu Qiyuan bared his teeth in a grin, “How fun!” He was sent back more than thirty meters, but he merely shook his body, and then charged back again as if nothing had happened. Yet Yuwen Tian wanted to throw up blood. His physique was far from being as tough as this. This kind of head-on confrontation was too disadvantageous for him.","His expression was solemn, and with a battle cry, multiple green sword blades appeared","around him.","Wu Qiyuan charged over. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Those green-coloured blades immediately slashed towards him. The blades were too sharp, and left behind multiple wounds on his bare upper body. Though they were not very deep, they still managed to wound this bull-like guy. “Die!” However, Wu Qiyuan’s blood only caused him to become even more frenzied. His eyes were bloodshot, and his offensive became even fiercer, forcing Yuwen Tian to put his life on the line. Otherwise, if he still held back, he would definitely die. Ling Han shook his head, and strode forwards. He had to mediate the fight."]},{"number":3816,"title":"Chapter 3816: Intercession","paragraphs":["Chapter 3816: Intercession","Ling Han strode toward the battle.","“Hey, are you seeking death?”","“That is not a battle that you can interfere in.”","Two team members immediately shouted a reminder, but there were also some who watched coldly from the sidelines. In any case, as long as the number of people in the team was no less than three, it was fine. It just so happened that some trash would be eliminated. In this way, the battle prowess of the remaining people would be stronger, and the average score would naturally be higher as well.","Boom, Wu Qiyuan’s fist attacked fiercely, the tip of the fist tearing through the air, forming a large number of swirls of air, which turned into multiple eyes of the storm. That scene was like the end of the world.","This guy was incredible. He walked the path of strengthening his physical body, and in future, who knows, he may become a great elite that dazzled the universe.","Shua, shua, shua! The green-coloured blades continuously slashed onto his body, and there were flashes of blood. However, Wu Qiyuan only acted as if he did not know anything. He simply threw fierce punches, simple, direct and domineering.","Peng! The punch landed, and Yuwen Tian was instantly sent flying. However, his","counterattack was also incredibly fierce, and left behind a considerable number of wounds on Wu Qiyuan’s body, causing blood to gush out.","Now that the battle had progressed to this extent, it was really like how stabbing knives drew blood, and he was really angered.","“Ao!” Wu Qiyuan roared loudly, like a violent bear. He charged towards Yuwen Tian, his whole body wrapped in grey energy, filled with terrifying destructive power.","One side was putting his life on the line, and the other side naturally could not hold back either. Otherwise, he would either die in battle or be severely injured.","Moreover, Yuwen Tian was also filled with anger. Why did he have to retreat?","Who was afraid of whom?","He also roared loudly, and multiple golden veined patterns appeared all over his body. The four Celestial Cauldrons also unleashed endless Celestial Qi, which transformed into a Divine Sword that blasted towards Wu Yuan Sheng.","Not good.","Everyone was exclaiming internally. If this exchange of blows really came to be, the two of them would probably be in dire straits.","They hadn’t even begun hunting, yet two of their powerhouses had already been killed because of internal strife. How could they continue to compete with the other teams?","Right at this moment, Ling Han finally barged into the battle area.","In a flash, he stopped between Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian. In this way, it was equivalent to the attacks of both of them being directed at him.","Hiss!","Everyone inhaled sharply. Everyone could clearly see the strength of Yuwen Tian and Wu Qiyuan. Yet Ling Han had barged right in between the two of them, which was equivalent to suffering the combined attack of the two of them. How could he possibly block this?","Oh no, he was definitely going to die.","With how fast the attack speed of the two elites was, even if they discovered that their “opponent” had already switched to Ling Han, they could not possibly stop.","Firstly, it would be too late, and secondly, what if he stopped, but the other party did not? Then, the attack would still land on him through Ling Han.","That would be courting death.","Thus, they could only grit their teeth and continue to attack.","Ling Han moved. His speed did not seem slow, but it was as if time itself was endlessly slowing down. It could be clearly seen that his left hand had grabbed onto Yuwen Tian’s wrist, while his right hand had grabbed onto Wu Qiyuan. Then, the scene stopped.","What, what was going on?","Everyone was petrified. An earth-shattering attack from two great prodigies, and in the end, they were forced to a stop just like that.","F***!","Everyone stared at Ling Han as if they were looking at a monster. All of them felt their heads go numb, and felt their hearts constrict to the extreme.","This, this, this, this, what kind of strength did this have to be, to be able to resolve the mad exchange of blows between Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian so easily?","In other words, not only did Ling Han’s strength have to be superior to the combined strength of Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian, it had to be far superior as well. Otherwise, it could not have been so easily done.","“It’s just a competition for the position of captain. There’s no need to be so rash,” Ling Han said calmly.","On the other side, Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian were also petrified.","They were even clearer than the others, and felt that with this grab from Ling Han, they could not use the power in their bodies at all.","No, this description was inappropriate. It should be said that there seemed to be a supreme god hidden in Ling Han’s body, that they could only worship him, and could not even think of matching him.","For prodigies like them, this kind of feeling was really too terrible. The two of them hurriedly composed themselves, and finally gained some courage, but they still felt that their abilities were severely suppressed.","They couldn’t help but feel stunned. Even if their abilities were equal, how much battle prowess could they unleash against Ling Han?","This was too terrifying. This guy who did not say a word was the most awesome person.","This naturally was because of the Celestial Cauldron in Ling Han’s body. That level far surpassed Golden Celestial Cauldron. In a situation when cultivation level was equal, anyone","would be affected.","“You’re not going to fight anymore?” Ling Han smiled, and looked towards Yuwen Tian.","Yuwen Tian was extremely depressed. He had wanted to show off, and in the end, he had encountered someone who could show off even more. Now, all the limelight had been stolen by Ling Han, so how could he not be depressed? However, Ling Han was too strong, so what","could he say?","“I’m not fighting anymore,” he said honestly.","Ling Han nodded, then turned to look at Wu Qiyuan, “What about you?”","Wu Qiyuan scratched his head, “You are stronger than me, so I will listen to you.”","Ling Han smiled, and at the same time, loosened his hands, and said, “We’re all in the same group. At least, in these ten days, we’ll work together.”","“Yes, yes, yes. We should, we should,” Huang Lingyun hurriedly said. “In future, we’ll all listen to... this captain.”","He still didn’t know who Ling Han was, but he definitely had to cling to this powerful backer. He was too strong. He was probably ranked in the top 700 on the Galaxy Network, or perhaps","even higher.","Ling Han shook his head, “I have no interest in becoming a captain. It would be better for you to do it.” He pointed at Yuwen Tian.","“Ah?” Yuwen Tian pointed at himself, slightly surprised.","Ling Han actually didn’t want to be the captain; he really was purely here to mediate the fight.","He indeed wanted to become a captain, but that was because of his temperament. He wanted to display his abilities, and show off a bit, so that others would look at him in reverence and worship, but now, Ling Han had let him have the position. All of a sudden, he had lost the meaning and pleasure of showing off.","“I don’t want to be one,” he shook his head.","“Then you go.” Ling Han looked towards Wu Qiyuan again.","“I’m not as strong as you. I don’t deserve it! I don’t deserve it!” Wu Qiyuan also shook his","head.","Ling Han couldn’t be bothered to be the captain, so he turned to Mu Long, and said, “Then","you can do it.”","“I-“Mu Long also wanted to refuse. There were three great gods in this team, and he, as the captain, could not command them at all. Then what was the point of being one?","But he had just opened his mouth, when he realized that Ling Han’s eyes had turned harsh. Instantly, he stopped abruptly, and did not dare continue.","“Alright, you’re the captain,” Ling Han said. “Let’s begin hunting.”","Hearing him speak of serious matters, everyone was solemn. No matter who was the captain,","they had to hurry up and hunt fierce beasts. Otherwise, without enough points, they would all","be eliminated.","“Let’s go,” Mu Long forced himself to say. With a wave of his hand, he led the way.","The hunting team began to move, searching for traces of the wild beasts, and then began their","attack.","In this aspect, Wu Qiyuan had played a very important role."]},{"number":3817,"title":"Chapter 3817: Six Cauldron-level Giant Frog","paragraphs":["Chapter 3817: Six Cauldron-level Giant Frog","Wu Qiyuan had been battling in the primitive forest since childhood. To him, wild beasts were far more familiar than humans.","What was a fierce beast?","For those living creatures that had cultivated and gained intelligence like the large black dog, they were called Demonic Beasts, while fierce beasts had walked the path of cultivation, but they had not developed intelligence and only knew slaughter.","This was very strange. They could clearly cultivate, and were in fact incredibly strong, yet they were muddleheaded, and could only act according to their instincts.","It could only be said that the heaven and earth was amazing.","Wu Qiyuan was extremely good at searching for traces of wild beasts. Furthermore, he only needed the slightest bit of information to be able to determine the strength of this wild beast. This kind of ability was really too useful. In a single day, the small team had killed a total of thirteen wild beasts, and it could be said that their battle results were quite bountiful.","Thirteen was really quite a number, because they had killed Cauldron Forging Tier-level fierce beasts. How many such existences were there in the whole Barbaric Planet? And just how big was the Barbaric Planet? It had only been a single day, and they had already gained so much. This was really commendable.","At night, they did not make another move.","It wasn’t that they didn’t want to, but that after night fell, those stronger wild beasts seemed to have all jumped out of their lairs at once. It was really too dangerous.","They saw a massive four-winged bat streak across the skies, its wingspan as wide as thirty thousand meters, completely covering the moon. A soundwave was sent out, and the mountains and forests collapsed, looking extremely terrifying.","This was most likely the first Core Formation Tier wild beast, and it was recklessly searching for its prey. However, it had just flown over a mountain when a crimson streak was seen shooting out from the forest. It wrapped around the giant bat, and with a shua, brought it back to the ground. After that, there was no more movement.","The strong preyed on the weak, and this was the law of the jungle.","Who would dare to run around on such a dangerous night?","They didn’t even dare to light a fire, nor did they dare to rest on a tree. They all dug a hole and buried themselves in it.","This was the safest method now.","A night passed, and in the early morning, everyone began to cultivate under the rising sun. The difference was too great.","For example, when Ling Han, Yuwen Tian, and Wu Qiyuan were cultivating, it was as if the three of them had turned into three massive whirlpools that were continuously absorbing the power of heaven and earth in the surroundings. Compared to them, the others were like a tiny splash of water, and the gulf between them was boundless.","Everyone could not help but be impressed by this. Ling Han and his group’s crushing strength was not without reason.","After they finished cultivating, they began to hunt.","“There is a large one,” Wu Qiyuan said. They were presently in a forest, and there were traces of battle all around them. “Two fierce beasts had an intense battle, and one of them won. Going by my deduction, the one that won should have the battle prowess of Six Cauldrons, but its opponent was not weak either, causing it to be severely injured.”","“Should we take the risk to battle?”","An equivalent to Six Cauldrons?","Everyone was stunned. Was this an opponent that they could contend against?","With a difference of one cauldron of cultivation level, the difference in battle prowess was overwhelming, and even Yuwen Tian and Wu Qiyuan only had four cauldrons, which was a whole two cauldrons of difference in cultivation level.","All of a sudden, everyone’s eyes were focused on Ling Han.","None of them knew exactly what cultivation level Ling Han was at. However, to be able to easily crush Yuwen Tian and Wu Qiyuan, he had to be at least Five Cauldrons.","Five Cauldrons against Six Cauldrons, though they were still at a disadvantage, Wu Qiyuan had also said that this ferocious creature had been severely injured, so its abilities should have dropped from the level of Six Cauldrons. Added with the fact that there were still nine of them, if they worked together, there might be a chance.","On the other hand, if they could kill a Six Cauldrons-level vicious beast, how many points would they get?","Riches were found in danger.","Ling Han smiled, and said, “All right, let’s go and take a look.”","Wu Qiyuan led the way, and everyone followed behind him, following the tracks left behind by that fierce beast.","After walking for quite a while, a lake appeared in front of them. The lake was not very big, and its widest area was only about 2.5 km wide. The lake waters were dark green, and there were large amounts of algae growing in the lake, blocking vision and preventing one from seeing into the depths beneath the surface of the water.","“The trail ends here.” Wu Qiyuan sniffed here and there, “My guess is that this fierce beast should be in the lake.”","“All right, let’s force it out,” Yuwen Tian said. He took out a sword, and with the surge of mystical power, the veined patterns on the blade all lit up.","He raised his sword, and shua, swept it towards the lake.","The green Sword Qi was like lightning as it shot into the lake, immediately scooping up a wall of water that rushed up the riverbank, causing the water level of the lake’s surface to drop","greatly.","“Gua!” A strange cry rang out, and a colossal creature scuttled out of the lake. It was as big as a house, and was actually a frog!","This frog was completely dark green in colour, but from its head all the way to its back, there were multiple blood-coloured veined patterns, which added a bit of viciousness to it. And on the chest of this giant frog, there was a very deep wound, which was still bleeding, though the amount was relatively small.","The giant frog rolled its eyes, and immediately focused on Ling Han and his group.","“Gua!” It suddenly charged out, and with a leap, jumped high into the air. Then, it rapidly descended, as if it wanted to use its colossal size to crush everyone to death.","Everyone hurriedly dispersed. Even Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian were no exception. This giant frog could possibly possess a battle prowess of Six Cauldrons. Even if it was severely injured now, it was probably still equivalent to a Five Cauldrons elite.","Blocking it head-on was an action of courting death.","Only Ling Han didn’t retreat. His eyes narrowed slightly, and his fists were already clenched","tightly.","He wanted to see what level his current strength was equivalent to.","Xiu, with a leap, he charged towards the giant frog.","The speed of the man and frog was astonishingly fast, so naturally, they immediately crashed","into each other. Frightening power collided, and masses of seals exploded. Everyone felt that the light was blinding, and could not see anything clearly.","Peng! Two shadows shot out of the ball of light, one large and one small. They were none","other than the giant frog and Ling Han.","No way!","The nine team members stared at the same time. Ling Han was actually capable of engaging","in a contest of strength with this giant frog?","Ling Han laughed loudly, filled with confidence. In terms of power, he was not the slightest","bit inferior to this giant frog, but he was naturally going to win.","In a contest of celestial techniques and mystical power, who would he be afraid of?","His figure landed on the ground, and he immediately exerted force with his feet. Imminent Skyline activated, and he charged towards the giant frog again.","The giant frog was extremely ferocious, and with a croak, a visible soundwave surged over. Pa, pa, pa, pa! There were fine particles in the air, but they were all shattered by this","soundwave.","Ling Han’s momentum was instantly halted. The powerful soundwave was even capable of","blasting him to burst.","But in the next instant, Starlight Screen appeared on Ling Han’s body, blocking the impact of","the soundwave.","The giant frog showed a hint of wariness. Even if the wild beast had not developed intelligence, its instincts of survival allowed it to realize that its opponent was not to be trifled with. It lowered its head. Xiu, xiu, xiu! The blood veined patterns on its back actually came to life, and multiple streaks of blood shot out, blasting towards Ling Han. Ling Han was unafraid, brandishing his fists in response. The Heavenly Dao Flames wrapped","around him, and had astonishingly high temperatures. Those bloody streaks evaporated completely before they could even approach.","Finally, he charged close enough, and began a physical battle with the giant frog."]},{"number":3818,"title":"Chapter 3818: Demon Core","paragraphs":["Chapter 3818: Demon Core","Even though the giant frog was huge, its movements were extremely agile. It pounced and jumped. Sometimes, it would stand on its hind legs, and its two front legs would rapidly swat at Ling Han. It was like a palm technique Grandmaster. Sometimes, it would lie down on all fours, and open its mouth to spit out a long tongue. That was like a fierce spear, its penetrating power incredibly terrifying. It could even just barely pierce through the Starlight Screen.","However, this kind of attack was also very taxing on the giant frog. It could not use it continuously, and could only attack suddenly, which was even more threatening.","Of course, Ling Han’s attack power was not to be outdone either. The level of the Heavenly Dao Flames was extremely high, and as the fist force blasted out, this giant frog was extremely wary, and had to dodge. Otherwise, this would be able to blast out a charred hole with a single blow.","Both sides were wary of each other, and the battle instantly became drawn out.","“Let’s go!” Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian exchanged a look, then leaped up and joined the battle.","However, the others did not make a move.","It wasn’t that they didn’t want to attack, but that they didn’t have the right to. At least, when the battle prowess of Five Cauldrons blasted over, they were only Heaven Cauldrons and Earth Cauldrons, so how could they withstand it?","Actually, if Ling Han went all out, it wasn’t that he couldn’t defeat this giant frog, but there was no need.","This wasn’t a test for him alone, so why did he have to do everything?","Moreover, it was naturally better for fewer people to know his ultimate moves. If there was no need, why would he use it?","With the addition of Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian, the three of them joined forces, and the giant frog instantly fell into a disadvantage.","With Ling Han holding it back, his battle prowess of Four Cauldrons could be unleashed to his heart’s content. How could this kind of destructive power be underestimated?","“Gua!” The giant frog shouted loudly, and the soundwaves turned into waves.","This was an area-of-effect attack, and was precisely a weapon to deal with mass attacks.","Ling Han was naturally unafraid, and Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian both had their own ways of dispersing the soundwaves. They both drew out their respective Spirit Tools to block the soundwave attacks.","Next, they launched a powerful counterattack.","After a few dozen moves, the giant frog was already struggling. It was already injured in the first place, and now that it was being ganged up on by the three of them, its injuries were compounded, so it naturally couldn’t hold on any longer.","“Gua!” The giant frog began to fight with its life on the line. It stuck out its tongue madly, like a divine spear committing violence. It could almost be claimed to be indestructible. Even the Starlight Screen could not block it. It was really very powerful.","Ling Han and the others didn’t face this head-on, and they continued to wander around. This kind of explosive power definitely wouldn’t last for long.","The giant frog took advantage of the opening to flee, but Ling Han and the others had caught up again, so it could only continue to put its life on the line.","Another dozen over minutes later, the giant frog was finally unable to continue, and was killed by the powerful attacks of Ling Han and the others.","“Phew, it’s finally taken care of.” Yuwen Tian panted heavily. There were also some injuries on his body. They had been left behind from the intense battle, but they were all light injuries.","Wu Qiyuan was not much better off either. His battle style was rougher than Yuwen Tian’s, so his injuries were even heavier. However, his physique was tough, so this little injury naturally did not matter.","Only Ling Han was an exception. In fact, he could deal with that giant frog all by himself. Thus, it was naturally impossible for him to suffer any injuries. He appeared to be extremely relaxed, and did not look like he had just fought a great battle at all.","Huang Lingyun and the others all gathered around it, and began to cut open this giant frog. The flesh and blood of a fierce beast of this level was extremely nutritious, so how could it be wasted?","“Yi, there is actually a Demon Core!” Mu Long suddenly called out, looking very excited. “What Demon Core?” Ling Han swept an eye over it, and saw that Mu Long was holding a dark green bead in his hand. It was only the size of a walnut.","“Brother Ling, don’t you know about Demon Cores?” Yuwen Tian asked in surprise.","“I really don’t know.” Ling Han shook his head.","“Demon Core can only be nurtured by this kind of fierce beast. Usually, they have special effects, such as protection against fire or cold. Some can even be used to concoct alchemical pills and formations. Their value is astonishing,” Yuwen Tian explained.","Ling Han was astounded. He really didn’t know that there was such a thing as Demon Core, and they were extremely valuable.","Actually, this was also because Demon Cores were really too rare. There may not even be one in a hundred fierce beasts that could nurture them, and the fierce beasts that possessed Demon Cores would also be extraordinarily powerful.","Mu Long delivered the Demon Core over. Though everyone wanted it, it was Ling Han and the others that had killed the giant frog this time. The others were not even qualified to receive the benefits.","Ling Han carefully examined the green bead, yet he couldn’t find anything special about it. He connected to the Galaxy Network, entered the information of the giant frog, and conducted a search. Finally, he found something.","It was extremely likely that this was the Poison Neutralization Pearl, which, according to its name, could neutralize poison. Moreover, though this was nurtured by a giant frog of Cauldron Forging Tier, it could neutralize poison on the level of the Core Formation Tier, at most. However, this would require the Poison Neutralization Pearl to be crushed and swallowed, unlike neutralizing other poisons, when one only had to hold the Poison Neutralization Pearll in one’s mouth or stick it on the wound.","“Haha, our luck is not too bad. We actually encountered a fierce beast that nurtured a Demon Core.” Laughter rang out, and five men walked out of the dense forest.","Seeing Ling Han and the others look over, one of the men’s expressions turned cold, “What are you standing around for? Hurry up and hand over the Demon Core!”","“Then, obediently destroy the connection device, so as to avoid suffering a little,” another man said.","Heh, this was both to decrease the number of competitors, and at the same time, to earn a","Demon Core.","“Fang Ming!” Huang Lingyun recognized one of the men, and immediately introduced him to the others, “An elite ranked in the 6000s on the Galaxy Network.”","Fang Ming crossed his arms behind his back, fully displaying his arrogance, “Since you know who I am, what are you still standing around for?”","Why was there only five people in their team?","That was because the other five were too weak. Fang Ming and the others felt that they were a burden, so they destroyed all their connection devices. From a certain aspect, teammates","were also competitors.","Five people was enough.","However, Huang Lingyun and the others were unafraid, because there were three freaks in their group. What was the Galaxy Network ranking above 6000 worth? It was completely not","enough.","“En?” Fang Ming and the others were slightly surprised. These people were actually unafraid","of them?","“Very well, youngsters nowadays really don’t know the immensity of the world.” A red- clothed man walked out, his expression dark. He pointed at a member of Ling Han’s group,","and shouted, “Kneel!”","“F***, what arrogance!” Yuwen Tian said slowly, a slight hint of mockery on his face. He finally had a chance to show off. This was great.","“Who do you think you are?” the red-clothed man asked coldly.","“I’m your uncle!” Yuwen Tian said with a smile.","The red-clothed man couldn’t help but look furious. He laughed loudly towards the sky, then","turned back to look at Yuwen Tian, “Though killing is forbidden here, there is no such thing as no beating. Hehe, a loose tongue causes trouble. I will make you feel extreme regret.” “Your uncle will always be your uncle. Come, grandson!” Yuwen Tian crooked a finger, his attitude extremely disdainful.","The red-clothed man humphed, and strode towards Yuwen Tian.","“Kneel!” he shouted loudly. He sent out a palm strike, and the light of lightning blazed."]},{"number":3819,"title":"Chapter 3819: Beast tide","paragraphs":["Chapter 3819: Beast tide","The red-clothed man’s attack arrived, while Yuwen Tian laughed loudly, and delivered a slap back at the red-clothed man.","Pa, with a palm strike, the red-clothed man was sent flying.","A figure streaked past, and pa, fell onto the ground, motionless.","This!","The faces of Fang Ping and the others twitched, and there was deep fear in their eyes.","He had sent their companion flying with a single slap. What kind of strength was that? Oh no, they had kicked an iron plate.","Yuwen Tian’s desire to show off had already soared to the heavens. Crossing his arms behind his back, he walked towards Fang Ping and the others, “How is it? Does anyone else want me to kneel?”","“Heh, apologies for the lack of manners!” Fang Ping clasped his hands in obeisance, and signalled at his three companions. The four of them turned around and fled at the same time. Run, this man was very likely to be ranked in the top 5000 in the Galaxy Network, or even ranked higher than that. They couldn’t fight him head-on.","“Little Wu, give me a hand!” Yuwen Tian called out, as he broke out into a run in pursuit.","“All right!” Wu Qiyuan also charged out, his body like a wild bull. Hong long long long, even the ground beneath his feet was reverberating endlessly.","The two of them attacked, and Fang Ping and the others couldn’t escape at all. They were forcefully stopped.","Since these people had made the first move, Yuwen Tian didn’t mind doing the same. After showing off for a while and robbing the five of them, he destroyed the connection devices of Fang Ping and the others. In this way, the five of them were eliminated.","Fang Ping and the others left angrily, but they did not dare to say anything. Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian were too strong. At least for now, they were completely outmatched.","“Come, let’s continue,” Ling Han said with a smile.","They continued to hunt fierce beasts, but though they killed a considerable number in a day, they did not encounter any more fierce beasts that had nurtured Demon Cores.","At night, they still dug a pit to sleep in. After a night, the sky gradually became lighter, and they welcomed the rising sun to cultivate, just like how it had been in the past.","During daytime, they continued to hunt. It was really as if they had become people who were earning a living in the primitive forest.","On the fifth day, they walked out of the forest, and a massive grassy plain appeared ahead of them. This grass was as tall as a man. If they did not jump, their vision would be greatly affected, and they would not be able to see very far at all.","Ling Han and the others then stepped on the grass. To Cauldron Forging Tiers, as long as they had the slightest bit of power to lend, they would be able to walk on air, so treading on grass was naturally even less of a problem.","They continued to hunt, and their gains were quite bountiful. There was a kind of wild beast in the grassland that was similar to a wild bull, but it had a triangular shape, six legs, and was in groups of three to five. It was just right to be hunted by a small team.","And in this manner, the seventh day had arrived.","On this day, they continued their pursuit as per usual, but all of a sudden, everyone felt a powerful tremor take place in the ground.","“What’s going on?”","The ten people were all confused. At first, they thought that a great battle was happening in the distance. A battle on the level of Cauldron Forging Tier was completely capable of causing such an effect, but very soon, the trembling became more and more intense. The grass rose and fell like waves.","“Look!”","Wu Qiyuan pointed at the sky, and saw that innumerable black shadows had appeared in the horizon. Because they were really too far away, he could not see clearly what exactly they","were.","“To be able to see it clearly from so far away, its body must be incredibly massive.”","“Are they the ones that caused the ground to tremble?”","In a short while, the silhouettes of those black shadows were fully revealed. They were at least","a few thousand winged lions, and their size was astonishingly huge. Even at such a far","distance, a terrifying vicious might still spread out.","In the team, some people with weaker abilities were already weak in the knees. This was because they had been intimidated by the ferocious might. It was completely the suppression on the level of being.","“Hurry up and crouch down. These fierce beasts are hunting for food!” Wu Qiyuan shouted. Everyone hurriedly jumped down from the blades of grass and hid among the grass.","These lion beasts were at least Four Cauldrons and Five Cauldrons-level. Otherwise, they could not possibly have such terrifying vicious might. One or two was not much, but if several thousand of them charged up at the same time, who would be able to withstand them?","Even Ling Han couldn’t.","However, the rumbling of the ground became more and more intense, and the ground fluctuated like a carpet.","“That’s not right!” Ling Han frowned. Those lion beasts were flying in the skies, so no matter how strong they were, how could it possibly cause the ground to tremble like this?","He flew on his Tool, and arrived at a higher position. His eyes swept over, and his expression instantly changed.","“Run!” he shouted towards the ground. Then, he immediately turned around. Xiu, he rapidly flew away.","Everyone didn’t understand the situation, but since even Ling Han had fled in such a panic, how could they dare not to flee?","Thus, they all flew on their respective Tools, following closely behind Ling Han.","After rising into the air, they naturally turned around to look, and what they saw shocked them all.","On the horizon, there were innumerable wild bulls charging towards them. Their numbers were at least in the hundreds of thousands, and what caused them to run so madly was those lion beasts in the skies. Occasionally, they would swoop down and grab hold of a wild bull, which they would instantly tear into pieces, which were then shared among a great many lion","beasts.","It was terrible. They had encountered a herd of lion beasts hunting and feeding, and the herd of wild bulls still ran towards them, dragging them into the water as well.","Whether it was a few thousand lion beasts, or over a hundred thousand bulls, these were all incredibly terrifying. They could easily destroy their team.","-Even if everyone that had entered here joined forces, they could only retreat in the face of","such a situation.","Xiu, a crimson light shot over from the distance.","“Ah!” One of their teammates instantly released a terrible scream. He had been struck by the crimson light, and there was shockingly a bloody hole in his lower abdomen. He collapsed","onto the ground.","Ling Han was already too late to save him. Hurriedly, he connected to the device and said, “Hurry up and call for help!”","At this time, aside from the great elites of the Holy Land, who else would dare to save him?","He could only give up.","He looked towards that group of lion beasts. It was one of them that had shot out a crimson light, easily injuring one of them severely.","With such a great distance separating them, the might of this strike was still so powerful. That lion beast had to be at least Six Cauldrons in cultivation level.","F***, in the entire universe, there were only a mere thousand cultivators that had reached Four Cauldrons, so why would fierce beasts reach Five Cauldrons or Six Cauldrons at the drop","of a hat?","“The cultivation system of fierce beasts is different. Their growth is completely determined","by their bloodline. What level they should reach, and what level they can reach after growth, would not be affected by natural talent or whatnot. However, once they reach the upper limit of their bloodline, they will lose the possibility of advancing further.”","This was what Wu Qiyuan said through the connection device. To think that he was still in the mood to explain to Ling Han after hearing Ling Han’s mutterings.","So that was the case.","Yi, could those seven babies be considered fierce beasts?","They didn’t need to cultivate, but their cultivation level was steadily increasing. Even the","Innate Saint Physique couldn’t do this. It was completely in line with the upgrade mode of","wild beasts.","However, if they were to be called vicious beasts, all of them had outstanding intelligence, and were completely different from vicious beasts.","This was extremely strange.","Ling Han gathered his idle thoughts, and hurriedly descended from the skies. Then, he put","away the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Flying in the skies was even more unsafe, completely becoming a live target for the lion beasts. He could still disperse one or two attacks, but what if there were a few dozen, or even a few hundred?","He had best just obediently run on the ground."]},{"number":3820,"title":"Chapter 3820: Running for Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 3820: Running for Life","The benefit of flying on a Tool was actually in “flying”, and not that there would be any increase in speed.","Thus, this plain didn’t have any earth-shattering obstacles, and one didn’t need to fly or leap over it. Thus, using one’s feet to run on the ground wasn’t slow at all.","They ran quickly, and as expected, they were no longer attacked by the lion beasts.","The nine of them rejoiced for a moment, but good times didn’t last long. They immediately discovered another problem.","The herd of bulls!","Their speed was too fast, so fast that it actually surpassed the speed at which they were running, and was closing the distance between them.","This was too dangerous. If they were rammed by the herd of bulls, then even elites of the Core Formation Tier would probably be rammed to death and trampled to death.","There were too many bulls, at least over a hundred thousand. What Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator would be able to withstand them?","“F***, how could a bull’s speed be so fast?”","“Six legs?”","“What do we do now?”","If they continued to run forward, with the speed of the bulls, they would definitely catch up to them. However, if they ran to either side, avoiding the direction in which the bulls fled, this would also be a huge problem. That was because the distance they ran diagonally would definitely be very long. Perhaps, they would be caught up to before they could even run out of the area where the bulls were charging.","“We still have to separate to the two sides. If the bulls really catch up to us, we’ll fly on our Tools. We’ll be at a super low altitude, just enough so we don’t get hit by the bulls.” Ling Han came up with an idea.","“All right!” Everyone nodded. This was also the only way out.","“Take care!” everyone said through the connection device.","In this kind of situation when they were fleeing for their lives, it was absolutely impossible for them to continue staying together. If they insisted that they wait for the others, that would really be a suicidal action.","They all ran towards the left, not daring to miss too much, or they would soon be caught up by the bulls.","Thankfully, though the bulls ran faster than them, they did not surpass them by much. Thus, for the moment, there was no need to worry that they would be crushed by the bulls.","In the process of running, they discovered that other teams had been startled and jumped out of the bushes, and joined the team that was fleeing for their lives.","-If any team dared to stay and fight, that would be like a mantis trying to stop a chariot, and would only be crushed into dust.","After so many days, the majority of the teams had walked out of the forest and entered into the great grassland. Thus, they were all implicated, and joined in on this majestic great flight.","Some reacted slightly slower, and were immediately drowned in the wild beasts. It was unknown whether they had been trampled to death, or if they had called for help in time, and were rescued.","In short, hunters like them had all become prey, and could only flee for their lives. Ling Han was separated from the others. At present, everyone was busy taking care of themselves, so how could they have the time to care about others?","He used the Imminent Skyline, and his speed was astonishingly fast. After more than ten minutes, he had arrived at the periphery of the herd of bulls. He only had to jump a few more times, and he would be able to leave the danger zone.","But right at this moment, xiu, a crimson light shot over.","Ling Han activated the Starlight Screen and blocked this attack. He turned around and saw a lion beast staring at him.","‘F*ck! There’s beef everywhere, yet you’re not eating it? Why are you targeting me?’","It was tired of eating beef, and wanted a change of tastes?","This lion beast opened its mouth, and another crimson light shot out, heading straight for Ling Han.","Ling Han still used the Starlight Screen to block, but the destructive power of the crimson light was too terrifying. With a single strike, the light screen was shattered.","This guy’s strength was not inferior to the giant frog from before.","Actually, Ling Han wasn’t afraid of a battle, but once the battle began, he would be surrounded. This was naturally an incredibly stupid thing to do.","“I’ll remember you!” Ling Han said. He didn’t even turn around as he ran toward the side.","Perhaps that lion beast really wanted a change of tastes too much. It actually flapped its wings and left the lion’s pride, setting off in pursuit of Ling Han and the others.","Was it seeking death?","Ling Han sneered internally. As long as you leave the main troops, just see if I won’t beat you up forcefully.","As he thought this, he continued to sprint, but did not cast the Imminent Skyline, slowing down his speed to avoid being lost by that lion.","One pursued relentlessly, while the other had the intention to draw the other away. Naturally, they maintained the situation of neither leaving nor abandoning each other.","After running for a while longer, Ling Han decided to get started.","He suddenly stopped, turned around, and faced that fierce beast in the skies.","The lion beast flapped its wings, and slowly descended. It raised its head, looking incredibly","arrogant.","It was a top-notch predator, and had the pride of a king of beasts in its bones.","Ling Han cracked his knuckles, “Come, I’ll teach you how to behave today.”","The intelligence of the lion beast was limited. It did not pursue Ling Han because it thought that this new prey was interesting, but rather really wanted a change of taste. What need was there for it to be so smug about its prey? Thus, it immediately charged towards Ling Han. Opening its mouth, xiu, xiu, xiu, the crimson light slashed out madly.","Ling Han shot out a punch, shattering the streaks of crimson light, and when the last streak of crimson light was dispersed, the lion beast had already charged over. Spreading out its wings, it quickly turned around, and a wing sliced towards Ling Han.","This was like a Spirit Tool Divine Saber. The tip of its wing emitted a light like cold iron, and","was definitely capable of slicing through iron as if it was mud.","Ling Han humphed, and Destructive Energy wrapped around his fists. He directly used Demonic Monkey Fists.","There was only one move, but this was an Imperial Technique, and one punch was enough.","Peng!","The punch landed, and the lion beast was instantly sent flying, landing heavily on the ground. Then, it flapped its wings rapidly, its four legs kicking rapidly. However, as if it was drunk, it was completely tossed around on the ground, unable to stand up at all.","In just half a minute, it stopped moving, and lay quietly on the ground.","Large amounts of blood gushed out of its chest, and its life was cut off.","Ling Han also flopped onto the ground. Even though it was only a single punch, it seemed to have sucked out all his energy.","If there were still enemies, he would definitely be able to fight again, but for a very long time, it would be impossible for him to channel the Demonic Monkey Fists.","Imperial Technique. That was a supreme technique that only an Ancestral King could casually","cast.","After Ling Han rested for a while, he dissected the lion beast, wanting to see if there were any","Demon Core.","To his disappointment, there was none.","He didn’t waste it, either, and stored the lion beast into his Spatial Spirit Tool. This was a Cauldron Forging Tier fierce beast, and its blood and flesh were greatly nutritious, so how","could he miss it?","“I don’t know what’s going on outside, so let’s not go that way first.”","Ling Han looked around at his surroundings. He was at the foot of a mountain. This mountain was neither too tall nor too big. Compared to those colossal trees that could easily reach 3000 meters, it could only be considered a small hill.","He strode forwards, planning to take a roundabout route.","After walking for a while, he could vaguely smell a fragrance.","As an outstanding alchemist, Ling Han was certain that this was the Celestial medicine’s","scent.","Yi, he had survived a great disaster, so a Celestial medicine was going to bestowed on him? Ling Han naturally wouldn’t miss it. He followed the fragrance, and soon, a cave appeared in front of him. The fragrance was coming from within the cave.","The Celestial medicine was inside the cave.","Ling Han pondered for a moment. He didn’t act rashly. Instead, he temporarily shut down the connection device. Then, he took out the Void Beast hide and put it on. He then headed into the cave.","There were many powerful wild beasts here, so he had to be careful."]},{"number":3821,"title":"Chapter 3821: Dragon Grass, Earth Spirit Milk","paragraphs":["Chapter 3821: Dragon Grass, Earth Spirit Milk","Better safe than sorry.","Ling Han was confident, but definitely not conceited. If he still had overwhelming confidence in such a dangerous place, that would only be courting death.","He entered into the cave, and searched for the Celestial medicine.","-The Celestial medicine’s medicinal fragrance, he could smell it from miles away, so with the sharp nose of a fierce beast, how could a fierce beast not smell it?","Thus, Ling Han would rather believe that there was something fishy going on than believe that this was really a coincidence. It just so happened that when he passed by, the Celestial medicine had ripened.","He walked slowly, and not long after, he arrived at the depths of the cave. Though this was not the end, it was pitch-black, and the medicinal fragrance was incredibly strong.","Ling Han activated his eye technique. The darkness naturally couldn’t stop him. He could clearly see that there was a plant that was half the height of a human that was growing healthily, and there was a green flower blooming at the top. It was precisely this that was exuding refreshing fragrance.","Dragon Grass!","Ling Han thought internally. It was said that the Dragon Grass had transformed from an ordinary Spiritual Herb into a Celestial medicine because it had been contaminated with the saliva of the Immortal Dragon so it was extremely effective in healing injuries, but that should have been fabricated.","He looked again, and a smile appeared at the corners of his lips.","Beside the Dragon Grass, there were multiple beast bones. Upon counting, there were at least","a few dozen, as if they were worshipping that Celestial medicine.","As expected, Ling Han confirmed internally. He released his divine sense, and searched carefully.","Found it.","Ling Han looked towards a corner and activated his eye technique. He immediately saw something different.","A... er, something that looked like mud was presently adhering to the rock. It was a very thin layer, and covered an extremely large area. However, Ling Han saw it with his eye technique, and discovered that this was not mud, but rather a fierce beast.","This guy used the Celestial medicine to lure other fierce beasts into this space, and then took advantage of the opening to attack and devour its prey.","The white bones on the ground were clear proof of this.","A smile tugged at the corners of Ling Han’s lips. It had always been this ferocious beast hiding in the shadows, waiting for an opportunity to sneak attack, but now, it was the other way round. He was the hunter that was hiding in the shadows.","He snuck over quietly, very, very slowly.","When they were extremely close, this fierce beast seemed to have sensed something, and instantly reacted.","It “floated”. At first, it was like a film, but now, it had turned into a long ball. It had short legs, and there were quite a number of them. It looked like an insect.","This insect didn’t have eyes, nor did it have a nose, mouth, or ears. However, its head was turning around, as if it wanted to find Ling Han.","Its senses were very sensitive.","Ling Han had already seen through to its strength, and did not hide any further. Instead, he directly uncovered the hide of the Void Beast, and began his attack.","Peng, his fist landed on the body of that fierce beast, but the strange thing was that it was actually empty without any place to exert force, and that fierce beast had turned into soft clay that actually wrapped around his fist, and then spread out towards his arm.","Ling Han immediately felt a burning sensation on his hand. That was the ferocious beast","tearing open his skin, wanting to suck out his blood and flesh.","Hiss, this fierce beast was really cruel. It did not kill its prey first before slowly feeding on it, but rather directly devoured its prey’s flesh and blood alive.","But it should be known just how agonizing this was for his prey.","Ling Han smirked coldly. He activated Destructive Energy. Boom! Like flames, it immediately combusted on his hand.","Instantly, that fierce beast released a terrible cry. It did not have a mouth, and this was a cry on the level of divine sense.","Originally, Ling Han’s opponents would try as much as possible to avoid being touched by Destructive Energy. That would be too terrifying, but this ferocious beast chose to approach him on its own volition, and was so determined to seek death. Who could it blame?","The ferocious beast hurriedly retreated. It had now returned to its soft mud-like form, but there was a piece missing from its middle. Furthermore, it was still expanding. That was the Destructive Energy spreading out.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “You’ve brought this upon yourself, so how can you live?”","The beast was scared, and hurriedly fled.","Ling Han caught up to it, and shot out several punches in quick succession. The Destructive Energy boiled, and in a few moves, this fierce beast was blasted into smithereens.","Unfortunately, though this fierce beast was very strange, it did not have a Demon Core.","Ling Han shook his head, and went to pluck the flower of that Dragon Grass.","This was the part that could be used in medicine, but the body and roots would not have any effect.","Ling Han walked deeper into the cave. He was going to search carefully.","That was because though the legend of the Dragon Grass was false, and this was not produced from the saliva of the Immortal Dragon, a Celestial medicine would not grow for no reason","either.","Since the Dragon Grass had grown here, there must be a reason for it.","A blessed land, or a land of peril, could nurture a Celestial medicine, and that was always the","case.","When he arrived at the end of the cave, Ling Han’s eyes lit up. He saw a groove on a rock, which was filled with milky white liquid. When he raised his head again, he saw that there was","a stone pillar hanging down, which just happened to point at the groove.","Dripping water penetrates stone.","At present, the stone had not been penetrated, and only a groove had formed, which had also preserved the “water” that was dripping.","This was... Earth Spirit Milk.","An extremely nutritious item!","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh loudly. As expected, a place that could nurture Celestial medicines definitely corresponded to a paradise or a desolate land. He was lucky; this was a","paradise.","Earth Spirit Milk was nurtured by heaven and earth, and could nourish one’s physical body and divine sense. It was the highest grade substance to be used at the point of breaking through. Though Ling Han had bought a great many Treasured Fruits of Life through the Galaxy Network, after advancing into the Cauldron Forging Tier, the corresponding Treasured Fruits of Life were not only more than ten times more expensive, but also incredibly rare in number. There was really no lack of buyers but no one willing to sell.","Thus, this Earth Spirit Milk was truly a pleasant surprise. It was also a timely help.","That was because Ling Han was just a sliver away from breaking through, and just happened","to be in need of this kind of nutritious tonic.","He carefully put away the Earth Spirit Milk. All of a sudden, he was overwhelmed with emotion. Previously, he had seen the great battle between the wild bulls and the flying lions, and he had also participated in such a soul-stirring hunt, so he was naturally moved.","All of a sudden, he discovered an opportunity to break through.","This was very sudden, but also very natural. With his natural talent, it was not difficult for him","to break through in the first place. The hunting in the last few days, and the final flight for life, had all touched him greatly, so he naturally took this step.","Ling Han didn’t hesitate. He immediately sat down in a cross-legged position and began to","break through.","This opportunity came easily, but once he missed it, it was possible that he would need who knew how long to be able to grasp it again.","Boom, tumultuous waves instantly rose up in his body.","Four Cauldrons, breaking through the limit, the commotion would naturally not be small.","He ingested a few drops of Earth Spirit Milk to nourish himself. Then, he used his own essence to construct the fourth Celestial Cauldron.","Unlike the Foundation Building Tier, the other three Celestial Cauldrons did not obstruct him. Thus, the fourth Celestial Cauldron naturally formed into an embryonic form, and then slowly grew stronger. The body of the cauldron was rapidly forming.","Very quickly, he felt his body dry up, and hurriedly drank a few more drops.","A day later, the fourth Celestial Cauldron was more or less formed, but it was a cauldron with","no legs.","This was the end of his breakthrough.","Ling Han smiled. He was now at Four Cauldrons, and his battle prowess had increased several","times over.","If he were to battle that lion beast again now, he wouldn’t need to use the Demonic Monkey Fists at all. With the Great Overarching Heaven Technique, he would be able to kill it. He put on the connection device again to check on his teammates."]},{"number":3822,"title":"Chapter 3822: Best not to trifle with me","paragraphs":["Chapter 3822: Best not to trifle with me","“Hu, Brother Ling, you have finally appeared again.”","“Haha, I thought you had died. I worried for nothing for you.”","|| ||","Connecting to the network of the Holy Land, Ling Han immediately received a considerable number of messages.","“Are you guys all right?” Ling Han asked.","“Sigh, this is terrible. Including you, Brother Ling, there are only five of us left,” Yuwen Tian said.","Only half of them remained?","Ling Han also felt a little rueful, but when he thought about how dangerous the situation had been at that time, it was already very impressive that half of them managed to survive. “Are you all together now?” he asked.","“En, after we escaped the barrage of bulls, we’ve gotten back together. Now, the only one left is you.”","“Alright, I’ll come over right away.”","The connection device actually had many functions. As long as the map was brought out, the location of the members of the small team would be displayed, which was very convenient.","Thus, Ling Han only had to head in that direction.","He used his movement technique, and his speed was extremely fast.","Half a day later, he found Wu Qiyuan and the others. All of them had more or less gained some injuries on their bodies, which was enough to prove how terrifying that beast tide was.","Even though they had only been apart for two days, everyone still felt as if they had been reborn after a great tribulation. They had all become closer to each other.","The five people who had been eliminated were the weakest among them. For example, Yuwen Tian, Wu Qiyuan, Huang Lingyun and Mu Long were still standing here, but Luo Shan, Ma Gang and the others had been eliminated. It was unknown if they were still alive.","“Let’s continue.”","They advanced, and began hunting again.","On the afternoon of the ninth day, everyone received a message.","“Now, the scores of each team and the remaining number of people will be announced. Every ten minutes, everyone’s whereabouts will also be displayed on the map.”","Sure enough, a noticeboard appeared in the cyberspace of the Holy Land that was connected through the connecting device. The points and remaining members of each team were listed on this noticeboard.","Ling Han’s team was shockingly ranked first, with a total of 752 points. On average, each person had more than 150 points.","The second place also had 684 points, but there were still six people remaining in the team. Thus, the average score would be even lower.","The third team just happened to have 600 points, but there were only four of them. In this way, each person’s points would be 150, second only to Ling Han and the others. It was possible that the gap between them would only be a matter of killing another fierce beast. With such direct observation, everyone only had to do a slight calculation to know which teams would be eliminated, and which teams would be able to advance into the top hundred.","Most importantly, everyone’s location would appear on the map at almost all times. This was equivalent to saying, “Come, kill this group of people, and we’ll be able to squeeze into the top 100.”","This was a gamble. That was because eliminating the members of the enemy team might not necessarily allow one to squeeze into the top hundred, because as long as the other party had more than three members, then with one less member, the average score of every person would instead be higher.","One could “eliminate” other teams, and he could also “eliminate” his own people. He could also continue hunting ferocious beasts. There were various choices.","“This time, a great battle is inevitable,” Ling Han said with a shake of his head. However, he was unafraid. He was already at Four Cauldrons, and his battle prowess was at least on par with Seven Cauldrons. Was there any elite at Seven Cauldrons here?","Whether it was the total score or the average score, their team was first place. Thus, they naturally had the initiative, and continued to hunt fierce beasts, to maintain the advantage of being in the lead.","But among the other teams, the “massacre” had already begun.","From the points leaderboard, it could be clearly seen that there would be teams that would disappear from time to time, and the number of people in some teams was decreasing drastically. There was suddenly a change in the individual rankings.","At night, Ling Han and the others were just about to find a place to rest when they heard Huang Lingyun say, “Not good, there are a lot of people heading towards us.”","It could be seen that there were a great many dots on the map that were very close to them. Furthermore, these dots were very close together. Clearly, they were in the same group. Counting, there were as many as 30 of them. This was clearly not just a single team. “Haha, they actually dare to have designs on us; there will be no return for them,” Yuwen Tian said with a laugh. The flames of showing off were already burning fiercely.","Wu Qiyuan merely clenched his fists, and did not speak.","His personality was simple, and there was only one word for it-fight.","Ling Han was even more unconcerned. He was completely unperturbed, as if he had not heard anything at all.","Seeing the three generals act in this manner, Huang Lingyun was naturally relieved.","After a while, figures appeared in the surroundings, forming a circle that surrounded them.","“Hand over the connection device!” The other party didn’t waste any words.","With such a good opportunity, how could Yuwen Tian not show off?","He strode out, incredibly flamboyant, “If you want the connection device, fine. Whoever can","take three moves from me, I will consider giving it to you.”","“Hahaha!” A great many people laughed, “Idiot, we all know that your team is awesome, with the first place in points. Who would come to fight you one-on-one?”","F***, he had failed in showing off.","Yuwen Tian couldn’t help but fly into a humiliated rage. Was it easy for him to show off? Why was it always ruined?","“I’ll beat you all to burst!” he roared, and took the initiative to charge out.","“You’re seeking death!” Those people immediately moved, pressing down on Yuwen Tian.","However, Four Cauldrons was still Four Cauldrons. How could this breaking of limits be","ordinary?","A Four Cauldrons formed through cultivation was different from Four Cauldrons cultivated by wild beasts. A Four Cauldrons wild beast was indeed Four Cauldrons, but a Four Cauldrons cultivator could possibly reach the battle prowess of Five Cauldrons, or perhaps even","stronger.","Yuwen Tian’s battle prowess was close to Five Cauldrons. Compared to an ordinary Heaven Cauldron, this surpassed his cultivation level by two minor levels. This made him feel like a tiger that had entered a pack of wolves, and he could do as he pleased.","But a wolf pack was a wolf pack, after all, and not a sheep that could not resist at all.","Some of the 30 people were responsible for impeding Yuwen Tian, while others were launching powerful attacks from the rear, causing Yuwen Tian to feel immense pressure. After all, everyone who could participate in the competition was extraordinary, what more those who could last until now.","After battling for a short while, Yuwen Tian was already on the back foot, looking extremely","disheveled.","“I’m coming!” Wu Qiyuan roared, and rushed into the battle.","He was a reckless man, and barged all the way. He would basically absorb all the attacks that came his way, and his tough physique could disperse more than half of them. Then, he","launched a fierce counterattack, causing those people to dodge quickly.","However, two fierce tigers were still not enough to suppress this wolf pack.","Huang Lingyun and Mu Long also joined the battle. However, though they were ranked in the top 10,000 of the Galaxy Network, under the current circumstances, these abilities couldn’t be considered strong at all. They could only barely protect themselves.","Ling Han did not make a move, and merely watched from the sidelines.","“Brat, you have a lot of free time.” Someone set their eyes on him.","Ling Han smiled, and said, “You had best not trifle with me.”","“So what if I trifle with you?” That person refused to believe it, and walked towards Ling Han.","Ling Han sighed, and sent out a palm strike. Peng, the clothes that the person was wearing, including the connecting device, were all turned into dust.","“That’s what.”"]},{"number":3823,"title":"Chapter 3823: God Slaying Technique","paragraphs":["Chapter 3823: God Slaying Technique","It was only a single palm strike, and he had eliminated one of them.","That person was not injured, but he had instantly turned into a naked pig, which naturally made him extremely angry and embarrassed.","However, he did not dare to make a move at all.","This palm strike didn’t hurt him in the slightest. It only shattered his clothes and connection device. The difficulty level was several times higher than killing him.","How could he dare to trifle with such an elite?","He hurriedly covered his crotch with his hand, and rapidly retreated.","“Hiss, so this guy is the core of the team.” The team of thirty people all looked over. The palm strike just now was enough to prove how terrifying Ling Han was.","“Let’s attack together. We’ll deal with him first.”","“All right!”","Twenty of them directly charged over, and the remaining nine held back Yuwen Tian and the others, not giving them the chance to help Ling Han.","However, was this useful?","Ling Han looked casual, but with a single punch, one of them was blasted into a naked pig. After ten punches, half of them had already revealed their fair behinds.","This time, no one dared to make another move.","He was too strong, practically reaching a freakish extent.","“Run!”","The remaining people all broke into a run, but since Ling Han had made his move, how could he leave any that slipped through his fingers? He used the Imminent Skyline, and followed up with a punch each time he caught up to one of them. Then, he threw another ten punches, and the remaining ten people had all become naked pigs.","Looking back, Yuwen Tian and the others had also unleashed their might, suppressing their opponent.","At this point, the opposing team of 30 had been completely annihilated.","They opened the map, and saw that there were originally spots of light that were approaching them, but now, they were far away.","Obviously, though these people could not see what had happened, the spots of light of thirty people were rapidly disappearing, so they could guess.","-The five people here were too strong. They had won with a disadvantage in numbers, and defeated all their opponents.","The number one team was indeed powerful, so it was best not to trifle with them.","The night passed, and there was only one day left in the competition.","Ling Han and the others continued to hunt. On their way, they also encountered a team of four led by Lin Qi, but the two sides only met face-to-face, and did not start fighting. In the afternoon, they also encountered the team that Jie Yingqiu was in. There were actually as many as fifteen people by this beauty’s side. Clearly, they were not in the same team, yet they had gathered together because of her.","Indeed, the might of beauties could not be underestimated, especially for someone like her, who could be ranked on the Exquisite Beauty Leaderboard. There may only be one in tens of thousands of galaxies.","The closer it was to the end of the tournament, the more intense the internal strife became. Occasionally, teams would disappear, and teams would suddenly turn from six, five, or four to three. Thus, the rankings of teams changed very quickly, and the individual rankings would change drastically in an instant.","However, when the sun disappeared from the horizon, it meant the end of this competition. They had received a notice, and everyone was to gather at a certain place. There was a Transfer Formation there that would allow them to leave.","After walking for half a day, Ling Han’s group of five arrived at their destination. They saw that this was a simple camp, but there was an ancient mirror floating in the air. Occasionally, a streak of light would pass by, exuding a chilling aura.","Though vicious beasts did not have intelligence, they would instinctively seek fortune and avoid calamity. Naturally, they would avoid this base from afar.","A great many people had already returned, and there was no shortage of those who had called for help and been eliminated or those who had lost their connection devices. They had all been sent here by the people of the Nine Suns Holy Land.","This time, the teleportation wasn’t going to take place in groups of 10 people. Instead, it was going to take place in groups of 100 people. After a short while, everyone left the Barbaric Planet and reappeared in the Nine Suns Holy Land.","Those who had been eliminated in advance naturally left dejectedly, and even if they managed to hold on until the end of the competition, the majority of them would still be eliminated.","The members of the Holy Land began to tally the scores, and then listed the top hundred according to their individual score ranking.","Actually, it was not just 100, but rather 103, because the final four had the same score.","In that case, they would relax the rules a bit, and take them all in.","On the Cauldron Forging Tier’s side, there were 103, and on the Foundation Building Tier’s side, there were 102. In total, there were 205 of them. For a Holy Land, this number was not the slightest bit large. Even if in the next nine years, the recruitment number was the same, there would still only be a total of over 2000 people, which could be considered quite poor. The empress and the others all passed the test successfully, though their ranking wasn’t the highest.","Those who passed all entered into the true Nine Suns Holy Land. Disciples of the Foundation Building Tier lived in the Foundation Building Valley, disciples of the Cauldron Forging Tier were in the Cauldron Forging Mountain, and when they advanced into the Core Formation Tier, they would move to the Core Formation Sea. From the True Self Tier onwards, they would be qualified to live in the Holy Palace.","Because the Nine Suns Holy Land would only open their doors once every 10,000 years to take disciples, the gap in cultivation level was extremely obvious. Those who could live for more than 10,000 years would have to be in the True Self Tier- very few, because the True Self Tier elites would only be able to live for 10,000 years at most. Those who could live for this number of years were basically extremely lucky, and had eaten Saintly medicine that could","extend their lifespan.","However, it wasn’t that the Holy Land didn’t have Foundation Building Tiers, Cauldron Forging Tiers, or even Core Formation Tier disciples. Because some elders and the like would also secretly take disciples, while others would be the Dao Apprentice by their side, receiving guidance. As time passed, a few naturally stepped onto the path of cultivation.","Because they had just entered into the Holy Land, everyone appeared to be very low-key.","In the Holy Land, everyone used the connection device that was unique to the Holy Land. There were contribution points used internally, and to be frank, it was Universe Coins. However, one could not use Dao Stones to buy Universe Coins. Instead, one had to make a solid contribution to the Holy Land to be able to obtain contribution points.","Contribution points included achievements in martial arts, or winning honour for the Holy Land. There were quite a number of different ways.","Ling Han investigated in detail. The Nine Suns Holy Land didn’t have a Saint Master, only an","acting Saint Master.","Why?","This was a rule that the Nine Suns Saint had set all those years ago.","The ultimate technique that the Nine Suns Saint was most proud of was the Nine Suns Finger. At the time, it was practically invincible in this world. Afterwards, he had failed in his competition for the position of Ancestral King, so he focused on his studies, and cultivated an even stronger ultimate technique called the “God Slaying Technique”. However, the God Slaying Technique had not been passed on. Instead, it had been hidden somewhere by the","Nine Suns Saint.","And whoever could find the God Slaying Technique and learn it would be the Saint Master of the Nine Suns Holy Land.","Why did the Nine Suns Saint take in so few disciples, which did not match the status of a Holy Land at all? This was also one of the rules of the Nine Suns Saint. The more talented he was, the more likely he was to become a successor. This was a good opportunity to gather his limited resources and nurture out a powerful successor. Otherwise, if he went out, wouldn’t that be embarrassing the Nine Suns Saint?","Ling Han felt that this Saint was a little extreme, because even those Imperial Clans did not","have such rules. There was no Great Emperor or Ancestral King that hid their invincible techniques, and would require their descendants to expend great effort to find them.","Then, was Nine Suns Finger easy to learn?","It would be difficult.","Because this was something that only the acting Saint Master could learn, and if one wanted to become the acting Saint Master, he would first have to become a Dao Child, and then emerge victorious from nine Dao Child candidates. He would have to be the first to reach the cultivation level of Venerate Tier, and then wait until the last acting Saint Master died, or he himself stepped down from his position, to be able to succeed.","Going by this calculation, no matter how smooth it was, it would still take tens of thousands of years the present acting Saint Master had only lived for over sixty thousand years, so no matter what, he should be able to live for another twenty thousand years.","Thus, the fastest way to obtain the Saint’s celestial technique was to find the God Slaying Technique, and become the Saint Master. Then the Nine Suns Saint would naturally fall into","his hands."]},{"number":3824,"title":"Chapter 3824: Cauldron Heart Pill","paragraphs":["Chapter 3824: Cauldron Heart Pill","Every generation of disciples, including the elders and the acting Saint Masters, were all searching for the whereabouts of the God Slaying Technique, but in the past 100 million years, not a single person had succeeded.","Who knew where the Nine Suns Saint had hidden this Saint Technique?","There were even some who speculated that the Nine Suns Saint had not created this ultimate technique that was claimed to be comparable to an Imperial Technique. It was completely because of the issue of pride that he had made such an exaggeration, and in order not to slap himself in the face, he could only say that he had hid the God Slaying Technique away.","Nearly 100 million years had passed, so Ling Han naturally couldn’t deduce which one was real and which one was fake. He would believe that there really was a God Slaying Technique first.","In the Holy Land, there was a cultivation technique that could be cultivated directly. It was called Earth Mysterious Art, which was equivalent to the level of Sect Master.","For an ordinary disciple to be able to cultivate a cultivation technique on the level of Sect Master, it was clear how wealthy the Holy Land was.","And above Earth Mysterious Art, there was still Heaven Mysterious Art. This was the level of Venerate Tier, but Heaven Mysterious Art was not something that could be easily obtained. Instead, one would have to use contribution points to exchange for it, and one could only exchange for cultivation techniques that was not above his own cultivation level.","Above Heaven Mysterious Art, there was still the Absolute Yang Scroll, and this was the Saint Technique. Only a Dao Child could cultivate this technique.","Aside from that, the Holy Land also had a great many secret techniques that could be traded with contribution points, or they could try their luck on their own.","That was because you could possibly pick up a rock by the roadside, and there would be a secret technique engraved on it.","Why did they do this?","This was because they wanted to encourage their disciples to be imaginative and find the God Slaying Technique.","When he saw this, Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh. This Nine Suns Saint was toying terribly with his descendants and disciples.","Hence, in summary, there were four points: contribution points, luck, Dao Child and God Slaying Technique.","After finding the God Slaying Technique, everything would be settled. Otherwise, they could only use their contribution points to exchange for it, or try their luck, or after becoming a Dao Child, they could obtain some cultivation techniques and secret techniques.","Obviously, the difficulty of finding the God Slaying Technique was much, much too high, and becoming a Dao Child would also need time. Thus, all Ling Han could do now was try his luck or earn merit points.","Trying his luck wasn’t reliable. Earning contribution points was still the most reliable method.","Though Dao Stones could not be traded for contribution points, it did not mean that they could not be traded for other items.","For example, alchemical pills.","The standard of alchemy was also the measure of a force’s strength. If one had control of a large pile of resources, but did not have an alchemist that coulc concoct alchemical pills, that would be a massive waste.","There were more people than there were resources. Something like alchemical pills was never enough.","Thus, if he handed the alchemical pills over to the Holy Land, he would be able to exchange them for contribution points.","Ling Han planned to start from here.","He took a look. Among the two levels of Foundation Building Tier and Cauldron Forging Tier, the most expensive alchemical pill was Foundation Dissolution Pill and Cauldron Heart Pill respectively.","What was the Cauldron Heart Pill?","After ingesting it, it could form the core of a Celestial Cauldron, and help a cultivator cultivate the Celestial Cauldron. Of course, it was only a help, and did not mean definite success.","This alchemical pill was extremely difficult to concoct.","Why?","That was because the alchemist needed to have the cultivation level of at least Four Cauldrons, to be able to use the power of his own Celestial Cauldron to form a core.","However, how many alchemists were prodigies of martial arts?","Dual cultivation in alchemy and martial arts was already commendable, but to excel in both? It was naturally difficult.","Yet Ling Han smiled. Wasn’t this just prepared for him?","At present, he could no longer concoct Foundation Dissolution Pills, so he had no plans to hand over the remaining Foundation Dissolution Pills. That was because who knew if Ling Xi and the others would give birth to some grandchildren, great-grandchildren or the like for him. Thus, he had best save the Foundation Dissolution Pills. Who knew how long it would take to wait for a second person who could concoct Foundation Dissolution Pills.","The pill recipe for the Cauldron Heart Pill was also quite expensive. It was sold for 5 million Universe Coins on the Galaxy Network, and Ling Han still bought it. This was extremely practical, and also very easy to sell.","The sale of pill recipes was real-time. Ling Han had just paid, and the pill recipe had conveniently appeared in his connection device. He only had to pull it out and he would be able to check.","Ling Han studied it carefully, then meditated, and simulated it in his mind. After a few times, The already had some confidence.","He continued to buy ingredients and transported them through the Transfer Formation, spending money like water.","Sigh, Origin and the others had also become smarter. Otherwise, if he sold tickets for battles, his wealth would be rolling in.","Forget it, he would earn money by concocting alchemical pills himself. It was the same.","After buying the ingredients, Ling Han shut himself in his room and focused on concocting alchemical pills.","The empress, Lin Luo, and the others had the advantage in numbers, so they didn’t need to worry about being treated unfairly at all. Thus, Ling Han only needed to work hard to earn","contribution points now.","Even for the Alchemy Emperor, Ling Han still failed many times when he first started. However, after only two days, Ling Han had already concocted his first cauldron of Cauldron","Heart Pills.","The first time he succeeded, for Ling Han, it meant that he could no longer fail.","Ling Han continued to concoct alchemical pills. Apart from cultivating for half an hour every morning, he spent the rest of his time concocting alchemical pills.","Ten days later, he finally walked out.","He tidied himself up, then went out the doors, and ran towards the Saint Palace.","Descending the Cauldron Forging Mountain, there was a massive plaza. On one side of the","plaza was the Saint Palace.","There was a stone tablet erected in the middle of the plaza, and it was surrounded by many","people.","Yi, what was so interesting about a blank stone tablet?","Ling Han was confused. Previously, when he had entered into the Holy Land, it was not like he had not seen this stone tablet before. It was completely blank, and looked very ordinary. Was there any need for it to be surrounded by so many spectators?","He walked over, and when he heard everyone’s discussion, realization dawned on him.","As it turned out, the stone tablet wasn’t blank now. Instead, there were rows of names listed","on it.","What kind of ranking was this?","Total contribution value.","He, was this inspiring competitive spirit?","Ling Han took a look. The person ranked first was Gan Ping, the super genius ranked 188th on","the Galaxy Network. His total contribution value was 206.","The total value was regardless of expenditure, representing the extent of your contribution to","the Holy Land.","“As expected of Gan Ping. His natural talent is too terrifying. He only used three days to","master the Dragon Spirit Sword Technique.”","“That’s right, I still haven’t learnt it even now.”","“He’s ranked in the top 200 of the Galaxy Network, after all. His freakish talent is","indescribable.”","Everyone was exclaiming in shock, and Ling Han only found out after looking at the news on","the connecting device. As it turned out, seven days ago, an elder had given a public lecture, teachingthe Dragon Spirit Sword Technique, and he had been focused on concocting alchemical pills, and turned off the connecting device, so he had not received any news at all. One could earn contribution points by quickly learning a sword technique?","F***, didn’t they say that secret techniques had to be traded for contribution points, or found","through luck?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel that it was a pity. If he had known, he would have gone.","Forget it. He would first hand over the Cauldron Heart Pills.","Ling Han walked past the plaza and arrived at the entrance of the palace. There were guards here, and anyone below True Self Tier would have to first make a report.","After knowing why Ling Han had come, the guard called over a companion, and had him bring","Ling Han in to seek someone out.","The two of them soon arrived at the alchemy repository. There was an old man sitting there,","unperturbed.","“Elder Qin.” That guard bowed respectfully.","“What business do you have with me?” the old geezer asked casually.","“This disciple wishes to contribute alchemical pills.”","“Oh?” The old geezer was still completely unconcerned, “What alchemical pill?”","“Cauldron Heart Pill.”","“What!” The old geezer immediately stood up, his eyes burning."]},{"number":3825,"title":"Chapter 3825: Screwed himself over","paragraphs":["Chapter 3825: Screwed himself over","The old geezer had initially been wearing an indifferent expression, but when he heard the words “Cauldron Heart Pill”, he instantly couldn’t sit still any longer.","Cauldron Heart Pill, what kind of good thing was that? The requirements for concoction were too high.","Just ask what alchemist could reach Four Cauldrons?","To say nothing of alchemists, just in terms of cultivators, how many could cultivate to Four Cauldrons? If this was placed in the case of alchemists, it was naturally even more pitifully","rare.","Furthermore, the Cauldron Heart Pill was the same as the Foundation Dissolution Pill, and both had the requirement of cultivation level. Those who could concoct it did not mean that they could concoct both.","These conditions added together naturally made the Cauldron Heart Pill incredibly valuable. It should be known that not only could this help Human Cauldrons and Earth Cauldrons cultivate a new Celestial Cauldron, it could also help Heaven Cauldrons, Four Cauldrons, Five Cauldrons and so on cultivate even more Celestial Cauldrons.","The significance... was incredibly shocking.","Just look, how many prodigies in the entire universe had cultivated Four Cauldrons or above? Even at the current Cauldron Forging Tier, there were only a thousand of them.","Such a large universe, and there were only a thousand? It was enough to prove how difficult it was to form Four Cauldrons, and how valuable they were. In that case, the value of the Cauldron Heart Pill would naturally be reflected.","Of course, the chances of Heaven Cauldrons, Four Cauldrons and the like being able to form more Celestial Cauldrons after ingesting the pill was pitifully small, but there was still an additional sliver of possibility after all. It was assured that any Cauldron Forging Tier prodigy would fight madly for this.","“Really?” The old geezer stared at Ling Han as if he wanted nothing more than to pounce over and rob Ling Han completely.","Ling Han smiled, and took out a pill bottle which he placed on the table. There were three Cauldron Heart Pills inside.","The old geezer hurriedly snatched it over. His speed was inhumanly fast, but when he uncorked the bottle, he was very careful, and his movements were extremely slow.","He sniffed lightly at the opening of the bottle, and poured out an alchemical pill for a closer look. A look of delight instantly appeared on his old face, and he hurriedly placed the alchemical pill back into the bottle. He closed the cork tightly to prevent the medicinal effects from dispersing.","“Not bad, this really is the Cauldron Heart Pill.” The old geezer was extremely satisfied. Now, no matter how he looked at Ling Han, he found him pleasing to the eye. “Brat, what’s your name?”","“This disciple is Ling Han.”","The old geezer nodded, “That’s a good name!”","What was so good about it?","Ling Han didn’t think that there was anything special about his name, but since the old geezer praised him like this, he would play along.","“I am Yan Dong.” The old geezer introduced himself. This was actually an honor, because if others came to hand in alchemical pills, he would not even bother to speak. He would directly collect alchemical pills and give them contribution points. He would not be introducing himself like he was doing now.","Thus, the guards at the side were naturally shocked, completely unable to believe their eyes and ears.","F***, Elder Yan had changed his personality?","“Lord Yan.” Ling Han clasped his hands in greeting.","The more Yan Dong looked at Ling Han, the more he liked him. He was all smiles, “According to the rules, the Cauldron Heart Pill is a Two Star Celestial level pill. No matter how extraordinary it is, it is still too low-grade. One pill is fifty contribution points. However, I will make the decision privately, and double that for you.”","This was really quite a lot. Three pills would be 300 contribution points, which was enough to send Ling Han to the first place of the current leaderboard of contribution points.","Obviously, Yan Dong was deliberately helping Ling Han.","Ling Han hurriedly clasped his hands and said, “Thank you for your concern, Lord Yan.”","The guard at the side hurriedly reminded, and said, “It’s Elder Yan!”","Yet Yan Dong waved his hand, “It doesn’t matter what the address is.”","This was also because of Ling Han. Otherwise, if it was any other person, he would have long since sent out a slap.","He looked at Ling Han and nodded, his expression filled with praise, “You were the one who concocted this Cauldron Heart Pill, right? I can smell that fresh medicinal fragrance.”","The fact that the old geezer had been allocated here meant that he was clearly someone who knew what he was doing.","Ling Han didn’t hide it, and said, “Yes. You really have good insight.”","Naturally, it would be a waste not to flatter him.","Yan Dong laughed loudly, appearing very happy. He deliberately circled around from behind the table and patted Ling Han’s shoulder, “I know that the Cauldron Heart Pill is extremely difficult to concoct, and the pill completion rate is very low, but I still hope that you can concoct more.”","Ling Han nodded earnestly, “All right.”","“Go on.” The old geezer’s gaze was practically benevolent to the extreme.","Ling Han felt slightly embarrassed, and said, “Elder Yan, actually, I still have more Cauldron Heart Pills to hand in.”","Er!","Yan Dong’s expression suddenly became a little stiff. He had just said that the Cauldron Heart Pill was difficult to concoct and had low pill completion rate, and you f****** said that there were even more? Sigh, this was a good thing, a good thing.","The old geezer paused for a moment before asking, “More?”","“En.” Ling Han took out another bottle of Cauldron Heart Pills and placed it on the table. However, before Yan Dong could reach over to take it, he took out a third bottle.","F***!","The corner of Yan Dong’s mouth was already twitching slightly. This was the Cauldron Heart Pill, and not some ordinary alchemical pill that was commonly found on the streets. How could they be taken out one by one like this?","Aiyo, my heart.","He wanted to stretch out his hand, yet saw Ling Han take out the fourth bottle of alchemical","pills.","The old geezer was rendered speechless, and the gaze he directed at Ling Han was a little eerie. ‘You’ve f****** deliberately come to slap the old geezer’s face, haven’t you?’ However, this was not the end. Ling Han took out the fifth bottle, the sixth bottle, the seventh bottle... very soon, nineteen pill bottles were laid out on the table, and added with the bottle that Yan Dong had put away previously, there were a total of twenty bottles, making a total of sixty Cauldron Heart Pills.","Yan Dong was already numb. He examined bottle after bottle, and by the seventh bottle, his petrified face had an expression of shock.","These were naturally all Cauldron Heart Pills, and there was no problem with them at all. What shocked him was the fact that these alchemical pills were too fresh.","Freshness was naturally not a bad thing, but what did it mean? These alchemical pills were all","concocted in the short term.","There was a huge problem here.","How difficult was it to concoct the Cauldron Heart Pill?","Even if there were alchemists who could concoct it, being able to concoct a cauldron’s worth","of these alchemical pills in a month was already very impressive. However, what about Ling Han? So many alchemical pills had definitely been concocted in the last month.","What kind of alchemy ability was this?","The old geezer was so stunned that he stopped what he was doing and went into a daze again.","Ling Han waited for a while, and couldn’t help but cough lightly.","Yan Dong finally came back to his senses, and said, “Brat, I was wrong!”","This wasn’t some alchemy prodigy, but a freak, all right? He had surpassed prodigy countless","times over.","At first, he could only say that he admired Ling Han, but now, he was really treating Ling Han","like a treasure.","Actually, he did not know alchemy. He only knew how to appraise alchemical pills, but having","dealt with alchemical pills for so many years, he naturally knew the difficulty level of","concocting various alchemical pills, and that was why he was so stunned.","Ling Han smiled “shyly”. For the Alchemy Emperor, this was really no big deal.","“Er... contribution points,” he kindly reminded.","“Ah!” Only now did Yan Dong remember, but his expression immediately became ugly.","He had personally announced that he would double the contribution points for the Cauldron","Heart Pill, but that was because there were only three pills. If he privately gave Ling Han an additional 150 contribution points, none of the other higher ups would say anything about","him.","But it was different now. There were a total of 60 pills, and the contribution points involved","was 3000 points.","Three thousand points!","A great many people had earned less than this amount of contribution points in a few years,","yet it had slipped out of his hands.","Oh no, he had screwed himself over."]},{"number":3826,"title":"Chapter 3826: Three Elements Treasure Bottle Formation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3826: Three Elements Treasure Bottle Formation","When Ling Han saw this, he smiled and said, “If this makes things difficult for Elder Yan, then I’ll just accept the original price.”","For the sake of his pride, there was no way Yan Dong could accept this. How could he go back on his word to a junior?","“No need, just stick with a hundred contribution points for one.” He was someone who cared about his pride.","“Thank you, Elder Yan!” Ling Han hurriedly bowed as low as possible. He had only been pretending to be polite in the first place.","Oh no, what exactly am I doing?","The corner of Yan Dong’s mouth twitched. He wanted nothing more than to slap himself. Originally, Ling Han had already given in, so why was he so determined to save face?","He had brought this upon himself.","The old geezer felt completely ill. He waved his hand, indicating that Ling Han could leave. He wanted to be alone for a while.","The guard from before still brought Ling Han out. His face was filled with envy, and he said, “Elder Yan is famous for his strict impartiality. If you can gain Elder Yan’s recognition, there should be no one who would bully you in the future in the Holy Land.”","Ling Han smiled. Even without Yan Dong’s protection, he wasn’t afraid of anyone.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, whom had Ling Han ever been afraid of?","Ling Han was quite satisfied with this trip. In an instant, he had obtained 6000 contribution points, which could be used to redeem for some good stuff.","He told the guard that he wanted to sit for a while, and the guard did not rush him. After all, this was Elder Yan’s favorite.","Ling Han opened the connection device of the Holy Land and searched for what he needed and could redeem.","He naturally ignored the alchemical pills. He could concoct alchemical pills himself, so using contribution points to exchange for alchemical pills was practically idiotic.","However, he still took a look, and saw that the “price” of the Cauldron Heart Pill was actually a hundred contribution points.","F***, so deceitful.","Though Ling Han did not lose out, this was actually the contribution points that Yan Dong had offered by doubling the original price. Ordinarily, it should have been fifty.","However, aside from the fact that the Cauldron Heart Pills here required contribution points, there was also a further explanation, saying that quantity was limited. Only three pills would be provided every month, and if there were many people applying to redeem, the Holy Land would make the decision on which three people to give them, or even the fact that all three pills would be given to one person.","Forget it, he wasn’t going to look.","Ling Han found the natural treasures. This was what he was most concerned about. In his hands, the value of natural treasures could be doubled.","Nine Stalk Exquisite Grass, Purple Crystal Heavenly Heart Stone, Yellow Flower Fruit... There was a dazzling array of them, and Ling Han was also extremely conflicted as he browsed.","He wanted this, and he also wanted that, but there were only so many contribution points, so which few should he choose?","If others knew this, they would definitely stomp in envy and jealousy.","-Others would only be able to redeem a single treasure after saving up for a few months, or even a few years in fact, yet you f****** can choose a few. What else do you want?","Ling Han was in no rush to make a move. He continued to investigate. Wasn’t there still the cultivation techniques and celestial techniques?","Hiss, he merely took a glance, and then shook his head. That was because the exchange for the cultivation technique and celestial technique required too many contribution points. Even the lowest cost would be a thousand contribution points.","Was he going to trade?","Of course not. How could a cultivation technique or secret technique that could be redeemed with 1000 contribution points be worthy of Ling Han’s notice?","He went to look at something else.","Formation technique.","“Yi!”","Ling Han soon set his eyes on a formation called the Three Element Treasure Bottle Formation.","This was a Core Formation Tier-level formation. Theoretically speaking, it could kill a martial artist in the Core Formation Tier, but it was very troublesome to set up. It required the heaven and earth environment to meet the requirements, and only then could it change the power of heaven and earth, forming a great formation to kill a martial artist in the Core","Formation Tier.","Ling Han decided to redeem this, and it would become one of his trump cards in the future. If any Core Formation Tier cultivator wanted to hunt him down, he would set up the Three Element Treasure Bottle Formation, and then draw them into the formation, refining them forcefully.","He handed over his application for redemption. Because he had enough contribution points, 5300 contribution points were immediately deducted, and all the information about this formation appeared in his connection device.","Without reaching the level of an elder, one definitely could not teach all the cultivation techniques, secret techniques, pill recipes, and formations that were redeemed with contribution points. Otherwise, they would be dealt with on the charge of betraying the Holy Land.","After redeeming it, Ling Han set out again, heading out of the palace.","-Previously, he had not been in a rush to leave, because if he wanted to redeem a physical item, he would still have to retrieve it from the Saint Palace, and would not have to make an","additional trip.","He exited the palace, and had not taken a few steps, when he saw that those people that had been looking at the stone tablet on the plaza were gradually turning their eyes towards him, all of them bearing expressions of shock.","How could it not be frightening?","This guy had obtained a total of six thousand contribution points, which left Gan Ping, who was in second place, far behind.","Ling Han was unconcerned, and strode forwards. He still had to study formation techniques.","He didn’t hand over all of the Cauldron Heart Pills. Instead, he left a portion for auction on the Galaxy Network. Otherwise, he couldn’t just sit by and do nothing, simply spending what","wealth he had, right?","After the auction was completed, he had the large black dog make a trip over, and as per usual, the Chang Clan was responsible for transporting the goods.","In exchange for a large amount of Universe Coins, Ling Han rented the Time Chamber again to master the Three Elements Treasure Bottle Formation as soon as possible.","A dozen over days passed, and Ling Han exited the Time Chamber, a smile on his face.","He was already familiar with this formation technique, so he could attempt to forge formation foundations.","He put on the connection device of the Holy Land again, and discovered that a great many people were discussing heatedly about his contribution points.","The sudden acquisition of so many contribution points would naturally draw the curiosity of others. Was there something fishy going on here? Furthermore, the Saint Palace had also made clear that Ling Han had used the Cauldron Heart Pill to exchange for contribution points. Because this was his first time, and because the Cauldron Heart Pill was too valuable and practical, they had given him twice the amount of contribution points. This was naturally Yan Dong’s excuse. He couldn’t say that he had screwed himself over,","right?","A great many people expressed their envy, but there were also some that made cynical remarks. For example, Gan Ping expressed that alchemy was only a minor path, and martial arts was the true path. What alchemist had ever become an Ancestral King?","Ling Han merely chuckled. This was completely jealousy, and there was no need to take it to","heart.","However, everyone had also guessed that Ling Han was definitely an alchemist prodigy. Moreover... he had formed Four Cauldrons. This was a necessary condition to concoct the","Cauldron Heart Pill.","Four Cauldrons, what kind of concept was that?","Among the current Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators, Ling Han’s strength could be ranked in","the top 1000.","Previously, Ling Han had been in seclusion. Now that he had come out, a great many people immediately came to pay him a visit, trying to cotton up to him.","Mainly, it was because of his alchemy abilities. They hoped that Ling Han could help them concoct the Cauldron Heart Pill. After all, it was too difficult to redeem them with contribution points – even though Ling Han had easily obtained 6000 contribution points, if it was anyone else, it would be extremely difficult to even obtain a single contribution point.","“Master, Celestial Maiden Tan seeks an audience,” a Dao Apprentice came to report to Ling","Han.","In the Holy Land, every disciple would be assigned a Dao Apprentice to handle some trivial matters. This Dao Apprentice of Ling Han was called Mingyue, and was only fourteen or fifteen years old. He had just broken through to the Mystery Realm Tier.","Ling Han glanced at him, and saw that this half-grown child’s face was filled with","admiration, looking completely distracted.","Right, he must have been captivated by Tan Meng.","As expected of a seductive beauty on the Exquisite Leaderboard; even this kind of young boy","fell for her charms.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. “Invite her in.”"]},{"number":3827,"title":"Chapter 3827: Asking for alchemical pills","paragraphs":["Chapter 3827: Asking for alchemical pills","Mingyue hurriedly scrambled over to invite her in. After only a short while, the clinking of ornaments was heard, and an exquisite beauty appeared in front of Ling Han.","Even with Ling Han’s picky taste, he had to admit that this woman was indeed beautiful. She was breathtakingly beautiful and elegant, slightly superior to even the princess of the Demon Race, Ling Han. She was only inferior to the empress and Hu Niu.","It should be known that she was only ranked fifty-third on the Exquisite Beauty Leaderboard. If she was in the top ten, what kind of grace would she have?","That was probably really capable of matching Hu Niu and the empress.","Ling Han sized up this seductive beauty with an admiring gaze. Her figure was slender, and she was clearly elegant and graceful, but because her slender waist was only tied simply, it was inevitable that both ends would appear very plump, adding a sliver of charm to her.","“Greetings, Senior Brother Ling.” She smiled slightly, revealing a little bit of her pearly white teeth, her bearing enchanting.","Mingyue was already transfixed with shock, his small face completely flushed red.","Ling Han was only admiring her, so he naturally wouldn’t be flustered. He smiled faintly, and said, “Hello, Junior Sister.”","“Senior Brother, are you looking down on me? You’re not even inviting me to sit down,” Tan Meng said slowly. It was as if she had suffered a grievance, causing one’s heart to melt.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and said, “Please sit.”","Only then did Tan Meng break out into a smile. Instantly, it was as if a hundred flowers had bloomed at the same time, indescribably beautiful.","She sat down in an incredibly elegant position, and just looked quietly at Ling Han, not saying a word.","Ling Han sighed, and said, “Mingyue, don’t look anymore. Hurry up and make some tea.”","Mingyue seemed to have woken up from a dream, and hurriedly turned around to exit. Peng, in his rush, he had even crashed into a pillar. Thankfully, he had not used too much force, or the pillar would definitely have been broken.","When Tan Meng saw this, she couldn’t help but cover her small mouth and chuckle softly.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “With Junior Sister’s arrival, even my Dao Apprentice doesn’t know how to do things anymore.”","“Senior Brother Ling, are you saying that a beauty like me is a calamity?” Tan Meng asked with a smile.","“I wouldn’t dare.”","Tan Meng laughed delicately again, “Senior Brother, you are too modest. With your cultivation level of Four Cauldrons, and added with your accomplishments in alchemy, you are definitely ranked in the top three in this batch of disciples. What would you not dare to do?”","Though her flattery was good, just what had Ling Han experienced? How could he possibly be knocked dizzy by her flattery?","He smiled slightly, “If you have something to say, just say it.”","“Senior Brother, what are you saying? Can’t I come see you for no reason?” Tan Meng asked with a smile.","“Sure,” Ling Han said with a nod. “I’ve always liked to cut to the chase. Why don’t we go to the bedroom and face each other frankly?”","The smile on Tan Meng’s face instantly froze. She had never imagined that Ling Han would be so direct.","She certainly saw Ling Han in a new light, but it was definitely not in terms of romance. Instead, she had her eye on Ling Han’s alchemy ability, and that was why she wanted to charm Ling Han with her personal charisma.","In her eyes, only the top 100 of the Galaxy Network would be worthy of becoming her husband.","Though Ling Han had formed Four Cauldrons, that was all. He was ranked in the top 700 on the Galaxy Network, at most, and that was still very far from the top 100.","“Senior Brother Ling, you jest.” Tan Meng forced out a smile.","“I never joke around in this area,” Ling Han said with a shake of his head. He wore a serious expression.","Tan Meng was suddenly rendered speechless. She felt as if she had encountered a pervert, and she was powerless to resist.","She did not just possess beauty, but also had outstanding intelligence. Otherwise, wouldn’t she just be a pretty face and an idiot? However, when she encountered Ling Han, who took the unusual path, it made both her EQ and IQ seem to have short-circuited.","Thankfully, Mingyue just happened to bring tea over. She hurriedly sipped it, as she calmed her emotions and organized her thoughts.","She decided that she could no longer be polite, or she would be teased to death by Ling Han.","“Senior Brother Ling, actually, I have indeed come this time to ask for Senior Brother Ling’s help.”","Meanwhile, Ling Han sighed faintly, “So, as expected, you are still playing around with me.” Tan Meng was instantly speechless. Playing around with you?","‘Do I dare to trick you? You’re clearly the one taking liberties with me.’","She finally understood. Ling Han didn’t think of her as a goddess or celestial maiden at all, and he didn’t have any adoration for her. Otherwise, no man would speak to a girl whom he was interested in like this.","“I would like to ask Senior Brother to concoct a cauldron of Moon Pills for me.” She acted as if she had not heard Ling Han’s words, and went straight to the point.","Moon Pill?","Ling Han thought for a moment, then gave an ‘oh’.","He didn’t know how to concoct Moon Pills, but he had seen the introduction of this alchemical pill before. In fact, it had completely nothing to do with cultivation. It would only increase","one’s charisma.","Bearing was an ethereal thing, but it was said that the Moon Pill could increase one’s temperament and increase one’s charm.","Obviously, Tan Meng was not satisfied with being ranked fifty-second on the Exquisite Beauty Leaderboard. She still wanted to be ranked fortieth, thirtieth, or perhaps even higher.","For elites, whether their appearance had changed or not could be seen clearly with a single glance, but temperament was a different story.","Ling Han smiled, “I never help others concoct alchemical pills for free. Why don’t we talk in the bedroom?”","Tan Meng’s expression instantly changed again, and she said, “Senior Brother, don’t joke","around.”","“I’m such a serious person, so how could I joke about something like this?” Ling Han asked","solemnly.","Tan Meng finally couldn’t hold on any longer. After saying that she was feeling unwell, she hurriedly left.","Ling Han couldn’t help but smile. This woman clearly wanted him to concoct alchemical pills for nothing. What a joke; did he owe her anything? She must be dreaming.","After leaving, Tan Meng’s intelligence instantly came online.","“Oh no, I’ve fallen into a trap!” She immediately realized that something was off. If Ling Han was really such an unbearable pervert, how could he have cultivated both martial arts and","alchemy?","Thus, the other party had deliberately used this kind of method to chase her away.","Though she had thought things through, Tan Meng was still filled with indignation.","A seductive beauty on the Exquisite Leaderboard was actually rejected?","This was too damaging to her pride.","No, she definitely could not take this lying down.","...","It was not just Tan Meng. The other two seductive beauties on the Exquisite Leaderboard also paid Ling Han a visit, one after the other. However, they did not intend to ask Ling Han to concoct alchemical pills for them. They merely thought that Ling Han was a genius, and was worthy of recruitment.","All of a sudden, the news of the three seductive beauties visiting Ling Han at the same time spread like wildfire, and also caused Ling Han to instantly become a public enemy.","Gan Ping and Lin Qi had both publicly declared that Ling Han was only an alchemist, and his","abilities were mediocre. If he dared to exchange blows with them, he would definitely be defeated within ten moves.","Ling Han couldn’t help but ponder. Should he seek out these two people for a battle, then collect tickets and earn some contribution points?","However, contribution points could not be transferred, and this was a problem.","Ling Han also spoke up. If they wanted a battle, he would oblige.","However, Gan Ping and Lin Qi both expressed disdain at exchanging blows with a weakling","like Ling Han. Bullying an alchemist would lower their status.","F***, they were the ones who said they wanted to fight, and they were also the ones who said","they didn’t want to fight.","Ling Han couldn’t be bothered to pay them any regard. He had bought the ingredients through the Galaxy Network, wanting to create the formation foundations of the Three Elements Treasure Bottle Formation.","This was not something that could be done overnight. He studied earnestly, and ruined a great many ingredients, but was still unable to create the formation foundations.","He was very busy at the moment. Aside from cultivating, he also had to concoct alchemical pills and study formation techniques. Several days later, he planned to go out and change his mood. Perhaps it would be of help.","After walking for a while, he suddenly came to an understanding. He sat under a tree, and was just about to grab hold of this enlightenment. Pa, something crashed down from the top. He hurriedly dodged, and when he raised his head, he saw that there was actually an elder standing at the top of the tree."]},{"number":3828,"title":"Chapter 3828: Illusion Cloud Cat","paragraphs":["Chapter 3828: Illusion Cloud Cat","The Nine Suns Holy Land only recruited new disciples once every 10,000 years.","Thus, for an old geezer to appear here, it was highly possible that he was an old monster that had lived for ten thousand years or even longer.","What did this signify?","He had to be True Self Tier, at least, but it was more likely that he was a Spirit Transformation True Lord, or a Sect Master elite.","“Brat, you’re not paying your respects to this old man!” the old man said with a humph. His aura fluctuated slightly, and it was indescribably abundant.","Initially, Ling Han had wanted to pay his respects. It was only right that he maintain respect for his elders, but hearing the other party’s words, he felt that something was off.","When he thought about it again, he had even deliberately thrown the core of the fruit at him. Was this something that an elder should do?","Thus, he activated his eye technique and looked at the old man again.","F***!","A smile appeared at the corners of Ling Han’s lips. Then, he shook his head, “No.”","“How dare you!” The old man shouted loudly, and landed on the ground. An image appeared behind him, manifesting the destruction of planets, which was extremely terrifying.","This had far surpassed the level of the Cauldron Forging Tier, or even the might of the Sect Master Tier.","Yet Ling Han was unhurried, and began to circle around the old man.","“Brat, are you tired of living?” the old man asked balefully.","Ling Han chuckled, and did not say anything. He continued to walk in circles.","“Are you really seeking death?”","“Hehe.”","“How dare you! I’ll give you another chance. Don’t ruin yourself!” the elder shouted loudly. His voice rumbled like thunder.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, saying, “Don’t just spout nonsense. Come, teach me a lesson.”","The elder flew into a thunderous rage, and with a wave of his hand, hong, multiple great stars appeared behind him. Every great star was engraved with incredibly complex seals, and it was as if even if only a single star crashed down, even a Spirit Transformation True Lord could only wait for death.","Ling Han wore a faint smile as he crossed his arms behind his back. He appeared calm and composed.","“You—” The old man shouted again, and suddenly withdrew his hand, pressing it on his stomach, “Not good, I ate something bad! Brat, just you wait, when I go to relieve myself, I will come back to deal with you!”","He turned around to flee.","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure flashed, blocking the other’s path.","“Brat, this old man will temporarily spare your life. Don’t forget yourself in your conceit,” the old man said coldly.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Come on, old senior, how do you plan to teach me a lesson?” “This old man, this old man, this old man-” The old man’s eyes darted around madly. No matter how he looked at it, he did not look like a Sect Master elite. He suddenly pointed behind Ling Han, “Look, what is that!”","Ling Han was unmoved, and continued to stare at him.","“Why aren’t you turning around?” the elder couldn’t help but ask.","“If I turned around to look, what if you managed to escape?” Ling Han asked.","“Would I run? Are you joking? Do you know who I am?” the old man shouted loudly. Ling Han cracked a smile, “A cat demon.”","Pu!","At first, the old man wanted to roar, but when he heard Ling Han’s words, he immediately wilted, and revealed a shocked expression, “You actually saw through my true identity?”","“What’s so difficult about it?” Ling Han asked calmly.","Peng, a burst of light twisted, and the old man in front of him immediately changed. From a great elite with an oppressive aura, he turned into an ordinary-sized white cat, with a bell hanging from his neck.","“Mew, brat, how did you see through it?” the white cat asked, an obvious curiosity on its face.","Though it was in the form of a cat, this was definitely not a wild beast, but rather a Cat Demon. It had developed intelligence, and even knew how to act mysterious and deceive others.","“Fiery Golden Eyes,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Forget it. Those that can see through my illusions must have cultivated a Mystical Eye Technique. There are only a few such people in the entire galaxy.” The white cat licked its paw, “Brat, let me warn you. Don’t expose me, or I will tell that old geezer, Nine Mountains, and suppress you.”","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Nine Mountains? Could it be that it was the Nine Mountains Venerate?","“Are you the pet beast of the Nine Mountains Venerate?” he asked.","“Pei, you’re the beast pet here. Your whole family are beast pets!” The white cat instantly became agitated. “One day, I’ll suppress that guy, Nine Mountains, and have him act like a stuffed furball for me every day – meow!”","It suddenly pounced out, grabbed a ball and began playing with it.","However, as it played, it realized that something was wrong. It hurriedly stopped, and stared at Ling Han with a bitter and hateful gaze.","It was this guy that had thrown the ball at it. It had actually reflexively pounced out without control.","He really wanted to chop off his own paws.","Ling Han pursed his lips, and said, “I see that you’re playing quite happily. It’s obvious that you want to play, right?”","“Pei, pei, pei! I am an incredibly noble Illusion Cloud Cat, so how could I possibly like to play with such childish things?” The white cat wore a proud expression.","“Go.” Ling Han threw another ball.","The white cat tragically discovered that it had pounced out again, unable to resist at all.","Ling Han shrugged, “Look.”","He was internally surprised. The Illusion Cloud Cat’s battle prowess was not very strong, but this kind of Demonic Beast was skilled in creating illusions. The higher the cultivation level, the more realistic the illusions were. Even Venerate Tier elites and Saints could possibly fall","for it.","Thus, the Illusion Cloud Cat was an extremely good supportive tool in battle. Additionally, because the Illusion Cloud Cat could create all kinds of images, it was actually of great help to cultivators comprehending precious techniques and cultivation techniques.","Of course, the Illusion Cloud Cat’s cultivation level also had to catch up. Wasn’t it a joke to have a Cauldron Forging Tier Illusion Cloud Cat create illusions that even Saints couldn’t","distinguish from reality?","“Don’t tease this cat anymore!” the white cat said in displeasure.","“All right, I’m done playing.” Ling Han nodded, but couldn’t hold himself back. Shua, he","threw out the third ball.","The white cat: “...”","“Alright, alright, I really don’t want to play anymore.” Ling Han sat down again. At first, he had suddenly come to an enlightenment, but the moment the enlightenment appeared, it was destroyed. He naturally had to punish this demon cat.","The white cat was still fuming, raising its head proudly.","Ling Han looked at the white cat, and said, “You’re here to trick people, right?”","The white cat humphed, “So what? I deceived you with my own abilities. Even if you have the ability, go ahead and deceive others yourself.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, “You’re acting so self-righteous now?”","“Let me warn you again, don’t leak out the matter of this cat!” the white cat said solemnly.","“Sure,” Ling Han nodded.","The white cat couldn’t help but feel doubtful, “So straightforward?”","Ling Han smiled and said, “What benefits did you get? Just give me some.”","‘Holy f*ck!’","The white cat stared fixedly at Ling Han, “I suddenly realize that you are even more","shameless than this cat.”","“You can deceive me with your own abilities, but I can also use my own abilities,” Ling Han","said with a smile.","“Pei, I only let those idiots use their contribution points to redeem some Cold Plum Wine to satisfy my cravings. I am not as unbearable as you think,” the white cat said angrily. “Alright, I’ll keep it a secret for you.” Ling Han observed the expression on the cat’s face, and felt that the white cat was telling the truth.","“You’re really so kind?” How could the white cat possibly trust Ling Han so easily?","“Just think, if they could have bene deceived by even you, they would have deserved it,” Ling","Han said with a smile.","The white cat instantly bristled, “What do you mean? Are you looking down on me?”","“Just kidding! Just kidding!” Ling Han hurriedly comforted the cat demon."]},{"number":3829,"title":"Chapter 3829: Legendary places","paragraphs":["Chapter 3829: Legendary places","Without any inspiration, Ling Han roamed around outside before helplessly returning to his residence.","After a few days, Ling Han was suddenly inspired again. Just as he was about to cultivate diligently, the large black dog ran over.","Because Ling Han had informed Mingyue before, if those like the empress, the large black dog, Lin Luo and the others came, there was no need to report their arrival. He could just let them in directly. Thus, he could be considered to have suffered the consequences of his own actions, and his rhythm had been disrupted again.","Ling Han sighed, “You despicable dog, you really came at the best time.”","“Woof, I’ve been tricked.” The large black dog felt extremely gloomy.","“What is it?” Ling Han asked, though his heart was moved.","“F***, I was looking for an opportunity, and encountered an old geezer. He said that he was fated with Grandpa Dog, and was willing to teach me the supreme Mystical Power. In the end, Grandpa Dog believed him, and even eagerly bought him a pot of Cold Plum Wine. The old geezer told Grandpa Dog to look for him on the mountain in the middle of the night, but in the end... I was chased down the mountain, and lost a contribution point for nothing.” The large black dog was extremely depressed.","Fine, this guy had been played by that white cat.","With the white cat’s illusion technique, aside from cultivating a Mystical Eye Technique, one would have to be a True Self Tier elite to be able to see through it. It wouldn’t be strange for the large black dog to fall for it.","“Grandpa Dog really doesn’t understand. As a Venerate Tier elite, do you have to go so far just for a pot of Cold Plum Wine!” The large black dog bared its teeth. In the day, he had said that would teach him the supreme Mystical Power, but at night, he suddenly turned hostile. Wasn’t this just toying with him?","Ling Han couldn’t help but think that the Nine Mountains Venerate was probably very depressed as well. That white cat impersonated him to deceive people everywhere, and it was to trick people into buying wine for it at that. How could this Venerate endure this?","His character was really too low!","“Despicable dog, when you see that old geezer in the future, why don’t you rush up and take a few bites?” Ling Han suggested.","The large black dog looked at Ling Han with disdain, “Do you think Grandpa Dog is retarded? That damn old geezer is a Venerate Tier elite, and you want Grandpa Dog to bite him? Even if Grandpa Dog bites that old geezer, the only result would be Grandpa Dog breaking all his teeth.”","Ling Han shook his head with a smile, “Since you don’t believe me, don’t blame me even if you can’t get your revenge.”","“Yi, do you know something?” The large black dog was skeptical.","“You guess.” Since Ling Han had already promised the white cat, he naturally wouldn’t go back on his word. No matter how much the large black dog pestered him, he didn’t relent.","The large black dog left resentfully, but he still managed to obtain a considerable number of alchemical pills from Ling Han. This was actually his main motive for coming here. Otherwise, how could it be that he really wanted Ling Han to fight with a Venerate Tier elite?","Actually, it was not only the large black dog, but also a great many people that had been deceived by that Cat Demon. However, not one of them managed to see through the illusion of the Cat Demon. They all thought that they had been tricked by a Venerate Tier elite, and dared not speak out in anger.","Another dozen over days passed, and Ling Han finally had some idea of how to create the formation foundations of the Three Elements Treasure Bottle Formation. He began to carve out the formation foundations one after another. Although there were also failures, he spent nine days to finally complete all the formation foundations.","He did not waste any more time on formations, and began to walk around in the Holy Land.","It was not just the Nine Suns Saint. The seniors of the past generations also liked to hide their ultimate techniques in some corner, waiting for their descendants to unearth them. Of course, to prevent them from being lost, they could also use their contribution points to redeem them. However, as long as it was a celestial technique at the level of Sect Master, the contribution points needed to redeem it would be overwhelmingly high. Thus, they still had to try their luck.","There were some strange places in this Holy Land. For example, there was a dry well with no bottom, a rock that couldn’t be moved no matter what, a mountain cave that cried like a ghost all day, and so on.","Ling Han was a very curious person. Thus, he planned to go to these legendary places to take a look. His first stop was that dry well with no bottom.","The rookies did not believe it, and were always suspicious of legends. Thus, there were also a great many people here.","“Three days have already passed, so why hasn’t he come up yet?”","“He didn’t die inside, did he?”","“That’s impossible. If there’s danger, the Holy Land will stop us from entering.”","The people in the surroundings were all discussing. As it turned out, one of them had gone into the well previously, but three days had already passed, and he had still not returned. What about the connection device then?","Sorry, but once they entered into the dry well, even if they were face to face, the connection device would not allow communication.","“Ling Han?” Someone discovered him, and revealed a smile, “My name is Cang Shan. How fortunate to meet you.”","How was he fortunate?","Ling Han mocked internally, and smiled, “Hello.”","“Ling Han, Senior Brother Cang Shan is at the peak stage of Four Cauldrons. Among the disciples of Cauldron Forging Tier recruited this time, his abilities are enough to rank in the top ten, so you had best be more respectful,” someone immediately shouted.","Tsk, they could already enter into the Holy Land, so how could there still be such boot- lickers?","Ling Han glanced at that person, but did not speak. If he spoke to a bootlicker, it would degrade his status for nothing.","Cang Shan smiled, appearing to be very magnanimous. He said, “It’s like this. I’m presently preparing to break through to Five Cauldrons. Though I have a 50% chance, I’m also afraid of what if. Thus, I would like Junior Brother Ling to give me two Cauldron Heart Pills.”","Junior Brother Ling? Give?","Ling Han was surprised. Where did your confidence come from? You’re calling me Junior Brother just like that? Moreover, who do you think you are? Why should I give you anything?","More importantly, he was clearly asking for something from someone else, yet he still looked like he was giving alms to him. What a joke.","Cang Shan smiled again, “Junior Brother, I will not take your things for nothing. If you encounter any difficulties in future, feel free to look for me.”","“For example, if someone wanted to beat me up, would you block them for me?” Ling Han","asked.","“Piece of cake,” Cang Shan declared proudly.","He was filled with anticipation for breaking through to Five Cauldrons, because his present strength could be ranked in the top ten, but if he could become Five Cauldrons, he would definitely be able to rank in the top five. In fact, he would even be qualified to challenge Gan","Ping, Lin Qi and the others for the position of king tier.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “You can block any opponent?”","“Of course.” Cang Shan’s expression was still filled with confidence.","Boom, a fist shot over.","Cang Shan couldn’t help but feel furious. Ling Han actually dared to make a move on him; how","audacious.","He also threw a punch, wanting to let Ling Han know the immensity of heaven and earth.","-Even if they were both at Four Cauldrons, there would still be a world of difference between","their abilities.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a punch, and Cang Shan’s expression instantly changed drastically. Teng, teng, teng! He took a few dozen steps back, his face flushed red.","Yi?","Everyone was stunned. Cang Shan was actually no match for Ling Han?","How was this possible?","It should be known that both of them had broken through their limits, and formed Four Cauldrons. Since that was the case, the deciding factor would be whose cultivation level was","higher.","Cang Shan was already at the peak stage of Four Cauldrons, so no matter how weak he was, he should at least be able to fight Ling Han to a tie, right?","“You do have some abilities. Looks like I can’t suppress you with only thirty percent of my strength.” Cang Shan forced himself to be calm, and said calmly.","When everyone heard this, realization dawned on them. So that was how it was.","However, only Cang Shan himself knew that he had used 70% of his strength in this punch, yet","was completely no match for his opponent. In that case, even if he went all out, he could not","possibly gain any advantage.","However, the arrow was already drawn, so how could it not be fired?"]},{"number":3830,"title":"Chapter 3830: The dry well without bottom","paragraphs":["Chapter 3830: The dry well without bottom","Cang Shan did not dare to be the slightest bit careless. He did not charge back at the first instant. Instead, he took a deep breath, and then formed his hands into claws. One in front, one on the right, one yin and one yang, and there were two balls of light, one black and one white, in his palms.","Xiu, he finally moved, his speed fast to the extreme. A great many people felt their vision blur, and there was already no sign of Cang Shan.","They couldn’t help but feel shocked. If Cang Shan wanted to kill them, would one move be enough?","Meanwhile, Ling Han simply threw a casual punch. He didn’t need to use any celestial technique, and it was just a simple punch.","But it was this very simple punch that directly hit the nail on the head.","Peng, Cang Shan was instantly sent flying.","Yi? Ah? Ya?","Everyone was once again stunned. What was going on here? Why had Cang Shan flown away again?","The first time could still be considered carelessness, but what about the second time? He clearly already knew how strong Ling Han was, yet would still be careless?","That was definitely impossible.","Thus, there was only one reason, and that was Ling Han was too strong.","Hiss, even a peak stage Four Cauldrons was completely unable to fight back in front of him. Just how strong was this guy?","Five Cauldrons? Six Cauldrons?","There were a few female cultivators here, and their eyes instantly lit up.","The prodigy cultivator and the prodigy alchemist added together, his brilliant light could not be concealed even by Gan Ping and Lin Qi.","Not far away, Cang Shan got up from the ground. He spat out a mouthful of blood, his face filled with viciousness, but did not say anything. He turned around and left.","“Wait!” Ling Han stepped forward to block him, and said, “You’re leaving just like that?” “What else do you want?” Cang Shan was indignant.","“Hehe, I have never liked to trifle with others, but after being trifled with, if I don’t kill my opponent, then I would have him admit it wholeheartedly. In future, when he sees me, he would have to call me Big Brother.” Ling Han broke into a smile, “Since we are all Sect Brothers, I will not kill you. I will just beat you until you call me Big Brother.”","He moved, launching an attack at Cang Shan.","Though Cang Shan was extraordinary, how could he be a match for Ling Han? He could only be continuously trampled on, and instantly, screamed repeatedly.","Everyone kept quiet out of fear, thinking that Ling Han was really the type to seek revenge for the smallest grievance.","But if they asked themselves honestly, if it was them, what would they do?","Quite a number of people nodded in agreement. That was definite. Why should I be extorted by you?","“Do you yield?” Ling Han asked with each punch.","“No! No! No!” In full public, Cang Shan naturally would not admit defeat. In any case, Ling Han did not dare to kill him, so he was completely capable of continuing to be stubborn.","Ling Han was extremely patient, throwing punch after punch. Every punch was extremely forceful, avoiding Cang Shan’s vital points, yet maximizing the pain he endured.","He could tolerate these ten or eight punches, but to continue like this?","Cang Shan couldn’t bear it either. In the end, he yielded.","“I concede,” he said with his eyes closed, his face flushed red.","Peng, another punch.","Cang Shan opened his eyes. F***, I have already admitted defeat, and you still want to fight?","“Have you forgotten something?” Ling Han smiled faintly, yet sent out another punch.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","After throwing another dozen over punches, Cang Shan finally came to his senses, and said, “Big Brother, I concede defeat.”","“You’re really convinced?”","“I’m really convinced.”","Ling Han nodded in satisfaction, “Go on.”","This time, Cang Shan really did not have the slightest bit of temper. After he got to his feet, he bowed and paid his respects to Ling Han, acting as if he was Ling Han’s lackey. Only then did he turn and leave.","Everyone looked at Ling Han with reverent gazes. In their eyes, Cang Shan was already unattainable, yet Ling Han was still trampling on him like a dead dog. Just what kind of power gap was this?","Right at this moment, a person actually climbed out of the dry well.","“It’s Wu Kan, he has finally climbed up!” someone exclaimed in shock.","This Wu Kan was the one who had gone down the well three days ago, and now, he had finally climbed back up.","Everyone looked over, and saw that there were bruises on Wu Kan’s hands and neck, and what was even more frightening was the fact that there was actually a palm print on his cheek. The fingers were unreasonably long, and it was definitely not something that Wu Kan had left on","his own.","Could it be that... there was a ghost in the well?","Everyone shivered, and hurriedly asked Wu Kan.","“What, three days?”","Wu Kan immediately jumped up, his expression filled with disbelief, “I have only crawled for over ten minutes.”","Everyone exchanged looks. He must have seen a ghost. It was impossible that they had all remembered the time wrongly. Wu Kan must have been bewitched, and that was why he was","treating three days like ten minutes.","“Also, what’s wrong with your face?” everyone asked.","“What’s wrong with my face?” Wu Kan was at a loss.","Someone took out a mirror for him to see. Wu Kan looked at it, and was even more at a loss,","“There is nothing on my face.”","Everyone looked, and an even stranger thing happened. That palm print on Wu Kan’s face had","actually disappeared.","This... was really haunted.","“What did you see in the well?” everyone asked.","“Nothing much, just an empty well.” Wu Kan said.","“Have you gotten to the bottom?”","“No.” Wu Kan shook his head.","“Then why have you returned? Didn’t you say that you would reach the bottom?”","“That’s right.” Wu Kan showed a puzzled expression, appearing very confused.","Ling Han’s interest was piqued. He strode towards the dry well and looked downwards.","It was pitch-black, and he could only see a depth of 30 meters. Beyond that, there was only","darkness.","Ling Han activated his eye technique again. This time, he could see about 300 meters away, and what followed was still complete darkness.","With a leap, he headed down the well.","This well was very narrow, and it was difficult for even one person to turn around. Thus, Ling","Han could only slowly squeeze downwards.","He soon became impatient. This speed was too slow. He compressed his bones, and with a crisp cracking sound, his figure shrunk by half, and his figure instantly sped up.","His hands pressed lightly on the wall of the well to maintain the current speed of his descent,","so that he would not accelerate too quickly, that he would not be able to stop in time.","Falling, falling, everything in front of him remained unchanged, incredibly monotonous.","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han was suddenly startled. How long had passed?","One minute, one hour, or... one day?","Ling Han exerted force with both hands, making himself stop. Looking down, it was still","pitch-black, and bottomless.","He released his divine sense, and saw that there was a palm print on his cheek. The fingers were especially long and slender, and he could tell at a glance that it was inhuman.","Just like Wu Kan?","Ling Han stretched out a hand to stroke the walls of the well. At the same time, he sniffed","lightly, a smile curling up the corners of his lips.","If it was another person, they would definitely be bewitched.","Unfortunately, he was both an alchemist and a Formation Master.","It was very difficult for these two identities to appear on the same person, but unfortunately,","he was this kind of freak.","Ling Han took out the giant frog’s Demon Core and placed it in his mouth. At the same time,","he released the Starlight Screen and began to touch the walls of the well.","Right, right.","He slowly climbed downwards, but he had only descended 300 meters when he stopped,","because he saw a very small hole. Compared to his body, this hole was completely impassable.","It didn’t matter. Ling Han shrunk down again and landed in the cave.","“How could you have possibly discovered it!” A voice was heard ahead of him, filled with","surprise."]},{"number":3831,"title":"Chapter 3831: Cave Dweller","paragraphs":["Chapter 3831: Cave Dweller","Ling Han channeled his eye technique. That was like a child, only three feet tall, yet possessed a pair of long, thin hands. But looking at his face, he actually had a beard.","“It’s just an illusory formation, and added with some medicine that can confuse one’s mind, how difficult would it be to break through?” He smiled slightly.","That dwarf’s expression was filled with disbelief. Don’t speak so lightly. Throughout the ages, aside from those higher ups of the Holy Land, which disciple could resolve the double mystery of this formation and medicine? Furthermore, he had also secretly placed palm imprints on people’s faces, which would rapidly disappear when they came into contact with sunlight, creating an extremely strange effect.","Though every new student would come out of curiosity, but as long as they were given a scare, they would naturally be well-behaved in future.","This was the first time he had been caught red-handed by a new student.","“You’re a freak,” he said weakly.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel speechless. Being called a freak by a dwarf... why did it sound so strange?","He shook his head, and asked, “Are you the only one here?”","“How could that be? Our Underground Cave People are a colossal tribe,” the dwarf said.","“Come, tell me about it.” Ling Han sat down in a cross-legged position.","“I can’t say, this is a tribe rule.” The dwarf hurriedly shook his head.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Looks like we need to have a nice chat.”","...","In just half an hour, the dwarf told him everything in full detail.","A very, very long time ago, the cave dwellers encountered their natural enemy, and were close to destruction. Thankfully, a Venerate Tier from the Nine Suns Holy Land passed by, and in a moment of soft-heartedness, saved the cave dwellers, and all of them moved to the Nine Suns Holy Land.","Cave dwellers, as the name implies, all lived in caves, and in the Nine Suns Holy Land, they all lived underground, digging one tunnel after another.","However, cave dwellers didn’t live for nothing. They had a specialty, and that was growing Celestial medicines.","In the colossal underground space under the Holy Land, the cave dwellers planted large amounts of Celestial medicines to supply the expense of the Holy Land.","Thus, one side provided shelter for safety, while the other side provided Celestial medicines, which could be considered mutually beneficial.","Ling Han’s eyes lit up, “Come, let’s go take a look at your Celestial Herb Garden.”","“Are you planning to steal the Celestial medicine?” This cave dweller was about to cry. How could he be so easily frightened? In a daze, he had confessed everything.","“Do you think a righteous person like me would be a thief?” Ling Han glared at him, “I just want to take a look.”","The cave dweller had no choice but to bring Ling Han on a tour.","The matter of the cave dwellers was not exposed, but rather left behind the legend of a dried up well without any bottom. This was due to the mischief of some big shot from the Holy Land that had long since died, and he was sure that the other legends were the same.","Ling Han was also extremely speechless. After the Nine Suns Saint hid the God Slaying Technique, he had screwed over his descendants, and they in turn were also thinking of ways to screw over their own descendants.","Very soon, a massive medicinal field appeared in front of Ling Han, and according to the cave dweller, this was only one of the medicinal fields.","Ling Han cracked a smile, and said to the cave dweller, “This is a small secret between the two of us. I was never here, right?”","“En!” The cave dweller hurriedly nodded.","Ling Han left in a flash. Whenever he wanted to concoct alchemical pills, he would come here","to roam around, using the Void Beast hide as a cover. He was sure that no one would be able to discover his existence.","He went back the way he came. After exiting the dry well, everyone hurriedly asked.","Ling Han pretended to be at a loss. There was also a palm print on his face, which quickly disappeared when he saw the light. The situation was the same as Wu Kan previously, so it naturally did not arouse anyone’s suspicion.","He then went to where the rock could not be moved no matter what. This was a rock that was only the size of a head. It definitely did not look like any precious stone material. It was very ordinary, but he could not move it no matter what.","Ling Han had tried many times. This rock would absorb power, and no matter how strong you were, it was useless.","To say nothing of being unable to move it, even if he used the celestial technique, it would be useless. This was a little like the perverted pig, being able to absorb all attack power.","Ling Han went to the cave that was releasing the wails of ghosts. There were people gathering here, and they wanted to enter and adventure.","According to an elder from the Holy Land, there was a secret technique hidden in the mountain cave, but the cave was extremely dangerous. Although venturing in wouldn’t be life-threatening, one would at least suffer a serious illness if they came out.","However, when these people heard that there was no life-threatening danger, and that they could possibly obtain the secret technique, they were naturally excited.","“Brother Ling, why don’t we explore together?” someone asked.","Ling Han shook his head. If he was alone, he would be more mobile.","“If we join forces, our chances of winning are higher.” That person still wanted to persuade","him further.","“Don’t waste your energy. He doesn’t like us at all,” one of the team members said in a strange tone.","The three people beside him hurriedly covered his mouth. You still don’t f****** know that Cang Shan had been beaten to the point that he was begging for mercy, right? He actually dared to trifle with this bringer of misfortune.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and walked into the cave.","“Wu-” He had only taken a few steps in, and sure enough, a strange sound was heard. It sounded like wind, but also like the howl of a ghost, causing one’s hair to stand on end. It even had destructive power against divine sense.","Ling Han activated the Starlight Screen. His reserves of mystical power were extremely deep, so he didn’t mind wasting just that tiny bit.","However, he discovered that the Starlight Screen couldn’t block this sound. It was only slightly weakened, and it was still charging towards him. It surged into his mind, turning into multiple sabers and swords, planning to cause great damage.","Ling Han humphed. The Six Characters Bright King Curse unfolded. Though there was only one word, this was an Imperial Technique, so how overbearing was it?","“An!”","He shouted in his mind, and the Buddhist chant rolled out. Those sabers and swords immediately crumbled.","Ling Han strode forwards, but the wails of ghosts sounded again.","“An!” Ling Han recited the Buddhist chant, resisting the wails of ghosts with ease.","This cave was very big, and also very complicated, going back and forth. After walking for a long time, the surrounding temperature dropped all of a sudden. Even with Ling Han’s physique, he felt the flow of his blood slow down. In fact, it was as if his blood was about to","freeze.","He couldn’t help but shiver. Was there a piece of Millennium Black Ice or something hidden in this cave, so why was it so cold?","Right at this moment, he suddenly saw a figure float out from a stone pillar ahead of him.","How could a person possibly pop out of a stone pillar?","Yin soul!","Ling Han immediately thought. Actually, illusions could also pass through physical matter, but combined with this environment that had suddenly become cold, he was more inclined to think that this was a Yin soul.","Could it be that the Nine Suns Holy Land was also suppressing an underworld passageway?","Just as he was pondering, the Yin soul released a sharp cry and launched an attack at him. Ling Han showed a hint of mockery. When the Yin soul approached, he shot out a punch, and Destructive Energy boiled.","The Yin soul instantly looked shocked, and hurriedly stopped in its tracks, then retreated.","In its eyes, encountering Destructive Energy was like a normal person seeing a ghost.","Ling Han gave chase, and with a series of punches, destroyed the Yin soul. According to the information obtained from the Ancient Sun Saint, the Yin soul was the enemy of all living beings. Once the Yin souls invaded in full force, they would be possessing","living beings, and the whole world would be in chaos.","Thus, when encountering Yin souls, he definitely could not be merciful."]},{"number":3832,"title":"Chapter 3832: Soul Forming Technique","paragraphs":["Chapter 3832: Soul Forming Technique","Death was like the extinguishing of a lamp.","Death was death. Even if the Yin soul was brought back from the Netherworld, and pressed back into its original body, it was no longer the original person.","Yin soul had lost all the beautiful aspects of intelligent creatures, leaving behind only extreme negative emotions. They were even more ruthless and terrifying than wild beasts. At least, wild beasts wouldn’t bother to hunt anymore after eating, but Yin soul was different. It only had the urge to destroy everything.","Was it a coincidence that Yin souls had appeared here? However, the great elites of the Holy Land had deliberately set up a place like this; was their main purpose still to tease the disciples of the younger generation?","Ling Han was willing to believe this possibility. Otherwise, if there was still an entrance to the underworld here, that would really be too dangerous.","In the past, with a Saint standing guard, the Celestial Sea Planet had still been destroyed in the great battle. Now, though this was also a Holy Land, it did not have a Saint standing guard. If a Yin soul riot broke out, it could be imagined that the Nine Suns Planet would very soon be wreaked havoc by the Yin souls, and become an Asura Hell.","He continued to advance, and soon, Yin souls appeared again, launching attacks at him. This was very rhythmic. It was as if every Yin soul was set in a fixed area. Only whenone walked into this area, would the Yin soul attack.","By the looks of it, the Nine Suns Planet probably didn’t have a door to the underworld.","The Destructive Energy was specialized in subduing Yin souls. Thus, Yin souls, which were extremely troublesome in the eyes of others, were extremely simple in Ling Han’s eyes. Furthermore, even the Six Characters Bright King Curse had a certain restraining effect on Yin souls.","After some effort, Ling Han finally arrived at the end of the cave.","This was a very smooth stone wall. It was obviously deliberately carved out by someone, but","it should have a very long history. There was no longer any signs that this stone wall had been scraped out.","However, there were also paintings on the stone walls.","Ling Han watched on as these static scenes suddenly moved, playing out in his mind.","This was a celestial technique called the Soul Forming Technique, and its use was... to manifest another soul.","This second soul was extremely fragile, and couldn’t cultivate. However, it could completely change one’s appearance.","At first glance, this seemed to be completely worthless, but if it was used to conceal one’s identity, this was a divine technique.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel a rush of excitement. After cultivating the Soul Forming Technique, could he open another Galaxy Network account? If he could deceive even Galaxy Network, then it would solve the problem of Ling Han being unable to use Galaxy Network to communicate with others.","He recited the verbal chant silently, comprehending each word. At the same time, the images on the stone walls were also changing, as if they were annotating him.","This had been left behind by a Venerate Tier elite. In the past, he had almost become a Saint, and what he studied the most was the soul. This Soul Forming Technique was only one of the techniques that he had created, and was also his most proud creation. Though it was completely useless for cultivation, he was probably the only one in the entire universe who had done it.","In fact, this Soul Forming Technique was not included in the exchange list of the Holy Land, and could only be cultivated here.","This verbal chant was too obscure, and Ling Han spent a whole day to finally grasp the gist of","it.","He connected to the Galaxy Network and rented the Time Chamber to master this technique as soon as possible.","Another three days later, he finally felt that he could try cultivating.","He split out a bit of his divine sense, and underwent a change of appearance.","Ling Han continuously failed, and after another two days, he finally succeeded.","With a thought, the divine sense fluctuation immediately changed. Now, even if he appeared outside, most people would probably think that he was impersonating Ling Han, because his appearance could be easily imitated by anyone, but the divine sense fluctuation was fixed. Every person was a unique individual, and there was definitely no duplicate.","Let’s give it a try.","He activated the connection device, and a voice immediately sounded. “You don’t have an account number yet. Do you want to immediately register one?”","“Yes.”","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. ‘It’s done. I can now appear on the Galaxy Network in broad daylight.’","There was nothing to hide then. He created his account name as Ling Han, the same as himself.","Shua, the Galaxy Network spirit suddenly appeared, turning into a five- or six-year-old little boy. He stared at Ling Han for a while, but did not say anything. He turned into a shadow and","disappeared.","What was the meaning of this?","Had he been discovered?","Ling Han shrugged. Since this account had not been written off, it meant that the Galaxy Network spirit had already tacitly agreed.","It was enough.","Ling Han immediately contacted Tang Yan, and the two of them became good friends. “You’re finally willing to use Galaxy Network!” Tang Yan appeared extremely happy.","“Are you still on the Moonlight Planet?” Ling Han asked.","“That’s right. At present, a great many forces are searching for our Tang Clan, so we must keep a low profile,” Tang Yan said. Then, he called out loudly, “When I have cultivated the Turbid Scroll to Great Accomplishment, I will definitely seek them out one by one for an","accounting!”","He paused, then asked, “What about you?”","“I am presently at the Nine Suns Holy Land.","“Good lord, you actually passed such a freakish test!” Tang Yan was stunned.","“How are you and that person from the Jin Clan doing now?”","“Not too bad. At least, when I talk to her, she would respond.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. “Your standards are really low.”","“It can’t be helped. If I had your strength, it would definitely be different.”","“Er!”","After chatting for a while, Ling Han cut off the communication. This time, he was only experimenting with the Soul Forming Technique. In any case, it would be very convenient to","communicate.","This was truly a pleasant surprise.","Ling Han walked back in a flash. When he passed a crossroads, he saw a group of people","running out in a sorry state. All of them were bleeding from their seven apertures, their","expressions greatly deflated.","Yin souls attack divine sense, and without divine sense-like attacks and defensive techniques, one would only be at a disadvantage.","He strode out and returned to his residence, only to see that the large black dog was already","waiting for him.","Ling Han was just about to make a joke, when he saw that the large black dog was extremely dispirited, as if it had suffered a serious injury.","“What’s going on?” he asked darkly.","“Grandpa Dog has been bullied, and your wife has also been bullied,” the large black dog said.","Ling Han was instantly enraged, killing intent exuding from his eyes. He forcefully","suppressed it, and said darkly, “Tell me the details.”","The large black dog nodded, “Your monkey wife-”","Ling Han immediately wanted to interrupt it. The princess of the Demon Race was not his wife, but with this interruption, the large black dog would probably be able to argue with him for a very long time. Thus, he chose to remain silent, and continue listening. “...She was quite pretty, but in the end, she was targeted by someone. That guy’s name is Xue Hai, and he’s always circling around your monkey wife. I can’t chase him away,” the large","black dog continued.","“Afterwards, Eldest Baby couldn’t bear it any longer, so she gave that guy a good thrashing.”","“I never thought that guy would actually have an older brother. He’s in the Cauldron Forging Tier, and his name is Xue Zhan. He actually bullied the weak with his superior strength, injuring the seven babies, Grandpa Dog, Lin Luo, and the others. He even threatened that if your monkey wife did not accept his younger brother, he would come again.” Ling Han controlled his killing intent, and said, “Isn’t there a rule in the Holy Land that says the Cauldron Forging Tier can’t attack Foundation Building Tier cultivators?”","If a sect did not have this kind of basic restriction, how could it possibly last forever?"]},{"number":3833,"title":"Chapter 3833: Counterattack","paragraphs":["Chapter 3833: Counterattack","“Don’t mention it. That Xue Clan actually has a clansman in the valley. He’s the Dao Apprentice of some big shot, and now, he’s also cultivated to the level of the Core Formation Tier. So, as long as he doensn’t cripple us, for the sake of that Core Formation Tier from the Xue Clan, the Law Enforcement Hall will just turn a blind eye,” the large black dog said gloomily.","“Which big shot is that person’s backer?” Ling Han asked.","“Liu Sanjun,” the large black dog replied.","Ling Han flipped through his memory, and Liu Sanjun’s information immediately appeared in his mind. This was a Sect Master, a very old elite. If he still did not break through to Venerate Tier, he should not have much lifespan left.","Thus, Liu Sanjun’s prestige was very high.","Ling Han calculated in his mind, and already came up with a plan.","“I’m going to see someone first,” he said.","“Who?”","“Yan Dong.”","“Yi, brat, you actually know Elder Yan?” The large black dog was very surprised.","Ling Han first went to see Yan Dong, and roughly related the matter, which made Yan Dong very furious.","A mere Dao Apprentice actually dared to undermine the laws of the Holy Land?","Humph!","“All right, just go all out,” Yan Dong vouched for Ling Han.","Ling Han nodded and left.","He first went to the Foundation Building Valley to see the empress and the others. The empress, Hu Niu, and Princess Bixiao were unscathed, but the seven babies, Lin Luo, and the others had suffered considerable injuries, but not too serious. After all, this was a breach of the laws of the Holy Land. Even Xue Zhan did not dare to be too heavy-handed. If anything serious happened, even that clansman of Core Formation Tier would not be able to protect him.","“Leave this matter to me,” Ling Han said solemnly. Previously, he had already been filled with anger when he heard the large black dog just talking about it. Now that he saw how injured everyone was, his fury burned even hotter.","He didn’t attack immediately. Instead, he chose the terrain first, then inserted the formation foundations one after another.","Humph, if that Core Formation Tier martial artist from the Xue Clan came, just see if he wouldn’t kill him!","The preparations were complete, and Ling Han still hadn’t found Xue Hai yet. He hadn’t thought that Xue Hai would actually come looking for him on his own.","“Hehe, there shouldn’t be anyone chasing me away this time, right?”","This Xue Hai looked to be only in his early twenties. He was tall and slender, and was also very handsome. However, the expression on his face was too smug, infuriating those who saw him. At least, that was the case for everyone here.","He swaggered in just like that, sat down on his own, and said with a smile, “Yi, why are you so unruly? Where’s the tea?”","Ling Han smiled, poured a cup of tea, and then tossed it over to Xue Hai. The cup drew a beautiful arc, and landed steadily on Xue Hai’s table.","“Now that’s more like it.” Xue Hai picked up the teacup, but he had just lifted the lid. Boom, a flame gushed out, scaring him so much that he hurriedly waved his hand, and threw the cup of tea onto the ground. He stood up angrily, “How dare you, to actually dare to toy with me!”","Meanwhile, Ling Han took a sip of tea, as if he had not seen anything.","“You’re seeking death!” Xue Hai charged over, and delivered a slap at Ling Han.","Ling Han opened the connection device at the right time, and began recording. Then, his figure flashed, dodging this attack, “Xue Hai, you really want to make a move on me?”","“So what? Do you think I don’t dare?” When Xue Hai saw Ling Han dodge, how could he possibly think that Ling Han was a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator? He only thought that Ling Han was afraid. He humphed, “In front of me, you are worthless!”","However, he was also a little puzzled. Why didn’t he seem to have seen this person before?","Hehe, these few words were enough.","Ling Han turned off the connection device, and delivered a palm strike at Xue Hai. Pa, how could Xue Hai possibly block it? Instantly, he was knocked to the ground.","“You!” Xue Hai finally came to a realization. This was a Cauldron Forging Tier elite, so it was no wonder that he looked unfamiliar.","Great, he had also invited a Cauldron Forging Tier.","As he used the connection device to ask Xue Zhan for help, he said coldly, “You actually dare","to trick me. Fine, when my brother comes, I’ll see how you die!”","Pa, Ling Han’s foot stomped down, and Xue Hai instantly released a terrible scream. He opened his mouth, and actually spat out over ten broken teeth.","Ling Han’s heart did not soften in the slightest. His reverse scale was his family and friends. If it was not for the fact that this was the Nine Suns Holy Land, how could Xue Hai still be alive?","He stomped on Xue Hai’s face, one step after another. Xue Hai’s face was covered with blood. Not only were his teeth shattered, even his nose had caved in.","The large black dog, Lin Luo, and the others all felt their anger vented when they saw this. With their strength, they were naturally not inferior to Xue Hai, but because of Xue Zhan, they had been very terribly humiliated by Xue Hai. It should be known that they were all ultimate elites in the Genesis World, so how proud and arrogant were they?","“Stop!” A loud shout rang out, and someone rushed in, shouting loudly at Ling Han.","It was Xue Zhan.","However, while Xue Hai did not recognize Ling Han, Xue Zhan did. He couldn’t help but feel stifled. Immediately, he clasped his hands and said, “So it is Brother Ling. Sorry, sorry.”","“Brother, what’s the point of being so polite with him? Kill him quickly,” Xue Hai couldn’t help but call out. ‘Can’t you see how miserable I am now? You’re actually still chatting with","my enemy.’","“Shut up!” Xue Zhan shouted harshly. He naturally knew how terrifying Ling Han was. How could he offend such a person?","Their backer was only a Core Formation Tier cultivator. Of course, Liu Sanjun was also one of the cards they had, because this great elite treasured pride and was protective of his own people the most, but he was too far from them, after all.","Ling Han breaking through to the Core Formation Tier definitely wasn’t a problem for him. It was best not to offend such an elite.","“Brother Ling, I’m ignorant. How has my brother offended you? I apologize on his behalf,”","Xue Zhan said. He was quite a ruffian.","Ling Han nodded, “The people here are all my friends.”","Xue Zhan immediately said, “I’m really sorry. I guarantee that what happened in the past will","never happen again.”","“Of course,” Ling Han said calmly.","“Then can you return him to me?” Xue Zhan asked patiently.","Ling Han shook his head and said, “I’ve only dealt with one of the main culprits, and there’s","one more left.”","Xue Zhan faltered upon hearing this. Only then did he realize that Ling Han was talking about him. His expression involuntarily darkened, and he said, “Brother Ling, we are fellow disciples, after all. Don’t take things too far.”","“Have I gone too far?” Ling Han laughed in spite of himself. Why didn’t he feel that he had","gone too far when he was bullying others?","He strode towards Xue Zhan.","Xue Zhan couldn’t help but retreat. He had heard of Ling Han’s strength. Even a peak stage Four Cauldrons had been beaten into submission by him. He was only a Heaven Cauldron, so","how could he possibly match him?","Why wasn’t that clan elder here yet?","Xue Zhan was internally anxious, but he still maintained the smile on his face, appearing calm and composed, “Ling Han, could it be that you don’t know that one of our clan elders is an elite of the Core Formation Tier, and is also Elder Liu’s Dao Apprentice!”","“What is it? Are you using this to suppress me?” Ling Han said with a faint smile. Xiu, his","figure had already charged out.","Xue Zhan didn’t dare to battle, but since Ling Han had made his move, how could he possibly","escape?","In just one move, he was taken down.","Peng, Ling Han slammed him heavily onto the ground, then stepped on him. Xue Zhan’s nose","instantly collapsed, and blood flowed from his nose.","“Ah-” he screamed tragically. The Xue Clan was also a Spiritual Transformation Tier clan. Since childhood, when had he ever suffered such injustice?","‘Uncle, hurry up and save me!’"]},{"number":3834,"title":"Chapter 3834: Angered","paragraphs":["Chapter 3834: Angered","Ling Han thrashed Xue Zhan harshly.","The Xue brothers should thank the fact that they were in the Nine Suns Holy Land. Otherwise, Ling Han definitely wouldn’t have been so polite. Instead, he would have directly killed the two of them.","“Brilliant! Brilliant!” the large black dog called out from the sidelines. However, he","suppressed his urge and didn’t rush over to give him a kick.","This was something that Ling Han had especially instructed. If it was just him alone, it would be easy to deal with him.","After being thrashed for more than ten minutes, that clan uncle of the Xue Clan, Xue Bingyuan, finally arrived late.","It was not that he had not received Xue Zhan’s call for help, but rather that he had been serving Liu Sanjun tea at that time, so how could he possibly dare to speak up?","—Liu Sanjun was indeed a headstrong person, but he was not an idiot. If he knew that Xue Bingyuan was using his name as an intimidation tactic, Xue Bingyuan would definitely be in trouble.","However, against a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, he naturally could deal with him easily, and there was even less need for Liu Sanjun to know.","Thus, Xue Bingyuan could only endure endlessly, right until Liu Sanjun had finished drinking his tea, and went off to cultivate. Only then did he get the chance, and immediately charged","over.","He was aggressive. Since he knew that the Xue brothers were his clansmen, this Ling Han actually still dared to make a move. He was really outrageously bold.","Could it be that he was trying to rebel?","“How dare you!” Xue Bingyuan said calmly. He was treading on empty air. This was an ability that only a cultivator at the Core Formation Tier could possess. Finally, he no longer needed to borrow the power of a Spirit Tool to be able to fly. In fact, he could even tread on empty air. “I’m not as bold as you. You’re just a Dao Apprentice, yet you actually dare to indulge your clansmen and break the rules of the Holy Land,” Ling Han said calmly. “Do you think that the Holy Land belongs to your family?”","Xue Bingyuan raised a brow, and was just about to flip out.","He was a Core Formation Tier elite, and furthermore, he was Liu Sanjun’s Dao Apprentice, so who would not give him some face? Even if he was a Cauldron Forging Tier disciple, so what? When they saw him, they still had to address him as Lord, their attitude respectful.","However, Ling Han actually dared to mock him, so how could he not be furious?","However, the Xue brothers were still in Ling Han’s hands, so he didn’t dare to make a move rashly.","“Let him go!” he commanded coldly.","“Who are you showing off your might for?” Ling Han shook his head, unmoved.","“Humph!” Xue Bingyuan released his own aura, which instantly boiled up like a tsunami. How foolish. Didn’t he know that the martial artist with a higher cultivation level could completely crush the martial artist with a lower cultivation level? He didn’t even need to make a move. A single aura would be enough to disintegrate Ling Han’s battle prowess, rendering him unable to withstand a single blow.","However, Ling Han’s aura didn’t change in the slightest. What!","Xue Bingyuan was instantly surprised. What was going on?","Could it be that he had some rare treasure on him that could resist the suppression of an elite’s aura?","That must be the case.","He felt slightly troubled, because this forced him to make a move, and once he made a move, Xue Zhan and Xue Hai, the two hostages, would become variables.","“It’s rude not to reciprocate!” Ling Han unleashed his murderous aura.","So what if he was a Core Formation Tier cultivator? Xue Bingyuan was completely unguarded, and was instantly hit. He was momentarily dazed.","However, he was an elite, after all, so the effects were really only momentary.","Xue Bingyuan flew into a humiliated rage, his old face flushed red.","-His name was Dao Apprentice, but after so many years, he had long since become an old","man.","This was too humiliating.","The aura he emitted did not affect Ling Han at all, but Ling Han’s counterattack had caused him to fall for it... how could this be tolerated?","One had to realize that Ling Han was only at the Cauldron Forging Tier. Meanwhile, he was at the Core Formation Tier.","A cold light shot out of Xue Bingyuan’s eyes, and he felt an urge to kill Ling Han, regardless of the consequences.","Ling Han smiled faintly, grabbed Xue Zhan and his brother, and turned to leave, “If you can, come and chase me. If you can catch me, it’s your win.”","He used the Imminent Skyline, and his speed was extremely fast.","Xue Bingyuan naturally set off in pursuit without the slightest hesitation. A mere Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, no matter how extraordinary he was, was still like an ant in his eyes, so how could he possibly be afraid?","But he shockingly discovered that Ling Han’s speed was really too fast, so fast that he did not seem like a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator.","With this kind of speed, it was probable that those who had just advanced into the Core Formation Tier would also just barely manage this speed.","This brat should have used some kind of powerful movement technique, but the stronger a cultivation technique was, the more limited the time he could cast it. The movement","technique was no exception.","Was this brat on steroids or something? He could still maintain his high speed even with two","people in his grasp?","s was too inconceivable.","But there was nothing that could be done. He couldn’t not give chase, right?","Xue Bingyuan chased with all his might, slowly closing the distance between them.","He was in the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, so his speed naturally couldn’t be compared to those who had just entered the Core Formation Tier.","Just as he was about to get closer and closer to Ling Han, this brat suddenly braked and","actually stopped.","‘Hmm?’","Xue Bingyuan didn’t know what Ling Han was playing at, but he was already extremely vigilant against this Cauldron Forging Tier junior. He really didn’t dare to be careless at all,","and also stopped.","As long as he remained unchanged, he would definitely be able to suppress Ling Han with his strength as a Core Formation Tier cultivator.","“I have hostages in my hands, so don’t come over again.” Ling Han raised Xue Zhan and Xue","Hai high in the air.","Pu!","Xue Bingyuan almost tripped and fell. Just now, he had still been wary of Ling Han, but this brat actually made such a weak move in the blink of an eye. This really made his jaw drop.","If it was claimed that this brat was cowardly, he even dared to trifle with him. But to call him courageous, he was actually using hostages to threaten him now. What kind of tough guy was this?","“What exactly do you want me to do for you to let them go?” Xue Bingyuan asked calmly. “Let’s have a nice chat about compensation,” Ling Han said seriously.","“All right, how do you want to compensate?” Xue Bingyuan smiled. This brat was finally","afraid.","This was very natural. He was the elite of the Core Formation Tier, and there was a great elite of the Sect Master level standing behind him. Wasn’t it very normal for him to give in?","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Old geezer, you’ve made a mistake. It’s not how I’m","going to pay, but how you guys are going to pay.”","What!","Xue Bingyuan was stunned for a moment before coming back to his senses. Involuntarily, he couldn’t help but look furious.","You beat up my clansmen, and that was already trifling with me in the first place. Furthermore, as a mere Cauldron Forging Tier, where did you get such great courage to dare ask him, a Core Formation Tier elite, to compensate you?","“You’re truly tired of living!” he said balefully.","Xiu, someone flew over from afar, one after another, and there were quite a number of them.","There was Lin Luo, the empress, and the others, as well as some unrelated people. Previously, when they saw Ling Han and Xue Bingyuan rushing past, they subconsciously ran over to","watch the excitement.","Xue Bingyuan was unafraid. He felt that he was in the right in this matter, so even if Ling Han was injured in the end, Liu Sanjun would still try his best to protect him.","Thus, he stood with his hands clasped behind his back, appearing very confident. Ling Han’s expression was solemn. “This b@stard coveted my wife, harrassed her several times, and was taught a lesson. After telling him to behave himself, he actually invited his Cauldron Forging Tier elder brother. He gave my friends a beating, but did not suffer any punishment himself. Ultimately, the reason why they have such great courage is because they have a relative who is in the Core Formation Tier like you.”","At first, he had wanted to say that Princess Bixiao was his friend, but when he thought about","how the grudge for the sake of a friend was not as great as the grudge for a wife, he changed his words at the last moment. He was sure that the empress and the Demon Race would","understand."]},{"number":3835,"title":"Chapter 3835: Formation confining Core Formation Tier","paragraphs":["Chapter 3835: Formation confining Core Formation Tier","Xiu, xiu, xiu, even more people ran over.","For example, Tan Meng, Jie Yingqiu, the three great beauties had all arrived. They were all very concerned about this matter.","In their eyes, though Ling Han was not qualified to become a good husband, he was a rare talent, which made them want to recruit him, and this was a very good opportunity.","Ling Han definitely wouldn’t be able to resolve this tribulation. Thus, if they helped Ling Han settle this tribulation, the latter would owe them a huge favor. The following matters would be easy to deal with.","It was naturally impossible for Xue Bingyuan to admit it in public. With a flutter of his sleeve, he said, “What a bunch of nonsense.”","Ling Han broke into a grin. He first threw Xue Zhan onto the ground, then patted Xue Hai’s head, “Come, as the person involved, and as the instigator, tell me the whole story.”","“You are spouting nonsense!” Xue Hai would definitely not admit it either, and immediately shouted loudly.","In this kind of situation, how could Ling Han possibly dare to use force to extort a confession from him?","“Ah-” He suddenly released a terrible scream. One of his arms had already been forcefully broken by Ling Han.","This guy really dared!","Hiss, no wonder this guy had only been targeting his face previously. At that time, had he already expected this scene to happen?","Ling Han not only broke his arm, but also began to crush his finger bones inch by inch.","The ten fingers were connected to the heart; how painful was this?","Xue Hai screamed repeatedly, tears streaming down his face.","“Stop!” Xue Bingyuan shouted angrily, but when he discovered that Ling Han’s whole body was filled with killing intent, he did not dare move. That was because in this state, Ling Han would really commit murder.","He could not force him into a corner.","With a thought, he used the connection device to inform Xue Hai, telling him to temporarily relent and admit it. In any case, he could still deny and say that it was Ling Han who had forced him to confess in the future, and that he had no choice but to admit it.","Initially, Xue Hai could no longer hold on. Now that his uncle had relented, he naturally related the matter in full detail.","A great many people did not know the whole story, and when they heard, they were all furious.","If a sect didn’t even have the basic rules, how could they cultivate in peace?","This was going too far.","“And you!” Ling Han pointed at Xue Zhan again.","Xue Zhan did not want to suffer any further, and also wanted to “confess”, but Ling Han did not care at all. He first broke more than half of his bones, and only then did he allow him to speak.","This... as everyone looked at Ling Han, they all broke out in a cold sweat.","This guy would seek revenge for the smallest grievance, and was resolute in killing. In future, The definitely could not be trifled with.","Even the beautiful eyes of Tan Meng and the other women rippled. Could they control such a man?","Ling Han cracked a smile and said, “Fine, since you’ve already confessed and admitted your mistake, I’ll let you go. I’ll naturally punish you according to the sect’s rules.”","As he said this, he shook his hands. Pa, pa! Xue Zhan and his brother were both thrown out by him, landing on the ground extremely far away.","Yi?","Everyone was stunned. What was going on here?","Without a hostage, how could you coerce a Core Formation Tier elite?","Just now, you were mighty and mighty, but as long as a Core Formation Tier cultivator made a move, wouldn’t you follow in the footsteps of the Xue brothers?","Had he gone mad?","Xue Bingyuan laughed loudly, but his voice was cold and sinister, clearly filled with fury, “Brat, you are really bold!”","“Uncle, kill him! Kill him!” Xue Hai shouted from the sidelines. He had been thrashed repeatedly, and previously, he did not dare to speak at all, fearing that he would anger Ling Han. But now that he had escaped from the tiger’s den, and with his uncle standing guard, he naturally had nothing holding him back.","Though Xue Zhan did not speak, his eyes were filled with venom. Naturally, he too hoped that Ling Han would be taught a harsh lesson by Xue Bingyuan. The best scenario would be for him to be directly killed.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “How could it be that I would be afraid of you?”","Because he was confident, Xue Bingyu was not in a rush to make a move. Instead, he asked calmly, “Shouldn’t you be afraid of me?”","“Why should I be afraid?” Ling Han shook his head, “I am a disciple of the Holy Land, and who do you think you are? You are merely a Dao Apprentice, and you want me to be afraid of you? Hehe, do you still have any regard for the Holy Land?”","Xue Bingyuan was instantly suffocated. This had pierced his sore spot.","Even if he was now in the Core Formation Tier, and could look down on all the disciples of this term, in terms of status, how could a mere Dao Apprentice be qualified?","His expression was twisted, his eyes shooting out flames of fury.","“I am a dignified Core Formation Tier cultivator, and you dare disrespect elites. This is looking down on the order of martial arts!” he said balefully. He couldn’t endure it any longer, and strode out, planning to apprehend Ling Han.","However, he had just taken one step, when he saw that there were actually veined patterns glowing on the ground all around him, forming a complicated pattern.","Not good, this was a formation!","He immediately understood why Ling Han had led him here, and why he had suddenly stopped. As it turned out, it was to draw him into the formation.","However... heng, heng, how could a mere Cauldron Forging Tier formation be able to trap him?","“If I were you, I wouldn’t move a single muscle from now onwards,” Ling Han said calmly.","How could Xue Bingyuan be willing to listen? His foot had already descended, “A mere Cauldron Forging Tier is no different from an ant in my eyes.”","Peng, instantly, the formation patterns’ brilliance flashed madly, shooting rapidly towards","Xue Bingyuan.","Xue Bingyuan moved, and shattered these streaks of light. However, he was shocked to discover that not only was the offensive power of these streaks of light terrifying, but there was also a huge amount of them. They were endless, and even he could only parry them","wearily.","He paled in shock. If this continued, he would eventually collapse.","This was really too hard to believe. A Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator was actually capable of setting up a formation on the level of Core Formation Tier.","He hurriedly broke through, wanting to charge out of the formation, but the moment he moved, it incited an even stronger backlash from the formation. More and more brilliance surged out, shooting towards him, and from the outside, these lights actually formed the","shape of a treasure bottle.","“This is... the Three Elements Treasure Bottle Formation!” someone recognized.","“What, a formation that can slay Core Formation Tiers?”","“No way!”","Everyone exclaimed in shock. Then, realization dawned on them. No wonder Ling Han was so","calm and collected. As it turned out, everything was under his control.","They couldn’t help but feel rueful. Even a Core Formation Tier elite was toyed around with by","Ling Han; he was truly awesome.","Tan Meng and the other seductive beauties’ eyes also lit up. They felt that Ling Han’s value had to be re-evaluated. This was not just a great alchemist, but also had outstanding natural","talent in formations.","This kind of talent was worthy of being roped in with the highest treatment. In fact, in fact, he could be listed as a candidate for future husband.","At this moment, the ones with the worst expressions were naturally Xue Hai and Xue Zhan.","The clan uncle that they were leaning on for support was actually dealt with by Ling Han just","like that?","It was as if they were in a dream.","They looked at Ling Han, and felt that this young man was a monster.","A Core Formation Tier versus a Cauldron Forging Tier, and it was the Core Formation Tier that was actually suppressed instead.","“Ah—” Xue Bingyuan screamed in agony. The Three Elements Treasure Bottle Formation could refine a cultivator in the Core Formation Tier, and though he was in the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, he was only a Dao Apprentice, so his natural talent in martial arts naturally couldn’t be too outstanding. His abilities could only be considered average, and he couldn’t break out of the formation at all."]},{"number":3836,"title":"Chapter 3836: Sect Master makes his move","paragraphs":["Chapter 3836: Sect Master makes his move","Hearing Xue Bingchuan’s screams become louder and louder, everyone’s hearts shivered. Could it be that... Ling Han wanted to forcefully refine Xue Bingyuan?","Hiss, no one would believe this if he told them.","A Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator not only defeated a Core Formation Tier cultivator, but also counterattacked? Wasn’t this a fantasy story?","Furthermore, Xue Bingyuan had a Sect Master elite backing him up. Aren’t you afraid that Liu Sanjun would fly into a thunderous rage?","“Brat, stop! Stop!” Xue Bingyuan screamed. He really couldn’t hold on any longer. If he continued to hold on, he would really be refined by Ling Han.","Yet Ling Han only acted as if he had not heard anything. Family and friends were his reverse scale. Thus, the moment someone dared to trifle with him in this aspect, he would definitely counter harshly, and let everyone know that this was an insurmountable bottom line.","Xue Bingyuan had not thought that Ling Han would be so ruthless. He was really going to put him to death.","He had no choice, and could only ask Liu Sanjun for help.","Originally, he had not wanted to trouble Liu Sanjun. What logic was there for a master to turn around and clean up the mess for a servant? Furthermore, he was a dignified Core Formation Tier cultivator, and could not even deal with a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator. With Liu Sanjun’s fiery temper, would he still allow him to stay by his side in future?","Thus, he had always wanted to break free through his own effort previously. But now that he couldn’t barge out forcefully and couldn’t beg for mercy either, he could only use his last","move.","There was only hope if he was alive. If he was dead, everything would be for naught.","Ling Han smirked coldly. He began to circle around the formation. Even though he seemed to be very casual, with every step he took, there would be streaks of Spiritual Power sinking into the ground, stimulating the power of heaven and earth.","With his current strength, it was naturally impossible for him to create a Core Formation Tier formation. However, the formation had already been formed, so if he only went to add fuel to the fire, it would naturally be a hundred times easier.","“Ah! Ah! Ah!” Xue Bingyuan’s screams suddenly became louder, and even shriller. He felt like he was about to die.","Most importantly, Liu Sanjun was presently comprehending Dao, searching for an opportunity to break through to Venerate Tier. Once he had entered into a state of deep meditation, how could he possibly awaken with a soft call from him?","“Elder! Elder! Save me!” He tried his best to call for help through the connection device, but very quickly, with a pa, the connection device fell down, and was destroyed by the formation.","He had lost all hope. The terrifying energy was presently refining him, and fusing him with the heaven and earth.","Weng, right at this moment, a terrifying aura circulated, and everyone felt their vision blur. A white-haired, white-browed, white-bearded old man had appeared in the arena. He had a square face, and was exuding endless might.","Liu Sanjun, a Sect Master great elite!","He moved, and with a single grab, the treasure bottle that was actually formed from energy instantly shattered with a loud bang. How could a Core Formation Tier formation be able to withstand an attack of Sect Master-level?","However, it was already too late. Inside the formation, Xue Bingyuan had already turned into a pile of bones.","Even so, Liu Sanjun could still easily sense that the shards of consciousness that were exuding from this corpse. It was lingering resentment.","“Who dares to kill this old man’s Dao Apprentice?” Liu Sanjun asked coldly. The temperature in the surroundings instantly dropped. Even if they were Cauldron Forging Tiers, so what? They were all trembling, wanting to cross their arms over their chests, and ice shards were continuously falling from the skies.","This was a Sect Master elite. With a single thought, he could affect heaven and earth, and in his fury, he could create a river of blood.","“Elder!” Xue Zhan scrambled over, “Xue Bingyuan is my uncle. My name is Xue Zhan, and my uncle was killed by that despicable brat!”","He pointed at Ling Han, his eyes filled with resentment and a sliver of light.","Xue Bingyuan had died at Ling Han’s hands. Not only could he use Liu Sanjun to kill Ling Han, if he acted appropriately, he could even form a relationship with Liu Sanjun.","Thus, this was a great opportunity.","Xue Hai was not stupid either. He similarly ran out, and knelt down together to talk about Ling Han’s crimes.","From the mouths of the two brothers, everything was naturally Ling Han’s fault. He bullied them just because he had higher abilities, and after they asked Xue Bingyuan to help them, he was even killed by Ling Han using formation techniques.","This was really distorting the truth and spouting nonsense.","However, Liu Sanjun’s expression became uglier and uglier. Even if he only had to trust a little bit of what they said, and added with the corpse of Xue Bingchuan laid out in front of him, it was enough to make him so furious that he wanted to commit murder.","“How dare you!” Liu Sanjun looked at Ling Han with baleful eyes, and said, “Even if your natural talent is unparalleled, you’ll only become a great calamity in the future if you commit evil. Let me eliminate you!”","He stretched out a hand. Boom, endless energy converged, turning into a colossal hand that struck out at Ling Han.","This was the attack of a Sect Master elite. Even if Ling Han was a hundred times more freakish,","it would still be useless. He was completely no match-unless he summoned the Heavenly Dao Flames inside the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","However, Ling Han didn’t.","That was because a figure had shot out, and managed to block this blow in time.","“Yan Dong, what is the meaning of this?” Liu Sanjun asked coldly. The person who had","stopped him was none other than Yan Dong.","Yan Dong chuckled, “I have come to resolve a misunderstanding.”","“Misunderstanding?” Liu Sanjun smirked coldly, “This Dao Apprentice of mine died here. Could it be that my eyes have blurred?”","Yan Dong’s face was still smiling, but he secretly blamed Ling Han for taking things too far, to actually kill someone. However, on the other hand, he was also very impressed with Ling Han. How many people in history had managed to kill a Core Formation Tier with the cultivation level of Cauldron Forging Tier?","He was only an apprentice, and not an official disciple. In Yan Dong’s eyes, this was not a big deal at all. The problem now was Liu Sanjun’s pride. As long as Liu Sanjun could maintain his pride, this matter was actually very easy to deal with.","“Ling Han, come, apologize to Elder Liu.” He waved at Ling Han.","“Yes.” Ling Han’s expression was respectful as he strode to Yan Dong’s side. He then raised his clasped hands in Liu Sanjun’s direction and said, “I accidentally killed Elder Liu’s Dao Apprentice by mistake, so I’m willing to pay compensation.”","Compensate, compensate your sister!","Liu Sanjun was almost angered to death. He, a great Sect Master elite, would care about the compensation of a mere Cauldron Forging Tier? What compensation could you offer? Even if you paid with your life, he would not take it to heart either.","Fine, was this an apology or a mockery?","“Good! Good! Good!” he said balefully, his eyes fixed on Yan Dong. “You must interfere?”","Yan Dong could not stop now, but he was extremely slick, and said, “This is all a matter of the Holy Land. They are all disciples of the Holy Land, so don’t be rash.”","Liu Sanjun only acted as if he had not heard him. Pointing at Xue Zhan, he said, “All right. I will give guidance to this person in one month’s time, and then have him engage in a mortal","duel with that despicable brat.”","A mortal duel!","Then it would be a battle to the death.","Liu Sanjun looked towards Xue Zhan, “Do you dare or not?”","Xue Zhan gritted his teeth, and said, “I dare!”","This was obviously a chance. Liu Sanjun would use extraordinary means to madly increase his strength within a month’s time. This was a great opportunity. Of course, this would definitely be incredibly painful. To have a world-shaking change in his strength within a month’s time, how could that be an empty promise?","Liu Sanjun looked towards Ling Han again, “Do you dare or not?”","Yan Dong gave Ling Han a look, signalling for Ling Han to not agree. In any case, Xue","Bingchuan was not a disciple of the Holy Land, so even if he died, so be it.","“Sure,” Ling Han said calmly."]},{"number":3837,"title":"Chapter 3837: Deathmatch","paragraphs":["Chapter 3837: Deathmatch","F***!","Yan Dong really wanted to curse. Why did you agree? Could it be that you don’t know how","amazing the methods of a Sect Master elite were? He was completely capable of creating a monster in a short period of time.","However, Ling Han had already agreed, so what else could he say?","“Good, very good.” Liu Sanjun nodded, then beckoned Xue Zhan over, “Follow me.”","“Yes, Elder!” Xue Zhan was overjoyed. Since Liu Sanjun had set a deadline of a month, then with his status and identity, how could it be that this Elder would slap himself in the face? Thus, he would be completely transformed within a month’s time, powerful to the point of crushing Ling Han.","This was a great opportunity.","He hurriedly scrambled after Liu Sanjun, and Xue Hai was extremely envious, but there was nothing he could do about it. Who asked him to only be a Foundation Building Tier?","“Sigh, you’re so rash. Why did you agree?” Yan Dong couldn’t help but grumble about Ling Han.","He truly admired this alchemy prodigy. Furthermore, Ling Han actually knew formations as well. He was even more of a prodigy among prodigies, which made him think even more highly of him.","“Do you know that mortal duels prohibit all external power? Tool, Talisman Weapons, formations, and so on aren’t allowed to be used.”","Ling Han really didn’t know, but he didn’t care. Both of them could not use external power, so what did he have to fear?","One month later, would Xue Zhan be able to become a Core Formation Tier elite?","This was impossible. Even a Sect Master elite could not do this. If it was a Saint, it would be more likely.","“With such a bet, it can motivate me.” Ling Han gave a reason. He naturally did not speak his true thoughts — this was a chance to kill Xue Zhan openly and publicly.","Yan Dong was speechless. You are just an alchemist, and now you have the identity of Formation Master, but in terms of martial arts, are you really that powerful?","“Ai, you child!” He sighed, and said, “Do you know that a Sect Master elite is capable of molding a Celestial Cauldron for a Cauldron Forging Tier? Though it does not last long, it is more than enough for a battle.”","“Then why does he still need a month’s time?” Ling Han was curious.","Yan Dong was also subconsciously taken aback, then looked shocked, “Unless... that guy, Liu Sanjun, wants to create more than one Celestial Cauldron for Xue Zhan!”","This kind of technique was actually used to help a Cauldron Forging Tier break through. This was because even if he managed to forge a Celestial Cauldron that was unstable and would soon collapse, it would still allow a cultivator to grasp a sliver of an opportunity and gain some comprehension.","However, only a single Celestial Cauldron had to be created for this, and that was enough. There was no benefit in having more. Furthermore, this was extremely damaging to the user’s vitality. What Sect Master elite would have nothing better to do?","Hence, it was very problematic that Liu Sanjun had set a deadline of a month.","-He did not just want to help Xue Zhan forge a Celestial Cauldron, but rather a few, allowing him to temporarily possess strength that surpassed Ling Han.","Only a Sect Master elite would dare to make such a boast. This kind of technique was indeed heaven-defying.","“Brat, just admit defeat and don’t go to this appointment,” Yan Dong hurriedly said.","Such a prodigy should focus on studying alchemy, and the larger the force, the greater the need for a great alchemist. This was one of the criteria for measuring the strength of a force.","Ling Han merely smiled, “Thank you for your concern, Elder Yan. However, in a battle of equal cultivation levels, I am not afraid of anyone!”","He said these words resolutely and decisively, his confidence soaring.","Yan Dong was also convinced. This was a kind of self-confidence that had even influenced him.","He secretly decided that he would have Ling Han participate in the battle. If he was outmatched, he would save Ling Han even if it meant sacrificing his pride.","Due to the appearance of the two Elders, the matter today had temporarily cooled down. The authorities of the Holy Land did not say who was in the wrong, but a month later, they would definitely settle accounts.","Rules were rules. Without rules, nothing could be accomplished.","The large black dog, Lin Luo, and the others were all a little worried. How could a powerful Sect Master elite confidently agree to a bet with a deadline of a month be slapped in the face?","Thus, when the time came, Xue Zhan’s strength would definitely undergo an earth-shattering change. He definitely had to be careful.","“I know.” Ling Han nodded, “In this month, I will also strive for another breakthrough.”","The maximum limit of the Cauldron Forging Tier was Nine Cauldrons, but there were pitifully few people that could cultivate to this level. Not only did they need their own natural talent, they also had to have astonishing fated opportunities.","Thus, Ling Han definitely did not believe that external power could help Xue Zhan reach this step.","Then he would assume that Xue Zhan could become Eight Cauldrons. This was the highest estimate possible.","He was now at Four Cauldrons, so it shouldn’t be difficult for him to destroy Seven Cauldrons. If he faced Eight Cauldrons, he might not be a match, but it wouldn’t be difficult for him to ensure his safety.","However, Ling Han had never pursued the purpose of just ensuring his safety. What he wanted was victory.","Thus, if he could advance further, and reach Five Cauldrons, then even if Xue Zhan could forge Eight Cauldrons, he would still have the confidence to defeat him.","Everyone was cheering Ling Han on, as well as comforting him to not force himself. That was because he was equivalent to having a battle of arts with a Sect Master elite, so no one would laugh at him even if he admitted his cowardice.","It was difficult to break through to Five Cauldrons within a month!","After advancing into Celestial Path, to say nothing of crossing over a minor level of cultivation level, even taking a small step within a minor level would take a very long time. It would take years at the drop of a hat. Thus, wanting to break through to Five Cauldrons in a month was a little like daydreaming.","Under normal circumstances, Ling Han wouldn’t dare to have such extravagant thoughts. However, he now knew the location of a medicinal field, and it was practically unguarded.","He decided to steal the medicine.","Stealing was definitely not right, but this was also a special circumstance. Worse come to worst, when Ling Han attained great dao, he would come back and make up for it. Special times require special measures, and there was no need to adhere too much to the","rules.","At night, Ling Han quietly arrived at that dry well. After entering, he put on the hide of the Void Beast and headed to the medicinal field.","He searched around, and found a few Celestial medicines that could increase cultivation level,","but they had not ripened.","He could only apologize.","Without maturity, the effects would be slightly inferior, but it would definitely be effective.","Ling Han plucked three unripe fruits and returned to his residence. Then, he ingested the fruits and after refinement, his cultivation level instantly shot up. Alchemical pills had a sliver of alchemic poison, and taking too many wouldn’t be beneficial. Instead, it would be harmful. However, natural treasures didn’t have such worries. It was just that there were too few of them, so it was impossible to take them in an unlimited amount.","Ling Han decided that he would go take a look tomorrow.","Time passed quietly, and Ling Han was also improving every day, which was very shocking.","The news that he and Xue Zhan were going to have a mortal duel in a month’s time had already spread throughout the entire Holy Land. A great many people had expressed their interest, and when the time came, they would definitely go and join in on the excitement. However, there were also some that appeared disdainful, such as Lin Qi and Gan Ping. They looked down on Ling Han greatly, and thought that Ling Han could only borrow external power. In terms of personal strength, he was only an ordinary Four Cauldrons.","This was naturally naked jealousy, because Ling Han actually killed a Core Formation Tier cultivator. What other Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator could do this?","Since they couldn’t do it, they could only nitpick."]},{"number":3838,"title":"Chapter 3838: Five Cauldrons","paragraphs":["Chapter 3838: Five Cauldrons","Ling Han didn’t counterattack. The best way to deal with this kind of person was to defeat them. If he defeated him, wouldn’t he be convinced?","Five days, ten days, half a month, time passed quietly, and the deadline of a month was getting closer and closer.","No one knew how powerful Xue Zhan was now, because he had been staying at Liu Sanjun’s place all this while. As the residence of a Sect Master great elite, who would dare barge in recklessly?","However, according to Lin Qi, he had once been invited by Liu Sanjun to spar with Xue Zhan.","When the news spread out, everyone was curious, and asked Lin Qi one after another to find out just how strong Xue Zhan had become by now.","Lin Qi did not speak directly, and only said that Ling Han was definitely going to die.","Was this not enough?","Yet Ling Han was completely unconcerned. In his imagination, he had already considered Xue Zhan as Eight Cauldrons. Then, what was so strange about an Eight Cauldrons tie, or even defeating Lin Qi in reality?","The problem now was that the cave dwellers seemed to realize that there was something “something” stealing the Celestial medicine, and had already strengthened their defenses. When Ling Han had gone to steal the Celestial medicine yesterday, he had almost been discovered, because there was shockingly a True Self Tier elite.","Stealing medicines would be much more difficult.","It couldn’t be helped. Who asked Ling Han to steal it every day? This would definitely arouse suspicion.","Thankfully, Ling Han’s cultivation level was close to peak stage Four Cauldrons.","He didn’t steal any more medicines. Instead, he focused on cultivating. Even if it wasn’t the half an hour before dawn, he was still cultivating. Although his efficiency was a hundred times lower, no matter how small a mosquito’s leg was, it was still meat. With the current situation, he had to make the most of every second.","Another seven days later, Ling Han finally reached the peak stage of Four Cauldrons.","He could now attempt to reach Five Cauldrons.","The basic conditions had been met, but there had to be an opportunity to break through. How could one break through just like that?","Ling Han then went to battle on the Galaxy Network, wanting to find inspiration in the midst of battle to take that crucial step.","One day, two days, three days, yet Ling Han made no progress at all. It was as if he could only cultivate to Four Cauldrons, and this was his limit.","Ling Han naturally didn’t believe this. He did not continue fighting, but rather cultivated in seclusion.","He emptied his mind and stopped thinking about the battle that would take place a few days later. He sorted through his recent battles over and over again. Finally, he recalled the battles of the Ancestral King, Pan Shi, in his mind. Great scenes appeared in his mind, surging magnificently.","All of a sudden, he had an inspiration.","Begin!","Ling Han took a sip of Earth Spirit Milk, then sat down in a cross-legged position and charged towards Five Cauldrons.","He had also ingested a Cauldron Heart Pill, and in his mind, the image of a Celestial Cauldron appeared.","Though this was only an image, it could be used as a reference to reconstruct his fifth Celestial Cauldron.","‘Come!’","His life essence condensed, turning into the core of the fifth Celestial Cauldron. Then, using this as a foundation, it continued to grow stronger.","Two days later, the breakthrough was completed.","In Ling Han’s mind, the fifth cauldron was formed. It floated gently, emanating Celestial Qi. However, it was only a cauldron, but there were no legs.","“Though it is only early stage Five Cauldrons, with my battle prowess, it would not be a problem for me to defeat Eight Cauldrons. Even if I encounter Nine Cauldrons, I am sure that I would be just barely qualified to battle them.” Ling Han was filled with confidence. Of course, the more Celestial Cauldrons he formed, it meant that the higher his natural talent, the stronger this prodigy’s battle prowess would be.","How many people in the entire universe could cultivate to the level of Nine Cauldrons within the same era?","Thus, this kind of person would definitely have battle prowess that defied the heavens. Ling Han didn’t dare to boast that he could still defeat someone with a disadvantage of a few minor levels of cultivation.","For example, Origin, Myriad Dao and Heaven Crushing were all monsters like him. He wanted to defeat them with a disadvantage of two or three minor levels? How was that possible!","However, Xue Zhan? Hehe.","How could this kind of cultivation level that had been rapidly achieved in a short period of time, and one that had been temporarily attained through the power of others, possibly compare to the likes of Origin and the others?","To say nothing of Origin, even Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian were much stronger than him.","There were still three days until the mortal duel.","Ling Han came out of seclusion, and began to wander around in the Holy Land, appearing extremely calm.","In this Holy Land, it was possible that secret techniques were hidden everywhere. Thus, since he had just broken through, it was not appropriate for him to advance any further. He needed to relax, so he could use this time to hunt for treasures.","His luck began to improve. In a short three days, he actually managed to obtain a considerable number of celestial techniques from within the cracks of a rock, the body of a fish in the lake, and the rhythm of eruption of a volcano, and so on. However, it was a shame that their levels weren’t too high. At present, he really didn’t take Sect Master-level secret techniques to heart.","Then, another night later, it would be the day of the final battle between Ling Han and Xue","Zhan.","The sun had just risen, and Ling Han cultivated for half an hour as usual. This was something","that would not change ever.","He packed his things, and left.","When he arrived at the foot of the mountain, he saw that the empress, Hu Niu, Lin Luo, Wu Qiyuan, Yuwen Tian and the others were all waiting for him.","Ling Han nodded at everyone, and then headed towards the location of the final battle.","This was a massive open space, and there were a great many people waiting there. The entire Holy Land had been strengthened by the great elites of the past eras, so to say nothing of Cauldron Forging Tier, even if Sect Master great elites moved, the damage they could cause would be extremely limited. Thus, there was no need for the deliberate set up of a tournament stage for the mortal duel.","As expected, neither Lin Qi nor Gan Ping had come. It was as if they wanted to use this attitude to tell everyone that they were not optimistic about Ling Han at all, and did not want to waste","any time.","However, Tan Meng and the other great beauties had all arrived, and when they saw Ling Han approach, they all approached him.","“Senior Brother Ling, if you’re not confident, it’s best not to accept the challenge,” Jie","Yingqiu was the first to say.","“That’s right. Senior Brother Ling is skilled in both alchemy and formations, so there is no","need for you to come to blows with a brute,” Jiang Yifei echoed.","Yet Tan Meng smiled beautifully, “I wish Senior Brother Ling a triumphant return in","advance.”","She had “exchanged blows” with Ling Han before, and with her intelligence, she was naturally very familiar with Ling Han’s personality. If this guy was not confident, how could The possibly agree to a mortal duel with Xue Zhan?","Therefore, this guy must have a trump card – it should be known that Elder Yan Dong had previously stood up for him.","Then, if Xue Zhan could obtain Liu Sanjun’s help, why couldn’t Ling Han do the same? Hu Niu instantly looked like she was protecting her food, and looked at the three women with","a vigilant gaze, “You three ugly monsters, Ling Han is Niu’s, don’t even think about it!”","These words were too direct, causing the beautiful faces of the three women to flush. They were prodigies on the Exquisite Leaderboard, and who knew how many prodigies would fight tooth and nail just to see them, yet you mistakenly thought that they were here to get","close to Ling Han?","Ling Han had not even spoken, when xiu, a swift light shot out from a certain mountain peak,","and appeared in the arena in a flash.","Liu Sanjun had come.","There was a person in his grasp, and it was Xue Zhan.","“Begin,” he said calmly. This was merely a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, and he couldn’t even be bothered to take another look at him. What was the point of wasting time? Meanwhile, Xue Zhan twisted his neck, as if he was stretching his muscles and bones. Then, he looked at Ling Han with a provoking gaze, “Haha, can you block three moves from me?” Right now, he was brimming with confidence. With Liu Sanjun’s help, he had condensed five Celestial Cauldrons, allowing him to become an Eight Cauldrons elite.","Though after this battle, those five Celestial Cauldrons would all disappear, there would still be seeds left behind. In future, it was possible that he could charge up to Five Cauldrons, or","even Six Cauldrons in fact."]},{"number":3839,"title":"Chapter 3839: Kneel","paragraphs":["Chapter 3839: Kneel","He was truly a vile character who had become conceited.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Who do you think you are, that you can strut around in front of me?”","“Hahahaha!” Xue Zhan laughed loudly, “Frog at the bottom of a well, you have not reached this level, so there is absolutely no way that you would know just how strong I am now!”","He stretched out a finger, “To defeat you, one finger is enough.”","Ling Han stood with his hands clasped behind his back, saying, “You’re far too boastful. Don’t be defeated at the first exchange. That would be far too humiliating.”","Xue Zhan’s eyes were cold. In terms of bickering, he was really no match for Ling Han. Thus, it was better to make a move directly.","He had absolute confidence in his own strength. He was so strong that it was as if he could match even a Core Formation Tier cultivator. Wasn’t suppressing a Four Cauldrons cultivator a piece of cake?","Fine, he would beat this brat to the ground first, and then slowly humiliate him.","Xue Zhan made up his mind, and walked towards Ling Han. As he walked, he released his Celestial Cauldron.","One, two, three, four!","When he released the fourth Celestial Cauldron, everyone couldn’t help but exclaim in surprise. Four cauldrons! In the entire Galaxy Network, there were only a thousand or so people who could form four cauldrons. This kind of strength was enough to rank in the top thousand. No matter which sect they went to, they would be qualified to become a Dao Child.","However, this was not the end. Xue Zhan released the fifth Celestial Cauldron.","“Heavens!” Everyone exclaimed in shock. Five cauldrons, breaking through on the basis of the maximum limit was even harder.","This was still not Xue Zhan’s limit. He released the sixth Celestial Cauldron.","Actually, he clearly could have released all the Celestial Cauldrons at the same time, but for the sake of achieving the greatest effect of showing off, he chose to show them one by one.","Only then would it be stunning.","As expected, everyone was exclaiming in shock. Six cauldrons! Even Gan Ping and Lin Qi probably only had this kind of strength.","Immediately afterward, the seventh Celestial Cauldron appeared.","Seven cauldrons!","Everyone was numb with shock, not knowing how to speak.","No wonder Gan Ping had said that Ling Han was definitely going to die. Seven cauldrons, that was too terrifying.","“Do you think that this is my limit?” Xue Zhan roared loudly, and the eighth Celestial Cauldron appeared.","Eight cauldrons, the highest peak that was inferior only to Nine Cauldrons.","Everyone couldn’t help but turn to look at Liu Sanjun. Was this the strength of a Sect Master? It had only been a month, and he had already raised a Heaven Cauldron to Eight Cauldrons.","“No, five of Xue Zhan’s Celestial Cauldrons were forcefully created by Elder Liu with his supreme might. This can’t be maintained for long.”","“So that’s how it is. Otherwise, it would be too terrifying.”","“That’s natural. If the Celestial Cauldron could be condensed like this, then what would be so strange about eight cauldrons or even nine cauldrons in fact?”","“That’s right.”","“However, this Celestial Cauldron has left a mark in Xue Zhan’s body after all. In future, if he wants to forge a new Celestial Cauldron, it would be ten times, or even a hundred times easier than others.”","“This guy is really lucky, and can be considered to have profited from this misfortune.” Everyone was discussing spiritedly. There would always be those who had good insight and were knowledgeable, and spoke of Xue Zhan’s true situation at this time.","This caused a great many people to feel envious. Perhaps, Xue Zhan’s limit was only Four Cauldrons, but after this incident, this guy’s future limit could possibly be Five Cauldrons, or even Six Cauldrons in fact.","After all, how could it be as simple as temporarily improving one’s battle prowess when it was causing serious injury to the vitality of a Sect Master elite?","Xue Zhan was really high-spirited now, proud to the extreme. He felt that all the men were envious of him, and all the women were admiring him, causing his vanity to swell endlessly. “Kneel!” he shouted loudly at Ling Han. His aura surged madly, like tumultuous waves.","In the distance, many people felt their legs go weak, and almost knelt down.","They couldn’t help but feel shocked. They were already so far away, yet they were still affected. This guy’s strength was practically heaven-defying.","However, Ling Han was completely unmoved.","Yi?","Xue Zhan looked surprised. Why was this guy completely unaffected?","“Kneel!” Ling Han also spoke up. Boom! A murderous aura surged out.","Xue Zhan instantly felt his mind go blank, and then a powerful chill rose up in him. Involuntarily, his legs weakened, and he fell to his knees.","Peng, this kneel was extremely heavy, and the sound was loud and clear.","F***, what was going on?","Everyone was dumbfounded. Xue Zhan was clearly awe-inspiring, with a cultivation level of Eight Cauldrons. To say nothing of the fact that he was invincible against all those in Cauldron Forging Tier, there were only a rare few that could defeat him at present. However, in the blink of an eye, Xue Zhan had knelt down, so how could they not be shocked to the point of their eyes popping out?","However, Tan Meng and the other seductive beauties’ beautiful eyes shone brilliantly. What they feared the most was Ling Han being rash and quick-tempered. Whether it was this kind of person as a subordinate, partner or husband, it was all incredibly troublesome. Now, it was proof that Ling Han wasn’t arrogant at all. Instead, he was genuinely powerful.","This was called confidence.","Meanwhile, Liu Sanjun’s expression instantly became dark. He had worked hard for a month, even sacrificing his vitality to forcefully raise Xue Zhan’s cultivation level to Eight Cauldrons. At first, he had thought that he would be able to trample on Ling Han and win back some face for him. Who would have thought that Xue Zhan would kneel down before they had even","exchanged blows?","What was the point of continuing the battle?","“Ah!” Xue Zhan immediately jumped up, his face flushed red. Pointing at Ling Han, he exclaimed, “You actually dare to use a Spirit Tool, despicable and shameless!”","Otherwise, how could a mere Four Cauldrons cause him to lose his senses?","When everyone heard this, doubt arose in their hearts. That’s right. This was a little","inconceivable. Could Four Cauldrons be so strong?","“Stop humiliating yourself, and make your move!” However, right at this moment, Liu","Sanjun suddenly shouted in a deep voice.","Was he using a Spirit Tool? How could it be that he wasn’t aware of it?","This was truly humiliating. His skills were inferior, yet he actually said that it was because his opponent had used a Tool. This was even uglier than when he had been kneeling on the","ground.","Hearing Liu Sanjun’s words, everyone naturally understood.","Ling Han didn’t use a Spirit Tool. Otherwise, Liu Sanjun would definitely attack at the first","instant.","Hiss, without using a Spirit Tool, and merely relying on his true abilities, Ling Han actually managed to make an Eight Cauldrons kneel. This was too terrifying.","It was not just Tan Meng and the other seductive women. Now, every female disciple’s gaze towards Ling Han was filled with iridiscent light, wanting nothing more than to immediately bed him, so that it would be done and decided.","Xue Zhan gritted his teeth, and with a loud roar, charged towards Ling Han.","His cultivation level of Eight Cauldrons was unleashed, and he was as terrifying as a Demon","King.","Unfortunately... Ling Han glared at him. Pa! Xue Zhan fell to his knees again.","This!","Everyone was speechless. Have you come to battle, or are you here to perform a kowtow?","“Ah!” Xue Zhan roared again. He leaped up, and charged towards Ling Han again.","Pa, kneel again.","“Ah!”","Pa!","“Ah!”","Pa!","–","Xue Zhan rose up again and again, but knelt time and time again. This scene was endlessly playing out, and actually made people feel that it was incredibly comical. A considerable","number of people were already laughing out loud.","This mortal duel was clearly a monkey show.","Xue Zhan was already extraordinarily furious. Even if he could show his divine might later,","and blast Ling Han into smithereens, he would definitely become a laughing stock in future, and would endlessly be mocked by others.","Hence, his killing intent filled the skies. He only had one thought, and that was to tear Ling Han into pieces."]},{"number":3840,"title":"Chapter 3840: Directly Killed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3840: Directly Killed","“Ling Han, do you dare to fight me head-on?” Xue Zhan provoked.","It was unknown what kind of technique the other party had used. Though he was prepared, it was still impossible for him to guard against it. He kept falling to his knees against his will. —This was natural. This was an attack on the level of divine sense. Unless one’s willpower was as strong as iron, only the heirs of the Buddhist Race would be able to stand against the attacks. The Six Characters Bright King Curse had an outstanding defensive effect against spiritual attacks.","Ling Han didn’t want to continue playing with him, and said calmly, “Make your move.”","Xue Zhan succeeded in provoking Ling Han, and couldn’t help but sneer. As long as he could unleash the battle prowess of Eight Cauldrons, he would have a crushing advantage against Four Cauldrons.","“Die!”","He charged over and threw a punch.","The mortal duel prohibited all external items, but it was all right. His fists could crush everything.","Ling Han humphed lightly, and also shot out a punch.","Peng!","The two fists crashed into each other, instantly creating a storm of energy, turning into a mushroom cloud that rose into the air. However, the ground here was too firm. Even this kind of attack could only create a pit that was not too deep.","Amidst the chaotic flashes of light, both Ling Han and Xue Zhan were seen retreating rapidly. What!","Everyone could not believe their eyes.","Previously, Xue Zhan had repeatedly knelt down, making everyone guess that Ling Han had mastered a powerful Spiritual Power secret technique, but just now, it was a genuine clash of mystical power. It would be clear who was stronger.","But what had they seen?","The two of them were actually evenly matched!","How was this possible?","Eight Cauldrons was actually unable to suppress Four Cauldrons in terms of power. What justice was there left in this world? Was there any law?","Liu Sanjun couldn’t help but turn to look at Ling Han. At first, he couldn’t be bothered to pay attention to a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, but now, he was suddenly curious about this young man.","Yi!","With his Sect Master-level strength, he naturally could see very clearly that there were five Celestial Cauldrons in Ling Han’s mind, and one of them only had the body of cauldron without any legs.","Early stage of Five Cauldrons.","There was a gap of three cauldrons, and he was actually not at a disadvantage at all?","Though Xue Zhan’s five cauldrons were all fake, and only temporary, in such a short period of time, using them was not much different from Eight Cauldrons.","Hiss!","Liu Sanjun looked again, and his expression involuntarily became solemn. What had he seen? Stone-like Celestial Cauldron.","The Five Elements Celestial Cauldron?","Aside from the bronze, silver, and gold Celestial Cauldrons, there were some prodigies that were unique. When forging the Celestial Cauldron, they would infuse some special substances, or even the power of the bloodline, which would cause the Celestial Cauldron to mutate. Thus, there would be the Flame Celestial Cauldron, Frost Celestial Cauldron, and so on. It would not be strange for a Stone Celestial. Perhaps Ling Han was a Stone Element Innate Divine Physique.","But when he took a closer look, he immediately discovered that something was off.","This was definitely no ordinary Stone Celestial Cauldron. Instead, it was filled with a supreme aura, as if that was the king tier of Celestial Cauldrons.","Hiss, there was actually someone that could forge a Celestial Cauldron like this?","Liu Sanjun couldn’t help but cherish talent. In this lifetime, there was practically no hope for him to become a Venerate Tier, but if he could nurture a Venerate Tier-level disciple, that feeling of accomplishment should not be inferior to him becoming a Venerate.","In fact, he felt that Ling Han’s future wasn’t limited to merely Venerate Tier. In fact, he even had a chance of becoming a Saint.","He didn’t dare to think about him being able to achieve the level of Emperor. Not only did one need natural talent, but they also needed great fortune and great opportunities. For example, the Nine Suns Saint had once claimed to be the strongest Saint, yet hadn’t he still lost to Ancestral King Lingtian?","“How is this possible!” Xue Zhan roared, his face filled with disbelief.","“Nothing is impossible,” Ling Han said calmly. “Within three moves, I’ll send you on your way.”","“Haha, you really have a wild imagination!” Xue Zhan smirked coldly, his killing intent blazing.","This time, he definitely had to kill Ling Han. Otherwise, his strength would very soon disappear like the ebbing tide, and Ling Han was still so strong. Then, wouldn’t he be terribly bullied by Ling Han in future?","Hence, this was the only chance, kill!","In a mortal duel, there was no need to bear responsibility for killing.","He roared loudly, and communicated with high-level energy. Instantly, his whole body was wrapped in flames, as if he had turned into a god of fire.","“Die!” He pounced out again, channelling a powerful celestial technique. As he shot out a punch, the power of his fist took the form of a massive firebird. Its whole body was covered with densely packed seals, as it pounced towards Ling Han.","Ling Han was unafraid, and directly charged towards the firebird. Peng, he threw a punch, and the firebird directly shattered. He charged out, channelling the Imminent Skyline beneath his feet, and instantly arrived in front of Xue Zhan. The Great Overarching Heaven Technique was","used, similarly entwined in flames.","Peng!","Xue Zhan was instantly sent flying. He hurriedly scrambled to his feet, and was just about to make a move, when he shockingly discovered that there were flames burning on his body.","He hurriedly wanted to extinguish the flames, but discovered that these flames were incredibly stubborn, and there was actually no end to them.","He was shocked, but he had not even finished this thought, when he saw Ling Han charge towards him again.","It was still the Great Overarching Heaven Technique. Ling Han’s hands formed into fists and claws, manifesting the ultimate technique of the Jin Clan. A series of attacks crashed down, and Xue Zhan was instantly killed.","Ling Han sighed internally. If he used the Three Styles of the God of War, he should be able to deal with him with a single strike.","As expected, there was still a very, very large gap between a Venerate Tier-level precious","technique and a Saint Technique.","But the others were all numb with shock, completely rendered speechless.","An Eight Cauldrons was directly killed by Ling Han just like that.","Open and aboveboard; there was no excuse.","Hiss, what kind of terrifying abilities was this?","Gan Ping, Lin Qi?","In front of this kind of strength, they would probably have to kneel down and proclaim their","conquest.","All the beauties’ eyes lit up with iridescent light, and even Tan Meng and the other seductive beauties were no exception. How could this kind of man not tempt others?","Outstanding alchemy skills, astonishing formation abilities, and now added with this incomparably domineering battle prowess, no matter how picky a noble daughter was, she would still have to cast aside her reservedness and be overwhelmed with uncontrollable love","for him.","Contrary to everyone’s expectations, Liu Sanjun only cast a meaningful look at Ling Han, and actually did not say a word. Instead, he directly turned around and flew away. “Strange!” Yan Dong mumbled in the crowd. This was not like Old Monster Liu. He had already prepared himself to make a move, to prevent Liu Sanjun from killing Ling Han in his humiliated rage, but he had not thought that Liu Sanjun would actually leave directly. Ling Han walked back, and everyone immediately surged towards him. Whether male or female, they were all incredibly cordial.","“Senior Brother Ling!” they all called out, feeling a bone-deep admiration.","Ling Han smiled at everyone, but did not stop at all. He squeezed out of the crowd, and brought the empress, Hu Niu and the others back.","The empress was proud, and didn’t pay any attention to anyone at all. Meanwhile, Hu Niu turned around and made a face at Tan Meng and the others, meaning that Ling Han was Niu’s,","so don’t even think about it.","However, how could this possibly scare off Tan Meng and the other women?","“This is the ideal husband that I am looking for. Not only is he skilled in both alchemy and formations, his natural talent in martial arts is also outstanding, and there is hope for him to become a Saint in future.” Tan Meng thought, “Furthermore, this guy has a glib tongue, so he should know how to be romantic. Being with him, the rest of my life would definitely not be","boring!”","Jiang Yifei and Jie Yingqiu had similar thoughts. The three women looked at each other, and animosity rose up in them.","They had never seen the empress and Hu Niu’s true appearances before, so they didn’t think of them as worthy rivals at all. They only felt that the two people in front of them were their","greatest rivals."]},{"number":3841,"title":"Chapter 3841: Candidate for the Dao Child","paragraphs":["Chapter 3841: Candidate for the Dao Child","After this battle, Ling Han’s name resounded throughout the entire Holy Land. In fact, his fame even surpassed that of Gan Ping and Lin Qi.","Just look at his battle merits – creating a formation that killed a Core Formation Tier, destroying Eight Cauldrons with punches, who could compare?","However, Gan Ping and Lin Qi quickly jumped out, and began to find excuses.","Creating a formation that killed a Core Formation Tier, there was nothing much to say about that; he was only relying on formations. Furthermore, the setting up of formations had to depend on the environment of heaven and earth, and that kind of great formation had to be set up in advance, as it had too many limitations.","Oh, if you met an enemy on a narrow path, how could it be that you could ask them to give you half a day’s time to set up the formation?","Thus, in a battle between elites, this ability was useless.","Secondly, destroying Eight Cauldrons with punches?","Hehe, could Xue Zhan be considered as Eight Cauldrons? That was only a fake Eight Cauldrons that had been forcefully piled up by an elite. His true battle prowess was comparable to Six Cauldrons, or even slightly above Five Cauldrons.","Thus, Ling Han was indeed a little strong, but he was still far from being invincible to the point of sweeping aside all opposition in the Cauldron Forging Tier.","Of course, this was deliberately belittling Ling Han. No matter how weak Eight Cauldrons was, he would still have battle prowess of at least Six Cauldrons to Seven Cauldrons, and Ling Han had easily killed Xue Zhan. Just how strong would his abilities have to be?","Anyone with eyes would naturally know, but there were also some people who were blind, and thought that Galaxy Network’s ranking was the most authoritative measure.","-What was the ranking of Gan Ping and Lin Qi, and what was Ling Han’s ranking?","Ling Han couldn’t be bothered to argue with them. He only had one thing to say: are you going to fight or not? If not, then cut the crap.","Yet Gan Ping and Lin Qi did not accept the challenge, and still responded with disdain. In truth, they should not have absolute certainty of victory either, so how could they possibly dare to rashly start a battle?","The Holy Land still issued a punishment. Xue Hai was imprisoned for five years, and though Ling Han was passively defending himself, he had still broken the rules and had to self-reflect for three months.","However, an unexpected person interceded on Ling Han’s behalf, turning three months of self-reflection into three days of self-reflection.","This person was none other than Liu Sanjun.","It should be known that punishing Ling Han to self-reflect for three months was also for the sake of taking care of Liu Sanjun’s pride, but no one would have thought that Liu Sanjun would actually intercede on Ling Han’s behalf. Then, the Law Enforcement Hall would naturally go with the flow, and give Ling Han a symbolic punishment.","This result was something that even Ling Han had not expected.","He had killed Liu Sanjun’s Dao Apprentice and the “disciple” that he had painstakingly nurtured, and he was actually interceding on his behalf?","He couldn’t figure it out no matter how hard he thought about it.","Forget it. So be it if he didn’t know. He couldn’t read Liu Sanjun’s mind.","A peaceful life continued. However, this peace was relative to people coming to cause trouble. In truth, though there were no attacks and challenges, Ling Han’s days were not easy, because the female disciples here seemed to have been pumped full of adrenaline, and came to visit him every day.","Even Tan Meng and the other seductive beauties were no exception. They all smiled lightly, and kept calling Ling Han Senior Brother Ling politely, so Ling Han couldn’t find any reason to chase them away.","And if he deliberately teased them... he would have fallen into the trap of the three women instead. All of them looked like they had feelings for him, causing Ling Han to instantly become a gentleman, and no longer dared to say any more teasing words.","However, he couldn’t stand being annoyed, but the pervert pig was like a fish in water. Originally, what it was most afraid of was being captured by Ling Han and compelled to work, but now, there were beauties patronizing this place every day, so it refused to leave.","From the outside, the pervert pig was indeed very attractive to young girls. Whether it was Tan Meng, Jiang Yifei or Jie Yingqiu, they would always hug this little perverted pig when they came, and made the little perverted pig captivated, drooling.","When the large black dog saw this, he was not willing to be outdone either. On what basis was it that it was the lecherous pig that was hugged instead of him?","Wasn’t he just a little bigger?","On this day, Ling Han had just finished cultivating when he saw a cute dog run out.","Pu!","Immediately, he spluttered. This was what the large black dog had transformed into. Needless to say, after shrinking its size and turning into a small puppy, it was really a little","cute.","“... Old Black, you also want to trick people into hugging you, so you can take advantage?” Ling Han suppressed his laughter.","“What is it? Can’t I?” The large black dog humphed. He just couldn’t bear to see the pervert pig, “Grandpa Dog is warning you, don’t expose me.”","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I can guarantee that you definitely won’t succeed!”","“Pei, it’s fine if you don’t want it yourself, brat, but don’t stop Grandpa Dog from seeking happiness!” The large black dog didn’t listen to Ling Han’s advice.","“All right, as you like.”","When they were having lunch, Jie Yingqiu walked over gracefully. When the large black dog saw this, it immediately wagged its tail and went up to greet her.","Come, give me a hug!","Pa, it only felt its vision blur, and was already sent flying with a kick.","F***, what the hell was this?","One failure was not enough to make the large black dog give up. He continued to work hard, and when Tan Meng came over, he went up to greet her again, wagging his tail even faster. At the same time, he widened his eyes, making himself even more adorable.","However, what greeted it was a kick of disdain.","Why?","It continued its efforts, and when Jiang Yifei came to visit, it went up to greet her again.","In the end, there was still no change. It was still sent flying with a kick.","“Why!” It finally complained to Ling Han, “Grandpa Dog is already so shameless, turning into","a cute little puppy, so why can’t I do it?”","Ling Han glanced at the iron underwear on the large black dog’s body. It was still flickering, and he wondered if he should give it a reminder.","Even if you are a little puppy, wearing a pair of iron underwear and immediately revealing a strong vulgarity, who would still find you cute?","Forget it. The large black dog was shameless, and he was really despicable enough. This kind of blow could not possibly cause him to become depressed.","After a small interlude, a major event was welcomed.","There was going to be a selection for the candidate for Dao Child and Holy Daughter.","There was no need for them to fight or compete. The Holy Land directly decided the ten candidates. In future, one of them would stand out and become the Dao Child or Holy Daughter, and then compete with the Dao Child or Holy Daughter of the next nine batches. Who knows, one of them would become the future Acting Saint Master.","The 10 people were Ling Han, Gan Ping, Lin Qi, Wu Qiyuan, Yuwen Tian, Cang Shan, Hu Ming, Jie Yingqiu, Jiang Yifei and Tan Meng.","This naturally did not mean that it would remain unchanged. Everyone could challenge these ten people, and the victor would be able to replace them. From then onwards, they would accept the challenges of others, right until the final Dao Child or Holy Daughter was","confirmed.","The moment the namelist of candidates appeared, challenges immediately appeared.","However, being able to be chosen by the members of the Holy Land, these ten people were definitely the strongest at present. Naturally, none of them had fallen from grace. This made Ling Han very surprised. Weren’t Tan Meng and the others ranked in the 1000s or 2000s on the Galaxy Network? How had they managed to squeeze into the top 10?","By the looks of it, they were hiding their strength. Their true strength far surpassed Galaxy","Network’s ranking.","However, only two days had passed, and a major event had happened.","Lin Qi had lost. He had lost to a challenger.","How was this possible? With Lin Qi’s strength, he was definitely in the top three, so how had","he lost?","His opponent was called Guo Xiang. Though he had also broken through his limits, and reached Four Cauldrons, no matter how he thought about it, he should not have been able to","defeat Lin Qi.","But a day later, everyone knew the reason.","That was because Lin Qi had issued a challenge to Ling Han.","Hehe, so that was the case. Lin Qi wanted to use this kind of method to humiliate Ling Han.","It would be utterly humiliating to kick you out of the position of candidate for the Dao Child","position. Ling Han naturally chose to accept this challenge.","Those who dared to offend him would be thrashed."]},{"number":3842,"title":"Chapter 3842: Fighting Lin Qi","paragraphs":["Chapter 3842: Fighting Lin Qi","Ling Han was about to fight Lin Qi.","This news instantly spread to the ears of every disciple through the network of the Holy Land. Instantly, everyone moved out, wanting to watch this fierce battle.","This wasn’t a mortal duel, so it was not forbidden to use Spirit Tools. However, because the challenger could choose the time and place, this undoubtedly crippled Ling Han’s formation abilities.","-Where were you going to set up the formation in advance?","It could be said that Lin Qi was quite smart.","On one side, it was the descendant of an Imperial Clan. Though he was not the most awesome descendant of the Lin Clan, he still had an Emperor’s blood flowing in his veins. Was that not enough?","He was ranked 207th on the Galaxy Network, and this was the best description of Lin Qi’s abilities.","On the other side, there was a dazzling new star. He came from an ordinary background, but his natural talent in cultivation was terrifying. With Four Cauldrons, um, Five Cauldrons, the Holy Land announced Ling Han’s cultivation level later, it was Five Cauldrons instead of Four Cauldrons, but even if he had defeated an Eight Cauldrons as a Five Cauldrons, he still belonged to the category of fantasy legends.","The battle between the two of them would definitely be incredibly exciting.","Early in the morning, everyone arrived at the open space, waiting for the two people involved to arrive.","Not long after, Ling Han and Lin Qi arrived at about the same time. They both arrived on the dot, not one second longer, not one second less.","Lin Qi crossed his arms behind his back, and slowly walked towards the centre of the arena. There was a faint smile on his face, but there was considerable fury in his heart.","He had always acted as if he couldn’t care less about Ling Han. Why had he suddenly issued a challenge this time?","It was very simple. A beautiful woman.","He had been pursuing Jiang Yifei all this while, and Gan Ping had his eye on Tan Meng. This was no secret. However, Jiang Yifei treated him coldly, and only acted as if she had not seen his attentiveness, yet she would go to Ling Han’s place every day.","How could he not explode in fury?","Thus, he wanted to take this opportunity to ruthlessly humiliate Ling Han, and let Jiang Yifei know that he was the one who was worthy of her favour.","When it came to women, even a descendant of an Imperial Clan like Lin Qi, a prodigy ranked 207th on the Galaxy Network, was dazed, and could no longer think calmly.","“Ling Han, come, see how I will suppress you!” he said calmly, showing his contempt for Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and also strode forwards.","Lin Qi drew out a sword. The blade was dark green in colour. This was a replica of the Lin Clan’s Imperial Weapon. It was also a standard Spirit Tool. All important heirs would have one each. Depending on the cultivation level, the level of the Spirit Tool would also be different.","However, even though this was a replica, how could the means of an Imperial Clan be ordinary?","This Jade Water Sword was one of the best of the current Cauldron Forging Tier Spirit Tools. He was sure that aside from similar Imperial Clan standard weapons, the other Spirit Tools would not be able to withstand a single blow in front of it.","Why?","That was because this Jade Water Sword had been forged right next to the Imperial Weapon. It had a sliver of the aura of the Imperial Weapon, and that alone was enough. What Spirit Tool in this world could stand against it?","“If you don’t want to suffer, I’ll allow you to surrender,” he said calmly.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “Who would’ve thought? You’re actually an expert at telling jokes.”","Lin Qi was not angered. In the Galaxy Network, he was no match for Gan Ping, but in a real battle, he believed that he would definitely be able to win.","This was because the Galaxy Network battles had excluded all external factors such as Spirit Tool, Talisman Weapon, and so on. This was both fair and unfair.","-I am a descendant of the Imperial Clan, so why can’t I use resources to crush you to death?","“How long can you continue to be stubborn?” Lin Qi said calmly, “In front of absolute strength, you are nothing but a clown.”","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “The more disdainful you speak now, the greater your humiliation will be.”","“That is impossible!” Lin Qi was filled with confidence, and the Jade Water Sword in his hand sliced out. Shua, a flash of Sword Qi sliced out towards Ling Han, turning into an azure streak, with a terrifying brilliance rippling out.","Ling Han activated the Starlight Screen and took this strike head-on.","Peng! The Sword Qi slashed over, and the Starlight Screen instantly shattered. However, the might of the Sword Qi was also exhausted.","Ling Han was slightly surprised. The might of this Spirit Tool was strong enough to actually slice open his Starlight Screen with a single strike.","However, Lin Qi was even more stunned, because he knew the background of the Jade Water Sword, but his opponent had taken a strike head-on, and it actually only managed to break through his protective shield, and he was unwounded. This caused his heart to tremble wildly. ‘I can’t underestimate him. I definitely can’t underestimate him. This brat is truly freakish.’ Alarm bells rang loudly in his heart, but his expression was calm. Furthermore, he indeed had the qualifications to break through Ling Han’s strongest defense with a single strike. The Jade Water Sword was indeed worthy of being a replica of the Imperial Weapon.","“Again!” Lin Qi brandished his sword. Shua, shua, shua! A flash of Sword Qi slashed over, and a green-colored stream filled the air. A terrifying aura was presently condensing. This was the aura of the Imperial Weapon, but it was too thin. However, with every strike of the sword, this aura would increase slightly, and when it reached a certain extent, this would eventually overwhelm everything. At least, there was no one that could match this in","Cauldron Forging Tier.","Thus, the Jade Water Sword was the strongest Two Star Spirit Tool. Aside from similarly an imitation of an Imperial Weapon, there was nothing that could match it.","Ling Han activated his Eye Technique and jumped around in the net-like Sword Qi, dodging each flash of Sword Qi just right. This could practically be considered an art, and was pleasing","to the eye.","Yet Lin Qi smirked coldly. The Sword Qi attacks were only superficial, while the true killing move was the aura of the Imperial Weapon. This was something that no Cauldron Forging","Tier could block.","Ling Han got impatient after dodging a few moves. He directly attacked head-on. The Starlight Screen spread out, and he faced the Sword Qi head-on.","The light screen shattered, and he used his fists to attack. At this moment, he was even more barbaric, violent, and direct than Wu Qiyuan.","Yet Lin Qi smirked coldly, and stretched out a hand to make a pressing motion at Ling Han.","From the looks of it, this palm strike was nothing special. However, he had drawn on the aura of the Imperial Weapon, turning it into an indestructible blade.","A powerful chill immediately rose up in Ling Han’s heart. This was an instinctive feeling of danger. He leaped forward, not facing it head-on.","“You can’t even withstand a single blow,” Lin Qi said disdainfully, but internally, he was crying out in pity. If this palm strike could land, then added with the destructive power of the aura of the Imperial Weapon, Ling Han would be severely injured. In fact, it would leave behind an aftereffect that would never be erased.","Ling Han’s sharp eyes focused on that dark green long sword. He had a feeling that all this was","because of that sword.","Since Lin Qi came from the Imperial Clan, this should be a replica of the Imperial Weapon, so","its might was naturally extraordinary.","If he had been more patient, he could have easily captured Lin Qi. However, he didn’t want to","drag the battle out for too long.","“I’ll dispose of you within three seconds,” Ling Han said calmly.","Lin Qi couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. What kind of colossal joke was this?","‘You’re at a complete disadvantage right now, and it’s only me who can hit you. Yet, you still want to dispose of me in three seconds? What kind of joke is this?’","But Ling Han had absolutely no intention of joking. Xiu, his figure darted out, heading","towards Lin Qi.","“You’re seeking death!” Lin Qi slashed out with his sword, and at the same time, his left palm was ready to strike. He wanted to see how Ling Han would deal with this blow.","Ling Han naturally charged head-on. Peng! The Starlight Screen shattered, but he also broke through the Sword Qi and charged over.","Lin Qi smirked coldly, and delivered a palm strike with his left hand. The aura of the Imperial Weapon was implicit, and increased the destructive power of this palm strike endlessly."]},{"number":3843,"title":"Chapter 3843: Burning Imperial Blood","paragraphs":["Chapter 3843: Burning Imperial Blood","Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, out!","Ling Han summoned his pseudo-Imperial Weapon. If even a future Imperial Weapon couldn’t block his opponent’s attack, then he would have no choice but to accept it.","Weng!","The two powerful auras clashed. This was a clash between two Emperors.","However, Ling Han charged over unscathed. As the aura of Primal Chaos descended, he was like an invincible god of war.","No matter what, how could a replica that only had a sliver of the aura of an Imperial Weapon rival the Origin Gold?","What cultivation level was Ling Han at? The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was the most powerful tool of this level. Unless there was another Spirit Tool forged from Origin Gold, only would there be a match for it.","Unfortunately, the Jade Water Sword in Lin Qi’s hand was only an imitation.","Ling Han charged over. Zi, zi, zi! Lightning flashed madly, and shot towards Lin Qi.","How could Lin Qi possibly withstand this? Instantly, he was struck head-on. Pa, the Jade Water Sword in his hand bore the brunt of the attack, and instantly exploded.","In front of the Origin Gold, all tools would feel inferior. This was imperial might.","Lin Qi wore a blank expression. What was going on? This was a replica of an Imperial Weapon, so how could it be so weak?","In a moment of distraction, Ling Han’s fist also smashed over.","Peng! Lin Qi was instantly sent flying.","All of this happened in the blink of an eye. Everyone had yet to react, and the majority were still exclaiming at how awesome Lin Qi’s Tool was. They had not thought that in the blink of an eye, the battle had practically been decided.","As expected, it was only three seconds.","Without a Spirit Tool, would Lin Qi still be able to fight?","Lin Qi got to his feet. Under the barrage of lightning, a large portion of his clothes had been torn apart. Thankfully, his skin had also been charred by the lightning, so he did not have to worry about exposing himself.","His situation was slightly dire. Wounds covered his entire body. This was caused by the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. The fact that he hadn’t been directly killed was already a sign of his strength.","He panted heavily, and looked at the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower with shock and suspicion. What kind of Spirit Tool was this? It was too terrifying, wasn’t it?","Ling Han put away the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and said calmly, “I won’t bully you either.”","Seeing this, everyone nodded internally.","Lin Qi drew out his Spirit Tool from the very beginning, clearly intending to depend on the might of the Jade Water Sword, but Ling Han’s Spirit Tool was clearly stronger than this, yet immediately withdrew and did not use it. The superiority was obvious.","-Ling Han already possessed the demeanor of an elite, because every elite walked the path of their own strength. Which one of them would depend on external factors?","Lin Qi glared hatefully at Ling Han. In full public, he had been defeated. This would be a humiliation that he could not wash away.","“You’ve angered me!” he said menacingly. At first, he was extremely wary of Ling Han’s tower-shaped Tool, but now that Ling Han actually put it away, he naturally had a chance of winning again.","He roared loudly, and the blood in his entire body boiled. There was also an indescribably powerful pressure exuding from him, as if even the stars in the skies had to submit in front of him.","This was because he had ignited his Imperial Blood. Though there was only a sliver, what kind of existence was a Great Emperor? Even if it was incredibly thin, it was still incredibly terrifying.","Lin Qi’s eyes were exuding white light, incredibly blazing. He looked coldly at Ling Han. That was a kind of indifference from a being of a higher level.","At this moment, Lin Qi was like a Great Emperor when he had been in the Cauldron Forging Tier. Who could stand against him?","Peng!","Lin Qi took a step out. It was clearly not heavy, but everyone felt as if their hearts had been harshly struck, and their faces had all turned pale.","Imperial Might.","Ling Han’s interest was finally piqued. The current Lin Qi seemed to have been possessed by a Great Emperor, and his battle prowess would undergo an earthshaking change.","The Great Emperor was invincible, but could a Cauldron Forging Tier do the same?","Ling Han didn’t believe this. This was because the Nine Suns Saint had even defeated Ancestral King Lingtian in the past. Thus, even the Great Emperor might not be invincible for the rest of his life. It could only be said that after achieving Dao, he would truly be peerless in the world.","Come, let’s battle.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and charged towards Lin Qi.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Lin Qi did not retreat in the slightest, and began exchanging blows with Ling Han. Various celestial techniques were used, and all of them were just right, indescribably amazing.","However, due to the limitation of his cultivation level, Lin Qi was unable to channel the Imperial Technique. At most, he could only unleash a burst of power, but this kind of burst of power naturally had to be left at the most crucial moment. It would either be used to achieve victory with a single strike, or to resolve a life-threatening danger.","The two of them battled fiercely, using their respective techniques to exchange blows. It was an extremely exciting battle.","“Lin Qi is burning his Imperial Blood, which is equivalent to transforming into a young Great","Emperor.”","“This battle prowess is really fierce.”","“But the problem is... Ling Han doesn’t have any Imperial Blood, but he can actually still","withstand it.”","“Hiss, being able to stand against a young Great Emperor, if this guy does not die, there is a possibility that he could become a Saint in future!”","Becoming a Saint!","This was an unattainable peak. Even among Imperial Clan elites, how many could reach the level of Saint Tier?","However, Ling Han was able to exchange blows with a Great Emperor when he was young. This kind of potential was really too astonishing, and that was why he had received such a","high evaluation. He had the potential to become a Saint.","“As long as Ling Han can hold on, the loser would definitely be Lin Qi.”","“En!”","Everyone nodded in agreement. Right now, Lin Qi wasn’t this powerful by himself. Instead, he","was relying on combusting his Imperial Blood The time that he could maintain this power was limited, and the cooldown period was also astonishingly long. Thus, he definitely wouldn’t be able to do this a second time.","Thus, as long as they fought a drawn-out battle, Ling Han would definitely win.","Lin Qi clearly knew this as well. He finally couldn’t hold himself back any longer, and with a sharp cry, he crossed his fingers in the air, forming a circle. Then, he aimed directly at Ling Han. Xiu, a flash of light blasted out, and instantly, everyone was blinded even if their eyes","were open, unable to see anything.","This was an Imperial Technique, and even he had only learnt one move.","However, an Imperial Technique was an Imperial Technique, which was invincible among its","peers!","Ling Han didn’t dare to be careless either. Right now, it was as if Lin Qi had been possessed by a Great Emperor, and he was no weaker than Ling Han, and had blasted out an Imperial Technique. He had to unleash his full strength.","“Go!”","He also channelled the Demonic Monkey Fists, and blasted out explosively. A Demonic Monkey that was exuding endless violence appeared, greeting that streak of light.","Peng!","Amidst a loud bang, multiple seals exploded. Brilliance surged, shooting madly into the skies, turning into a massive mushroom cloud.","Looking again at Ling Han and Lin Qi, they were both injured. The Imperial Techniques clashed, destroying each other, but still causing both of them to be injured.","Thankfully, their injuries were not heavy.","Without the slightest bit of hesitation, the two of them once again charged towards each","other.","Peng, peng, peng! The battle situation was incredibly intense, but without the explosive burst","of the Imperial Technique, neither of them could insta-kill the other, and continued to be in a","stalemate.","However, the battle did not last long, and Lin Qi’s aura fell drastically.","– His Imperial Blood had already been exhausted.","There was nothing more to say. Under Ling Han’s powerful attacks, Lin Qi was quickly","defeated.","Without a word, he left with his tail between his legs.","This was truly humiliating. Not only had his Spirit Tool been destroyed, but he had even used","the last resort of combusting his Imperial Blood. Yet, he had still suffered a crushing defeat.","How could he defend himself?","Meanwhile, Ling Han frowned slightly. This was only a clansman of the Imperial Clan, and he wasn’t the strongest heir yet. However, after combusting his Imperial Clan, he was actually able to fight him to a stalemate. There were so many Imperial Clans in the world, and if two or three of them joined forces, wouldn’t he be in a very passive position?","No, he had to become stronger!"]},{"number":3844,"title":"Chapter 3844: Malicious Guest","paragraphs":["Chapter 3844: Malicious Guest","Yet Ling Han was thinking too much.","Even for the Imperial Clan, the number of times they could combust their Imperial Blood in their lifetime was extremely limited.","-After the Imperial Blood was burnt, it would slowly recover, but it would become slower and slower, and in the end, there would be no more Imperial Blood left to burn.","Moreover, what was Lin Qi’s cultivation level?","It was Six Cauldrons now, and with the advantage of one cauldron, he still hadn’t defeated Ling Han. What did that mean?","Ling Han was even stronger than a young Great Emperor at the same cultivation level, even if it was just a little bit.","If Ling Han also had six cauldrons, then if he battled with Lin Qi, who was burning his Imperial Blood, would it still end in a tie?","After this battle, Ling Han’s status as the number one disciple of the younger generation was completely confirmed. Lin Qi had suffered a terrible defeat, so what about Gan Ping? He was sure that he would only be able to lose with grievances.","Gan Ping naturally wouldn’t admit this. However, he didn’t say anything else about how Ling Han could not withstand a single strike. He had accumulated some merit.","However, the main doors of Ling Han’s residence became even livelier. The male disciples all came over to cotton up to Ling Han, while the female disciples were all filled with tender affection, wanting nothing more than to use some medicine and forcefully bed Ling Han.","If Ling Han was a little more fickle, he could completely become a groom and sleep next to different beautiful disciples of the Holy Land every night.","However, he was naturally not that kind of person, so he could only tire himself out in parrying such exquisite beauties like Tan Meng and Jiang Yifei, which also made the others envious and jealous.","The following days became peaceful. Everyone made the most of their time to cultivate, while at the same time, they searched for the God Slaying Technique that the Nine Suns Saint had hidden somewhere, whether it existed or not. This was the true purpose of everyone entering into the Nine Suns Holy Land. Once they obtained the God Slaying Technique, they would be able to further obtain the Nine Suns Finger, and gain control of a colossal force. In future, they would have a Saint Tool in their hands when they fought with others. How domineering would that be?","To say anything major happened, it would be that Lin Qi had snatched back his identity as a Dao Child, causing a great many people to laugh their heads off.","Before they knew it, they had already entered the Holy Land for a year.","At this time, a great many people had arrived in front of the gates of the Holy Land, and were waiting for the Holy Land to once again open its gates, and recruit a second batch of disciples.","“Hurry up and go see a beauty!” someone posted on the Holy Land network. “A supreme beauty!”","No matter when, a beautiful woman would always be able to capture the eyes of others, and cause them to become excited.","Thus, quite a number of people went to watch the disciple recruitment this time round.","In the end, a heated discussion instantly broke out on the net.","“A great beauty has really come. In fact, she is even more beautiful than Celestial maiden Tan, Celestial maiden Jie,!”","“You’ve got to be kidding, Celestial Maiden Tan and the others are on the Exquisite Leaderboard!”","“Hehe, won’t you find out once you take a look for yourself?”","This attracted the curiosity of many people, and they all ran over to watch. In the end, those who went to watch all thought that this woman’s beauty was something that even Tan Meng and the other women could not compare to.","“That’s natural. Do you guys know who she is?” someone asked disdainfully.","“Who?”","“Ninth on the Exquisite Leaderboard, Song Lan!”","“What!”","When they found out the identity of this stunningly beautiful woman, everyone was stunned, but also felt that it was only natural. She was ranked ninth on the Exquisite Beauty Leaderboard, so she was naturally exquisitely beautiful.","“Hey, hey, hey, don’t have any delusions. How can you guys even think of touching the beauty who is ranked ninth on the Exquisite Leaderboard?”","“Can’t you even think about it?”","“Hey, do you guys know who Song Lan came with?”","“Who?”","“Lu Qi.”","Hiss!","At this moment, everyone was silent.","Who was Lu Qi?","Ranked nineteenth among Cauldron Forging Tiers in the Galaxy Network!","It should be known that if one managed to squeeze into the top hundred of the level rankings, there would be a considerable gap in strength between every ten or so people. Lu Qi was ranked nineteenth in Galaxy Network, which was who knew how many times stronger than","Gan Ping.","It was said that this person had already formed eight cauldrons.","The eight cauldrons that he had formed were completely different from the eight cauldrons that Xue Zhan had temporarily accumulated with the help of an elite. If the two of them were to battle, Lu Qi would probably be able to crush Xue Zhan with a single strike.","“No way, one of the top twenty in the Galaxy Network rankings would actually join the Holy","Land?”","“Hehe, because Lu Qi is presently courting Song Lan, since Song Lan is here, Lu Qi is naturally here as well.”","“Hehe, there’s going be a good show now,” someone said meaningfully.","Ling Han was presently the number one disciple of this generation, but after Lu Qi had come, the situation was different.","Would it be a battle between two mighty figures, or would Ling Han withdraw from the stage","dejectedly?","When Ling Han heard this, he only smiled faintly, and did not take it to heart.","Perhaps Lu Qi was indeed stronger than him now, but he was only in the late stage of Five Cauldrons. He only had to increase his cultivation level, and in a battle of equal cultivation levels, let’s see who would be able to defeat whom.","Furthermore, he had a great many trump cards. He had the Three Elements Treasure Bottle Formation, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and any one of them could kill any","Cauldron Forging Tier elite.","After a few days of examination, Lu Qi and Song Lan naturally entered into the Holy Land without a doubt. There were also other freakish characters in this batch, such as Su Wenbai and Ji Yuanbai. They were all ranked in the top 100 of the Galaxy Network, and in the area of beauties, there was actually another beauty on the Exquisite Leaderboard, Du Qingqing, who had also entered into the Holy Land, but because of Song Lan’s existence, she was naturally","much dimmer.","With the addition of this batch of disciples, the Holy Land was instantly bustling with noise and excitement.","The first and second batches of people naturally formed their own teams. Those who came first thought that they were seniors and were experienced, and those who came later were naturally dissatisfied. There were ten batches of disciples, so they naturally belonged to the same batch. Why had they become seniors just because they came a year earlier?","In addition, what did martial arts depend on?","Strength!","Thus, battles naturally broke out among the disciples of the two batches. Because the","numbers were equal, the abilities were more or less the same. They fought a few times, but did not manage to distinguish a clear advantage or disadvantage. In the end, it was the Law Enforcement Hall that stepped out and forbade this kind of large-scale group battle, or they","would be expelled.","Ling Han only wanted to cultivate quietly, and was in no mood to contend for first and second place. He paid absolutely no attention to the outside world. Even if the large black dog egged him on time and time again, he completely ignored it.","However, this was how things were sometimes. You didn’t cause trouble, but things would come knocking on your door.","Ling Han was concocting an alchemical pill when he heard a knock on the door.","If this was any other alchemist, this cauldron of pills would probably be considered useless after being disturbed like this. However, Ling Han was the Alchemy Emperor. Moreover, he had already refined the Cauldron Heart Pill countless times, so he could still control it even if he multitasked. He asked, “What is it?”","He was already a little angry. He had already instructed that he was not to be disturbed while","he was concocting alchemical pills.","“Master, a malicious guest has come. I have clearly already told him that you are presently concocting alchemical pills, and cannot see him, yet he broke the door. He even said that he would only wait three minutes, and after three minutes, he would barge in,” Mingyue said softly, looking a little aggrieved, but also showing a strong fury.","Ever since Ling Han was crowned as the strongest disciple, who would dare to be so rude? Ling Han continued to concoct alchemical pills, and said, “Ignore him.”","“Understood,” Mingyue replied with a nod.","Peng!","As expected, not long after, a loud bang was heard. That malicious guest must have gotten","impatient from waiting, and barged in forcefully."]},{"number":3845,"title":"Chapter 3845: Summoned by my Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 3845: Summoned by my Master","Ling Han continued to concoct alchemical pills, acting as if he had not heard anything.","If he stopped now, all his previous efforts would be wasted. He naturally wouldn’t waste a precious medicinal ingredient and the time that he had already spent.","Mingyue trembled. He had not stepped onto the Celestial Path yet, and Cauldron Forging Tier was like a god to him.","A terrifying aura approached, and soon, a man walked into the alchemy chamber.","This was a tall, broad-shouldered man. He was not very old, and looked to be less than thirty years old, while his eyes were burning with spirit. In fact, his gaze would cause one to feel a piercing pain.","“He, what arrogance. I, Zha Hu, have come to pay a visit, and you actually still dare to hide and not come out!” This man said coldly. His aura had turned into a blade that could be seen with the naked eye. Pu, pu, pu, marks had appeared on the walls and furniture of the room, showing his powerful strength.","Ling Han’s hands didn’t stop, and he said calmly, “You’re in the right to barge into my residence?”","“What is it? Can’t I barge in?” Zha Hu asked disdainfully.","Ling Han did not speak further, but rather focused on alchemy. Even if he was the Alchemy Emperor, he could not possibly be distracted all the time while concocting alchemical pills.","This kind of disregard caused Zha Hu to feel very hurt. What kind of existence was he? A mere alchemist actually dared to disregard him?","“Don’t think that you can look down on everyone just because you know how to concoct a few alchemical pills!” he said balefully.","He had heard of how Lin Qi had lost to Ling Han, but as he saw it, this was completely just a rumor. How could an alchemist have such high battle prowess?","What kind of joke was this?","It should be that someone was boot-licking Ling Han, and that was why they had deliberately fabricated such a story. After all, he was an existence that could concoct the Cauldron Heart Pill, and even his Master was very interested in Ling Han.","“Ling Han, my Master summons you, come with me quickly!” he called out loudly.","Ling Han chuckled, and said, “What does your master have to do with me? He wants to see me, so I have to go and see him?”","“My Master is Lu Qi!” Zha Hu declared proudly.","Lu Qi, ranked 19th on the Galaxy Network!","Tremble like a mortal, Zha Hu stared at Ling Han. A great many people would turn pale when they heard Lu Qi’s name, and be at a loss of what to do. He was sure that Ling Han was no exception.","However, he was disappointed.","Ling Han was as calm as could be, as if Lu Qi was no different from any random person.","Er, it must be that this brat only knew how to concoct alchemical pills, so he had absolutely no idea who Lu Qi was. That must be the case.","Zha Hu introduced, “My Master is the supreme prodigy ranked 19th in Cauldron Forging Tier on the Galaxy Network!”","Ling Han smiled and said, “I thought you were going to say that he is the number one on the Galaxy Network! Merely 19th, and he actually dares to show off!”","F***.","Zha Hu looked at Ling Han as if he was looking at an idiot.","Do you know what ranking 19th on the Galaxy Network means?","The 19th place in the entire universe, what kind of concept was that?","Sigh, he was really an alchemist. His head was filled with alchemy, and he had no concept of martial arts at all.","“Humph, my Master said that he wants to see you. Whether you’re willing or not, you have to come with me!” He had lost all patience, and moved directly, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Ling Han was presently concocting alchemical pills, so he naturally could not free himself. He was not concerned either. His figure moved, and dodged Zha Hu’s grab. Meanwhile, his movements did not stop. He continued to stimulate the energy of heaven and earth, and did not stop the process of concocting alchemical pills.","Yi?","Zha Hu’s attack missed, and he couldn’t help but reveal a hint of surprise.","He had actually missed?","Again.","He moved again, grabbing out at Ling Han. However, Ling Han’s steps were still the same. Ling Han calmly dodged his attack, and the process of concocting alchemical pills was still the same. It was not interrupted.","This caused Zha Hu to feel slightly embarrassed. He had been boasting for so long just now, but who would have thought that he would not be able to do anything to Ling Han at all?","He pulled himself together, and decided that he had to be more serious.","He pounced again. Shua, shua, shua! However, after a few times, he was still unable to touch a single corner of Ling Han’s clothes.","Zha Hu’s expression changed drastically. Looks like he had underestimated this alchemist.","He stopped, one hand in front and one behind. Three veined patterns appeared on his forehead. They were purple, red and blue respectively, exuding light. A vicious might also seeped out, as if he was not a human, but rather an incredibly fierce beast.","In truth, he was a Demonic Beast from the Tiger Race.","He charged out again, his hands turning into tiger claws, and a golden whip also grew from his back. That was his tail, and with a scissoring, its might was boundless.","However, it was still useless. Ling Han moved back and forth in such a small room, yet he was repeatedly unsuccessful.","Zha Hu couldn’t bear it any longer. This was practically a blatant humiliation. Just look, he was being attacked and was still concocting alchemical pills. What kind of contempt was this towards his opponent?","He roared loudly, and struck out with both palms. This time, he wasn’t aiming to grab Ling Han, but was instead sweeping out with a large-scale attack.","Ling Han frowned and blocked this attack. He activated the Starlight Screen and took the","attack head-on.","...Mingyue had long since run out.","Boom, as the attack surged past, energy surged, and this house was naturally razed to the","ground in an instant.","Thankfully, the alchemy cauldron wasn’t damaged, and the formation wasn’t affected.","Ling Han moved casually, and the lid of the alchemy cauldron flew out. Four crimson-gold alchemical pills flew out, and he grabbed them in his hand.","The pills were completed!","Ling Han put away the alchemical pills, then turned to look at Zha Hu, his eyes cold.","Even if Zha Hu was from the Tiger Race and had a murderous aura to begin with, when this","gaze swept over him, he still felt a chill rise up from the bottom of his heart, and actually felt","a fear that made him want to tremble.","“Heng, heng, now you know fear, right?” Yet he was still stubborn.","Ling Han sighed. Why were there always such idiots?","Xiu, with a flash, he had already appeared in front of Zha Hu.","So fast!","Zha Hu thought to himself. His hands hurriedly slapped forward instinctively, and at the same","time, his legs retreated.","However, how could he possibly be faster than Ling Han?","Pa, he was smacked onto the ground, feeling as if his head was about to explode.","How could he be so strong? Wasn’t this an alchemist? When did an alchemist also possess","such battle prowess?","Peng, peng, peng! He was pummeled, and Ling Han’s punches rained down. Each punch landed on his most painful spot, causing him to scream repeatedly.","This naturally attracted the attention of the surrounding people. Disciples gradually came over to watch the excitement.","Zha Hu felt humiliated. He roared in fury, “Ling Han, you insulting me is equivalent to insulting Lord Lu Qi. You have to think carefully, can you bear this kind of consequences!” Ling Han scoffed, “You should think carefully about what consequences you would have to","bear if you trifled with me.”","When everyone saw this, they all shook their heads.","How could it be that this idiot had not heard of the fierce legend of Ling Han?","In the past, even a Core Formation Tier elite had been forcefully refined by Ling Han. Even a","Sect Master elitehad not been able to force him to bow his head. How could he possibly be","afraid of anyone?","Even avoiding this kind of murderous god was not enough, and you actually took the initiative to trifle with him. If he did not beat you up, who would he beat?","Peng, peng, peng! Ling Han gave Zha Hu a good beating, beating him until he was almost out","of breath. Only then did he stop.","“Now, let us discuss the matter of your compensation.”"]},{"number":3846,"title":"Chapter 3846: Old Monster Liu","paragraphs":["Chapter 3846: Old Monster Liu","What, you still want compensation from me?","Zha Hu was a little dizzy. He had been beaten up, and was riddled with injuries. Who knew","how many bones in his body had been broken, or even shattered. Shouldn’t it be Ling Han who was compensating him?","“Firstly, it’s the main doors. I’ll give you a cheaper price. Just 100 Dao Stones.” Ling Han started to calculate.","Pu!","Zha Hu immediately raised his head and looked towards Ling Han. Are your doors made from Divine Metal; how could they be worth a hundred Dao Stones?","‘You’re deliberately extorting money.’","Pa, Ling Han slapped him across the face, and said balefully, “Do you have any objections?” Yes, but he did not dare to say.","Zha Hu lowered his head, thinking that no matter what Ling Han said now, he would no longer object. In any case, once he escaped, he would ignore this matter altogether. In the future, Lu Qi would naturally deal with Ling Han.","A mere alchemist like Ling Han actually dared to oppose his master; he was truly courting death.","“The house has also been destroyed by you.” Ling Han continued to calculate, “Let’s make it cheaper. I’ll price it at 900 Dao Stones, um, let’s make it a whole number, so let’s make it 1000.”","‘Motherf*cker! Is there any such thing as rounding up the numbers?’","Zha Hu wanted to retort, but when he saw Ling Han’s fierce gaze, he obediently shut his mouth.","“And there’s also that cauldron of alchemical pills of mine. It’s cheaper, so I’ll just count it as 100,000 Dao Stones,” Ling Han continued.","“Isn’t that cauldron of pills of yours undamaged?” Zha Hu could no longer bear it. This naturally still had to be debated.","Pa, Ling Han slapped him across the face, “With you charging over and attacking like this, what alchemist would not have their cauldron explode? It did not explode because of my own skill. I used my own skill to save the alchemical pills, so what does it have to do with you?”","Yi, that made a lot of sense. There was practically no way to refute that.","Actually, Zha Hu very much wanted to refute him. What kind of f****** alchemical pills did he concoct? One cauldron was actually worth a hundred thousand Dao Stones.","Extorting money, this was a blatant extortion of money.","He would endure it. In any case, when he escaped, he would not admit to anything.","“As for other furniture and whatnot, I won’t argue with you. Please pay 11,100 Dao Stones quickly.” Ling Han stretched out his hand.","Zha Hu shook his head, and replied, “I don’t have it.”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “It’s all right even if you don’t have any cash. I also accept transfer of Universe Coins.”","Zha Hu’s expression involuntarily darkened. ‘You’re really thoughtful.’","“I don’t have that much money,” he said weakly.","“You don’t!” Ling Han’s expression instantly changed. His smile disappeared, and peng, he threw a punch. “Think carefully about whether you have or not!”","One punch after another, under the endless barrage of blows, Zha Hu finally could not hold on any longer.","“Yes, I do!”","He connected to the Galaxy Network, then transferred money to Ling Han’s account. However, he only had 73,000 or so Universe Coins.","“I really only have this much,” he said, scowling miserably.","He was only a Cauldron Forging Tier, and he was Lu Qi’s subordinate at that, so how much savings could he have?","“Poor guy!” Ling Han thought for a moment, “It’s fine. I’ll ask your master for the rest.”","Zha Hu hurriedly lowered his head to hide the excitement on his face.","You want to ask Lu Qi for money?","Hahaha, wasn’t this just walking right into a trap?","Go on, hurry up and go.","“Scram!” Ling Han shot out a foot and sent Zha Hu flying. Then, he went to the Saint Palace to make his application. This house was damaged, so he naturally had to change to another one.","However, the Saint Palace had directly arranged an abode for him.","What difference did it have with an ordinary house?","There was a formation in the abode, which could extract the energy of heaven and earth to speed up cultivation. It also had protective effects. As long as the owner didn’t allow it, outsiders couldn’t barge in unless this person had the strength of a Sect Master.","Since there was such a good thing, why wasn’t it taken out earlier?","Because there was a limited number of such abodes, the Saint Palace had not yet decided who would be using them. However, Ling Han’s house was broken, so they took advantage of the situation and directly arranged an abode for him.","Being so generous, it must be because there was someone backing him up.","Ling Han immediately went to find Yan Dong, wanting to express his thanks. However, the result was slightly beyond his expectations, because the one who had really exerted great effort in this matter was actually Liu Sanjun.","-This Lord was very old in the Holy Land, and was close to the end of his lifespan. Thus, everyone had to give him some face.","Added with the fact that Ling Han was indeed freakish, being extremely prodigious in the three fields of martial arts, alchemy and formations, this kind of talent naturally had to be nurtured vigorously. Thus, the Saint Palace decided to simply do him a favour, allowing Ling Han to be the first to move into an abode.","Yi, had Liu Sanjun’s head been damaged because he had been too agitated?","“The way I see it, it should be Old Monster Liu that has developed a desire to cherish your talent,” Yan Dong said seriously. Previously, when Xue Zhan had been defeated, Liu Sanjun surprisingly did not make a move on him. At the time, he was already suspicious, and added with this matter, he was absolutely sure that Liu Sanjun indeed admired Ling Han very much. Moreover, people like Liu Sanjun were eccentric and prone to going to extremes. If they disliked someone, they would despise them immensely, but if they admired someone, they would also admire them immensely. For example, though Yan Dong also admired Ling Han, he would definitely not slam his hand on the table in public, and rage in front of a great many people, immediately supporting the motion of having Ling Han moveinto his abode.","This old man was quite interesting.","Ling Han decided to pay a visit to this great elite. He had done him such a huge favor, so no matter what, he should still go and thank him.","He took his leave from Yan Dong, then went to pay his respects to Liu Sanjun.","It had already been so long, so Liu Sanjun naturally had a new Dao Apprentice, who was only fifteen or sixteen years old.","However, when this young man saw Ling Han, his face instantly turned pale. As he retreated, he shouted, “Don’t kill me! Don’t kill me!”","Ling Han’s expression involuntarily darkened. ‘F*ck! Is this necessary?’","He had indeed killed Liu Sanjun’s Dao Apprentice, but it was not to the extent that he had developed a grudge against all of Liu Sanjun’s Dao Apprentices, and kill every single one he saw, right?","“Don’t worry, I won’t kill you,” Ling Han said.","Only then did the Dao Apprentice breathe a sigh of relief. However, he immediately asked","weakly, “Will you eat me?”","Where did this come from? Where did you f****** hear that from? Am I a man-eating","demon?","Ling Han sighed, “Don’t worry, I don’t eat humans either.”","“You’re not lying to me?” The Dao Apprentice was still worried.","Ling Han felt an urge to pummel someone. F***, who exactly was spreading rumors about him behind his back? When had he become a murderous demon, or a man-eating monster?","“No, I, am, not!” he said word by word.","Only then did the Dao Apprentice breathe a sigh of relief. He patted his chest and said, “Now I can rest easy.” After saying this, he turned around and headed up the mountain.","“Hey, hey, hey, don’t go,” Ling Han hurriedly called out.","The Dao Apprentice turned around, and his face instantly became pale again. “Are you still","going to eat me?”","“No, I have something to see Elder Liu about,” Ling Han said. He felt like he was about to go crazy. These words should have been said at the first instant.","“Oh, you have come to pay your respects to Elder Liu, and really have not come to eat me.”","The Dao Apprentice was even more at ease.","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, “Quickly go and make the report.”","He turned his head, not looking at this Dao Apprentice, fearing that he would not be able to","hold himself back from beating this guy up.","“Oh.” The Dao Apprentice finally turned around and went up the mountain, and did not start","another topic of conversation.","Not long after, a thought rang out in Ling Han’s mind, “Come.”","It was Liu Sanjun."]},{"number":3847,"title":"Chapter 3847: Admiration","paragraphs":["Chapter 3847: Admiration","Ling Han climbed the mountain.","There were some elders who lived in the Saint Palace, but there were also some elders who chose to live on the mountain for peace and quiet. Liu Sanjun was one of the latter.","Ling Han arrived at the summit, and saw that there was a thatched cottage on top. It did not take up much space, and could not be distinguished at all that this was the residence of a Sect Master elite.","“What are you doing here?” Liu Sanjun walked out of his rooms, “You want to kill my Dao Apprentice again?”","The Dao Apprentice from before was presently following behind him, and when he heard this, he couldn’t help but shrink his neck back, hiding behind Liu Sanjun.","F***, it was definitely this old geezer who had spread the rumor that he was a murderous demon and a man-eating monster.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. He glanced at the Dao Apprentice, scaring the latter so much that he hurriedly ducked his head back in, as if Ling Han’s gaze would kill him.","“Senior, I have come to express my gratitude to you.” He bowed with both hands.","Liu Sanjun said coldly, “So, you scared my Dao Apprentice to this extent?”","The Dao Apprentice hurriedly nodded his head. This was too terrifying.","Ling Han’s expression was extremely dark. Hadn’t all this been because you have deliberated defrauded me? Furthermore, this Dao Apprentice was really too cowardly, wasn’t he?","“How could that be? Senior, you have misunderstood,” he said with a smile.","He knew that Liu Sanjun should still be embarrassed, because Ling Han had indeed killed his Dao Apprentice. Even if he had changed his mind out of love for his talent, but what about his pride?","Hence, he had to treat Ling Han coldly and indifferently.","It was easy now that he knew this. Ling Han had been around the large black dog for a long time, and he had a smooth tongue. He was extremely good at pleasantries, and after saying a few good words, a smile slowly appeared on Liu Sanjun’s cold face.","This scared the Dao Apprentice out of his wits. If Liu Sanjun had been bewitched by Ling Han, what would he do?","Would he be steamed or braised?","Ling Han conversed with Liu Sanjun for a long time, and he also reacquainted himself with this elder.","That’s right. Liu Sanjun was indeed headstrong and conceited, and he was indeed protective of his own people. However, he was not a bad person by nature. Previously, he had trusted Xue Bingyuan too much, and always thought that the people around him would not deceive him.","Finally, the old geezer said to Ling Han that if he encountered any confusion during cultivation, he could come and find him at the first instant, and if he encountered any trouble, he could also come and find him.","Ling Han thanked him, then descended the mountain.","Unless he really encountered an opponent that he could not match, Ling Han could not possibly use this kind of relationship.","Moreover, if he went to seek out Liu Sanjun to resolve any trouble, would Liu Sanjun still admire him?","Ling Han went to his new abode. He took control of the formation core, and in future, only he himself would be able to control this abode.","The abode wasn’t big, and could only accommodate him and a Dao Apprentice. Thus, it was unrealistic to ask the empress and the others to share the benefits brought by the formations here.","Through the connection device, he informed everyone of his new accommodations. Instantly, not only did the empress and the others come, even Tan Meng, Jiang Yifei and the other seductive beauties also came over to offer their congratulations. Their voices were filled with affection, and their tender attacks were on again.","Just when they were enjoying themselves, an uninvited guest suddenly paid them a visit.","“Which one of you is Ling Han?” That was a young man in his early twenties. He was tall and slender, but did not look frail at all. He looked like a cheetah, ready to explode with terrifying power at any moment.","“What is it?” Ling Han asked.","“So you’re Ling Han,” the young man said with an arrogant smile. “You don’t have three arms or four legs either.”","These words were filled with a strong provocation.","Wu Qiyuan walked out, and rubbed his arms, “Are you asking for a beating?”","Xiu, that young man raced out, his speed astonishingly fast. In an instant, he had already arrived in front of Wu Qiyuan, and delivered a palm strike at his left shoulder.","This blow was too fast. Even Wu Qiyuan was not able to dodge, but this guy was born with a fondness for close-quarter combat, so did not panic in the slightest. He too shot out a punch at his opponent.","Peng, the two of them exchanged a blow, and both retreated.","The blow that Wu Qiyuan had sustained was slightly heavier, but because his physique was tough, he had dispersed more than half of the force. Thus, his injuries should be about the same as that young man’s.","The young man was slightly dissatisfied. It was clear that he had the upper hand, and had taken him off guard, yet he had still fought to the point that both sides were injured.","Only then did he withdraw his arrogance, and said, “My name is Cheng Bao, and I have come under the command of my Master, to have you-” he pointed at Ling Han, “—immediately go to my Master and beg for forgiveness. The deadline is one day. If you do not do as you are told, my Master would be very angry! Believe me, you definitely would not want to see my Master angry.”","“Who is your Master?” Yuwen Tian asked, though he already had an answer in his heart.","“Lu Qi!” Cheng Bao declared proudly.","Sure enough, it was the guy who ranked nineteenth in the Galaxy Network.","“Alright, that’s all I have to say. You’re on your own now.” Cheng Bao laughed loudly, then","strode off.","Arrogant, how truly arrogant.","“Ling Han!” Everyone looked towards Ling Han.","The opponent this time was too strong. Ranked nineteenth on Galaxy Network, and it was said that it had already formed eight Celestial Cauldrons. This kind of strength overwhelmed Xue Zhan by who knew how many times, and was much stronger than even Lin Qi. How was Ling Han going to stand against that?","“It’s fine. Counter soldiers with arms, and water with an earth weir.” Ling Han smiled calmly, and everyone was relieved.","“Why don’t we go over tonight and cripple that brat?” the large black dog suggested. Everyone’s expressions darkened. What kind of stupid idea was this? Did he really think that the great elites of the Holy Land were all useless?","However, this matter ended in an unexpected manner.","-Song Lan had stepped out, and interceded on Ling Han’s behalf with Lu Qi.","Now that the beauty had stepped out, Lu Qi naturally had to give her face, so he said that this matter would be temporarily put to an end.","It was not a resolved matter, but resolved for now. After all, wasn’t Lu Qi’s reputation worth anything? As for how long this would last for for, that would have to depend on Lu Qi’s mood.","Ling Han also found this strange. He clearly didn’t know this beautiful Song Lan, so why would she intercede on his behalf?","However, it was as if Song Lan had forgotten about this matter. She had only offered a casual word, and had not taken it to heart at all.","Temporarily, peace returned.","Everyone was searching for the whereabouts of the God Slaying Technique, but tens of millions of years had passed, and not a single person had managed to find it. How could they find it just by searching like this?","However, no one gave up. This was because the Nine Suns Saint was most likely the most powerful Saint in history. The Nine Suns Finger was incomparably powerful, and there were few that could rival it in the world. In that case, just how powerful would the God Slaying Technique that the Nine Suns Saint had painstakingly developed in his later years be? Even if it was only a legend, everyone would tirelessly search for it, unwilling to give up. “Ling Han, recently, the ancient abode of a Spirit Transformation True Lord has been discovered. Should we go and take a look?” Yuwen Tian came to find him.","“Oh?” Ling Han was slightly curious, and he asked, “Why are you interested?”","It wasn’t that he was arrogant, but the celestial technique that they had obtained in the Holy Land was at least on the level of Spirit Transformation True Lord. There was absolutely no need for them to explore the abode of a Spirit Transformation True Lord, right?"]},{"number":3848,"title":"Chapter 3848: Spirit Transformation True Lord’s abode","paragraphs":["Chapter 3848: Spirit Transformation True Lord’s abode","“The abode of a normal Spirit Transformation True Lord is certainly not worth exploring. However, this one is different.” Yuwen Tian shook his head. “Because this Spirit Transformation True Lord is also a great alchemist, Earth Tier High Grade alchemist!”","Only then did Ling Han give an ‘oh’, revealing an interested expression.","“What is it? Are you tempted?” Yuwen Tian asked, smiling.","“En, indeed.” Ling Han nodded. He was naturally not interested in alchemical pills, but in pill recipes.","Even if he was willing to spend money, he could not possibly buy all the pill recipes on the Galaxy Network, because there were some alchemical pills that were not difficult to concoct, and the demand for them was great. Thus, the pill recipes had become treasures, and would definitely not be leaked out.","This was profit.","Thus, Ling Han wanted more pill recipes, and finding the abode of this kind of ancient Grandmaster Alchemist should be a very good solution.","“The Spirit Transformation True Lord is called Sun Quan, and he’s been dead for almost 3000 years,” Yuwen Tian said. “Sigh, it’s been too long, and most of the pills have probably already deteriorated. They can’t be taken anymore.”","“Where did you get the information?” Ling Han asked.","“The Galaxy Network has people who specialize in selling this kind of information,” Yuwen Tian said. “We have to hurry. If we’re late, we won’t be able to get anything.”","“All right.” Ling Han nodded.","When it came to this kind of thing, it was the time when friendship would be shown. Yuwen Tian went to call Wu Qiyuan over. After some thought, he also called Huang Lingyun and Mu Long over. Because the empress, the large black dog, and the others were presently breaking through to the crucial stage of Cauldron Forging Tier, Ling Han did not call them over.","The group of five set out, heading towards Sun Quan’s ancient abode.","This Sun Quan was actually quite famous. Though he was only an Earth Tier High Grade alchemist, he had mastered a few pill recipes that had long since been lost. Thus, the alchemical pills he concocted were very popular. No matter where he went, he would be treated as an esteemed guest. However, he had never taken a disciple in his whole life, so after his death, those pill recipes were once again lost.","If their group could find those lost pill recipes, they would naturally make a killing.","They naturally had never thought of earning money from pill recipes, because Ling Han knew how to concoct alchemical pills. Thus, they naturally would hide those pill recipes away, so that they could maximize their profits.","Of course, the prerequisite was that they could obtain the pill recipes.","The information on Sun Quan’s abode was already on sale on the Galaxy Network, so there should be quite a number of people who would go there to try their luck. In fact, there might even be elites of Core Formation Tier and True Self Tier among them. Thus, whether Ling Han and his group would be able to gain anything was another matter.","Thus, time was extremely precious now.","This ancient abode wasn’t located on the Nine Suns Planet. Instead, it was located on a nearby planet. Of course, this “not far” was in terms of interstellar units. If one flew over physically, they would need at least a few dozen years.","Thankfully, there was a Transfer Formation that could reach it directly.","After the five of them handed over the Dao Stones, there was a flash of light, and they had appeared on another planet.","This planet was completely dark blue, not because there was a wide ocean, but because there was a kind of dark blue plant growing everywhere, covering the entire planet. Thus, if one looked at it from the galaxy, this planet would appear the colour of the ocean.","After exiting the Transfer Formation, they immediately discovered the commotion here. Weng, weng, weng! The Transfer Formation was constantly glowing, and practically every moment, there would be people coming over. Afterwards, to prevent the Transfer Formation from being overused and breaking down, the person-in-charge here had no choice but to shut down the Transfer Formation, so that the formation foundations could “rest” for a while.","Hiss, these people should have come for Sun Quan’s abode.","Ling Han activated his eye technique to take a look, and couldn’t help but feel apprehensive. Among them, there was no shortage of elites of Core Formation Tier. Once he encountered such competitors, unless he had set up the Three Elements Treasure Bottle Formation in advance, Ling Han would need to use the Heavenly Dao Flames inside the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","“Let’s go.”","The five of them hurriedly set out. With their speed, they only used half a day’s time to arrive at Sun Quan’s abode.","This was hidden within a mountain, and had originally been protected by formations. However, Sun Quan had died three thousand years ago, and the power of heaven and earth was also slowly changing. Thus, the formation gradually lost its effect, allowing this ancient abode to appear in front of the world.","It could be clearly seen that the words “Sun Manor” were written on the doors of the abode. Combined with the information that Sun Quan had indeed lived on this planet in his later years, it was reasonable to conclude that this was Sun Quan’s abode.","However, no one was entering at this moment.","That was because there were a total of two parts to the formation that guarded the Sun Residence. One part was an illusory formation, which was already ineffective, but the other part was the defensive formation. The moment anyone broke in, the formation would immediately attack. It was extremely fierce, and even a Core Formation Tier cultivator would not be able to withstand it.","At present, no True Self Tier elites had arrived, and there was no way to forcibly break through the formation, so they could only ask a Formation Master for help.","“Ling Han, you’re a Formation Master, right?” Yuwen Tian asked.","Ling Han knew what he meant, and nodded, “I’ll break the formation.”","He circled around the mountain, and soon had some ideas.","“How is it?” When they saw him return, the four of them asked.","“Follow me.”","Ling Han was just about to begin breaking the formation, but he had just inserted the first formation foundations, when someone flew over, and shouted harshly, “What are you guys","doing?”","What was he doing? Wasn’t it obvious?","Yuwen Tian humphed, and said, “Of course, to break the formation. Otherwise, what else","could it be?”","“No!” That person was very rude and unreasonable. “The Formation Master that we invited hasn’t arrived yet, so you’re not allowed to break the formation!”","F***, what kind of reason was that?","Ling Han and the others were all angered. You guys are too overbearing, aren’t you?","“Yuan Zhong, what’s going on?” A middle-aged man walked over.","The person from before hurriedly bowed, and said, “Ninth Uncle, they want to break through","the formation!”","“Oh!” The middle-aged man swept his gaze over. “Our Cao Clan arrived first, so we’ll break the formation first. You guys have no objections, right?”","It would be strange if there was no disagreement!","Wu Qiyuan was enraged, and wanted to charge out to fight. His mind was the simplest, and could not be bothered to think too much. There was only one word for it: fight.","Ling Han pulled him back, and said calmly, “Of course not.”","Hearing Ling Han say so, Yuwen Tian and the others all shut up.","“That’s good.” The middle-aged man nodded, then seemed to ask very casually, “You guys","are from the Nine Suns Holy Land, right?”","“That’s right,” Ling Han said.","“Go on.” The middle-aged man waved his hand.","Ling Han and the others retreated.","“F*ck! This is far too displeasing! The Cao Clan is far too arrogant!” Yuwen Tian couldn’t help","but curse.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “That person just now already harbored killing intent toward us. However, he deduced that we might be from the Nine Suns Holy Land, and that we might have a connecting device on us that could communicate with the network of the Holy Land at any time. Thus, he confirmed it and gave up on the idea.”","“So ruthless?” Huang Lingyun was surprised.","“That is a Core Formation Tier; he does indeed have the possibility of insta-killing us,” Ling","Han said slowly. This was also the reason why he had given in. Otherwise, he would have to summon the Heavenly Dao Flames.","Yuwen Tian and the others were all filled with lingering fear. Even though they could all","possibly reach the level of Sect Master in future, at present, any Core Formation Tier would be","able to easily take their lives.","Just now, they had just passed in front of the gates of hell."]},{"number":3849,"title":"Chapter 3849: Counterattack","paragraphs":["Chapter 3849: Counterattack","“So ruthless?” Yuwen Tian jumped up.","Yet Wu Qiyuan nodded, “I can sense that guy’s killing intent.”","No one would doubt Wu Qiyuan’s sensory ability. This was a man with child-like innocence, and also a person who had grown up among wild beasts, so he was the most sensitive about killing intent.","“In other words, if we hadn’t come from the Holy Land, we would have been killed just then?” Huang Lingyun hissed.","The five of them watched the two members of the Cao Clan leave, their eyes filled with fury.","Ancient sites had no owner, so everyone could explore them. Moreover, they hadn’t even entered yet, so they couldn’t be considered competitors at all. Yet, they were already filled with killing intent.","How ruthless.","“We’ll wait and see,” Ling Han said calmly, appearing neither angry nor shocked. If the other party had really made a move just now, he would have directly released the Heavenly Dao Flames to see who was stronger.","It wasn’t long before the Formation Master that the Cao Clan had hired arrived and began to break the formation.","This Formation Master’s skill was not too bad. Very soon, he had some ideas, and slowly advanced.","After he had advanced a certain distance, he called for the members of the Cao Clan to follow him. If he wanted to break through the formation, his skill was still slightly inferior, but just finding a safe route was much simpler.","“How infuriating, having them leave first.” Yuwen Tian slapped his thigh, appearing very defiant.","Yet Ling Han smiled and said, “It’s not that simple. Prepare for battle.”","“Yi, what did you see?” Yuwen Tianwen asked.","“They won’t be able to pass,” Ling Han said very confidently. At present, he was also an elite Formation Master, and could tell the level of Formation Master with a single glance.","-If he was given enough time, that person should be able to find a safe path, but he was too confident. Previously, he had still carefully probed, but after grasping a few nodes, he thought that he had figured everything out, and led his people in. This had planted hidden dangers. As long as there was the slightest mistake, it would cause a calamity.","Ling Han believed that this scene would soon play out.","As expected, only ten minutes had passed, and a panicked shout suddenly erupted from the group of people from the Cao Clan. A brilliant light flashed past. Boom, violent energy exploded, as if a supreme elite was making a move.","The formation had been activated.","This was a formation that could kill cultivators at the Core Formation Tier. Now that it was activated, the members of the Cao Clan instantly suffered great misfortune.","It was only the first wave of attack, and half of the members of the Cao Clan had already been killed. Meanwhile, the three group leaders in Core Formation Tier began to hurriedly retreat with the remaining cultivators.","However, in their rush, they had already lost their composure, and were unable to completely follow the steps that they had taken previously. Now, great, the formation had been activated again, and the killing intent returned.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Light exploded madly, incredibly terrifying.","In the end, only three people from the Cao Clan managed to escape. Even the three Core Formation Tier elites were severely wounded.","At first, they had wanted to protect a few of their clansmen, but in the end, they could only give up on this idea helplessly. That was because even protecting themselves was difficult, and they still wanted to bring people out? They would only be trapped inside.","Ling Han’s eyes turned cold. Xiu, he charged out.","‘Huh? You’re not planning to snipe these three Core Formation Tier cultivators, are you?’","“Ling Han, don’t be rash. Although they’ve been severely wounded, they’re still at the Core Formation Tier, after all!” Yuwen Tian hurriedly advised. However, Wu Qiyuan roared and followed him.","“F***!” he cursed, and hurriedly followed after him.","Huang Lingyun and Mu Long exchanged a glance before breaking into a run as well.","Seeing Ling Han approach aggressively, the three Core Formation cultivators from the Cao Clan all smirked coldly. Did he think that they could be taken advantage of just because they were injured?","“Brat, are you trying to take advantage of the situation?” the middle-aged man who had chased Ling Han away said. However, before he could even finish his words, he had already launched an attack.","As for the demeanor of a senior? That was all empty words.","His present injuries were extremely severe. Even if he could still kill Cauldron Forging Tiers, his injuries would be compounded. Thus, he naturally didn’t want to continue the battle, and wanted to kill his opponent at the first instant.","Ling Han wasn’t surprised at all. Some people had no principles at all.","He unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and unleashed a burst of Primal Chaos Qi above his head. Lightning then surged toward the middle-aged man from the Cao","Clan.","Peng, the attack of the middle-aged man from the Cao Clan landed on the Primal Chaos Qi, just barely penetrating through it. However, Ling Han still had the protection of the Starlight Screen, which completely dispersed this attack. Meanwhile, lightning blasted out, causing the middle-aged man to let out a terrible scream. He was already riddled with injuries in the first place, and now the wound was even larger, looking extremely terrible.","This result was too unexpected. No matter how injured a Core Formation Tier cultivator was, he was still a Core Formation Tier cultivator, so how could he be injured by a Cauldron Formation Tier cultivator?","“Detestable brat!” The middle-aged man gritted his teeth. Being hit by the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, his injuries were compounded. Not only was he in great pain, but his abilities were also weakened by 30%.","And this was still because he was a Core Formation Tier cultivator. Otherwise, if it was a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, he probably wouldn’t have the ability to stand after taking a","hit head-on.","Hong long long, Wu Qiyuan had already charged over. Like a wild bear, he crashed towards the","middle-aged man.","The middle-aged man almost went mad with fury. What was wrong with the Cauldron Forging Tier juniors now? Did they really think that he was an easy target to bully?","He gave a loud shout, and shot out an attack at Wu Qiyuan.","Ling Han believed that Wu Qiyuan should be able to deal with the middle-aged man. After all,","he had been severely wounded, and had even been struck by Ling Han’s Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. His battle prowess should have fallen to five to six cauldrons at most, and after more than a year, Wu Qiyuan had also reached the peak stage of Four Cauldrons, so he should be able to put up a fight.","He set his eyes on the other two, not giving them the chance to provide reinforcements.","“Die!”","The two of them didn’t waste their breath, immediately summoning their Spirit Tool. One wielded a spear, while the other wielded a saber, blasting towards Ling Han.","They already knew that Ling Han’s strength was extremely strong, and could not be measured in terms of ordinary Cauldron Forging Tier.","Ling Han was calm and composed. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower hovered above his head, emanating streams of Primal Chaos Qi. This should be the strongest defense of Cauldron Forging Tier, and added with the fact that there was the Starlight Screen behind it, and the fact that he was wearing a Battle Armor, this defense could be considered adequate.","He charged forward, battling two Core Formation Tier cultivators on his own.","If this spread out, it would definitely shock people to the point of numbness.","A Cauldron Forging Tier was actually capable of matching two Core Formation Tier elites?","It could not be helped. Who asked the two of them to be severely injured? Though their situation was better than the first, they only had battle prowess of Eight Cauldrons, at most. This was still no problem for Ling Han.","The great battle was fierce, and Ling Han didn’t dare to be careless. A starving camel was still bigger than a horse. Core Formation Tiers must have grasped some secret technique, and once it exploded, it could possibly be extremely terrifying.","“You’re seeking death!” A Core Formation Tier cultivator released his own aura. This was the best method to deal with low-level cultivators.","However, this was completely ineffective against Ling Han. Instead, they were struck by Ling Han’s murderous aura, causing both of them to be slightly stifled.","At this time, Yuwen Tian and the others also rushed over.","“The three of you, deal with one of them. You only have to hold him back,” Ling Han said. He","created an opening for the three of them to deal with one of his opponents, while he battled a middle-aged man in green alone."]},{"number":3850,"title":"Chapter 3850: Killing Core Formation Tier","paragraphs":["Chapter 3850: Killing Core Formation Tier","Five Cauldron Forging Tiers versus three Core Formation Tiers.","Under normal circumstances, this would be a joke. There was no need for there to be three Core Formation Tiers. Merely the intervention of a Core Formation Tier martial artist would be able to instantly eliminate five Cauldron Forging Tiers. In fact, a Core Formation Tier would be able to kill 50 or even 500 Cauldron Forging Tiers. However, the present situation was unique. The three Core Formation Tiers were all heavily injured, and there was only 1% of their strength remaining. In fact, there was even less. In that case, it was a different story.","Even so, among the three Core Formation Tiers, there were still two people who had the upper hand. Aside from Ling Han who could still resist, in the other two battles, it was the Core Formation Tier that had the upper hand.","Thankfully, Yuwen Tian and the others could still hold on for the moment.","This was Core Formation Tier, after all. Even if it was a dragon swimming in shallow waters, it was still incredibly fierce.","Ling Han knew that he had to turn the situation around.","He gave a loud shout and activated the Demonic Monkey Fists.","Weng, a frightening aura spread out. He was like a young Great Emperor, possessing a supreme bearing.","“What?!” His opponent paled in shock. This was only a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, so how could he give him a feeling of weakness and felt that he could not rival him?","Boom!","Right at this moment, Ling Han had already thrown a punch. Endless energy condensed on his fist, concentrated on a single point of explosive power.","The middle-aged man in green wanted to dodge, but Ling Han’s murderous aura attack caused him to pause slightly, and he instantly missed the best opportunity to dodge.","Left with no choice, he could only return the favor.","Peng!","In an exchange of blows, that Core Formation Tier cultivator was instantly sent flying, his whole person spurting out a fountain of blood, but what was shocking was that he actually didn’t die.","‘F*ck! A Core Formation Tier cultivator is so hard to kill?’","Ling Han forcefully suppressed the burning sensation in his chest, and once again charged over.","“Han Long!” The other two members of the Cao Clan exclaimed in shock. They hurriedly charged over to help, yet they were tightly held back by Wu Qiyuan and Yuwen Tian. However, they had also paid a great price for this, and the injuries on their bodies had become slightly heavier.","Core Formation Tiers that had gone berserk were too terrifying.","On the other side, Ling Han had already caught up to the man in green. He threw another punch, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower also shot out lightning, wanting to kill this man by force.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The man in green parried, but he had taken a blow from the Demonic Monkey Fists. This was an Imperial Technique, so how could it not cause injury on top of injury? Furthermore, with Ling Han’s ferocious barrage of blows, it was naturally more and more unbearable for him. Every time he took a punch, he would spit out a mouthful of blood, and there were even pieces of his internal organs.","He took more than a hundred punches, and finally reached the point of exhaustion. With a bang, his whole person suddenly exploded.","Ling Han was neither happy nor angry. He turned around and stared at the remaining two Core Formation Tiers.","The two members of the Cao Clan were both terrified by his gaze. A Core Formation Tier clansman had already been beaten to burst by Ling Han, so how could they be spared?","No, they had to break out of the siege immediately. Their injuries were too severe that they could not even suppress a few Cauldron Forging Tiers, but as long as they stabilized their injuries, and they didn’t even need to heal completely. Then wouldn’t killing a Cauldron Forging Tier be child’s play?","“Let’s go!”","The two of them were just about to break out of the siege, but Wu Qiyuan and the others also began to fight with their lives on the line, clinging tightly onto the two of them.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and charged back.","The two members of the Cao Clan were extremely regretful. If they had known earlier, they wouldn’t have cared if they were from the Nine Suns Holy Land or not. If they had encountered them, they should have killed them. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have had such bad","luck.","Obviously, they still did not have the slightest intention to reflect on their actions.","Ling Han once again used the Three Styles of the God of War. This was a Saint Technique, and though it was not the most exquisite ultimate move, after three consecutive moves, that Core Formation Tier cultivator from the Cao Clan was naturally severely wounded, and his battle prowess dropped even further.","And now, it was again Ling Han who was battling alone, while Wu Qiyuan, Yuwen Tian and the others were battling against the other Core Formation Tier from the Cao Clan.","The scales of victory were already completely leaning towards Ling Han’s side. Whether it was Ling Han, Wu Qiyuan and the others, they were all firmly on the upper hand.","“Come, let’s see who can end the battle first,” Ling Han said.","“All right!”","Wu Qiyuan and the others all replied. How could it be that even if the four of them joined forces, they would still be no match for Ling Han?","Kill, kill, kill!","Meanwhile, the two members of the Cao Clan were about to explode in fury. They were Core Formation Tier elites, yet now they had actually become props in a competition between","Cauldron Forging Tiers?","How could they accept this!","“Humph!” The two Core Formation Tier cultivators both released their own auras,","suppressing on the spiritual level.","As expected, Wu Qiyuan and the others were instantly affected, and it was clear that they were much weaker in their attacks. However, Ling Han was completely unaffected, and was still blasting out blows fiercely. In fact, the barrage of murderous aura from him could even slightly affect the Core Formation Tier cultivators.","The two Core Formation Tier elites gritted their teeth. How could it be that they had no other way?","Most importantly, in the process of charging out of the formation, they had already expended all their rare treasures and techniques. Now, even if they wanted to put their lives on the line, they did not have any trump cards that they could use.","Could it be that it was really going to die at the hands of a few Cauldron Forging Tiers?","They were defiant.","“I’ll give it my all!” the two great Core Formation Tier elites roared furiously, breaking through with all their might.","They completely ignored the attacks, and were completely focused on breaking out of the","siege.","“Ah!” Ling Han’s opponent screamed in agony. With a bang, he collapsed onto the ground. -Ling Han’s strength was not suppressed by the aura of Core Formation Tier, and he actually dared to ignore Ling Han’s attack; wasn’t that just courting death?","However, the other member of the Cao Clan finally charged out. He turned around to look at his two companions on the ground, and then swept his gaze over Ling Han and the others. He remembered all five of them. When he recovered, he would definitely charge back and take the","lives of these five people.","Then, he turned his head, and was just about to run with all his might.","But in an instant, he was drenched in cold sweat.","That was because there was a person standing in front of him.","Ling Han!","How was this possible? How could this guy’s speed be so fast?","Ling Han did not make a sound, and simply shot out a punch.","The Core Formation Tier cultivator hurriedly parried. Peng! After receiving a single punch, he","was forced into a continuous retreat.","This person was precisely the one who had exchanged blows with Ling Han at the beginning. He had long since been severely wounded by the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Now, he was fighting head-on with Ling Han, so how could he possibly be a match?","After a consecutive dozen over punches, he was beaten to burst.","“Haha, Ling Han, we won,” Yuwen Tian said with a smile, pointing at the second Core Formation Tier cultivator from the Cao Clan that had been killed by the four of them. -He had been knocked down by Ling Han, so Yuwen Tian and the others took advantage of","the opening to move, and take his life.","Ling Han smiled in reply. He naturally wouldn’t say anything about their cheap tricks.","Cauldron Forging Tiers faced a Core Formation Tier elite head-on. None of these four people fell behind, which made him very happy.","The friendship between them naturally deepened further.","“Come, let’s rake in our spoils.”","They searched the corpses of three Core Formation Tier cultivators. However, the treasures on","those three people had all been expended in the formation. Perhaps they still had some","savings, but it must have been on the Galaxy Network account.","“Now, I’m beginning to dislike Galaxy Network,” Yuwen Tian sighed.","“I agree.” The others nodded as well.","They had painstakingly killed three Core Formation Tier cultivators, yet their gains were only","a few Dao Stones. How could this not be depressing?","Furthermore, aside from Ling Han, Wu Qiyuan and the others had all sustained considerable","injuries.","“Let’s recover first, then we’ll enter the abode to rest,” Ling Han said.","Wu Qiyuan and the others didn’t try to be brave. They accepted the healing alchemical pills","and began to recover.","Half a day later, they all leaped up. Though they had not recovered to their prime condition, it","no longer affected their movements.","They had to hurry up, or more and more people would come.","Ling Han was just about to begin breaking through the formation. Xiu! Several figures","streaked past in the sky. Other people had arrived."]},{"number":3851,"title":"Chapter 3851: Shaking hands","paragraphs":["Chapter 3851: Shaking hands","Ling Han suddenly stopped, and saw that those figures had directly descended, not too far from them.","There were a total of five people on the opposing side, three men and two women","respectively, and Ling Han’s eyes were first drawn to a man.","It was not that the other was world-shakingly handsome, but rather that this person’s aura was too strong.","He was clearly just a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, but when he stood there, he was like a black hole, attracting all eyes and attention.","He was indeed quite handsome. He had a dignified appearance, and his features were as sharp as if carved by a knife. His features were well-defined, and his hair was black and shiny, as if every strand was a piece of art that had been meticulously carved.","Then, Ling Han’s sharp eyes turned to look at a woman.","Beautiful, astonishingly beautiful.","Ling Han had to admit that even the empress and Hu Niu couldn’t gain the upper hand in front of her. However, another feeling quickly rose up in him, and that was emptiness.","This woman was clearly standing there, yet it was as if she were empty air, and no one could lock onto her.","-If it was not for the fact that she had an Innate Divine Physique, it would be that she had cultivated some kind of special cultivation technique.","These people were?","When Ling Han’s eyes swept over the two men again, he immediately determined the identity of this group of people.","Lu Qi and Song Lan.","That was because he had seen Zha Hu and Cheng Bao. Thus, it was needless to say that the man they were protecting was definitely Lu Qi, and who would be the woman that could be accompanied by Lu Qi?","Song Lan, an exquisite beauty ranked ninth on the Exquisite Beauty Leaderboard.","Indeed, she was breathtakingly beautiful, and indescribably exquisite.","Lu Qi swept an eye over Ling Han, but did not speak. However, Cheng Bao immediately stepped out, and shouted, “Ling Han, meeting Master, pay your greetings!”","This was an absolutely condescending position. Even a lackey was so arrogant.","Ling Han smiled knowingly, and strode forwards.","Everyone thought that Ling Han had admitted defeat. After all, Lu Qi was a super elite ranked nineteenth on Galaxy Network. Theoretically speaking, only a mere eighteen people could defeat him in Cauldron Forging Tier. With how big the universe was, no one would think that it was inappropriate even if he was a hundred times prouder.","Though Wu Qiyuan, Yuwen Tian and the others also felt extremely displeased, they also knew that this was the best choice for Ling Han. If he did not bow his head now, he would only be asking for his own suffering.","Lu Qi was proud, and there was a hint of disdain at the corners of his lips.","Humph, what number one? He did not have the slightest bit of backbone.","Ling Han had already arrived. He suddenly stretched out a hand, and at an extremely fast speed, grabbed onto Song Lan’s slender, jade-like hand.","This was really too sudden. No one would have thought that Ling Han would actually be so bold. Even Song Lan herself was dumbfounded. Her captivating beautiful eyes turned towards Ling Han. She was 70% surprised, and 30% embarrassed, but very quickly, her pretty face flushed red, and she hurriedly tried to pull her hand back.","How could Ling Han be willing to let go? He said, “Thank you, Miss Song, for speaking up for me. I am truly endlessly grateful. Miss Song is really worthy of being called an exquisite beauty of the world. She is practically indescribably beautiful...”","His mouth was full of nonsense. In short, he was just grabbing onto Song Lan’s hand to express his gratitude.","As a seductive beauty who was ranked in the top ten of the Exquisite Leaderboard, Song Lan was naturally a public figure who knew how to socialize. What had she not seen in this world? But what man would dare to be so bold, and hold onto her delicate hand in public? Just how thick-skinned was he?","She tried her best to slap him, but Ling Han was also grabbing onto her too tightly. Song Lan couldn’t pull her hand out at all. However, in order to maintain the demeanor of a goddess and celestial maiden, she still couldn’t get angry. After all, Ling Han was expressing his gratitude to her.","According to her true thoughts, she really wanted to unleash a celestial technique and kill Ling Han. However, she still had to maintain a smile on her face, which made her extremely","depressed.","But the person who was the angriest here was definitely Lu Qi. It should be known that though he was earnestly courting Song Lan, he had never had any physical contact with her.","He looked at Song Lan’s jade-like hand falling into Ling Han’s “claw”, and his heart was filled with mixed feelings. At first, his face was livid, then it turned black, and finally turned into a murderous intent that could burn the skies.","“You’re seeking death!” he spat out word by word, his voice icy cold, making one feel as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","Wu Qiyuan and the others were also dumbfounded. They had thought that Ling Han had gone to admit defeat, but in the end, this guy was really outrageously bold. Not only had he not admitted defeat, he had even slapped Lu Qi right in the face.","No, this was a hundred times worse than a slap.","However, it was clear that Lu Qi had already been angered, and it was even more impossible for Song Lan to intercede on Ling Han’s behalf. Then, how would Ling Han resolve Lu Qi’s","anger?","Ling Han finally withdrew his hand. Tsk, it felt really good to the touch. As expected of the ninth beauty of the galaxy.","He coughed, looked towards Lu Qi, and asked seriously, “Who are you again?”","In the first place, Lu Qi had already suffered 10,000 points of damage, and now, this was definitely a critical blow.","“Die!” He moved, launching an attack at Ling Han.","Ling Han clenched a fist and replied with a punch. Peng! He instantly felt an unstoppable force surge over, sending him flying. Then, it was as if every bone in his body was about to break. A few of his muscles had already been forcefully torn, and blood was seeping out.","As expected of Eight Cauldrons, with an advantage of three minor levels over him. This was not a weakling like Xue Zhan, but had been obtained through his own hard work. It required great comprehension ability, great intelligence, and strong determination. Thus, in terms of battle prowess, this kind of Eight Cauldrons far surpassed wild beasts of the same level, and was chillingly strong.","Just like Ling Han. He clearly only had five cauldrons, yet could easily slaughter a ferocious beast having eight cauldrons.","If Lu Qi’s strength was solidified, that should be equivalent to a ferocious beast of Nine Cauldrons, or even the peak of Nine Cauldrons.","He was no match for him.","Lu Qi smirked coldly, and charged over once more.","Ling Han activated his eye technique, seizing the opening that his opponent had revealed, dodging this attack. Then, he opened his mouth, and the Sword of Metal shot out, shooting","towards Lu Qi.","Lu Qi did not dare to ignore this either. He sent out a palm strike. Peng, the golden sword was shattered, but a bloody mark had appeared on his palm, and blood was seeping out.","Seeing this scene, both Cheng Bao and Zha Hu were shocked.","There was actually someone in the Cauldron Forging Tier that could wound their master!","It was not one of the top 18 of the Galaxy Network, but rather a “unknown” minor character-","in the Galaxy Network, Ling Han was indeed not well-known.","This was too inconceivable.","Lu Qi raised his hand for a look, and a smile appeared at the corners of his lips, “Amongst those of the same age range, you are the first person that has truly wounded me.”","In the Galaxy Network Level Battles, though he had lost before, that was a battle of Spiritual Power. It was impossible for his physical body to be injured.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “Then you’ll have to get used to it. In the future, you’ll have","many chances to get beaten.”","Lu Qi’s expression darkened. He seemed to be praising Ling Han, but in truth, he was also","promoting his own strength.","“Insolent words, you don’t know what’s good for you!” He charged out again. This time, he had used some kind of celestial technique. Boundless celestial light danced as his palms opened and closed, and every streak was filled with boundless might.","Ling Han took this strike head-on with the Starlight Screen, and it instantly shattered.","It wasn’t that the Starlight Screen was weak, but rather that he was at a disadvantage in terms","of cultivation level. After all, Ling Han was only at Five Cauldrons.","He used the Imminent Skyline, and his figure moved swiftly. Even Lu Qi could not catch sight","of him.","“Interesting,” Lu Qi said coldly. “Thousand Silk Net!”","He shouted lightly, and the boundless celestial light instantly intertwined, turning into a","large net."]},{"number":3852,"title":"Chapter 3852: Fighting Lu Qi","paragraphs":["Chapter 3852: Fighting Lu Qi","This net surrounded him, locking down all routes of escape.","Lu Qi himself also charged over, his gaze sharp, his aura frightening.","He was already brimming with killing intent, yearning to crush Ling Han into dust.","He dared to touch the woman that he had his eye on?","His only fate was death. No one could save this b@stard.","Ling Han sighed. There was a gap of three minor levels between them. Furthermore, Lu Qi himself was a prodigy ranked nineteenth in Galaxy Network, so his battle prowess was really too powerful.","Weng, the barrage of murderous aura shot out.","So what if Lu Qi was a supreme prodigy? Instantly, his senses were affected, and he fell into a temporary state of confusion.","Ling Han retreated continuously, right until the net disappeared due to exhaustion of energy. Lu Qi came back to his senses, and couldn’t help but feel slightly apprehensive. “Who would’ve thought that you’ve actually mastered a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool!”","A Spiritual Power Spirit Tool could be something like the Heavenly Pattern Jade that could be thrown out, causing physical damage. It could also have direct effects on the divine sense, and could even penetrate the mind.","He definitely did not believe that Ling Han had used some kind of secret technique to affect him, because he believed that with the sturdiness of his divine sense, no one at the same cultivation level could break through it.","Ling Han did not try to explain himself. No matter how he thought about it, it was his business. Firstly, it was meaningless, and secondly, how could someone as proud as Lu Qi believe him?","He unleashed the Imminent Skyline, launching a counterattack.","Lu Qi was calm and composed. His advantage was too obvious. Casually striking out with both palms, he possessed invincible might.","However, once Ling Han unleashed his murderous aura, he would be hit no matter what. Although it was only a short instant, it completely messed up the rhythm of his attacks, and he was still unable to turn his advantage into victory.","After a few dozen moves, Lu Qi felt a little embarrassed.","He was at Eight Cauldrons, while Ling Han was only at Five Cauldrons. Yet, he was actually unable to take down Ling Han even after so long?","It should be known that with a difference of a cauldron in cultivation level, the battle should be completely one-sided. This situation was unacceptable to him.","If news of this got out, he would definitely be humiliated, and others would wonder if his rank of 19th on the Galaxy Network was not real.","He roared in fury. Boom! There was the sound of thunder in his body, and his entire body suddenly enlarged endlessly. In an instant, he had turned from a normal person into a giant that was like a mountain.","Boom!","His palm descended, truly covering the skies with a single hand.","How could he block such an attack?","Peng, the palm strike landed, and the whole ground trembled, as if an earthquake had happened.","Lu Qi’s figure trembled, and he returned to his normal size.","This was not some secret technique, but rather a Mystical Power that he had grasped. –Great Power Diamond Physique, one of the most powerful Innate Divine Physiques. Humph, with this strike, Ling Han should have been blasted into smithereens by now, right? However, he could only see a precious tower rising and falling, sending down streaks of Primal Chaos Qi. Vaguely, he could see a person standing proudly inside.","Ling Han!","Lu Qi couldn’t help but pale. He still hadn’t managed to kill Ling Han?","One had to realize that the Great Power Diamond Physique was far too powerful. In fact, it was so powerful that even he found it extremely difficult to control it. In fact, he could only use it two to three times in a short amount of time.","However, looking at Ling Han’s appearance, it was clear that he was completely unscathed.","He had to be seeing things!","He soon set his eyes on the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. His instincts told him that Ling Han was able to dodge his explosive attack completely because of this precious tool. The more he looked, the more he discovered the extraordinary nature of this precious tool, causing him to feel a strong covetous desire, wanting to take it for his own.","He channeled the Innate Divine Physique again, and his body rapidly enlarged. Then, he grabbed out at Ling Han.","What did being large mean?","His power was tremendous.","For example, ants. Even if they were strong creatures among ants, when they encountered humans? Even if it wasjust a child, he would be able to easily crush the strongest ants.","Thus, after Lu Qi channeled the Innate Divine Physique, his power soared exponentially, and was comparable to the early stage of Core Formation Tier.","He grabbed hold of Ling Han, but the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower exuded Primal Chaos Qi, which formed a powerful defense, protecting Ling Han within.","“Shatter!” Lu Qi roared, his voice as loud as a sudden clap of thunder.","He gripped his right hand tightly, wanting to shatter the Primal Chaos Qi, and then forcibly crush Ling Han.","This wasn’t impossible. Although the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was a future Imperial Weapon, and could be considered the strongest weapon in the Cauldron Forging Tier, it was only limited to the Cauldron Forging Tier. Most importantly, the current Lu Qi was like Core Formation Tier, though he could only match the weakest of Core Formation Tiers.","A Core Formation Tier could easily crush a Cauldron Forging Tier.","Thus, the air of Primal Chaos was rapidly rupturing. Though the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was still continuously pouring down Primal Chaos Qi, it could not compare to the rate of destruction.","Right at this moment, zi, the light of lightning blazed.","“Ah-” Lu Qi released a pained groan, and hurriedly let go.","His current strength was comparable to the Core Formation Tier, but it didn’t mean that his defense was the same. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower’s counterattack was too","fierce.","Xiu, Ling Han and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower fell together. However, in the next instant, Ling Han had already moved on his Tool, launching a counterattack at Lu Qi. The Great Overarching Heaven Technique was used. Brilliant light shone, and multiple seals","circulated.","After Lu Qi had just barely withstood a few moves, his figure shrunk. He could not maintain","this state for very long.","He frowned deeply. The strength of this precious tool had exceeded his expectations. It could actually just barely match a Core Formation Tier cultivator.","Damn it, if his Innate Divine Physique could channel for a while longer, that would be great.","Ling Han also felt a little apprehensive. This Lu Qi was really powerful. After channeling the Innate Divine Physique, he could actually unleash battle prowess on the level of Core Formation Tier. He had almost penetrated the defenses of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and almost forced out his Heavenly Dao Flames.","This top-notch Innate Divine Physique was too terrifying.","Though he was thinking this, he still charged out without hesitation. The Great Overarching","Heaven Technique was used, and he continued to attack madly.","-The Three Styles of the God of War and the Demonic Monkey Fists had both just been used,","and there was still a very long time until he could channel them again, so he could only use the Great Overarching Heaven Technique.","Lu Qi approached. He was also using various amazing techniques, wanting to take down Ling","Han.","However, it was a shame that his attacks could only barely penetrate the air of Primal Chaos. To say nothing of the endless air of Primal Chaos that was pouring down from the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, there was also a layer of protection from the Starlight Screen. Thus, it would be wishful thinking if he wanted to wound Ling Han.","After opening up the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, if one wanted to pose a threat to Ling Han, it would have to be those freaks ranked in the top ten of the Network that had formed Nine Cauldrons!","Fight, fight, fight.","Ling Han only needed to attack, and did not need to defend. This naturally meant that he had","the upper hand. After several hundred moves, it was clear that Lu Qi couldn’t hold on any","longer.","He released a furious roar, and withdrew to retreat.","He couldn’t fight any longer. Otherwise, he would only gain a loss.","“If you can, put away your precious tool before fighting me,” he provoked.","Ling Han smiled calmly, “All right. You self-destruct three Celestial Cauldrons, and I will not","use amy Spirit Tool.”","‘Damn!’","Lu Qi almost bent his nose in anger. Was it easy for him to cultivate to eight cauldrons? Even if prodigies were as prodigious as he was, he did not dare to guarantee that he could reach the height of Eight Cauldrons again through re-cultivation. That was because from Six Cauldrons onwards, every cauldron cultivated would be due to natural talent, good luck, and great opportunities. Not one factor could be missed.","“We’re all disciples of the same Holy Land, so we’ll see each other frequently. Let’s enter the abode first,” Song Lan spoke up to mediate the situation. She swept an eye over Ling Han, her expression as cold as ice."]},{"number":3853,"title":"Chapter 3853 Cuckolded","paragraphs":["Chapter 3853 Cuckolded","Song Lan was naturally extremely displeased with Ling Han.","Though she was a goddess that had charmed millions, she had always maintained her chastity, and had never had skin contact with any man. Unexpectedly, Ling Han had forcefully pulled her hand, which made her so furious that she wanted to commit murder.","What made her even angrier?","Ling Han didn’t admire her at all. Instead, he was simply using her to anger and provoke Lu Qi.","What pride would she have left?","Ling Han could clearly feel the coldness in Song Lan’s eyes, which made him feel slightly anxious. It was not fear he felt, but rather guilt.","“Qing Qing, Qing Qing, you resolve the formation.” Song Lan didn’t linger on this matter. Instead, she turned to the other woman and said.","This woman’s appearance was ordinary, but she had an indescribable bearing, making one feel comfortable just looking at her. She smiled slightly, and said, “All right.”","Obviously, she was a Formation Master.","Ling Han smiled, and said, “There’s no need to trouble Miss Qing Qing. I already have a rough idea. You guys can just come with me.”","Song Lan appeared slightly surprised. She had not thought that Ling Han was actually also a Formation Master.","Meanwhile, that Miss Qing Qing looked towards Ling Han, and said solemnly, “The path of formations has myriad changes. The slightest mistake can lead to a great calamity, so don’t show off.”","She had seen too many people show off in front of Song Lan, and what was the result?","Ling Han smiled, and strode into the formation.","Wu Qiyuan bared his teeth in a grin at Song Lan, and followed closely behind Ling Han.","Yuwen Tian and the others followed closely behind. They naturally knew just how amazing Ling Han’s accomplishments in formations were. Previously, he had killed Xue Bingyuan by force, and just now, he had also seen that the Formation Master of the Cao Clan would definitely make mistakes. Just based on these two points, could he not believe Ling Han’s strength?","Ling Han led the way ahead. In just a few steps, he had already entered deep into the formation.","Peacefully, without any turbulence.","Song Lan looked slightly surprised. Looks like she had underestimated this rash person.","“Let’s go.”","They also entered into the formation. Since that Miss Qing Qing was a Formation Master, she would naturally be able to remember Ling Han’s steps just by watching him walk once. This was the lowest level ability of a Formation Master.","With Ling Han and the others in front, the people behind naturally could be at ease and be bold.","Not long after, they walked through the formation, and arrived in front of the main doors.","With a light push, the stone door was opened. The defense of this abode was set up on the formation outside, and there were no more restrictions set up inside.","The abode was very simple. There was a bedroom, an alchemy chamber, and a meditation chamber, but this alchemy chamber was really huge. There were formations on the ground, and they were all different. They were used to concoct different alchemical pills, and there were rows of wooden shelves all around, on which there were many pill bottles.","Everyone hurriedly went to check on the alchemical pills. For most people, this was their greatest gain.","However, Ling Han didn’t. He was searching for pill recipes, and Song Lan also had another target. Her attention wasn’t focused on the wooden shelves, and she instead went to the meditation room.","Neither of them interfered with the other, but very soon, they saw a jade pendant almost at the same time.","Spirit Tool?","Ling Han reached over, and Song Lan also reached over.","This time, the two of them were not shaking hands.","Song Lan’s jade-like hand was as smooth as jade, but when the surge of power from the tap of her finger swept over, it could penetrate through Divine Metal.","This woman’s strength was extraordinary, and she was definitely not just for show.","Ling Han’s Starlight Screen was entwined around his hand, and he immediately switched from defense to offense, grabbing at Song Lan’s wrist.","The finger-generated power arrived, and the Starlight Screen was instantly torn apart. However, it wasn’t torn into pieces, just a sliver away from that extent.","Hiss, this destructive power was shocking enough.","However, Ling Han’s counterattack had already arrived, and was aimed at Song Lan’s wrist.","Song Lan’s wrist turned nimbly, turning into a claw that pecked back at Ling Han’s palm.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He clenched his hand into a fist, and punched out at Song Lan.","Peng!","The two of them finally exchanged a solid blow. A powerful force surged over, and the two of them trembled, taking a few steps back.","Ling Han activated his eye technique and looked toward Song Lan.","Six Cauldrons.","He was slightly surprised. This beauty was actually only Six Cauldrons!","Six Cauldrons, and she was almost evenly matched with him. This woman’s battle prowess was truly formidable.","If Song Lan was also at Eight Cauldrons, would Lu Qi be a match for her?","As he thought this, Ling Han’s hands didn’t stop moving. He grabbed out at the jade pendant again.","Song Lan did not give in either. She similarly rushed forwards, her hands slicing, pressing, tapping and pushing. Like a celestial maiden dancing, graceful and enchanting.","This kind of battle was actually very intense, yet had a kind of pleasing beauty to the eye.","After exchanging a dozen over blows like this, Ling Han’s right hand gripped onto Song Lan’s left wrist, but Song Lan’s right hand had also gripped onto his left wrist, and again, it was a tie.","For cultivators, their vital points were extremely important. If one was controlled by an opponent, it was naturally extremely disadvantageous to oneself.","Thus, the two of them interlocked their vital points and could cause great damage to each other.","However, on the surface, the two of them were holding hands, and could not look more intimate or ambiguous.","“Let go!” Song Lan shouted lowly, not daring to alert the people next door.","Her pretty face was flushed red. It had not even been a day, and Ling Han had already gripped her slender hand twice.","“You let go first.” Ling Han smiled faintly. The person who let go first would definitely be at a disadvantage.","Song Lan naturally wouldn’t let go. She thought for a moment, then said, “I only want a piece of information from the jade pendant. Everything else can belong to you!”","“Oh, you’re that confident? Is that a Spatial Tool?” Ling Han asked.","“That’s none of your business,” Song Lan said. “If that isn’t a Spatial Tool, then there’s no point in us fighting over it, right?”","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “That makes sense. However, I’m sure that things aren’t as simple as that.”","Song Lan took a deep breath, “All right, I can tell you. The reason why Sun Quan could become an Earth Tier alchemist is because he has obtained the inheritance of a Heaven Tier alchemist. What I need is the alchemical pills left behind by that Heaven Tier alchemist. I think that this jade pendant might contain information about the inheritance of that Heaven Tier alchemist.”","Ling Han thought for a moment, “All right. If there really is the inheritance information of that Heaven Tier alchemist, we will explore it together. You can take away the alchemical pills, while I will take the pill recipes.”","Song Lan was also a resolute person. She nodded, “All right!”","“Then we’ll let go on three.”","“One.”","“Two.”","“Ling! Han!”","They had not even said ‘three’, when they heard a voice that was filled with endless hatred through gritted teeth.","Ling Han and Song Lan turned around at the same time, and saw that it was none other than Lu Qi.","The two of them had already reached an agreement in the first place, and now that an “outsider” had appeared, they naturally took advantage of the opening to let go. They both released their grips, and took a few steps back.","However, in Lu Qi’s eyes, this was far too strange.","It was clearly two people having an affair, and after he discovered it, only then did they hurriedly separate.","Just look, Song Lan’s pretty face was flushed red, delicate and beautiful.","He had been cuckolded!","Lu Qi’s expression was livid. He looked menacingly at Ling Han, his killing intent blazing.","Ling Han smiled faintly as he summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. The Tower hovered above his head.","He wanted a battle?","Whatever, who would be afraid of whom?","Song Lan took advantage of the opening to pick up the jade pendant. Then, a hint of pleasant surprise immediately appeared on her pretty face."]},{"number":3854,"title":"Chapter 3854: Surrounded","paragraphs":["Chapter 3854: Surrounded","Lu Qi did not dare make a move.","Even with the use of his natural Mystical Power, it was still unable to penetrate the defenses of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, what more under normal conditions.","If he forcefully made a move, the result could possibly be him asking for his own suffering.","Thus, he only looked angrily at Ling Han and thought that Ling Han was lucky to have obtained such a powerful Spirit Tool.","However, as long as he advanced into the Core Formation Tier, it would be a piece of cake for him to deal with Ling Han. Furthermore, even if Ling Han advanced into the Core Formation Tier, how could it be that the might of this Spirit Tool would also rise accordingly?","Just you wait, he would definitely not let things go like this!","Song Lan hesitated slightly, but still tossed the jade pendant over to Ling Han.","This was not only because she had to keep her word, but also partly because she had a very high opinion of Ling Han’s formation skills, and wanted to borrow them.","Two Formation Masters exploring together was naturally safer than one Formation Master exploring alone.","Ling Han picked up the jade pendant and inserted his divine sense into it. He immediately discovered that this wasn’t a spatial Spirit Tool. However, there were several messages left behind, and they weren’t left by Sun Quan.","It recorded the location of the Heaven Tier alchemist’s inheritance that Song Lan was looking for, and this jade pendant was the key to opening it.","He nodded at Song Lan, and put away the jade pendant.","In Lu Qi’s eyes, this was practically a naked display of affection.","Did they both think that he was blind?","Lu Qi’s eyes were spitting fire, while his fists were tightly clenched, and cracking sounds could be heard. Veins could also be seen popping on his forehead.","However, his reason was still firmly controlling him, and he did not make a move.","Ling Han glanced at him, revealing a pitying expression.","In this kind of situation, one could not be too rational. If it was him, he would either give up resolutely, and never pursue Song Lan in future, or rush up and fight. That was what a man","was.","However, Lu Qi did not make a move, since he knew that he was outmatched. Yet, he was unwilling to give up, so his image was naturally countless times degraded.","“Please take care of me in future,” Ling Han clasped his hands and said to Song Lan.","To Lu Qi, these words sounded like a couple making a solemn vow – I will entrust my future to you. Please take care of me. He stared fixedly at Ling Han, and felt even more puzzled. He had pursued ger for so long and been at her beck and call, yet Song Lan had always been neither cold nor indifferent towards him, but how had Ling Han managed to capture her in just a few moves?","Was it because the two of them had “skin contact”?","This b*tch!","He cursed internally. Thoughts raced through his mind, and all kinds of thoughts that he could not believe appeared in his mind.","“We’ve already plundered this place clean, let’s retreat!” Yuwen Tian also came out of the alchemy chamber, and said to Ling Han.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded, turned to Song Lan and said, “Then we’ll take our leave first.”","Song Lan lightly swept back the silky hair at the side of her neck, and said, “Of course, together.”","Ling Han had taken the jade pendant. It was not just a set of coordinates, but also the key to open the doors. How could she possibly allow Ling Han to act alone?","“Alright.” Ling Han nodded. He had never thought of taking the inheritance of that Heaven Tier alchemist for himself.","Keeping one’s word was the basic moral character of a person.","Yuwen Tian was already watching dumbfounded from the sidelines. What was going on here? Since when had Ling Han courted the great beauty Song?","This was too fast, wasn’t it!","If he had come out a little later, would Song Lan already be pregnant?","He quickly walked to Ling Han’s side, and said in a low voice, “Ling Han, Senior Brother Ling, Boss Ling, you’re too awesome, aren’t you? You won the ninth beauty in the galaxy! Hurry up and teach me how to pick up girls!”","These words were spoken very lowly, but which one of the elites in the room was not a great elite? How could they not hear this little bit of sound?","Ling Han’s expression involuntarily darkened. This guy must have done it on purpose, and his motive was to anger Lu Qi to death.","Sure enough, Lu Qi’s expression instantly became livid. It was so dark that it could drip water.","He stood there without moving, but his hands were trembling slightly. That was because his killing intent was close to being unstoppable.","“Master!” Zha Hu and Cheng Bao also walked out, all smiles. Their gains this time were quite bountiful.","But when they saw Lu Qi’s face, they instantly fell silent out of fear, because they knew that Lu Qi was furious to the extreme.","And at this moment, they were still in high spirits. That was equivalent to courting death.","Lu Qi did not say a word, and strode forwards.","He was not going to give up on Song Lan. Thus, he definitely had to keep a close eye on her, and not give Ling Han another chance to be alone with Song Lan, and the moment he advanced into the Core Formation Tier, he would immediately kill Ling Han.","Definitely.","The group had just walked out of the abode, when their expressions froze, because they had been surrounded.","At least a hundred over people blocked the entrance, but did not enter. Instead, they were looking for someone to break through the formation.","Seeing Ling Han and the others appear, a white-browed old man immediately shouted, “All","of you, come here!”","“Sure enough, someone has entered.”","“This is just right. Let them hand over what they have obtained, and save us the trouble of","going in and taking risks.”","“Yi, that woman is too beautiful!”","“She really is an exquisite beauty. If I could sleep with her for a night, I would even be willing","to live a hundred years less.”","The others also saw Ling Han and the others, and began to talk. The majority’s eyes were focused on Song Lan, their words without any reservations.","Song Lan instantly looked furious. Not only was she the ninth beauty of the galaxy, she had also come from a clan that had a Venerate Tier elite. She had been the beloved daughter of the clan since childhood, and had been doted on to the extreme. When had she ever had such crude words spoken to her face?","However, there were a considerable number of people here that were in the Core Formation Tier. If she went out, she would only be walking into a tiger’s den.","Moreover, once one’s desires exploded, who would still care if you were the heir of a Holy Land, or the descendant of a Venerate Tier elite?","Otherwise, would there still be the word ‘taking risks’?","Lu Qi humphed, and said, “Watch your mouths, and don’t seek your own suffering!” “Hey, pretty boy, who do you think you are?” A great many people turned to look at Lu Qi.","“Pei, you guys don’t even know my Master?” Cheng Bao immediately called out, “My Master","is Galaxy Network’s 19th, Lu Qi, Lord Lu!”","19th on the Galaxy Network!","This title was quite destructive. Those people on the other side all fell into deep thought.","However, it wasn’t long before an old man spoke up, and said, “To say nothing of the 19th place, even the first place is only Cauldron Forging Tier. There is a hierarchy in martial arts, and in front of us, the Core Formation Tiers, how could you be qualified to act arrogant?” “Come out, hand over what you have obtained, and we can let you leave.”","“Hehe, but this woman has to stay!”","Someone pointed at Song Lan and said, their eyes burning, unable to conceal their desire.","This woman was really too beautiful, causing one’s heart to throb wildly, and unable to stop their desire from burning.","Lu Qi humphed, “We are all disciples of the Nine Suns Holy Land, so could it be that you people dare to trifle with us?”","The surroundings instantly fell silent again.","The Nine Suns Holy Land was the strongest force in this galaxy, and any one of them would","have to submit to them. To say nothing of the fact that there were only Core Formation Tier- level forces here, even if Venerate Tier elites came, they would have to consider the consequences of offending the Nine Suns Holy Land.","“Alright, you guys come out. We won’t make things difficult for you,” an elder said with a","smile."]},{"number":3855,"title":"Chapter 3855: Count to ten","paragraphs":["Chapter 3855: Count to ten","Ling Han and the others naturally didn’t believe it.","By the looks of it, he wanted to lure them out, and once they left, their lives would no longer be under their own control.","Cultivators were meant to control their own destiny, so how could they possibly entrust their lives to the kindness of others?","“You’re not coming out?” Outside, a person smirked coldly, “Our Formation Master is about to break through the formations here. You guys are completely like turtles in a jar. Furthermore, there is also a shielding Spirit Tool set up around here. It is impossible for you guys to contact the Galaxy Network or Holy Land, so don’t even think that anyone would come to save you guys.”","Ling Han and the others hurriedly opened the connection device. As expected, whether it was the Galaxy Network or the Holy Land Network, they were both unable to connect.","Instantly, even Lu Qi’s expression changed drastically.","Now, if these people killed them to keep the secret, they would really die here for nothing. But how could these people dare?","There was no concealing the truth. Once the news leaked out, they would all have to bear the fury of the Nine Suns Holy Land. How could a mere Core Formation Tier force withstand that?","However, the words “Core Formation Tier” were the true reason why these people dared to take risks.","-Because this was the abode of a Spirit Transformation True Lord, the secret technique that he had inherited was not taken seriously by Ling Han, Lu Qi and the others, but for Core Formation Tiers, just how valuable was it?","If their obtained it, perhaps he would be able to leap up to become a True Self Tier or even in fact become a Spirit Transformation Tier force.","Every major tier in martial arts was a fundamental change. Thus, the treasure trove of a Spirit Transformation True Lord was an irresistible temptation to a Core Formation Tier force.","Worse come to worst, after obtaining the secret technique, they could flee. No matter how far the reach of the Nine Suns Holy Land was, they couldn’t possibly touch every corner of the universe.","“Master, what should we do?” Cheng Bao and Zha Hu couldn’t help but ask.","The situation now was very dire.","Lu Qi did not speak. He had a rare treasure on him, which was enough to allow him to withstand the attacks of a Core Formation Tier elite without dying. However, that could only protect him alone, so he was naturally hesitant about how he could bring Song Lan out with him. As for Cheng Bao and Zha Hu, he did consider them at all.","He could just find a few more servants in the future.","However, he was also a little pleased. When these people attacked the formation, Ling Han would definitely be killed as well. Merely imagining that scene made him feel overwhelmed and slightly excited.","“You guys, whoever comes out to surrender first can be spared from death.” On the other side, someone laughed loudly, “Time is limited. I will only count to ten, so hurry up and seize the opportunity.”","“One!”","“Two!”","Song Lan also frowned slightly. She came from an extraordinary background, so she naturally had a life-saving Spirit Tool as well. However, Chang Qing Qing was her close friend, and she had also accompanied her to many ancient sites. If she were to escape alone, there would be a regret in her heart that she could not overcome.","“Lan Lan, you can break out of the siege on your own.” Chang Qingqing saw through her hesitation, “As long as you can break out of the siege, you can ask for help from the Holy Land. These people would naturally have reservations, and their only thought would be to flee for their lives.”","“That’s right,” Lu Qi hurriedly replied from the sidelines. Judging by Chang Qingqing’s confident tone, it was clear that Song Lan was capable of protecting himself. This caused her to feel much more at ease. In fact, he even felt a strong sense of satisfaction.","He and Song Lan were alive, while Ling Han was dead. This was the best result. “Celestial maiden Song, the two of us will break out of the siege together. That way, the success rate would be slightly higher,” Lu Qi said, as he glanced very obscurely at Ling Han, his expression filled with pride.","This was saying to Ling Han, “We’re leaving, just wait for your death.”","“Master!” Cheng Bao and Zha Hu were both shocked. Master was going to escape on his own, then what were they going to do?","“Don’t worry. Once Fairy Song and I escape, we’ll immediately ask the Holy Land for help. You two will definitely be fine.” Although Lu Qi didn’t care about the life or death of his two subordinates, he still had to put on an act and comfort Cheng Bao and Zha Hu.","Cheng Bao and Zha Hu both looked terrible. Once Lu Qi and Song Lan escaped, those people outside would definitely launch a mad offensive, tearing them into pieces.","They were trembling all over, completely at a loss.","Ling Han chuckled, and said, “There’s no need to act like we are going to die. Isn’t it just a few Core Formation Tiers?”","Lu Qi and Song Lan were both startled. Wasn’t it just a few Core Formation Tier cultivators?","‘How boastful of you. Don’t you know that the gap of a major tier means a complete one- sided suppression?’","Previously, when Lu Qi had cast his natural Mystical Power, it was merely comparable to the early stage of the Core Formation Tier, and almost broke through the defenses of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. What more when there were so many Core Formation Tier elites here, there should be quite a few that had reached the middle stage, late stage, or even the consummate level.","‘How are you going to withstand this?’","He actually said, “Isn’t it just a few Core Formation Tier cultivators?” What the heck.","“It’s already come to this, so what’s the point of boasting?” Song Lan frowned slightly, extremely displeased.","If it wasn’t for the fact that the jade pendant was still in Ling Han’s hands, she wouldn’t have bothered to care about Ling Han’s life or death. He actually dared to hold her slender hand!","Ling Han ignored her. He decided to use the Heavenly Dao Flames.","Of course, it was not because he had been entranced by Song Lan, and wanted to show off, but rather because Wu Qiyuan, Yuwen Tian and the others were all here.","Would this eventually be discovered by the Holy Land of Metal Element?","Ling Han didn’t pay too much attention to it. Even if it was discovered, how could it be that they could chase him all the way to the Nine Suns Holy Land to apprehend him? Moreover, it wasn’t only the Black Moon Planet that had Heavenly Dao Flames, so how could it be that","Ling Han couldn’t get it elsewhere?","He strode out.","“Ten!” At this moment, the person on the other side also slowly counted to ten. He watched as Ling Han slowly walked out of the formation, and a smile appeared at the corners of his lips, as he said, “Very good, very good. Finally, there is a smart person.”","Ling Han took a few more steps. He stopped, and broke into a grin, “Don’t say that I didn’t give you guys a chance. Retreat immediately, and I can spare your damn lives.”","Er!","When the people outside heard this, their expressions instantly varied.","Some were furious, while others smirked coldly. However, none of them took Ling Han’s","threat seriously.","This was natural. What right did a mere Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator have to threaten a Core Formation Tier cultivator?","“I’ll count to ten. If you still don’t retreat, I’m going to unleash a powerful attack,” Ling Han said slowly. “One, two, three...”","The man who had counted earlier flew into a thunderous rage. He himself was strong, and that was why he could play a game of cat and mouse. How could a mere Cauldron Forging Tier","like you dare to be so arrogant?","“You’re seeking death!” he said balefully.","He secretly decided that the moment Ling Han came out of the formation, he would","immediately rush up and directly blast Ling Han apart. He would show the others the consequences of a mere Cauldron Forging Tier provoking a Core Formation Tier cultivator.","“Ten!”","Ling Han suddenly stopped, and his eyes swept over the surroundings. Not a single person","stepped back.","This was a very obvious result. If there was anyone who was afraid and retreated, that would be an inconceivable thing.","Ling Han continued to walk forward at a very slow pace.","“Hurry up and break the formation!” the humiliated Core Formation Tier cultivator shouted","at the Formation Master who was breaking the formation. He looked like he wanted nothing more than to immediately charge into the formation and drag Ling Han out.","One was walking out, while the other was breaking into the formation. Thus, the two sides","soon met.","“Die!” The Core Formation Tier elite charged over."]},{"number":3856,"title":"Chapter 3856: Burned to nothing","paragraphs":["Chapter 3856: Burned to nothing","“Sigh!” Ling Han shook his head. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was unleashed, and instantly, a flame gushed out like a tsunami, rolling towards him.","This speed was too fast. In an instant, the area within a few kilometers of them was","completely enveloped in a sea of flames.","“Ah-“Tragic cries rang out in all directions, but all of them had just cried out, when they suddenly stopped.","The Heavenly Dao Flames were too domineering, and could instantly burn a Core Formation Tier cultivator to death.","This was the case even for Core Formation Tier elites, what more for Cauldron Forging Tiers and Foundation Building Tiers.","As the fiery flames surged past, nothing could not be burned, and nothing could not be destroyed.","In just an instant, the whole world had become peaceful and quiet.","Ling Han turned around, only to see that Song Lan, Lu Qi, Wu Qiyuan and the others were all staring at him in dumbfounded shock. It was as if he weren’t a person, but rather a monster. “Why are you guys looking at me like that?” he asked with a faint smile.","Don’t you f****** know what you have done?","A whole bunch of Core Formation Tier cultivators were burned to death by your flames, and not even a single bone was left behind. How could they not be shocked?","If you were at the True Self Tier or a Spirit Transformation True Lord, then so be it. Killing even more Core Formation Tier cultivators wouldn’t be too shocking, but the problem here was that you are a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator.","Monster, he was definitely a monster.","Song Lan looked meaningfully at Ling Han. This person was really hiding his abilities. She had completely misjudged him.","With how terrifying those flames were, perhaps even True Self Tier elites or Spiritual Transformation Tier elites wouldn’t be able to rival them. Moreover, was this all of Ling Han’s trump cards?","Meanwhile, Lu Qi’s forehead was covered with cold sweat. If Ling Han had spat that flame at him, he would have long since turned into ashes, right?","19th on the Galaxy Network, and he was actually going to die soundlessly?","So what if he had cultivated to the Core Formation Tier? You see, so many Core Formation Tier cultivators had died without even being able to release their screams, so what could he do?","Unless... he launched a sneak attack on Ling Han, so that Ling Han wouldn’t even have the chance to unleash that world-destroying fire.","All of a sudden, many thoughts streaked through Lu Qi’s mind, and his feet moved slightly, unobtrusively turning himself, Song Lan and Ling Han into a straight line. Furthermore, if Ling Han suddenly made a move, Song Lan would be the one to bear the brunt of it. He did not believe that Ling Han would make a move on Song Lan.","There was no need to think about this, and this was a natural reaction.","“Thank you,” Song Lan said solemnly to Ling Han. Otherwise, she could have broken out of","the siege, but Chang Qingqing could possibly be torn to shreds by those Core Formation Tiers.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “Let’s leave this place first.”","“All right.”","Everyone exited the formation area, then rode their Tools and headed towards the Transfer Formation.","On the way, everyone was still immersed in the shocking scene of how Ling Han had destroyed all Core Formation Tiers with a single fire, and could not come back to their senses for a long time.","Right until they arrived at the Transfer Formation, did they finally regain their senses. After paying the Dao Stones, they entered the Transfer Formation, and instantly returned to the Nine Suns Planet.","Now that they had set foot on the land of the Nine Suns Holy Land, they were really safe. What force here would dare to trifle with the disciples of the Nine Suns Holy Land?","It wasn’t long before they returned to the Holy Land.","“Ling Han, when can we set out?” Song Lan asked.","“Anytime,” Ling Han replied nonchalantly.","These words that came out of nowhere caused everyone to feel puzzled. However, the expressions of Wu Qiyuan, Yuwen Tian and the others were all “Oh, so you guys have already hooked up”, and Lu Qi’s expression was livid. This adulterous couple had actually reached some kind of agreement behind his back, which made him so furious that he wanted to commit murder.","However, he didn’t say a word, because he was afraid of Ling Han’s terrifying flames. “All right.” Song Lan nodded, “Then I will inform you when the time comes.”","“All right.”","After Song Lan and Chang Qingqing left, they naturally had to discuss this matter as well.","Meanwhile, Ling Han shared alchemical pills with Yuwen Tian and the others. However, Ling Han was more concerned about pill recipes than alchemical pills. Yuwen Tian and the others found a few, and stuffed them all into Ling Han’s hands. However, they were mostly Four Star pill recipes, and Ling Han was currently unable to concoct them.","He would just leave it for now.","Ling Han returned to meet with the empress and the others. He had not gained much from this trip. Instead, he had wasted a Heavenly Dao Flame. However, it had also proven the friendship between Wu Qiyuan, Huang Lingyun and the others, which was quite a","considerable gain.","The peaceful days had only passed for two days, when Song Lan sent a message to Ling Han, asking if he could set out tomorrow.","Ling Han naturally had no objections, so he agreed.","This time, only three people went. Ling Han, Song Lan, and Chang Qingqing went with Ling","Han.","They took the Transfer Formation, and after traveling through a considerable number of galaxies, they arrived on a planet of wilderness.","There were no large-scale forces here, and wild beasts rampaged. In fact, there was no shortage of Venerate Tier-level elites among them. Those wild beasts were too terrifying, so it was not suitable to settle down here at all.","However, precisely because there were many fierce beasts, there were a great many people hunting here. That was because the meat, skin, bones, fur, and internal organs of fierce beasts were all very useful, and could be sold for a very high price. If one could obtain a Demon Core, it was even more likely to be priceless.","A Heaven Tier alchemist actually set up his home here?","Don’t say, this planet was rich in alchemical pills, and the blood, bones, and Demon Cores of wild beasts could also be used to concoct alchemical pills. Thus, for alchemists, the environment here was actually very good.","The three of them followed the coordinates in the jade pendant and crossed mountains and ridges, passing through the territory of a great many fierce beasts. In fact, they even alerted a great beast on the level of Sect Master, forcing Ling Han to summon the Heavenly Dao Flames and burn it to death.","If he could kill a Sect Master Tier-level beast, his gains would definitely be astonishing. Merely its blood and flesh was a super treasure. However, the Heavenly DaoFlames was too domineering, directly burning that great beast to the point that not even a single bone was","left.","This was equivalent to wasting a chance to use the Heavenly Dao Flames.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel gloomy. Meanwhile, Song Lan wore an apologetic expression.","This woman couldn’t have done it on purpose, right?","Previously, they had actually been very careful. Logically speaking, they should not have alerted that great beast, but it just so happened that they had still alerted it. Could it be that this little girl was deliberately expending his Heavenly Dao Flames? With Song Lan’s personality, she was definitely unwilling to be restrained by Ling Han, and Ling Han, who possessed the Heavenly Dao Flames, had the ability to threaten her.","Thus, it was reasonable to use fierce beasts to expend the Heavenly Dao Flames. Hiss, he really could not underestimate this woman. Even though she was as beautiful as a fairy, she was definitely not just a pretty face. Her intelligence was definitely outstanding. Subsequently, Ling Han became even more careful, not giving Song Lan another chance to stimulate the wild beasts.","Of course, it was also possible that it had really been an accident previously, and Song Lan had not planned to deliberately exhaust Ling Han’s trump card.","After spending a whole nine days, they finally arrived at their destination.","It was not that the distance was too far, but rather that the whole journey was too dangerous. Flying on a Tool was a suicidal action. There were a great many Core Formation Tier-level, True Self Tier-level and even stronger fierce beasts in the skies, so they could only walk on the ground obediently. If they encountered powerful Demonic Beasts, they even had to take a different path, so how could they possibly speed up?","They studied the surroundings for quite a while, and only then did they find the entrance to","the abode. Using the jade pendant, they opened the doors.","A Heaven Tier alchemist’s treasure appeared in front of them."]},{"number":3857,"title":"Chapter 3857: Ascending Dragon Gathering","paragraphs":["Chapter 3857: Ascending Dragon Gathering","Ling Han and the others entered the abode and searched for a while, but they were all disappointed.","All the treasures had been taken by Sun Quan?","No, the pill recipe that Sun Quan had discovered and the alchemical pill that he had taken were only a part of it, and was the less valuable part of it at that. The truly valuable pill recipes and alchemical pills were still here. However, this was protected by a supreme formation, and could not be entered at all.","Even when Ling Han and Chang Qingqing teamed up, they were still unsuccessful. At most, they could only form a formation that could deal with Core Formation Tier, but if this was only the level of Core Formation Tier, so how could this possibly block Sun Quan? He was a Spirit Transformation True Lord.","Thus, this formation was at least Sect Master-level, or even Venerate Tier-level.","They were naturally at a loss of what to do now.","What could they do?","The three of them exchanged looks, then shook their heads. They could not do anything at all.","Song Lan was extremely disappointed. In fact, she even felt a sense of misery.","“Lan Lan, don’t worry. There must be another way,” Chang Qingqing consoled.","Song Lan smiled bitterly, and said, “The pill recipe for the Tenth Leaf Revival Pill has long since been lost. In the past, only Alchemist Qinghe could concoct this pill. However, he didn’t have a successor, so I had initially thought that Sun Quan would be able to obtain it. Unexpectedly, when I traced it back here, I was still disappointed.”","“What do you want the Tenth Leaf Revival Pill for?” Ling Han asked.","Song Lan paused slightly, then said, “When my great-grandfather was cultivating, he went mad, and can only be saved by the Tenth Leaf Revival Pill.”","Oh, so that was how it was.","Ling Han chuckled, “Then when I reach the level of Sect Master, I’ll break through the formation here and obtain the pill recipe. I’ll help you concoct the alchemical pill.”","He said these words very casually, as if he was just talking about an incredibly simple matter.","Song Lan instinctively wanted to retort, but on second thought, Ling Han was indeed qualified to do so.","– Being able to concoct the Cauldron Heart Pill meant that Ling Han’s natural talent in alchemy was astonishing.","-And now, he had also displayed his outstanding natural talent in formations. He was already a master of both alchemy and formations.","And being able to enter into the Holy Land, there was naturally no need to doubt his natural talent in cultivation.","The question was, how long would Ling Han need to advance to the level of Sect Master? Ten years, a hundred years, a thousand years?","Could Song Lan afford to wait? Could that Venerate Tier elite from the Song Clan afford to wait?","“Then I’ll thank you in advance.” Song Lan nodded. Merely for Ling Han’s good intentions, she still had to thank him.","“When we meet in the future, remember to call me good brother,” Ling Han said seriously. Shua, what greeted him was a gust of wind from Song Lan’s palm.","Ling Han leaped over, dodging the palm strike. He was only joking, and Song Lan also knew that, so this palm strike did not have much destructive power.","“Let’s go back.”","They returned to the Nine Suns Holy Land, and Lu Qi obviously found out that the three of them had gone out together. It was rumored that he had flown into a thunderous rage, and destroyed his own house.","Aside from cultivating, Ling Han also started to wander around the Holy Land.","Where exactly had the Nine Suns Saint hidden the secret technique inheritance?","“Old Black, it’s up to you now,” Ling Han said to the large black dog.","The large black dog was instantly proud, “What is it? You still have to depend on your Grandpa Dog, right?”","“Yes, I need your dog’s nose,” Ling Han said with a smile. “Let’s see if we can find something that the Nine Suns Saint used years ago. I’ll let you smell it, and then dig out even the Nine Suns Saint’s underpants.”","“Woof, Grandpa Dog will fight you to the death!”","However, no matter how hard they searched, they couldn’t find a single trace.","“We have to change our way of thinking. In these close to 100 million years, all the places that could be searched should have been flipped over a few times, yet not a single person has succeeded. Perhaps, this inheritance is not in the Nine Suns Holy Land,” Ling Han deduced.","“Then how are we supposed to find it?” The large black dog shook his head, “Just how big is the Nine Suns Planet? To carefully turn over every inch of it, it would be impossible without a few thousand or tens of thousands of years.”","“So, within the Nine Suns Holy Land, there should be clues that point to the secret technique inheritance, and not the inheritance itself hidden here. Let’s use this line of thought to look for it.”","“All right.”","The man and dog began to search. Not only them, but Lin Luo, Zhou Heng and the others also joined the search team. With the Holy Land’s resources nurturing them, everyone soon broke through to the Foundation Building Tier and became Cauldron Forging Tiers. -To these prodigies, the barrier into Cauldron Forging Tier was really nothing. However, they had not searched for a few days, when a big piece of news came. The Ascending Dragon Gathering of the North Heavenly Realm was about to begin. The entire universe was divided into four super-large regions, which were respectively the East Heaven Realm, West Heavenly Realm, South Heavenly Realm and North Heavenly Realm. Just how big was a Heavenly Realm? Even if one was using Transfer Formations to roam a circle, the time needed would number in dozens of years, which showed just how expansive a Heavenly Realm was.","The Ascending Dragon Gathering was a super-large event of the North Heavenly Realm. Anyone below the True Self Tier could attend. They would be able to enter into a super-large","Mystery Realm, where they could obtain great fortune.","Thus, those who had reached the Foundation Building Tier, the Cauldron Forging Tier, or the Core Formation Tier would try their best to get a ticket to enter.","For example, if Ling Han was currently in the Cauldron Forging Tier, he would be able to capture celestial clouds in the Mystery Realm and nurture them in the Celestial Cauldron. He would then be able to cultivate a Mystical Power, and turn the celestial clouds into an indestructible divine light.","In future, when he broke through to the Core Formation Tier, the celestial clouds could also be fused into the Celestial Core, increasing the quality of the Celestial Core.","And the Mystery Realm also had various opportunities that could speed up the cultivation of cultivators.","In short, this was a chance for a hidden dragon to rise to the heavens, and that was why it was called the Ascending Dragon Gathering.","Ling Han’s heart naturally throbbed wildly. He was sure that he would definitely be able to obtain a spot.","Sure enough, it wasn’t long before the Holy Land announced this. However, Ling Han was overthinking things. Not only did he have a spot, but everyone else did. None of them had","failed.","As a Holy Land, they naturally had enough spots.","Thus, everyone only needed to make some preparations. They would set out in a month’s time, heading towards the Great Forest Planet.","Only now did Ling Han find out why the Holy Land didn’t hold any ranking competition in advance. That was because there was no need. Everyone could go to the Ascending Dragon Gathering, so what was the point of fighting for nothing?","Everyone was very excited. This was a chance for a carp to leap over the Dragon’s Gate. As long as they obtained a great opportunity in the Mystery Realm, it was no daydream to achieve a great breakthrough in cultivation level. Their abilities would also be greatly improved in a battle of equal cultivation levels.","A hidden dragon ascended to the heavens, and from now onwards, this dragon would look proudly down on the heaven and earth.","The empress, Lin Luo, and the others were also filled with wild ambition. The gap between them and Ling Han was very wide, and they hoped that they could use this opportunity to close the gap between them. They couldn’t always have Ling Han charge ahead of them, bringing them great fortune.","This was especially the case for Lin Luo, Zhou Heng, and the others. Which of them wasn’t a big shot of the Genesis World? How proud and arrogant were they?","A month later, everyone set out, heading towards Great Forest Planet. This trip was led by a Venerate Tier elite, and it was precisely the Nine Mountains Venerate. In","this world where Saints almost never appeared, Venerate Tier elites could be considered the strongest battle prowess. With the Nine Mountains Venerate leading the team, what blind fool would dare to attack?","However, the Nine Mountains Venerate did not have a very high status in everyone’s hearts. He actually tricked juniors like them into buying him foor and drink. Though they could not","say anything in public, there would definitely be some discussions in private.","With how powerful the Nine Mountains Venerate was, how could he not know?","Thus, his expression was always livid.","“Achoo!” Amidst the Nine Suns Holy Land, a white cat sneezed. “Yi, which b@stard is cursing","me?”"]},{"number":3858,"title":"Chapter 3858: White Lotus Holy Land","paragraphs":["Chapter 3858: White Lotus Holy Land","Even if there were Transfer Formations along the way, no one could use them continuously without pause. Thus, they spent a total of seventeen days before finally arriving at the Great Forest Planet.","The Great Forest Planet was a super large planet. There had once been an Ancestral King, and he was respectfully known as the White Lotus Holy Emperor.","This was one of the few female Ancestral Kings who had defeated tens of thousands of prodigies all those years ago. In the end, she had ascended to the throne, and could be considered a hero among women.","It was said that the Mystery Realm here was created by the White Lotus Holy Emperor.","A long time ago, the entrance to this Mystery Realm was not fixed. It could be on some planet, or it could be in the depths of the universe, but the White Lotus Holy Emperor had used a great technique to eternally fix this entrance on the Great Forest Planet.","The Ascending Dragon Gathering would be held once every million years; why did it have to take so long?","It was very simple. This large Mystery Realm would only appear once every million years. Merely from this, it was clear how important this Mystery Realm was.","After arriving at the Great Forest Planet, the Nine Mountains Venerate didn’t bring them to the ancestral grounds of the White Lotus Holy Emperor. Instead, he found a random place to settle down. In any case, it wouldn’t be too late for them to rush over after the Ascending Dragon Gathering began.","In this great Mystery Realm, it had never been the case that one would be able to obtain great fortune by arriving first.","The so-called great opportunity was a coincidence. There was no such thing as first come, first served.","There were more than 400 people in their group, and there were always some people with out-of-character personalities who could not bear the loneliness. Since they were free now, they went out to roam around.","However, this place was now the center of entire North Heavenly Realm. Countless forces had already arrived, or were in the process of catching up to them. The chances of encountering other forces while strolling around outside was astonishingly high. Sometimes, it was inevitable that conflicts would arise.","Some were minor conflicts, while some were quite big. In fact, they had even gotten into a group fight.","Although the Nine Suns Holy Land was well-known in the universe, it didn’t necessarily have the upper hand in this kind of conflict.","The reason was very simple. There was no Core Formation Tier elite.","There would only be enrollment every 10,000 years, and these were the two levels of the Cauldron Forging Tier and the Foundation Building Tier. In a mere year, not a single person had advanced into the Core Formation Tier. How could this compare to other forces?","They only had to send out a Core Formation Tier cultivator, and it would be enough to make the Nine Suns Holy Land’s party fall.","Thus, after a few battles, the youngsters of Nine Suns Holy Land also learned to keep a low profile, and for the moment, it was best not to cause any more trouble.","It was also very lively on the Galaxy Network. Occasionally, there would be people saying that some elite or prodigy had arrived.","Unfortunately, Origin, Myriad Dao, Heaven Crushing, and Number One in the Galaxy were all too mysterious. No one knew what their true identities were, and which Heavenly Realm they belonged to. Thus, it was unknown whether they would be participating in this gathering.","For example, Lu Qi was ranked 19th in Cauldron Forging Tier on the Galaxy Network. His arrival naturally shocked the Galaxy Network. In truth, as long as one could enter into the top 1000, they would be a well-known figure, and would be pursued wherever they went.","Ling Han’s “Ling Han” account had only reached the 100,000s, so it naturally belonged to an unknown category. However, “The Number One in the Galaxy” had already reached the 900s. Every day, it would advance four to five places, and it would take a long time for it to enter the top 100.","As a whole, the strength of the North Heavenly Realm was relatively weak.","Because among the top ten Cauldron Forging Tiers of the Galaxy Network, there was not a single one from the North Heavenly Realm – the highest ranking in the North Heavenly Realm was only 12th in fact. Thus, Lu Qi’s 19th place was naturally awesome, and could even be ranked in the top five in the North Heavenly Realm.","It was not just the Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators. It was the same for Foundation Building cultivators, and Core Formation Tier cultivators.","Although there wouldn’t be any level battles after Sect Master-level, it was said that the number of elites at the Minor Advanced Tier and fourth pinnacle level of the North Heavenly Realm were also the least. Moreover, all of this was caused by a great battle ten million years ago, which seriously affected the fortune of the Heavenly Realm. Thus, it was very difficult for the most top-notch characters to emerge from this place.","Ling Han wanted to find out more about this part of history, yet he discovered that there was a huge blank in history. He actually couldn’t find any information on the Galaxy Network. He only knew that a huge battle had broken out, but he had no idea who exactly was fighting with whom, or what level of elite was fighting.","To be able to cause the fortune of a Heavenly Realm to fall, could it be that it was Ancestral Kings that were fighting?","However, who didn’t know that only one Ancestral King could appear in each era?","-Hold on.","Ling Han suddenly recalled that Brother Monkey had once said that the Ancestral King of his bloodline had gone to some Mystery Realm at the edge of the universe to search for a way to achieve immortality. He had not returned even now, but it was very possible that he was still","alive.","Thus, it was possible that two Ancestral Kings would coexist in this world.","The Ancestral King had gathered the fortune of heaven and earth, and was invincible in this world. The battle between two great Ancestral Kings had shattered the fortune of a Heavenly Realm. This was something that was possible.","Forget it. There was no point in guessing randomly here.","Ling Han placed his focus on the Mystery Realm.","This Mystery Realm was nameless, but because it was forcibly fixed by the White Lotus Holy Emperor, every million years, it could allow the world to obtain good fortune. Thus, to commemorate this Ancestral King, this great Mystery Realm was called the White Lotus","Mystery Realm.","In truth, this Mystery Realm was incredibly colossal, and the environment inside was also extremely complicated.","There were Celestial medicines that could increase one’s cultivation level there, as well as celestial clouds that others would drool over. There were also transcendent minerals that could allow the Celestial Core to evolve the Celestial Cauldron had the difference between bronze, silver and gold, and Celestial Cores naturally had them as well. Some of the active minerals could turn a Copper Core into Silver Core, Silver Core into Golden Core, and allow cultivators to undergo a qualitative change.","Thus, this was a chance for a hidden dragon to rise to the heavens.","It was said that the White Lotus Mystery Realm also had an ultimate good fortune. It was personally said by the White Lotus Holy Emperor, but no one had ever obtained it.","No one knew what that good fortune was, but to be described by the word ‘ultimate’ by an Ancestral King was enough proof of how nature-defying this good fortune was.","Another ten days later, the Ascending Dragon Gathering began.","A blazing light descended from the skies, and then a doorway of light appeared out of thin air. That was linked with another world.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Instantly, countless people flew out on their divine tools, coming out from all corners, heading towards that doorway of light.","The doorway of light was over 500 meters tall and 300 meters wide. It was truly magnificent.","It was clear how powerful the Holy Emperor was.","A great many people directly passed through the doorway of light, but there were also a great many that crashed head-first into it, and then fell straight down.","Why? Some people’s cultivation levels were inconsistent with the requirements.","A True Self Tier cultivator wanted to enter? No way.","Some were not qualified. If they wanted to pass through the stargate, they would first have to","obtain a token issued by the Lian Clan – the Lian Clan was a descendant of the White Lotus","Holy Emperor.","“Go on,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said.","Everyone had long since been unable to restrain themselves. Immediately, they leaped up, and steered the precious tool towards the doorway of light.","Weng!","They all had the tokens of the Lian Clan, and this was something that the Nine Mountains Venerate had just given them. Thus, they naturally passed through the doorway of light, and felt as if they had passed through a layer of mud. Their speed instantly slowed, and the scenery in front of their eyes was also swaying. When they recovered their speed, they had already appeared in a new world.","The surroundings were boundless, and there were rocks everywhere.","Yi, where were the others?","Ling Han looked left and right. He had clearly entered with the empress and Hu Niu, so why","was he the only one left?"]},{"number":3859,"title":"Chapter 3859: Desolate plains","paragraphs":["Chapter 3859: Desolate plains","Ling Han turned on the connection device. Of course, it was Galaxy Network’s. After leaving the galaxy governed by Nine Suns Holy Land, the holy land’s network naturally couldn’t be connected.","However, in this Mystery Realm, the Galaxy Network connection device was also useless.","Looks like he could only return to the most primitive method of communication – face meeting.","face-to-","“This is a desolate plain, followed by a mountain of flames, followed by a desert, followed by an ice valley, and lastly, the Weapon Mountains. This is the first stage.”","Information about the White Lotus Mystery Realm flashed through Ling Han’s mind, but in truth, there was not much information about this Mystery Realm.","-Many great sects and clans regarded this as a secret, so how could it possibly be passed on to outsiders?","And in the case of the Nine Suns Holy Land, because they would only open their doors every 10,000 years, this led to the fact that when the Ascending Dragon Gathering began, there were a great many times when they did not have disciples that could participate – they would either have died, or broken through to the True Self Tier.","Thus, the authorities of the Holy Land did not have much information on this Mystery Realm. Ling Han could only slowly explore with the limited information.","If he wanted to reunite with the empress and the others, he would probably have to pass this first stage, but as for what the second stage was, Ling Han still didn’t know, because in history, there were very few people that could pass the first stage. It would be good enough if even one in a hundred could complete it.","Furthermore, this Mystery Realm did not only contain opportunities, but also dangers.","However, didn’t they have the tokens of the Lian Clan on them?","If he really encountered an irresolvable danger, he only had to crush the token, and he would be immediately teleported out of the Mystery Realm.","However, he only had one chance. Once he left, it would be impossible for him to come back in. Otherwise, he would have to wait another million years.","That was a million years, and even Saints could only live for so long. Who could afford to wait that long?","And precisely because of this, every time the White Lotus Mystery Realm opened, there would always be a great many people who wanted to take a gamble, and for a long time, did not crush their tokens, and lost their lives here.","Ling Han thought to himself as he continued to advance. This was an endless desolate plain. The ground was covered with uneven rocks, and weeds grew between the rocks, showing a strong vitality.","Flying on a Tool could not be done here, and there was a powerful gravity field pressing down on them. Furthermore, it was not just the problem of being unable to fly here. Even travelling was slightly difficult. Under the pressure of the powerful gravity field, one would be out of breath without walking very far.","But this was not the only problem that had to be considered, because there were still a great many traps here.","Some rocks weren’t as sturdy as they looked. Instead, they would shatter with a single stomp, and there was a deep hole beneath them.","Flying on a Tool could not be done here, so if one really stepped into a trap, if he could not escape at the first instant, he would have to use his token to save his life. That was because if he fell to the bottom, he would basically be crushed into pieces. Furthermore, even if he did not die from the fall, with how heavy the gravity field here was, it would be impossible for him to climb out.","Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, wanting to see if the Imperial Weapon could dispel the gravity fields.","However, what disappointed him was the fact that even the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower could do nothing about it.","This wasn’t because the Origin Gold was weak, but rather because the level of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was far too low.","Sigh, he had brought shame to the Origin Gold.","Ling Han pulled himself together. He also had to be careful. He didn’t want to return with his tail between his legs before he had even completed the first area of the first stage.","He strode forward, one step after another, steady and powerful.","‘Hmm?’","He placed a foot down, but the rock beneath his foot was soft and he did not feel any force exerted. Immediately, it shattered.","Ling Han hurriedly channelled the Imminent Skyline, and took another step at an incredibly fast pace, successfully stepping on another rock.","He turned around and saw that the rock from before had completely disappeared. In its place was a pit that was so deep that the bottom could not be seen.","As an extremely curious person, Ling Han didn’t leave immediately. Instead, he activated his eye technique and looked into the pit.","It was really deep. Even with Ling Han’s eye technique, he couldn’t see the bottom. If he fell, it would definitely be terrible.","Ling Han sighed, and continued onwards.","On the way, he encountered a great many such traps, but they were all successfully resolved by him. Unknowingly, the sky had darkened.","Ling Han did not continue his journey. He had to maintain abundant energy. Otherwise, if he worked day and night, his spirit would definitely not be able to bear it. Then, it would not be","worth it.","He then sat down in a cross-legged position on a large rock, channelling the Ancient Sun Scroll, absorbing the weak power of heaven and earth in the surroundings to recover the power that he had expended during the day.","This effect was very poor, but he did not battle during daytime, so his mystical power was limited in expenditure. After more than an hour, his mystical power had completely","recovered.","Ling Han took out the vicious beast meat he had hunted earlier, and started a fire to barbeque. Not long after, a fragrant smell wafted in all directions.","This was a Cauldron Forging Tier-level fierce beast, and its meat contained astonishing energy. Not only could it rapidly replenish physical power, it was also greatly nutritious for the body. After ingesting it for a long time, one’s physique would definitely become even tougher — just look at Wu Qiyuan, who knew just how great the effects of eating fierce beast meat from a young age would be on the body.","However, after a while, Ling Han revealed a stern expression, because he could sense that there was a life aura approaching him.","Was it a competitor that had also entered into this space?","Ling Han was on his guard, but he wasn’t overly nervous, because he was basically invincible in the Cauldron Forging Tier, and if he encountered a Core Formation Tier, he also had the Heavenly Dao Flames, which he could use as a deterrent-he still had five chances to use it.","In a short while, a round creature popped out.","This thing looked a little like a bear, but its body was covered with sharp spikes, and every spike was exuding a cold light.","Ling Han shuddered upon seeing this. This was a ferocious beast, and he could see this from its eyes and from the aura that it exuded. It was filled with ferocity and viciousness.","However, because this guy’s figure was too round, it was very difficult to connect it with a","fierce beast.","This fierce beast did not stop, but rather rushed over at the first instant, launching an attack at","Ling Han.","Good lord, even a small beast in the Foundation Building Tier was so arrogant?","Against fierce beasts, there was naturally no need to be reserved. Ling Han merely shot out a murderous aura attack, and that fierce beast was scared to death, falling head first.","He wondered how this ferocious beast would taste like.","Ling Han mumbled internally. As a glutton, his first thought was naturally to eat.","However, before he could finish his thought, he frowned, because he could sense even more","auras approaching him.","One, two, three, and at least a few hundred round things appeared.","F***, had he poked a hornet’s nest? There were so many fierce beasts, but why hadn’t he seen","a single one in the day?","Had they all been seduced by the aroma of the meat?","Ling Han stood up. The wild beasts here were not only Foundation Building Tier-level, but also Cauldron Forging Tier-level, and there were quite a number of them. Instantly, a few dozen fierce beasts rushed over at the same time. When they had rushed close enough, these fierce beasts all curled up, and like a ball, crashed towards Ling Han. These wild beasts had spikes all over their bodies, which turned into a ball that smashed over.","The destructive power was quite shocking.","Ling Han still shot out a barrage of murderous aura. Peng, peng, peng! Instantly, half of the wild beasts fell directly from midair. Their minds were shattered, and they instantly died on the spot, but half of the wild beasts still charged over."]},{"number":3860,"title":"Chapter 3860: Bragging","paragraphs":["Chapter 3860: Bragging","About twenty over fierce beasts crashed over. They were like heavy rocks that had been tossed over by catapults, and they were even wrapped with spikes.","Ling Han activated the Starlight Screen. At present, there were pitifully few opponents in the Cauldron Forging Tier that could force him to use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Peng, peng, peng! One after another, fierce beasts crashed over, causing the light screen to tremble. However, it continued to stubbornly exist, and did not crack.","Ling Han humphed, and shot out a punch.","It would be impolite not to reciprocate; they should take a blow from him as well.","Peng!","Instantly, those fierce beasts flew up, and were all sent flying with a single punch from him.","However, even more wild beasts gathered together, using themselves as weapons, and smashed towards Ling Han. Furthermore, there was even light glowing on the spikes of a great many wild beasts, as if they knew that normal impacts could not cause any damage to Ling Han, and thus launched powerful attacks.","Peng, peng, peng! This time, it was different. As the fierce beasts crashed towards him, one after another, cracks appeared on the light screen. There were more and more of them, and it looked like it was about to break open.","This incited an even stronger desire for attack from the wild beasts, and they smashed towards him as if they were mad.","Ling Han smiled faintly. As his Spiritual Power surged, the Starlight Screen was restored to its original state.","With his reserves of mystical power, he was completely capable of standing still like this, allowing these Demonic Beasts to crash to the point of death.","However, he naturally wouldn’t be so passive. He immediately launched a counterattack. With a punch, a dozen over ferocious beasts were immediately sent flying. Some of their hearts were directly shattered, and they instantly died on the spot.","Against Vicious Beasts, he naturally did not need to be reserved. He went all out, and as he shot out punch after punch, there were endless Vicious Beasts that were destroyed by him. Their corpses were like flowers scattered by a celestial maiden, falling down from the skies.","Now that there was blood, his killing intent also rose. He turned into a god of death, endlessly reaping lives.","After close to a hundred of their companions had died, those wild beasts finally knew fear. They all turned around, and broke into a mad run.","Even though they were round, their speed was really fast. Very soon, they had disappeared without a trace.","Ling Han didn’t give chase. The rocks here were filled with traps, and he didn’t want to put himself in danger just because he was chasing a few fierce beasts.","In any case, there was no animosity between them, so what was there to be mad about with this kind of brainless vicious beast?","Ling Han stopped in his tracks. He picked up the corpse of a fierce beast, and planned to roast it for a taste.","In the end, he threw up after taking a bite.","This meat was too unpalatable, bringing with it an indescribable sour taste.","Forget it, he didn’t want a single piece of meat.","Ling Han walked a little further away. There was blood everywhere here, and the smell was not pleasant at all.","The night passed, and the sun rose as usual.","Yi, there was still a sun here?","Ling Han looked at the sky and activated his eye technique. However, he shockingly discovered that this was indeed a sun.","Could it be that he was on some planet in the universe?","But since that was the case, why had it never been discovered before, but rather needed the doorway of light to teleport?","Was it because there was a formation covering this planet?","These thoughts streaked through his mind. Without any hesitation, he hurriedly sat down in a cross-legged position, and began to absorb the power of heaven and earth.","Half an hour later, Ling Han finished his cultivation.","He started to ponder. At first glance, the power of heaven and earth that he had absorbed seemed normal, but upon closer examination, it seemed like something was missing.","That’s right, it was like using natural treasures to increase one’s cultivation level.","Was the power of heaven and earth here a natural treasure?","Of course, it was the lowest grade of natural treasure, more or less the same as cultivating normally.","Interesting.","Ling Han had already felt that this place was a little strange before, and now, this kind of thought was naturally even more intense.","He continued on his way. He travelled by day, and rested by night.","This desolate plain was too big. Three days had already passed, and he actually did not encounter a single person. On the other hand, there were quite a number of fierce beasts. Aside from those round ones, there were also lizards. They were ash grey in colour, close to the colour of the rocks. They would spit out ink-black light from their mouths, which had a very strong corrosive ability. Furthermore, the overall strength of the lizard beasts was stronger as well. There were actually some that were in the Core Formation Tier.","With how ferocious they were, Ling Han naturally couldn’t afford to trifle with them. Thankfully, these ferocious beasts wouldn’t actively hide their tracks, and he could discover them in advance, and he would have long since taken a different path.","The fourth day arrived, and Ling Han was unlucky enough to encounter another Core Formation Tier lizard. He could only take a different path.","He had just circled around, when he saw a man running over from behind him. This person looked to be in his early twenties, and should be very handsome. However, there was a scar that extended from his left eyebrow all the way to the right corner of his lips, instantly ruining his handsomeness without a doubt. This wound was very deep, and the flesh on either side was slightly exposed, making him look a little twisted.","However, Ling Han naturally wouldn’t pay too much attention to other people’s appearances. He only swept an eye over them before retracting his gaze.","Yet the scar-faced man’s expression turned stern, and he asked, “Are you looking at the scar","on my face?”","Er, Ling Han shook his head, “Not interested.”","He didn’t care who the other party was, so he was even less concerned about his appearance.","“This was left behind from my duel with Lu Qi.” Unexpectedly, the scar-faced man said it himself, “This is not a humiliation. Instead, it is a sign of my courage.”","Ling Han was surprised. What kind of shamelessness was this? Having his face disfigured, he actually called it a sign of courage?","However, Lu Qi was only 19th on the Galaxy Network, so what was there to be proud of?","“I understand,” Ling Han said with a nod. Since he liked to brag, he would just let him brag. Yet the scar-faced man did not give up, and continued, “Do you know who Lu Qi is?” Without waiting for Ling Han to speak, he immediately continued, “Lu Qi is the super genius ranked 19th in Cauldron Forging Tier on the Galaxy Network. I was able to exchange 500 blows with him before finally being wounded by him. This is strength!”","Ling Han didn’t know how to complain anymore.","As it turned out, he could also ride on someone else’s popularity like this.","“So what?” He was getting a little impatient.","“So, why don’t you kneel down obediently!” the scar-faced man said proudly. “Otherwise,","just because you disrespected me, I can also take your life.”","Ling Han laughed in spite of himself. He took a step forwards, and grabbed out at the scar-","faced man.","“You’re seeking death!” When the scar-faced man saw this, he immediately drew out a","sword, which sliced towards Ling Han.","Ling Han easily snapped his hand and plucked the sword from his opponent’s hand. He then","placed his hand on his opponent’s neck.","Instantly, the scar-faced man did not dare to move.","If he moved, his head would fall off.","“Let’s talk things over peacefully. Don’t be rash.” He was extremely cowardly, and his","previous arrogance and haughtiness had completely disappeared.","Yet Ling Han’s expression was filled with suspicion, “Have you really exchanged blows with","Lu Qi?” With such strength, how could he possibly battle with Lu Qi for 500 rounds? He was a character that could be killed in a single move.","“Of course!” The scar-faced man revealed an expression of pride again.","Ling Han chuckled, and said, “I’ve fought with Lu Qi before. Although I don’t have any","positive feelings for this person, I think he can insta-kill you a hundred times with a single","finger.”","The scar-faced man instantly looked awkward, and explained, “When I fought with him, it was still several decades ago. He was far from being as powerful as he is now.”","Ling Han laughed in spite of himself, “Lu Qi is only in his thirties, at most. And you fought with him a few decades ago?”"]},{"number":3861,"title":"Chapter 3861: Hard to Guard Against","paragraphs":["Chapter 3861: Hard to Guard Against","The scar-faced man’s mouth was agape, but the flaw in this lie was too big. He didn’t even know how to cover it up.","He thought for a moment, then sighed, and said, “Actually, I had really fought with Lu Qi before, but at that time, I was only a nameless pawn, and there were also other people. However, I was struck by a flash of Sword Qi from Lu Qi, and was disfigured.”","The truth of these words was much higher.","In truth, Ling Han had no intention to pursue the matter of whether this person had fought with Lu Qi or not. He had only pursued the matter out of curiosity.","He smiled, “Judging by your tone, it seems like you are no longer a nameless nobody?”","“Of course.” The scar-faced man’s tail was about to stick up again.","“Dare I ask how should I address this elite?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“I’m Li Zisuan.” The scar-faced man raised his head high, yet when the blade of the sword scraped past him, blood instantly gushed out, causing him to hurriedly shrink his neck. His image was completely ruined.","Ling Han patted that person’s shoulder, “Come, tell me about your understanding of the White Lotus Mystery Realm.”","Li Zisuan didn’t dare to hide anything, and he revealed everything he knew.","His strength could only be considered average, but the clan he had come from was still quite strong, and had given him an entry spot. And because he had always boasted that he had fought with Lu Qi, he did have some reputation. Otherwise, merely having the reputation of the clan was not enough.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel surprised. He was actually qualified to boast like this; this person was quite capable.","After talking for half a day, Ling Han nodded, “You can leave now.”","“Really?” Li Zisuan was delighted, and also in disbelief.","“Could it be that you still want to stay?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Hehe, thank you, thank you.” Li Zisuan hurriedly bowed and thanked him, then slipped away.","Ling Han naturally would not take this kind of minor character to heart. However, from the other party’s words, he had gained a little more understanding of this Mystery Realm.","He also continued on his way. Another two days later, he finally reached the end of this desolate plain.","In these two days, he had also encountered a few people, but no conflicts broke out. Without involving any treasures, very few people would provoke him for no reason. After all, there were not many people who were as arrogant and domineering as that.","At the end of the desolate plain, there was a mountain of flames.","This was not a mountain that was burning fiercely, but was rather filled with holes. Occasionally, a flame would spew out of these holes, and shoot out to a height of six to nine meters.","Boom, boom, boom! Multiple flames rose and fell, as if they were playing a piece of music. Ling Han didn’t immediately walk up. Instead, he observed for a while, and saw that there were also shattered seals flickering in the flames.","Tsk, this destructive power would be different in that case.","Ling Han activated the Starlight Screen, then walked over and stood there without moving. Boom, a flame shot out, and a hole was immediately burned into the Starlight Screen. Then, the flame blasted towards him.","He was already prepared, and hurriedly leaped out, dodging the flames.","Thankfully, though the destructive power of the flames was great, the speed at which they gushed out could not be considered very fast.","However, even the Starlight Screen was unable to block a single strike. The might of these flames was at least on the level of the Core Formation Tier. In fact, even a Core Formation Tier could possibly be severely wounded.","There were many holes on the mountain, and occasionally, a surge of flames would rush out. It was practically impossible to guard against.","Of course, this was unless he could find a pattern to it.","Ling Han stood upright and still, but his eyes could see everything clearly.","He was analyzing and calculating, but though the gushing of the flames seemed to be very rhythmic, they kept changing, as if there wasn’t any repetition at all.","However, just as Ling Han was feeling a headache coming on, he shockingly discovered that someone had taken out two rocks and tied them under each foot respectively. Then, he stepped into the volcanic area.","A miraculous scene appeared. Flames surged out, but did not burn these two rocks.","Though that person’s appearance was comical, he successfully left into the distance.","Ling Han saw very clearly that the rocks had come from the desolate plain behind them. There were a great many of them.","He couldn’t help but sigh. This was experience.","He turned around and returned to the desolate plains. Ling Han stowed away two rocks and placed them into his Spatial Tool. After some thought, he took a few more rocks. What if they burned for too long and still broke?","He returned, and did the same thing. Then, he headed up the mountain.","Boom, a flame rushed out, instantly burning the rock to burst.","Ling Han hurriedly used Imminent Skyline, narrowly dodging this attack.","He couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. He had almost been hit head-on, and with the might of the flames, it was enough to severely injure him.","Why couldn’t he?","Ling Han took out the stones in his Spatial Tool, one after another, and threw them up the mountain to fill in the holes.","Boom, pa! Boom, pa! Boom, pa!","Each stone was thrown, one after another, and would be burnt to burst, infuriating Ling Han so much that he threw out all the remaining stones.","Pa, pa, pa, pa! Explosions rang out endlessly, and those rocks shattered one after another.","Hold on.","Ling Han’s sharp gaze stopped on a rock. It had not shattered, but had rather suppressed a","hole.","He spent some effort to retrieve this stone.","What was so special about this stone?","Ling Han looked closely, and soon discovered that there was a very thin black pattern on this","rock.","Was this the key?","Ling Han returned to the desolate plain, and examined carefully. True enough, the majority of the stones did not have any black patterns.","He found a few stones with black patterns, and brought them back to the Flame Mountain to make another attempt. As expected, the stones with black patterns could suppress the holes. No wonder that person had not avoided him at all, allowing him to see how he should cross the mountain of flames. As it turned out, that person was not being generous at all, but was deliberately screwing him over.","-Who would have thought that there was actually requirements for this stone?","Previously, if it was not for the fact that Ling Han’s reaction speed was fast enough, he would either be severely injured or dead by now.","What a treacherous guy.","Ling Han thought back to that person’s appearance, and very soon, outlined it in his mind.","Fine, when he saw him in future, he would definitely give him a good beating. Ling Han didn’t need to tie the rocks to his feet. His feet generated a suction force that was enough to firmly lock the rocks that weighed several thousand kilograms.","Xiu, he shot out, and leapt on the flaming mountain as if he was flying.","The width of this mountain of flames was incredibly shocking, but its depth was considerably limited. Ling Han only crossed two mountains, and a desert appeared ahead of him.","He leaped down, and saw that the two rocks had endured the barrage of flames many times,","and were more or less burnt. If his speed was slightly slower, he would have to replace them","with new rocks.","Ling Han turned around to take a look before continuing to advance.","This desert was extremely large. The sun was at the top of the sky, and the sunlight was blazing, turning this place into a furnace. Even if Ling Han had a high cultivation level, sweat still rolled down his forehead. He had not walked for too long, when he felt dehydrated.","F***, he couldn’t bear it.","He activated the Starlight Screen, and the scorching heat instantly subsided by a significant","amount.","However, Ling Han discovered that this kind of high temperature had a very strong destructive effect on the Starlight Screen. He had to continuously replenish the energy expenditure of the Starlight Screen.","If his reserves of mystical power weren’t close to unlimited, he really wouldn’t be able to withstand this kind of expenditure. But now, it didn’t matter. What was a little expenditure","worth?"]},{"number":3862,"title":"Chapter 3862: Endless desert","paragraphs":["Chapter 3862: Endless desert","Ling Han strolled around in the desert.","The blazing sun shone directly overhead, and it was very difficult to believe that this was a real sun. That was because the temperature was unbelievably high, and waves of heat were rising from the air. They had all distorted, seriously affecting visibility.","This desert was boundless, and one would become lost as they walked, wondering where they should go next?","Especially in such high temperatures, it was very easy to become dizzy from the heat, and one’s intelligence would drop drastically.","Thankfully, Ling Han had the protection of the Starlight Screen, so there was not a single wave of heat that could invade his body. He felt very refreshed.","The problem was that he discovered that the electromagnetic field here was too chaotic. How was he supposed to determine north, south, east, and west?","In a natural magnetism field, the north and south were two poles, so the remaining east and west directions were easily determined.","Especially for a Formation Master, determining the location was the most basic requirement, but Ling Han discovered that the electromagnetic field here was constantly switching, extremely chaotic, as if east, west, north, and south did not exist.","Was it because there was a large-scale formation here that had affected the natural magnetism field?","Then there was nothing else that could be done. He could only use a more primitive method. Just look at the sun.","Ascending from the east and descending from the west were the most basic principles.","Ling Han stopped, and began to record the trajectory of the sun’s course. However, after an hour, he revealed an extremely shocked expression.","-If he had drawn out the orbit of the sun, there would definitely be no one who would believe him. Instead, they would think that this was a child’s graffiti.","Twists and turns, this was practically a joke.","In other words, the circulation of the sun was completely illogical.","After another few hours, the sun set and disappeared from the horizon. The temperature immediately began to drop rapidly. Previously, it could still make people dizzy from the heat, but now, it was so cold that he was about to shiver.","This was too abnormal.","Ling Han had initially thought that there was a formation here that concealed the existence of this planet in the universe. It was also because of this formation that it had affected the magnetism of heaven and earth. However, through observing the trajectory of the sun, he came to a conclusion. There was indeed a super-large formation that directly created this world.","He definitely wasn’t in any corner of the universe. Instead, he was in a separate dimension. Here, a massive formation controlled everything, and that was why there were so many strange phenomena.","The sun in the sky may be real, but it was definitely captured by a supreme great elite, and forcefully stuffed into the Mystery Realm.","Hiss, just how powerful was this existence to be able to be so generous?","Was it an Ancestral King?","Ling Han sighed inwardly. He removed the Starlight Screen. Although it was cold now, it was completely within tolerable limits. Of course, there was no need to waste the mystical power.","He started a fire and prepared dinner for himself.","After resting for a night in the desert, on the morning of the second day, the sun rose from some unknown corner of the sky. Ling Han immediately began to cultivate. The power of heaven and earth surged over, helping him raise his cultivation level.","Yi, the power of heaven and earth here was so dense, it was comparable to cultivating in his abode in the Nine Suns Holy Land.","Ling Han nodded. As expected, there was still a lack of something in this energy, so this should be a simulation of the power of heaven and earth.","The power of great dao?","Ling Han pondered deeply. No matter what natural treasures, they could not possibly replace the effects of the power of heaven and earth, because there would always be something inconceivable. An elite once said that was the Dao of Heaven and Earth, the most fundamental force of life in the world.","This also indirectly proved that this place was cut off from the normal heaven and earth.","After Ling Han finished cultivating, he continued to advance.","However, the problem now was that he had really lost his way.","Where should he go?","Ling Han thought for a moment, and decided to go all the way to the end.","Regardless of north, south, east, and west, he was simply walking in one direction. He refused to believe that this desert had no bounds.","He firmed his resolve, and continued to fly forwards.","There was no gravity suppression here, so Ling Han quickly began to fly on his Tool. In fact, he even began to fly into the sky, wanting to find the end of the world from this angle. However, after flying to a height of tens of thousands of meters, he was unable to go any higher.","There was a powerful force suppressing him, preventing him from flying any higher.","Looks like it was impossible to break out of the situation at this point.","Ling Han flew down, and obediently walked in a specific direction.","This flight took ten days.","Time and space seemed to have frozen. It would always be a boundless desert. If it was not for the fact that there was still day and night, it would really drive one crazy.","This was too lonely.","Ling Han didn’t believe it. Although this desert was huge, he had already walked for more than ten days, so how could he not encounter a single person?","But in front of this super great formation, even Ling Han was helpless.","In fact, he didn’t even know that this was a formation. However, the phenomenon like the sun’s circulation path and the chaotic nature of the magnetism field indirectly proved that this should be a formation that affected everything.","If this continued, it was believed that a great many people would not be able to tolerate it,","and choose to give up.","Fine then, just treat this as a test of willpower.","Ling Han was firm in his resolve, and he continued to advance in a single direction. Another 20","or so days passed, and as he flew, suddenly, sand flew up in front of him.","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han faltered for a moment before coming to his senses.","There was a change.","Previously, it had only been the blazing sun shining down from the skies. There were no clouds for miles, and there was not the slightest bit of wind, but now, there was dust and sand","rising. What did this mean?","The wind was blowing.","Any change was a good thing, which meant that he was heading in the right direction. However, Ling Han immediately revealed an expression of shock, because this flying sand immediately turned into an eye of the storm, and began to wreak havoc in his direction. Not only was it extremely fast, the range of the eye of the storm was also expanding continuously. It could be clearly seen that there were terrifying seals flickering in the eye of the storm.","If he was swept up in this, then if he was hit by the grains of sand that had seals attached to them, just how much damage would it cause?","It was already too late for Ling Han to dodge. The eye of the storm had already expanded to a diameter of 5km, and he hurriedly tunneled downwards.","The sand was soft, so it naturally couldn’t stop him. He continued to dig deeper and deeper","into the ground.","However, Ling Han immediately sensed that the storm was approaching. A large amount of sand on the upper layer had been swept away, and he was presently exposed.","F***.","Ling Han hurriedly tunneled downwards again, contending in speed with the eye of the storm.","After walking downwards for several hundred km, he finally sensed that the eye of the super","storm had left.","He broke out of the ground, and was once again stunned.","That was because the initially flat desert seemed to have turned into an ocean, with a huge","concave area.","However, what was even more astonishing was the fact that the sand from an endless distance was presently filling in, like a tsunami. Its speed was astonishingly fast, and in just over ten minutes, everything had returned to its original state, as if the storm had not been blown over","at all.","This was truly a strange place.","Ling Han hesitated for a moment before setting off again.","Now, nothing could stop him.","Ling Han flew all the way on his Tool, and didn’t walk too far before three small black dots","appeared ahead of him. Ling Han activated his Eye Technique, and couldn’t help but tense up.","He hurriedly descended.","These weren’t cultivators who had entered, but rather three vultures. They were all at the","level of the Core Formation Tier.","However, the three vultures had obviously discovered him as well. They all let out a sharp cry, and flapped their wings as they flew towards him."]},{"number":3863,"title":"Chapter 3863: Cover","paragraphs":["Chapter 3863: Cover","F***","Ling Han hurriedly descended. After storing away the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, he activated Imminent Skyline and searched for a place to dodge.","However, this was a desert, so where could he hide?","Though his speed was fast, surpassing all Cauldron Forging Tiers, and could even match the early stage of the Core Formation Tier, those three vultures were in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier or even the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, so their speed was faster than his, though not by much.","The distance between the two sides was slowly closing in.","Ling Han frowned slightly. Could it be that he could only use the Heavenly Dao Flames?","Right at this moment, his eyes suddenly lit up.","In the distance, a valley appeared.","Very good, Ling Han quickened his pace, and raced towards that valley.","After a few leaps and landings, he was already close to the valley, yet shockingly discovered that there was presently a group of seven people walking out of the valley.","When they saw Ling Han, the seven of them were stunned. Then, they also saw those three vultures, and all of them cursed. They turned around and ran into the valley.","Ling Han followed them into the valley, and immediately discovered that the expressions of those seven people were extremely unfriendly.","What, did I offend you guys?","However, everyone’s attention was now focused on the three vultures outside. What surprised Ling Han was that these three vultures seemed to be very wary of the valley. They only circled above the valley, and not a single one flew down.","After a long time, the three vultures flapped their wings and left, as if they had given up on hunting.","“Brat, you’ve wasted so much of our time. How are you going to compensate us?” a man in green said.","Ling Han spread his hands and said, “Adventuring in ancient sites together is a very common thing, right? Fine, I can apologize to all of you.”","“Apologize?” The man in green humphed, “What is the use of an apology? Can it exchange for the time that we have wasted?”","Tsk, did he have to be so overbearing?","Ling Han cracked his knuckles as he clenched his fists. By the looks of it, someone was asking for a beating.","“What, you want to fight?” The man in green sneered. There were seven of them, and they were all at the cultivation level of the Cauldron Forging Tier. The strongest person was at Four Cauldrons, and his abilities were enough to rank in the top 1000 of the Galaxy Network. Was there any need for him to fear Ling Han?","He was only a Cauldron Forging Tier.","Ling Han merely cracked a smile. It seemed like these seven people were quite familiar with this place, so it was a good opportunity for him to make some queries.","“How dare you!”","“Stop!”","The man in green was just about to rush forwards with his fists out, but a loud shout suddenly rang out, causing him to involuntarily stop.","At first, he had thought that this was a call from a companion, because there were only eight people in the valley. Since Ling Han did not speak, it must be a companion. However, when he turned his head, he was surprised, because an unfamiliar man had just entered into the valley. It was that man who had spoken up to stop him.","F***, the man in green was instantly displeased. Who do you think you are?","He sized him up. This man was also a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, and there was a scar on his face that extended from his left eye to the right corner of his mouth, making him look extremely malevolent.","“Yi, could it be that you are Li Zisuan?” The man in green was just about to flip out, when he saw a companion rush out, cupping his hands in respect towards the scarred man.","“That’s right,” the scar-faced man said proudly.","Li Zisuan? Who was he?","The man in green did not dare to be rash, because that companion was the only Four Cauldrons among them, and was also the strongest elite. Even he was so polite, so this scar- faced man should be very powerful.","When the Four Cauldrons cultivator saw the puzzled expressions on his companions’ faces, he hurriedly said, “You may not have heard of Brother Li’s name, but Lu Qi knows, right?”","Of course, Lu Qi was ranked 19th on the Galaxy Network, and he was ranked in the top five of the North Heavenly Realm. He was practically their idol.","The Four Cauldrons cultivator nodded, and said, “Brother Li had once exchanged blows with Lu Qi, and only after exchanging five hundred moves, was he no match, and this scar was left behind at that time. Thus, this is definitely not a humiliation, but rather a symbol of honour and courage.”","A look of admiration appeared on the faces of the man in green and the others. This was too awesome. He had only been defeated after exchanging 500 blows with Lu Qi, and he had even survived. This was practically inconceivably powerful.","Pu, Ling Han couldn’t help but splutter in laughter. He had never thought that he would encounter Li Zisuan so soon. What was even more unexpected was that there was actually a market for Li Zichuan’s lies.","“What are you laughing at!” The man in green immediately shouted at Ling Han.","Without waiting for Ling Han to speak, Li Zisuan coughed, and said proudly, “You dare to be rude to my friend?”","“This is actually Brother Li’s friend?” the Four Cauldrons cultivator asked in surprise.","“Of course!” Li Zisuan said proudly, but he was a little anxious internally. That was because","he was actually not worthy of being associated with Ling Han, and feared that Ling Han would immediately act up.","However, Ling Han didn’t say anything, which was equivalent to tacit agreement.","He was actually very curious about how far this Li Zisuan could pretend.","“Since he’s Brother Li’s friend, then we’re all a family!” The Four Cauldrons on the other side chuckled, then nodded at the man in green. “Yue Zhi, apologize to this friend.”","The man in green hurriedly clasped his hands in Ling Han’s direction, saying, “Please don’t take my previous offense to heart.”","There was not the slightest bit of reluctance in this, which showed how useful Li Zisuan’s","reputation was.","And in truth, all this was based on Lu Qi’s great reputation.","The seven people all introduced themselves. The Four Cauldrons was called Geng Xing, and ranked 966th on the Galaxy Network. The man in green was called Lao Yuezhi. As for the others, Ling Han didn’t care.","Ling Han asked about this valley, and the seven people on the other side immediately answered with everything they knew.","As it turned out, there were many other valleys like this in this desert, and they were all shelters. If they encountered ferocious beasts that they could not match, or encountered a terrifying natural disaster, they could enter into the valley to hide.","None of the wild beasts dared to enter into the valley, and natural disasters, such as the super storm, would cause extremely limited damage here.","Ling Han nodded. These were all experience that had been passed down through the generations, and the Nine Suns Holy Land’s situation was unique. They did not have the slightest bit of information about this, so he could only guess blindly.","“Brother Li, Brother Ling, how about we move together?” Geng Xing earnestly invited.","Li Zisuan didn’t dare to make a decision without permission. He looked at Ling Han.","Ling Han was unconcerned, and said with a smile, “Brother Li can decide.”","Li Zisuan couldn’t help but feel secretly grateful. Ling Han gave him face like this, which made him feel extremely touched.","“Then let’s go together,” he said reservedly. Though he was putting on airs, he still had to","take advantage when he should.","They exited the valley, and continued onwards.","After walking for half a day, the terrifying sandstorm appeared again.","“Quick, there’s a valley ahead,” Geng Xing said, pointing ahead.","Their luck was not too bad. Not too far away, there was a valley where they could hide, so","there was no need for them to dig another few hundred miles.","Taking advantage of the fact that the storm had not completely taken form, they quickened","their pace, and entered into that valley.","However, there were others in the valley.","“Yi, Geng Xing!” There were more people on the other side, and the person in the lead","recognized Geng Xing with a single glance.","“Yu Feiming!” Geng Xing also recognized him, and his expression immediately darkened,","with a sliver of wariness."]},{"number":3864,"title":"Chapter 3864: Resolving the Trouble","paragraphs":["Chapter 3864: Resolving the Trouble","Geng Xing was somewhat apprehensive, because this Yu Fei Ming was also Four Cauldrons, and was an old rival of his.","Not only were they old enemies on the Galaxy Network, but they had also fought countless times in the real world.","That was because they both came from the same planet, and knew each other very well.","“I’m really sorry. We arrived here first, so please go somewhere else,” Yu Feiming said calmly.","Geng Xing sneered, “You guys don’t own this place, what right do you have to chase us away?”","“Hehe, because our abilities are stronger!” Yu Feiming said with a smile, “If we are strong enough, we can do as we please.”","“Stronger?” Geng Xing shook his head, “Not necessarily!”","His and Yu Feiming’s strength should be about the same. The two sides had already fought almost a hundred times, with victories and losses on both sides. He did not dare to say that he could defeat Yu Feiming, but Yu Feiming did not dare to say that he was stronger than him either.","Thus, the other party’s words now seemed to be lacking in confidence.","“Hehe, though you can contend against me, but if it was this one, would you still dare to speak tough?” Yu Feiming pointed at a white-robed young man beside him.","Which one was this?","“Let me introduce.” Yu Feiming smiled slightly, and said with a hint of mockery, “This is Shi Deze, Brother Shi. I’m sure you’ve heard, Brother Shi is ranked in the 700s on the Galaxy Network.”","The white-robed young man smiled proudly. Even though there was only a gap of around two hundred rankings between them, after entering into the top thousand, every gap of a hundred ranks meant that the gap in strength was like the gap between heaven and earth, what more when there was a gap of two hundred.","Geng Xing’s expression immediately changed. Over seven hundred, this was too strong.","However, when he thought of Li Zisuan, he immediately became bolder.","This person was a man who could exchange 500 blows with Lu Qi, so what was a Galaxy Network ranking in the 700s worth?","“Haha!” He laughed loudly, “So it’s Brother Shi. You have really found a powerful helper. However, do you know who this Brother Li beside me is?”","‘Hmm?’","Yu Feiming and Shi Deze both looked towards Li Zisuan. Who are you?","“Li Zisuan, Brother Li, an existence that can exchange five hundred moves with Lu Qi.” Geng Xing declared proudly.","Right, Lu Qi’s limelight was borrowed again.","Li Zisuan was naturally feeling uneasy. He could only bluff. If they really fought, his strength wouldn’t even be able to squeeze into the top 10,000, so how could he stand against an existence ranked above 700?","But now, he had to stick to his words no matter what. Could it be that he could say that he had just been boasting previously?","“Hehe, thank you for your praise, Brother Geng. I have only exchanged a few hundred moves with Lu Qi, so there is no need to mention it,” Li Zisuan said calmly, putting on a very high air.","Meanwhile, Yu Feiming and Shi Deze’s expressions changed slightly. Who was Lu Qi? He was a super genius ranked 19th on the Galaxy Network. Being able to exchange 500 moves with Lu Qi, his abilities would at least be able to squeeze into Galaxy Network’s top 100, or perhaps even higher.","Compared to them, this kind of person was practically a god.","Could they afford to offend him?","Yu Feiming hesitated for a moment, then opened his mouth, and said hoarsely, “So it is Brother Li, apologies for not recognizing you.”","Li Zisuan instantly felt relieved. He had fooled him again.","However, Shi Deze’s words caused him to feel anxious again, “So Brother Li has actually fought with Lu Qi before. I am really envious! I wonder if I can spar with Brother Li, so that I can broaden my horizons.”","‘F*ck you!’","Thoughts flashed across Li Zixing’s mind. What should he do?","He definitely couldn’t agree. Once he was beaten, he would be exposed, but if he didn’t agree, how could he refuse so that he wouldn’t show his cowardice?","But no matter how he thought about it, he could not think of a suitable reason.","“Hehe, let me spar with you.” Ling Han walked out with a smile, “Brother Li’s cultivation has improved greatly recently. Probably, even Lu Qi is no match for him. It would not be good if he hurts Brother Shi.”","Seeing Ling Han step out, Li Zisuan was practically moved to the point of wanting to cry.","His savior.","“You?” Shi Deze swept an eye over Ling Han, “Who are you?”","“Ling Han.”","“What’s your ranking in the Galaxy Network?” Shi Deze asked.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before replying, “About 100,000.”","Indeed, this account of his was only ranked at this place for the moment. Even Number One in","the Galaxy had only just broken into the top 1000.","“Haha!” Shi Deze immediately smirked coldly. How could a guy ranked merely in the","100,000s be worthy of challenging him?","Defeating this kind of opponent would be an unjust victory, and would further degrade his","status.","“You are still not qualified!” He shook his head.","Ling Han sighed, “Why do there always have to be people who think so highly of themselves, and are always condescending?”","‘F*ck! You are ranked over 100,000 in the Galaxy Network, so how can others look up to you?’","Everyone thought. Those like Geng Xing and the others were still fine, but Yu Feiming and the others all began to mock him, all of them merciless in their words.","Towards this kind of “mediocre character”, did they need to take into account Ling Han’s feelings?","Ling Han wasn’t angered, and he said calmly, “If you don’t dare to fight me, then step aside.”","‘Tsk, you’re getting arrogant?’","“Scram, what right do you have to exchange blows with Brother Shi!” A man rushed out, stretching out a hand to grab Ling Han.","It was beneath Shi Deze to make a move on Ling Han, so he would do it for him.","Ling Han stood with his hands clasped behind his back, acting as if he didn’t know.","If the large black dog saw this, he would definitely pout and say that Ling Han was going to show off again. However, in the eyes of others, this was clearly because Ling Han had no time to react at all. The other man was too strong, while he was too weak.","That person had already charged over, and his hand was aimed directly at Ling Han’s chest, intending to throw him out.","Just when the other was about to touch him, Ling Han moved. He was as fast as lightning, and grabbed the other’s chest in a single move. Then, with a toss, peng, that person was thrown onto the mountain wall. Then, he slid down, and lay on the ground, unable to move in the","slightest.","Instantly, the surroundings fell silent.","Hiss, this guy ranked in the 100,000s on the Galaxy Network was actually so powerful?","“So you’re pretending to be a pig to eat a tiger.” Shi Deze finally took Ling Han seriously. He looked at Ling Han, and nodded slowly, “Let me experience how strong you are.”","He strode forwards, walking towards Ling Han.","Ling Han still crossed his arms behind his back.","This time, everyone knew that it wasn’t that Ling Han didn’t react in time, but that he was","deliberately showing off.","However, your current opponent is Shi Deze, an existence ranked in the 700s on the Galaxy Network. Is he someone you can show off to?","Shi Deze had already neared, and stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han.","After all, he was an elite in the 700s on the Galaxy Network. His strength could be said to be astonishingly strong, and as his palm pressed down, streaks of divine light circulated.","Ling Han also moved, grabbing back at the other.","Pa, their hands clasped together.","This time, it was a clash of strength between the two sides. Whoever had the stronger power","and stronger physique would emerge victorious.","Shi Deze smirked coldly. The Dragon Elephant Prajna Technique that he cultivated was focused on cultivating power and physique. To clash head-on with him like this, even those ranked fifty places higher than him would have to kneel.","You are really courting death.","His fingers exerted force, wanting to make Ling Han moan and scream. Then, he felt that the bones in Ling Han’s hand were extremely hard, and could not be kneaded at all."]},{"number":3865,"title":"Chapter 3865: The team expands","paragraphs":["Chapter 3865: The team expands","Shi Deze looked at Ling Han in shock. ‘Are you really ranked in the 100,000s on the Galaxy Network?’","“Are you sure?”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “What is it? Feeling like you’ve bitten a hard nut?”","That really was the case.","A string of curses raced through Shi Deze’s mind. ‘You’re far too good at showing off, aren’t you? You’re clearly powerful enough to rival me, yet your ranking in the Galaxy Network is only around 100,000. Aren’t you afraid of showing off too much and being struck by lightning?’","“You’re cursing me in your heart.” Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I despise people like you. You have to understand that it’s extremely immoral to speak ill of others in secret.”","Then how much better would it be for you to show off like this?","Though Shi Deze was filled with wariness towards Ling Han, it was not to the extent that he feared him. He asked coldly, “So what about it?”","“I’m naturally going to thrash the one who does it.” Ling Han smiled, and suddenly burst out with power.","How powerful was he? How could Shi Deze withstand such an explosive burst of power? Instantly, he was pressed onto the ground, and served with a flurry of punches.","Seeing this scene, everyone was shocked speechless.","Shi Deze was ranked in the 700s in the Galaxy Network. He could be regarded as one of the super geniuses in any galaxy. However, in front of Ling Han, he couldn’t fight back at all and was beaten like a punching bag.","Then, they turned to look at Li Zisuan.","Judging by Ling Han’s tone, Li Zisuan was even more powerful than him. Just how powerful would he be then?","Li Zisuan was also very confused.","He knew that Ling Han was very strong, but had definitely not foreseen that he would be this strong.","However, with so many people staring at him, he couldn’t reveal any flaws, right?","Thus, his nonchalant expression made people think that he was even stronger than Ling Han, and that was why he didn’t take it to heart at all.","In this way, everyone looked at him with even more reverence.","As expected of a fierce man who could battle Lu Qi for 500 rounds. Just look at that scar, exuding such a powerful and heroic aura.","Ling Han only pummeled him for a while before withdrawing. There was no animosity between him and Shi Deze, and he was only a little annoyed that the latter wanted to chase him out, and that was why he had pummeled him.","“Alright, we’re all here to adventure. It’s unknown whether we’ll be in trouble or good fortune now. It’s better to unite and face unknown dangers together.” Li Zisuan mediated.","Now that his identity was completely different, his words naturally carried a lot of weight, causing the people on both sides to nod endlessly. They felt that not only was this person’s abilities unfathomable, he was also benevolent and generous, which was rare.","In a sparring match in martial arts, it was very normal for one’s skill to be inferior. Shi Deze also very quickly returned to normal. He had already believed in Li Zisuan’s “identity”. This was a man that could challenge Lu Qi, and was much, much stronger than him. And once he was strong to the point that others could only look up to him, even if he was defeated by the latter, that could still be considered an honour.","―Though he had actually lost to Ling Han.","Thus, it wasn’t long before the animosity between them disappeared. They silently waited for the super storm to end before setting off together and continuing to advance.","The environment here was really too terrible. In the evening, they encountered another great storm, and had no choice but to go to another valley to hide. Now, it was already late, so they simply decided to rest here for a night.","Not long after they entered into the valley, another team quickly entered into the valley to hide.","Li Zisuan immediately stepped out, calling on everyone to unite.","At first, the opposing team was not on good terms with them, but as Shi Deze and Geng Xing came out respectively to explain, “convincing others with virtue”, this team was instantly convinced.","Coincidentally, a few more people entered the valley at night. They had all come alone, and had also been recruited into this team.","There would always be those who were ambitious, unwilling to be a lackey, and wanted to challenge Li Zisuan. In the end, Shi Deze, Geng Xing and the others moved, and easily suppressed him, causing Li Zisuan’s prestige to become higher and higher.","You see, even Shi Deze, an elite that was ranked more than seven hundred in the Galaxy Network, was willing to be inferior to him, so what did they have to be dissatisfied about? On the second day, they continued onwards.","This time, they were relatively lucky. They didn’t encounter any great storms for an entire day.","However, they didn’t encounter a single valley on their way, and at night, they started a large bonfire to prepare dinner.","Because there were so many people, the atmosphere was naturally lively, especially after they had drunk some wine. Everyone was fawning madly on Li Zisuan, and Li Zisuan had been pretending all this while. He had become accustomed to it, and began to boast about the great battle between himself and Lu Qi. Those five hundred moves were vividly described by him, fierce and exciting, and they caused everyone to exclaim endlessly in shock.","Ling Han listened from the sidelines, and smiled internally. Going by how Li Zisuan was going on like this, this guy’s fame would definitely become bigger and bigger. When Lu Qi heard about this, who knew what kind of expression he would have.","-The reason why he would cover for Li Zisuan’s lie was actually because of this simple","mischief.","Everyone was making a fuss, and toasting one another. It was very lively.","In the middle of the night, they finally finished drinking, and all of them fell asleep.","The next morning, the sun rose, and the temperature immediately soared, waking everyone","up one by one.","They all sat cross-legged and cultivated, but there were also people practicing fist techniques. This was also a kind of cultivation method. Half an hour later, everyone packed up and prepared to set out.","“Yi, why is there one less person?” Li Zisuan’s eyes wandered around, and couldn’t help but exclaim in surprise.","Everyone counted heads. There was really one person missing. His name was Huang Liang. He did not come as part of a group, but rather blended into the group all by himself. “Strange, Huang Liang was still drinking with us yesterday. It can’t be that he left alone,","right?” someone said.","Someone flew on a Tool, and when they arrived at a higher altitude, they looked around, but","did not find anything.","“Forget it. Perhaps he doesn’t want to be with us.”","“Let’s go.”","Everyone set out, and Ling Han was a little surprised. Li Zisuan was quite a responsible leader,","wasn’t he? These people were all unfamiliar with him, and he could actually tell that someone","was missing with a single glance.","Ling Han fell into deep thought. Though he had also fallen asleep, his divine sense was sensitive. If there was the slightest movement, he would immediately be awakened, but he","did not sense anything at all.","Had Huang Liang really left on his own?","This desert seemed to be shrinking in size. In the afternoon, they encountered another team, consisting of fourteen people. Shi Deze stepped out, and successfully subdued this group of","people, uniting under the leadership of Li Zisuan.","Unintentionally, they also said that there were originally fifteen of them, but one of them had","left this morning.","Everyone hurriedly asked, and the result was that the situation on both sides was the same. They had both only discovered that the person had quietly disappeared in the morning.","Yi, so coincidental?","That night, no one dared to drink anymore. Instead, they arranged for sentry guards to take","turns keeping watch.","However, on the morning of the second day, something happened again. Not only were there","fewer people, there were three of them missing.","This was a huge problem.","Was this a ghost? Three people had suddenly disappeared into thin air?","Everyone felt their hair stand on end."]},{"number":3866,"title":"Chapter 3866: Mysterious Kidnapper","paragraphs":["Chapter 3866: Mysterious Kidnapper","“I was on the last shift. When I changed shifts, I counted the number of people, and there still wasn’t anyone missing,” someone said.","But the problem was, when he was on shift, he did not discover the slightest bit of","abnormality. It was just when it was almost dawn, and he counted heads again, he discovered that there were suddenly three people missing.","How was this possible?","He could clearly see that there was definitely not a single person approaching from the surroundings, what more kidnapping three people soundlessly.","Everyone’s expressions were ugly. Though the three people who had been kidnapped were not all that strong, they were still Cauldron Forging Tier, and they had actually been kidnapped before they could even make a sound. Just how powerful was the culprit?","What if... it was their turn tonight?","At present, they could still crush their tokens and leave, but if they were taken down in a single move, then their lives would completely be out of their control.","“Don’t panic. Everyone, stay alert tonight. We must find the reason,” Li Zisuan said, his expression calm, making everyone calm down.","However, no one knew just how anxious he was.","They continued onwards. A day had passed, and their team had epanded again. Not only had five lone travellers joined them, there were also two teams. Their numbers had exceeded ten, so the total number of their group had exceeded fifty.","As the leader, Li Zisuan was both a little vain and anxious. F*ck, if he was exposed, that would be a huge joke. There would probably be too many people who wanted to tear him to pieces.","It was night, and everyone was gathered around the bonfire. The atmosphere was slightly oppressive.","“According to yesterday’s situation, the person should have suddenly disappeared when it was close to dawn, so there’s no need for everyone to be so nervous now.”","“That’s right. If we stay tense all night, we won’t have the energy to travel during the day. Furthermore, how are we going to spend tomorrow night?”","“Everyone, relax.”","That was what he said, but who would want to disappear so soundlessly?","Some people deliberately joked, but only a few responded. The atmosphere was still very awkward.","Time passed second by second, but everyone felt that time was especially slow. Why was it that only half an hour had passed after such a long time?","One hour, two hours, everyone was counting the time.","Unknowingly, a sliver of white had appeared in the east.","Ling Han looked like he was meditating with his eyes closed, but his divine sense was spread out. Previously, though he had maintained vigilance, it was only directed at himself. This time was different. His divine sense had enveloped the entire area.","‘It’s here!’","With a thought, his eyes suddenly snapped open.","The eye technique activated, and he saw the flow of sand forming some kind of rhythm.","A man fell forward soundlessly, as if he had suddenly dozed off. However, before he fell headfirst, his body actually sank into the sand. Like a clay ox sinking into the sea, he disappeared extremely quickly.","“Humph!”","Ling Han dashed out, stretching out his right hand to grab that person’s left shoulder.","However, the speed at which this person was descending had far exceeded Ling Han’s expectations. Before Ling Han could catch him, that person had already completely disappeared into the sand.","Strangely, there wasn’t any crater left on the ground, and it was as smooth as before.","Ling Han’s action instantly alerted the others. They all looked over, and they all saw the last scene of that person sinking into the sand.","What the hell?","Ling Han charged over, directly tearing open the sand, and charged downwards.","His speed was extremely fast, and his hands were like sharp blades, forcibly squeezing the sand in front of him to either side, opening up a passageway.","He had locked onto the life force of the person in front of him all this while, and this had become his guiding light.","However, the mysterious abductor seemed to have realized this as well. All of a sudden, this aura of life disappeared.","Ling Han chased for about another 5km, then suddenly stopped.","He had lost him.","He returned to the ground, yet his expression became even uglier. That was because when he had been pursuing, another two people had sunk into the sand, and thus disappeared. Now, he had found the method of how the culprit had executed the kidnapping. He had launched an attack from the bottom of the sand, and had used some unknown method to knock the victim out. Then, he would drag him into the sand and bring him away from below the ground surface.","He did know, but the crux of the matter was, how was he supposed to resolve this problem?","The crux of the matter lay in what method this mysterious culprit had used to knock someone unconscious?","As for whether the victim would be steamed or braised after he had been kidnapped, that was a completely different matter.","“Ling Han, how is it?” Li Zisuan asked Ling Han. By now, he was already very engrossed in his new role.","Ling Han shook his head.","Everyone was disappointed. Ling Han was the first to discover the abnormality, and was also the first to chase after the culprit. Even he couldn’t catch up to the culprit, which naturally made everyone’s mood worse.","“What do we do now?”","Everyone looked towards Li Zisuan. This was their backbone, and now, it was naturally up to","him to decide.","Li Zisuan thought to himself that he was also terrified, so how could he have any good ideas?","He thought for a moment, then said, “We have to quickly walk out of this desert.”","This was nonsense. He had not thought that it would win everyone’s general agreement.","As long as they walked out of the desert, it was naturally impossible for the mysterious culprit","to charge out of the ground again.","Everyone set out, speeding up, wanting to leave this place as soon as possible.","However, while their wishes were beautiful, reality was cruel. One day passed, and they still couldn’t walk out. Instead, the scale of their team expanded again.","“Let’s go. We’ll continue our journey at night.”","Experience from the past few days told them that this desert was only large now, and there was no longer any danger like a great storm. Thus, they could completely journey at night. Instead, it was stopping here that was dangerous. Didn’t they see how many people had disappeared in the last few nights?","No one had any objections, and they all continued their journey.","On the way, no one made a sound, as if they were afraid of attracting the mysterious culprit.","However-","One of them was running, but when his foot landed, it was as if the pile of sand had turned into empty air, and his whole person had sunk in.","“Ah-” That person instantly exclaimed in shock, but his voice came to an abrupt stop. He","had already fallen into a coma.","This time, Ling Han could see very clearly. A hand stretched out from the sand, grabbed that person’s ankle, and then pulled that person into the sand.","Judging by the size of the hand and the smoothness of the skin, it should be a female hand.","As he thought this, Ling Han didn’t hesitate at all. He immediately unleashed a murderous","aura.","He had succeeded.","The woman couldn’t see it, but the person who had sunk into the sand suddenly paused,","leaving his head exposed.","Ling Han leaped over, grabbed the man’s head, and pulled him out first. However, when he","dug up the sand, there was no sign of the culprit.","She had still fled!","Ling Han frowned, slightly displeased.","But a round of applause rang out all around him. He swept his gaze around, and saw that","everyone was indescribably excited.","This was their first victory after clashing with the mysterious culprit. No one was kidnapped by the latter, which gave everyone a strong confidence."]},{"number":3867,"title":"Chapter 3867: Sand Maiden","paragraphs":["Chapter 3867: Sand Maiden","When Ling Han attacked for the first time, he discovered the mysterious culprit. When he attacked for the second time, he even forced the culprit to give up on the “prey” that she was about to obtain. Then, if Ling Han attacked for the third time, wouldn’t he be able to capture the culprit?","Furthermore, this also indirectly proved that the culprit was actually not very strong. Otherwise, why would she be afraid of Ling Han?","Then, they had an elite on their side that was even stronger than Ling Han, Li Zisuan who could battle Lu Qi for 500 rounds. If he made a move, wouldn’t that mysterious kidnapper be captured without a fight?","All of a sudden, everyone turned to look at Li Zisuan.","‘F*ck! Don’t look at me like that! The pressure is immense!’","Li Zisuan mocked in his heart. His true strength was weaker than most of the people here. If he made a move, he would definitely reveal his true strength.","However, he had already put on such airs, so there was naturally no way out for him. Immediately, he said calmly, “Don’t worry, I’m here!”","Everyone nodded in agreement. Since the prodigious Li Zisuan had already spoken, what else could they be worried about?","However, Ling Han was pondering over this. The mysterious culprit who had kidnapped them was most likely a female. Moreover, she was skilled at travelling under the sand. This might be a unique ability. At the very least, he couldn’t travel underground at such a rapid speed. Who exactly was she? And why had she kidnapped people?","Everyone continued to set out, heading forwards.","‘Hmm?’","After taking a few steps, Ling Han suddenly felt a sense of danger.","Someone was attacking him, and they had come from underground.","Ling Han forcibly suppressed the thought of attacking or dodging. He only acted as if he didn’t know. When he took a step, a hand suddenly appeared from the sand, grabbing onto his ankle.","This hand was incredibly slender, possessing an indescribable beauty, but it was also filled with power.","Suddenly, a mysterious power assaulted him, directly heading towards his mind, instantly causing his vast mind to dim, as if it had become a dead sea.","Ling Han felt as if his consciousness had stopped working, and he was about to sink into eternal darkness.","However, when this power came close to his Celestial Cauldron, it could not advance the slightest bit further. His Celestial Cauldron had evolved from the Primitive Celestial Gate, and even an Ancestral King could not suppress it, what more when it was a power of this level.","Ling Han pretended to be restrained, and his whole person fell forwards.","That hand seemed to hesitate for a moment, but it immediately dragged him further into the sand.","Ling Han discovered that a power was wrapped around him, turning the sand into air, and could not stop him at all. It was like he was running on a plain, and he was being dragged at an astonishing speed.","Outside.","“Ling Han!”","“F***, even Ling Han has been captured!”","Everyone was exclaiming in shock. Everyone knew that Ling Han was the second elite that was only inferior to Li Zisuan, but now, Ling Han had been hit soundlessly. This naturally caused everyone to feel anxious.","All of a sudden, everyone’s eyes turned to look at Li Zisuan.","This was their only hope.","Don’t look at me, I was just boasting.","Li Zisuan called out mentally, but his expression was calm. No matter what, he had to f****** hold on. Otherwise, without Ling Han’s protection now, once the truth was revealed, The would be torn into pieces at any moment.","And underground, Ling Han was being dragged by someone, endlessly heading towards the land’s heart.","5km, 50km, 250km!","Ling Han did some calculations. They were about 500km underground. At this moment, he suddenly stopped, and the hand that was holding onto his ankle also loosened.","“Stop pretending. I know you didn’t lose control!” A woman’s voice sounded in his mind.","Yi, he had been exposed?","Ling Han opened his eyes, smiled, and stood up.","He was not in the layer of sand, but rather in a mud chamber. Unknown rocks were adorned all around him, exuding a weak light.","In front of him stood a woman. She was completely naked, but it did not cause anyone to have any inappropriate thoughts at all. They would only feel that it was terrifying.","This was because this woman didn’t have a single hair on her body. Moreover... she didn’t have any facial features. If it weren’t for the undulating curves of her body, no one would think of her as a woman.","This was the true face of the mysterious culprit?","No wonder she had used her divine sense to directly transmit a message in his mind. That was because she did not have a mouth at all, so how could she speak?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and also used his divine sense to transmit a message, saying, “Since you discovered that I was pretending to be restrained, why did you bring me down?”","“Because you’re walking right into a trap,” the woman said.","Since she was living at the bottom of the desert, why not call her the Sand Maiden?","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Then you should have already informed your companions to surround me, right?”","It was clear that there was more than one Sand Maiden.","“That’s right.” That Sand Maiden nodded, and as she did so, multiple heads appeared from above their heads, beneath their feet, as well as in the walls around them. They were all bare- headed, featureless Sand Maidens. Strangely, there was actually not a single one that was","male.","“Haha, this can’t be called walking into a trap, but like a tiger entering a flock of sheep,” Ling Han said with a laugh.","“Capture him!” the first Sand Maiden said. She seemed to be the leader of the Sand Maidens.","Instantly, one after another, the Sand Maidens moved. Weng, every single one of them","released a sliver of intent, that surged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han’s mind started to dim again, turning into a sea of death.","Previously, a single Sand Maiden had almost caused him to lose consciousness, what more","when there were so many Sand Maidens here?","These divine senses surged over, causing Ling Han’s mind to rapidly fall, turning into an eternal zone of darkness.","However, when these divine senses reached the vicinity of the Celestial Cauldron, it was like a flood that had encountered an indestructible dam. No matter how tumultuous the waves were, they could only retreat in defeat.","The Celestial Cauldron that was modeled after the Primitive Celestial Gate was unstoppable","and invincible.","Ling Han launched a counterattack. His divine sense rippled, and the invading consciousness instantly melted like snow that had encountered boiling water. Then, they hurriedly","retreated.","“Ah!” One after another, screams of agony rang out via divine sense. Every single Sand Maiden was grabbing their heads with both hands, appearing to be in extreme pain.","“You!” The female leader of the Sand Maidens couldn’t help but feel shocked. Previously, she had not been able to conquer Ling Han’s mind, and had only thought that Ling Han’s consciousness was too strong. She could not accomplish it on her own, but as long as she gathered the power of the women, she would definitely be able to subdue Ling Han.","She had never imagined that even if everyone attacked together, the result would still be a terrible defeat at Ling Han’s hands.","Heavens, w’as this really a Cauldron Forging Tier?","Could it be?","A thought flashed through her mind, and then she communicated with the other Sand","Maidens.","Ling Han humphed, and asked, “What exactly did you guys kidnap people for?” “Sir, could you let us take a look at your Celestial Cauldron?” Yet the leader of the Sand Maidens said something that Ling Han did not expect through her divine sense.","Yi?","Ling Han hesitated slightly, but still released the Celestial Cauldron.","It was as if the Celestial Cauldron had been forged from stone. It looked ordinary and plain,","but an incredibly terrifying pressure reverberated slightly, as if it was the emperor of martial","arts.","“Master!” All the Sand Maidens knelt down, paying their respects to Ling Han."]},{"number":3868,"title":"Chapter 3868: Acknowledged Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 3868: Acknowledged Master","Yi, what was going on here?","After taking a look at the Celestial Cauldron, they were calling him Master?","“Why do you address me as Master?” Ling Han asked.","The leader of the Sand Maidens was incredibly respectful, “According to our ancestral teachings, if we encounter someone who has cultivated a stone Celestial Cauldron, and is not affected by our Soul Extinguishing Technique, that would be our Master!”","Who had created this setting?","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before asking, “Who are you people?”","“We don’t know where we come from either. We’ve only lived here for generations, guarding a key,” the Sand Maiden in the lead said.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. The White Lotus Holy Emperor had said before that there was an ultimate fortune in this Mystery Realm. Could it be that it was opened by this key?","“What key?” Ling Han asked.","The leader of the Sand Maidens immediately turned around, and with a swoosh, melted into the wall.","Ling Han couldn’t help but grumble. Since you guys can pass through sand as if it was air, then why did you have to build a house? Wasn’t that superfluous?","He had just finished complaining, when he saw that the Sand Maiden had returned, and as expected, she was holding a key in her hand.","She walked in front of Ling Han, knelt down on one knee, and respectfully handed him the key.","Ling Han caught it, and couldn’t help but feel his hand sink.","So heavy.","What kind of power did Ling Han possess? Yet, the key actually felt heavy in his hand? This was a clear sign of just how heavy this key was.","What material was it made of?","Ling Han examined it carefully. At first glance, this key looked like it was made of bronze. It should be extremely ancient, and there were even spots of rust on it.","Would Divine Metal rust?","Yes, but that would require an astonishingly long time, and this key was incredibly heavy. The materials used should be considerably precious, and it was very possible that they were Four Stars, Five Stars or even higher grade. To make this kind of Divine Metal rust, how many years would it take?","Ling Han sent his divine sense into it, but there was no reaction.","This most likely wasn’t a Spirit Tool, but rather a key forged from a high-level Divine Metal. Whatever it was, he would put it away first.","Ling Han placed the bronze key into his Spatial Spirit Tool, then asked, “Where are the people you guys kidnapped?”","“In reply to Master, we did not hurt those people. We were only using them to breed,” the leader of the Sand Maidens said.","Br-breed?","Ling Han couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. Could she not use such strong words? He was curious, “Don’t you have any male members?”","“No,” the leader of the Sand Maidens replied. “If we mate, we’ll only give birth to a girl.” “Then what if there are no men?” Ling Han’s desire for gossip burned. This Mystery Realm would only open once every million years, and even Saints would die of old age. How could you guys hold on for a million years until a new batch of men came?","“After we die, a life core will be left behind, nurtured with the energy of the land’s heart, and a new life will be formed,” the leader of the Sand Maidens replied. She was really telling him everything she knew.","Asexual reproduction? How boring.","However, this kind of life was really amazing. If there were men, they would copulate, and if there were no men, they would die and come back to life.","Of course, life couldn’t be duplicated. If one died, that was the end.","“Will a new life maintain its previous memories?” Ling Han asked. This was the key.","“No.” The leader of the Sand Maidens shook her head.","That’s right. All beings only had one life. Even if they reincarnated from the dead, they would only have the same body, and their souls were completely two different people.","“What about those men?” Ling Han asked.","“They are here. Master, please follow me,” the leader of the Sand Maidens said.","Ling Han followed her, and soon arrived at a very, very large house. He saw that there were multiple men lined up neatly on the ground. However, they were all naked.","Er, were they being treated like a stud pig?","“Master, we won’t hurt them. After mating, we’ll send them back to the surface,” the leader of the Sand Maidens emphasized.","Ling Han mocked internally. If these men knew who he had “mated” with, just this kind of damage alone would be enough to leave a psychological scar in their minds for the rest of","their lives.","However, thinking about how these Sand Maidens were quite pitiful, and how they called him Master, Ling Han decided to pretend that he didn’t know about this.","“You guys have always lived in the desert. Do you know how big this place is?” Ling Han asked.","“Master, it’s actually very simple to leave the desert,” the leader of the Sand Maidens said.","“Oh?”","“We only need ten minutes to leave if we set out from here,” the leader of the Sand Maidens said. Then, she drew a diagram for Ling Han.","As it turned out, this desert was indeed astonishingly huge. Furthermore, the sand was still flowing. It looked like you had been walking forwards, but in truth, you could possibly be walking in circles. Thus, whether you could walk out or not actually depended on luck.","If you were lucky, you would be able to walk out in one or two days, but if you were not, trapping you for a few months would be no big deal.","However, if he directly went to the end from underground, that would only be a matter of ten","minutes.","Of course, if you weren’t extremely familiar with this place, even if you went underground, you wouldn’t know which direction you should go. You would still be trapped.","Ling Han felt that this adventure was quite worth it.","-After unravelling the mystery of the mysterious kidnapper, he had obtained a bronze key,","and could even leave this desert quickly.","“Master, I don’t know if you need this.” The leader of the Sand Maidens seemed to have suddenly recalled something, and turned to leave. When she returned, she was holding some","crimson beads in her hands.","“What is this?” Ling Han asked.","“We call it the Crimson Sun Cold Dew,” the leader of the Sand Maidens said. “The energy of the blazing sun gathers underground, condensing into dew, forming ice crystals.”","It sounded very high-end.","“We’ve been eating this since childhood,” the leader of the Sand Maidens said.","Ling Han was extremely curious, and he asked, “You people don’t have a mouth, so how are","you going to eat?”","The leader of the Sand Maidens began her demonstration. She took out a bead, and gripped it in her hand. The size of the bead rapidly shrunk, and soon disappeared.","So that was how it was eaten.","Ling Han also took one and channeled the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll. Instantly, a scorching energy was transmitted from the bead, surging into his body.","Yi, this was equivalent to natural treasures.","Ling Han showed a hint of pleasant surprise. This was not an alchemical pill, but rather a naturally formed natural treasure. Thus, it possessed one of the unique traits of natural treasures, and that was being devoid of alchemic poison, so no matter how much of it was consumed, the effects would only be slightly inferior, and there would not be any alchemic poison left behind.","More importantly, how many pearls were there?","Ling Han asked. The leader of the Sand Maidens thought for a long time, then directly brought him to the place where the Crimson Sun Cold Dew was stored.","Good lord, there was an entire room!","“How much can I take?” Ling Han asked.","“If Master wants it, you can naturally take it all,” the leader of the Sand Maidens said respectfully. “In this place, we can gather dozens of Crimson Sun Cold Dew every day. Even if we give birth to newborn babies, it would be enough.”","True, otherwise how could they have saved up a whole room?","“There are still too many that have turned back into energy and disappeared because too","much time has passed,” the leader of the Sand Maidens said.","What a waste, what a great waste!","Ling Han didn’t stand on ceremony. Rather than letting them go to waste, it would be better","for him to keep them.","In a few moments, he had moved almost all of the Crimson Sun Cold Dew in this room into his Spatial Tool, leaving behind close to a hundred. These Sand Maidens also needed this thing to replenish their stamina."]},{"number":3869,"title":"Chapter 3869: Six Cauldrons","paragraphs":["Chapter 3869: Six Cauldrons","“Oh, that’s right, Master. If these Crimson Sun Cold Dewdrops were brought to the surface, they would immediately evaporate,” the leader of the Sand Maidens said.","What?","Ling Han turned to look at her, and instantly felt speechless.","F***, if he couldn’t bring it outside, what was the use of taking so much?","Ling Han sighed, “All right, I understand.”","His joy turned into disappointment. However, being able to refine them here was still better than nothing.","He asked for a room, and told the Sand Maidens not to disturb him. Then, he began to refine the Crimson Sun Cold Dewdrops.","One drop after another, and his cultivation level instantly began to soar.","In truth, the effects of this thing was not much better than the Cauldron Forging Pill, but it could be considered natural treasures. They were purely natural without any side effects, and no matter how much he ingested them, there was no need to worry that he would be harmed by alchemic poison.","Half a month later, Ling Han’s cultivation level had still reached peak stage Five Cauldrons. He settled down for two days, then began to break through to Six Cauldrons.","For ordinary people, even breaking through to Four Cauldrons was incredibly difficult. This was something that required breaking through limits. However, for Ling Han, Six Cauldrons was far from his limit. Thus, in just two days, he had completed this leap.","Six Cauldrons!","Ling Han broke into a grin. Breaking the limit again, just how strong would his battle prowess be?","If he fought with Lu Qi now, even if he didn’t use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, he would still be able to fight Lu Qi to a tie.","Continue.","Ling Han continued to refine the Crimson Sun Cold Dewdrops, but he discovered that the effects were getting worse and worse.","It couldn’t be helped. Though this could also be considered natural treasures, one would still have immunity after ingesting too many, and their effects would become weaker and weaker. Otherwise, as long as there was a treasured medicine that could extend one’s lifespan, wouldn’t elites never die?","Another twenty plus days later, Ling Han stopped cultivating.","That was because the Crimson Sun Cold Dewdrops was completely ineffective now.","Unfortunately, he was still a little bit away from the peak stage of Six Cauldrons, and could not break through another limit in one go, and cultivate to Seven Cauldrons.","However, one had to be content. In just over a month, he had cultivated from the middle stage of Five Cauldrons to the peak stage of Six Cauldrons. His advancement could be considered extremely shocking.","He decided to leave. There was no longer any need for him to stay here.","“Master, you’re leaving?” the leader of the Sand Maidens asked.","Ling Han nodded.","“Master, we sisters are already pregnant, so these men are useless,” the leader of the Sand Maidens said.","Er, the mating was completed so quickly; it was quite efficient.","Ling Han mocked internally. However, he stretched out a hand and grabbed all the men with his mystical power. Then, he broke through the layer of sand and headed towards the ground. With the Sand Maiden’s guidance, Ling Han naturally knew where Li Zisuan and the others were. He headed straight for them, and in just over ten minutes, he broke out of the ground. Peng! Dust flew into the air.","“Who goes there!”","“Are they here to kidnap someone again?”","Li Zisuan and the others all shouted, all of them extremely nervous.","Though since Ling Han had been kidnapped, the mysterious kidnapper had not committed any further crimes, and there had already been close to two months’ time, but even Ling Han, the “number two elite”, had been taken down without any preparations, so who would not feel a chill in their hearts?","Thus, now that the situation had suddenly changed, everyone was extremely nervous.","However, Shi Deze was an elite ranked over 700 on Galaxy Network, after all. He recognized Ling Han with a single glance, and immediately looked pleasantly surprised, as he exclaimed, “It’s Ling Han!”","“What, Ling Han!”","“It really is Ling Han!”","Peng! Immediately afterward, Ling Han also brought the captured men out. However, these people were all pressed together, so it was as if he had plucked out a carrot.","“Huang Liang!”","“Fu Donglin!”","Everyone recognized these men one by one, but there were even more people that they did not recognize, because the Sand Maidens had not targeted them specifically.","These were the people who had been kidnapped.","Not only was Ling Han unscathed, but he had even brought back those who had been captured","by the mysterious kidnapper.","At this moment, everyone was extremely excited.","“Ling Han, what’s going on?” they all asked.","Ling Han had long since prepared his words. He did not reveal the secret of the Sand Maidens, and only said that he did not know the true identity of the culprit either. They were just","human-like figures.","The two sides fought fiercely, and he finally chased off the culprit. He spent a lot of time to finally find the people who had been kidnapped, and caught up to them.","Everyone shook Huang Liang and the others awake again, and asked about the situation.","However, Huang Liang and the others didn’t know what had happened. They only said that they seemed to have had a beautiful dream. In the dream, they had spent a night of pleasure with countless beauties. It was indescribably wonderful.","Ling Han listened intently, shaking his head internally. He couldn’t bring himself to tell them. Otherwise, their beautiful dreams would become nightmares, and they would be traumatized for the rest of their life.","Even so, everyone was still filled with admiration for Ling Han.","You see, they were completely helpless against the mysterious kidnapper, but Ling Han was","able to send him running. This was strength!","Yet Ling Han smiled, and pushed the credit onto Li Zisuan.","When everyone heard this, they all exclaimed in surprise.","That’s right. Ling Han was only the second strongest elite after Li Zisuan, and he was already able to chase away the mysterious kidnapper. Then what if it was Li Zisuan?","“If Brother Li makes a move, then the culprit would definitely be captured without putting up","a fight!”","“That’s right.”","“Unfortunately, he did not make a move on Brother Li. Otherwise, he would be asking for his","own suffering.”","“He must know how powerful Brother Li is, so the culprit didn’t dare to attack Brother Li at","all.”","Everyone praised him one after another, expressing strong praise for Li Zisuan.","Li Zisuan’s expression was filled with pride as he accepted everyone’s praise. However, he was","really about to cry in his heart.","Heavens, it was fortunate that Ling Han had returned. Otherwise, he would really have","collapsed.","“Let’s go,” Ling Han said. “I know how to get out.”","Ling Han led the way, bringing everyone forwards. However, he did not walk in a straight line. Instead, he twisted here and there, as if he was walking randomly.","This caused some people to be displeased, and begin to doubt him.","“Those who disrespect Ling Han are disrespecting me,” Li Zisuan said loudly, appearing very","domineering.","Everyone sighed ruefully. Li Zisuan really trusted Ling Han very much.","However, Li Zisuan knew very well that his current status and reputation were all given to him","by Ling Han. Would he dare not treat Ling Han like a grandfather?","Two days later, a valley appeared ahead of them, enshrouded in white snow.","“He, we have walked out!”","“Haha, we’ve finally walked out!”","Everyone was excited. How long had they been in the desert? All of them had been anxious,","and now that they had finally seen the way out, they were naturally feeling extremely pleased.","“Thanks to Brother Ling’s guidance,” someone said.","“No, it’s all thanks to Brother Li’s leadership.” Someone began to flatter Li Zisuan.","“That’s right. Brother Li is our leader, and all of this is thanks to Brother Li.”","Li Zisuan felt uneasy. He was afraid that Ling Han would be angered, and quit from now on.","Thankfully, Ling Han didn’t care at all.","Ahead of them was... an ice valley."]},{"number":3870,"title":"Chapter 3870: Ice Valley, Ice Tiger","paragraphs":["Chapter 3870: Ice Valley, Ice Tiger","“I wonder what dangers lie ahead.” Someone looked at the ice valley, with a sliver of longing and at the same time, a sliver of worry.","After entering this space, they didn’t obtain any great opportunities, but dangers came one after another, which naturally made some people feel afraid.","Many people nodded in agreement.","Ling Han strode into the valley. Previously, it was still a large desert with bright sun, but after entering into this valley, the temperature dropped abruptly, enough to freeze one into an ice statue.","Starlight Screen spread out, and instantly, all the coldness was blocked outside. Ling Han continued to advance, but every step he took was cautious. Who knew if there was an ice hole here, and if one fell in, he would be consigned to eternal damnation.","Yi, there was no gravity suppression here?","Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, planning to fly by on his Tool.","However, he had just soared into the air, when he saw a cold stream turn into an ice blade that stabbed towards him.","He clenched his hand into a fist and threw a punch. Peng! The ice blade was shattered, but Ling Han’s fist also broke open, bleeding dark red blood.","Shua, shua, shua! More ice blades appeared.","F***","Ling Han hurriedly descended. These ice blades were too terrifying. One of them was enough to make him bleed, and if several of them attacked him at the same time, even he wouldn’t be able to withstand it.","However, once they landed, peace returned to this place.","In other words, if you had the ability, you could completely do as you liked in the skies. You only had to shatter the ice blades. However, if you did not have that ability, you had best just obediently walk on the ground.","Ling Han walked around for a while, and discovered that aside from extreme cold, there were no other frightening traps here.","He turned around to take a look, and couldn’t help but shake his head.","He had the Starlight Screen, so it was naturally no problem for him to walk here. However, for others, this place was no different from hell. The majority of them were shivering from the cold. To say nothing of fighting, it would already be good enough if they could just continue walking like this.","The valley was extremely open, and the further they walked, the wider it became. After walking for more than ten minutes, a team suddenly walked out of a cave in the valley wall.","“Everyone, don’t advance any further,” someone said.","“Why?”","“There’s an ice tiger ahead. It’s a Core Formation Tier, and it’s blocking our path. If we don’t kill it, we’ll be stuck here,” the person on the other side explained.","“Core Formation Tier!”","Everyone was exclaiming in shock. The people here were all Cauldron Forging Tiers, and if they encountered a Core Formation Tier, their only fate would be defeat.","Speaking of which, it was quite coincidental. There was clearly no shortage of Foundation Building Tier and Core Formation Tier cultivators that had entered, so why had they all encountered Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators?","“Brother Shi!” Even more people walked out of the cave. A great many people had recognized Shi Deze, and all of them were incredibly cordial.","He was ranked 700s in the Galaxy Network; it was too awesome.","How could Shi Deze possibly dare to be rash? Hurriedly, he said, “This is Li Zisuan, Brother Li. He is the one who had fought with Lu Qi for 500 rounds! This time, it was all because of Brother Li that we managed to walk out of the desert.”","“What, this is Brother Li!” Everyone was stunned.","Meanwhile, the people on Li Zisuan’s side were all proud, sharing the glory.","Everyone came over to greet him. There was no one here whose rank in the Galaxy Network","was above Shi Deze. Thus, even Shi Deze admitted that he was far inferior to Li Zisuan, so who would dare not be extremely respectful towards Li Zisuan?","“Brother Li, you’re finally here!”","“With you leading the way, we will definitely be able to defeat that ice tiger, and successfully charge over.”","“Brother Li, you take command!”","Everyone spoke one after another, all of them filled with anticipation.","Li Zisuan felt apprehensive. What a joke; he was going to battle with a vicious beast of the Core Formation Tier?","Wasn’t this taking his life?","However, at this moment, how could he back down?","“Everyone, don’t be rash. After all, this is an existence of Core Formation Tier. To say nothing of me, even if Lu Qi was here, he would not dare to be rash.” He used Lu Qi to blow things over again. This signboard was really too useful.","Instantly, everyone nodded. If even Lu Qi did not dare to use force, then they would naturally have to be even more cautious.","“Let’s wait for a while longer. Having more people would increase the power on our side. This way, we can minimize casualties,” Li Zisuan continued.","He was clearly cowering, but in everyone’s ears, this was a display of Li Zisuan’s benevolence and righteousness. Just look, he was actually concerned about everyone’s lives.","“Brother Li, I am impressed!","“Frank and straightforward!”","“Brilliant!”","Everyone was rueful. By now, what other person would have such strong abilities, yet be so kind-hearted?","The various teams talked about how they had traversed the desert. What depressed Li Zisuan and the others was the fact that only they had wasted so much time in the desert. The others had only spent two days at minimum, while at maximum, others had only spent six days to","traverse the desert and arrive here.","What else could be said? It was a matter of luck.","Meanwhile, Ling Han surveyed his surroundings. He wanted to see if he could set up the Three","Elements Treasure Bottle Formation and kill that ice tiger.","However, he was disappointed. The environment here was not suitable for setting up","formations, because this place was within a formation in the first place, and he wanted to","make use of power of heaven and earth further?","This was as difficult as ascending the heavens.","Heavenly Dao Flames?","Ling Han shook his head. He couldn’t think of borrowing the Heavenly Dao Flames whenever","he encountered difficulties. He would become reliant on it, and when the five times of the Heavenly Dao Flames was used up, what else could he rely on?","This was used to save his life.","Then he would just wait. When there were enough of them, he would then attack that ice tiger.","A few days later, teams and lone travelers appeared one after another, but Ling Han did not discover the empress, Hu Niu, Lin Luo, or the large black dog.","In terms of abilities, there were a great many Human Cauldrons and Earth Cauldrons here.","Thus, if it was claimed that the empress and the others were unable to walk here because their abilities were inferior, this seemed to be impossible. At the very least, a few of them could","reach here, right?","Thus, Ling Han was more inclined to believe that there were still many deserts and ice valleys","like this, which had the effect of dividing them up. Otherwise, if all the Cauldron Forging Tiers came, then so what if it was a Core Formation Tier? Even if they saw them, they would have to","flee in fear.","More and more people came, but there was no one that could shake Li Zisuan’s position – even if there came another person ranked in the 400s in the Galaxy Network afterwards. Though he was eager to give it a try, he was more afraid that he would lose to Li Zisuan and embarrass himself, so he chose to keep a low profile.","However, because of his tacit agreement, everyone thought that he was afraid of Li Zisuan.","Hence, a few more ranked in the 200s of the Galaxy Network came later, but all of them chose to tacitly acquiesce to Li Zisuan’s leadership.","In the eyes of others, this was only natural. Being able to battle Lu Qi for 500 rounds, how could it be that his abilities could not be ranked in the top 100 of the Galaxy Network? However, Li Zisuan was constantly worried that his heart would explode. This was taking things too far. Once his true strength was exposed, wouldn’t he be trampled to death? However, it was impossible to stop halfway. At this time, he could only go all the way to the","end.","Yet Ling Han still announced that Li Zisuan’s cultivation level had greatly improved, and even","Lu Qi was no match for him.","There were very few people who believed him. After all, Lu Qi’s reputation was too well- known, and this was proven by the Galaxy Network. However, Li Zisuan almost fainted in fright, and the eyes he directed at Ling Han were filled with resentment.","Brother, do you have to mess with me like this?"]},{"number":3871,"title":"Chapter 3871: Battling Lu Qi again","paragraphs":["Chapter 3871: Battling Lu Qi again","Editor: Henyee Translations","At this moment, the number of people gathered in the ice valley had already exceeded 200, and there were more than 30 people ranked in the top 1000 of the Galaxy Network. This filled everyone with confidence. With such a lineup, they should be able to challenge that ice tiger.","“Brother Li, issue the command!”","“As long as you lead the way, we’ll charge.”","“Brother Li, my saber is already thirsting for blood.”","Everyone shouted.","Li Zisuan really wanted to beat someone up. If he was the leader, they definitely wouldn’t be charging towards victory. Instead, they would be charging straight into the stomach of the ice tiger.","—With his ranking in the Galaxy Network, merely in the 10,000s, wasn’t taking the vanguard just sending himself to his death?","However, as the leader, he naturally had to take the lead. If the strongest person didn’t take the lead, who would be at the front line?","In fact, this was also one of the reasons why those who ranked higher in the Galaxy Network chose to remain silent. This was indeed impressive, but there was also a price to be paid.","Just when Li Zisuan was still racking his brains for a way to refuse, a person suddenly ran over, his face filled with excitement, “Lu Qi is here! Lu Qi is here!”","This was a sentry, and his mission was to welcome those who had walked through the desert.","When everyone heard this, they were all excited.","That was Lu Qi, the super elite ranked nineteenth in the Galaxy Network. If he led a team to charge at the ice tiger, then not only would their chances of success be higher, their casualties would also be lower.","However, Li Zisuan began to shiver.","Oh no, now that the main character had appeared, his lies would naturally be exposed to the world. He would definitely be torn into pieces by countless people who had been deceived.","Everyone went out to receive him. That was Lu Qi, the elite cultivator who was ranked nineteenth in Galaxy Network and ranked in the top five in North Heavenly Realm.","Sure enough, it wasn’t long before Lu Qi was welcomed by the prodigies as if they were stars revolving around the moon.","He wasn’t alone either. Instead, he was leading a team. However, Song Lan wasn’t in the team. It was clear that the people who had entered were in an extremely chaotic state.","“Humph, I have heard that there is someone here that can exchange 500 blows with me.” Lu Qi spoke up, his voice icy cold, “Step out, and let me see. I, Lu Qi, do not remember who would be able to exchange 500 blows with me without losing!”","Li Zisuan was about to cry. What kind of luck did he have? How had he met the real deal so quickly?","He had even planned to deceive them for a while, and then disappear without a trace.","“Lu Qi, are you even worthy of fighting Brother Li?” Ling Han laughed loudly, and shot out like an arrow.","“Ling Han!” Lu Qi’s expression instantly became extremely ugly, and there was an unconcealable killing intent in his eyes.","“You can’t even defeat me, and you still want to fight Brother Li?” Without another word, Ling Han immediately charged over to fight.","Faced with Ling Han, even Lu Qi did not dare to be careless. Hurriedly, he went up to greet him, and at the first instant, unleashed his full battle prowess. Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them went all out, with rolling waves of energy blasting the heavens and earth. The whole valley was swaying, and innumerable accumulated snow was boiling into the skies, creating a terrifying commotion.","However, this valley was really sturdy. Even after being beaten like this by them, it did not collapse.","Everyone was dumbfounded. Lu Qi had actually been blocked.","Hiss!","Then, Li Zisuan should not have lied.","You see, Ling Han said that he was no match for Li Zisuan, and he was able to fight Lu Qi to a stalemate. Then, Li Zisuan naturally had a chance of defeating Lu Qi.","—It was true that they had fought for 500 rounds, and now, it was highly possible that Lu Qi was no match for Li Zisuan.","Misunderstanding, it was really a misunderstanding.","Everyone looked towards Li Zisuan, all of them bearing reverence and lingering fear. They actually dared to doubt Li Zisuan’s strength. And those prodigies ranked in the top two hundred were also sighing endlessly. Thankfully, they had not issued a challenge. Otherwise, they would have long since been beaten to the ground and conquered.","Yi, how could there be such a miraculous turn of events?","Li Zisuan had not expected this either. He was also extremely dumbfounded. It was as if... this bullsh*t had reached a new height. In future, there was no need for him to say anything about battling Lu Qi for 500 rounds. It could completely be claimed that even Lu Qi was no match for him. Just look, everyone here today could be his witnesses.","Then, he looked at Ling Han in horror. Who exactly was this guy? He could even match Lu Qi, so why had he never heard of him on the Galaxy Network?","Li Zisuan was astonished, and so was Lu Qi.","It was not that he had not exchanged blows with Ling Han before, but a few months ago, Ling Han definitely did not have that kind of strength.","Previously, Ling Han could only just barely match him by a bit. If it was not for the fact that the other had an incredibly amazing Spirit Tool, he had full confidence that he could kill Ling Han.","But now, Ling Han already possessed the strength to completely oppose him.","This was too freakish, wasn’t it?","Just how long had passed?","At this rate, before he broke through to the Nine Cauldrons or reached the Core Formation Tier, Ling Han would have already surpassed him and become an elite of Core Formation Tier.","Lu Qi roared in fury, and unleashed a series of amazing moves. Energy surged, and one move was enough to insta-kill a large swathe of Cauldron Forging Tiers. However, in front of Ling Han, even this was not enough.","Ling Han exchanged blows, not falling into a disadvantage at all.","Lu Qi naturally had a trump card, and that was channeling his Innate Divine Physique. This could allow him to possess the battle prowess of a cultivator at the early stage of Core Formation Tier. However, the problem was that Ling Han also had that powerful weapon that he had yet to use. It was completely capable of resisting his natural Mystical Power.","After several hundred more exchanges, Lu Qi could only stop reluctantly.","He had to admit that the present Ling Han was completely capable of matching him. There was no meaning to continue the battle.","Unless he could obtain a great fortune, capture the celestial light, and cultivate a supreme divine light. He was sure that even Ling Han would not be able to withstand the might of a single slash.","Ling Han didn’t press his advantage. Instead, he shook his head and said, “Lu Qi, be more modest in the future. How can you possibly be a match for Brother Li?”","The matter was very simple. Ling Han and Lu Qi were evenly matched, and Ling Han was no match for Li Zisuan. In that case, Lu Qi was naturally no match for Li Zisuan either.","Everyone nodded, and the gazes they directed at Li Zisuan were filled with strong reverence and admiration.","Just look, he had been provoked by Lu Qi previously, yet Li Zisuan did not say a word about it. Just how broad-minded was he?","Lu Qi almost spat out a mouthful of blood.","F***, he had never seen that so-called Li Zisuan before, so how could they have fought for 500 moves?","He suddenly understood. This was f****** Ling Han deliberately causing trouble for him.","Most importantly, this move was really effective.","Even if he said that Li Zisuan was no match for him now, who would believe him?","They would only say that he was a sore loser!","Depressing, this was too depressing.","Lu Qi wanted to kill Li Zisuan on the spot, and everything would naturally be clear. However, Ling Han was standing by Li Zisuan’s side, clearly protecting this person.","If he made a move, Ling Han would definitely make a move as well. That would be the same irresolvable situation as before.","‘Motherf*cker!’","An elite like Lu Qi would not even bother to curse, but now, he really wanted to curse all eighteen generations of Ling Han’s ancestors.","Why are you so mean?","“Brother Li, now that we have such supreme elites like you, Brother Ling, and Brother Lu, it should be enough to attack that ice tiger!” someone said.","The current Li Zisuan was naturally filled with confidence.. Immediately, he waved his hand, “Let’s go!”"]},{"number":3872,"title":"Chapter 3872: Joint Attack on the Ice Tiger","paragraphs":["Chapter 3872: Joint Attack on the Ice Tiger","Everyone set out, preparing to challenge that ice tiger that was in the Core Formation Tier.","Lu Qi was considerably displeased.","Of course, he would go and battle that ice tiger, but he should definitely be the leader, not like now, when he had actually become someone’s lackey.","Thus, his expression was dark the entire time.","They arrived at the end of the valley, and sure enough, there was a massive fierce tiger standing guard there. It was completely snow-white, and with a breath, a cold wind instantly howled.","This was a vicious beast of Core Formation Tier that had blocked their path.","Seeing this group of people walk over, that fierce beast only cast a lazy look at them, and did not stand up to attack them. As if it had not seen them at all, it lowered its head again.","“This beast can’t pursue us. There’s a formation blocking it,” someone said.","Some people had already challenged this ice tiger at the beginning, and they were naturally defeated. Now, there were still a few corpses that had been frozen into ice sculptures lying there, looking like they were about to flee, but they had long since been covered in ice.","“Brothers, attack with me!” Li Zisuan roared. He felt too good now, as if he had become a Great General, commanding an invincible army.","In truth, though there were only over 200 of them, there was no shortage of Galaxy Network’s top 1000. Which one of them was not one of the strongest in their own galaxy, and it was not too much to call them an invincible army.","Perhaps, in future, there would be a few Venerate Tier elites among them, or even a Saint among them. Then, Li Zisuan would really be able to boast for the rest of his life.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said to Lu Qi, “How about it? Do you want to compete again?” “Compete in what?” Lu Qi naturally would not cower.","“Who would cause more damage to that ice tiger?” Ling Han asked.","“Humph, if you unleash that invincible flame, how am I supposed to compete with you?” Lu Qi asked coldly.","Ling Han smiled and said, “I promise I won’t use it.”","“All right!” Lu Qi nodded. He naturally did not think that he would lose to Ling Han, no matter which aspect he was in.","The two of them charged at the forefront, and seeing these two fierce people charge at the forefront, the others’ confidence naturally increased greatly. They roared repeatedly, and followed closely behind.","“Die!”","Everyone roared loudly, their voices reverberating, their might extremely great.","Only then did the ice tiger stand up. With a shake of its body, a powerful aura spread out, chilling to the bone.","Everyone couldn’t help but shiver. They suddenly realized that this was a Core Formation Tier-level vicious beast, not a Cauldron Forging Tier-level one. Instantly, a considerable number of people felt fear rise up in their hearts.","Ling Han humphed, and spat out a golden sword. He was the first to attack.","The ice tiger was disdainful, and opened its mouth as well. Instantly, a burst of cold air gushed out. Pa, the golden sword was wrapped, and condensed into layers of ice. It suddenly dropped down from midair, shattering into pieces on the ground, turning back into Metal Element energy, which returned to the heaven and earth.","Lu Qi smirked coldly. He drew out a long silver whip. Shua, he lashed out with the whip, and the whip stretched out endlessly, lashing out at the ice tiger.","Pa, this whip landed on the ice tiger’s body.","Without waiting for Lu Qi to show an expression of delight, he saw that there was ice attacking from one end of the whip, spreading out towards him through the whip at an astonishing speed.","He hurriedly shouted loudly, and divine light flickered on the silver whip. Then, he rapidly retreated.","The combined attack of the two supreme prodigies had failed, and they were completely at a disadvantage in front of this ice tiger.","As expected of a fierce beast on the level of Core Formation Tier. In terms of level, it completely overwhelmed the Cauldron Forging Tier.","Everyone moved one after another, but none of them dared to rush close enough. They all attacked from afar.","Peng, peng, peng! Energy continued to explode from the ice tiger’s body, but no attack could penetrate its defense.","However, this seemed to have angered it. The ice tiger stared at the masses, and suddenly opened its mouth. Shua, a cold stream sprayed out, surging rapidly towards the masses.","Everyone hurriedly dodged. As the cold stream surged past, there were still two people who had not managed to dodge in time, and were forcefully turned into ice statues.","“There’s still life force.”","“Quick, carry them to the side, and immediately melt the layer of ice with fire energy. There should still be hope.”","These two people were carried to one side, and naturally, there were people that were proficient in fire-element energy that moved to save them, while the others continued to attack the ice tiger.","Ling Han gave a loud shout, and the Great Overarching Heaven Technique was used. He fully displayed the secret technique of Venerate Tier-level. Every move, style, punch and palm strike had boundless might.","Lu Qi was not outdone either. At present, he was not in the mood for internal strife either. He had to defeat the ice tiger to pass the test, and he alone could not deal with it. He had to join","forces with Ling Han.","Since that was the case, just like the previous agreement, let’s see whose battle prowess was stronger, and see who could cause greater damage to the ice tiger.","Their battle prowess definitely couldn’t be underestimated. If they were allowed to unleash their full power, even those at the early stage of Core Formation would have a headache. Thus, after the ice tiger was hit a few times, a great amount of fur instantly fell off.","However, this was still unable to enrage the ice tiger, and it still maintained its original rhythm of attack.","Ling Han was surprised. This didn’t make sense. As a fierce beast, why did it have the word “fierce” in its name?","That was because they only had the nature of beasts, but did not have intelligence. They were cruel and domineering.","He had been blasted to the point that his fur had fallen off quite a bit, and he actually still did","not have any temper?","Yi!","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. Could it be that this ice tiger wasn’t a genuine ferocious beast? Could it be that it was just an empty shell? Perhaps it was actually a puppet controlled","by the formation?","This was very possible. Only then could it explain why it had been standing guard here all this","while.","However, being able to guess the truth didn’t mean that he could end the battle. Ling Han attacked with his full strength, trying to cause the most damage to the ice tiger.","On the other side, Lu Qi also couldn’t help but use a powerful move.","His figure suddenly enlarged, even surpassing this ice tiger. Then, with a palm strike, all the accumulated snow in the valley was sent flying into the skies.","“Virtuous Wisdom Heavenly Mountain Palm!”","Multiple veined patterns lit up on that massive palm, intertwining to form incredibly","complex seals. It was as if they had been boosted with some kind of powerful power, and","could penetrate heaven and earth with a single strike.","He used the power of his bloodline, and this battle prowess directly soared to the early stage","of Core Formation Tier.","Boom, this palm strike descended, and the heaven and earth swayed.","The ice tiger roared in fury, and sent a palm strike into the skies.","Peng!","Its colossal body instantly sank downwards, and was forcefully pressed onto the ground.","“All right!” Everyone exclaimed in shock. Lu Qi was truly powerful. He had actually been able to defeat a vicious beast of the Core Formation Tier! Just how powerful was his power?","However, his handsomeness only lasted for three seconds. Lu Qi’s face immediately paled, and it was as if his body had been emptied, rapidly shrinking in size.","However, the ice tiger shook its body, and stood back up. There were a few more injuries on its body, and it had lost a lot of fur, but it did not suffer any serious injuries.","After all, he was a Core Formation Tier, so how could he possibly be severely wounded by an attack of early stage Core Formation Tier?","The ice tiger set its eyes on Lu Qi. It seemed to know that he was a great threat, and wanted to","kill him.","It charged out, but Ling Han still charged forwards. Using the Three Styles of the God of War,","his battle prowess instantly soared to a new height.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He barely managed to parry the ice tiger, but even if he used the Three Styles of the God of War, he was still no match for the ice tiger. He was blasted back repeatedly."]},{"number":3873,"title":"Chapter 3873: Taken Down","paragraphs":["Chapter 3873: Taken Down","After three moves, Ling Han hurriedly stepped aside.","This was like three axe strokes. After using it, he could only fall into a disadvantage.","Thankfully, Lu Qi also approached, and took over the position of Ling Han’s position as the main force, clashing head-on with the ice tiger.","But there was a gap of a major tier in cultivation level. Even if he was Eight Cauldrons, so what? In a head-on confrontation, he had only blocked two to three moves, and his whole body was trembling, as if his blood was about to freeze.","Ling Han charged forwards, and continued to exchange blows with the ice tiger.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The others also moved, blasting towards the ice tiger. They couldn’t just let Ling Han and Lu Qi go all out, right?","Ling Han released a battle cry. He channelled out the Demonic Monkey Fists.","This was his strongest technique at this moment. Once he channeled it, his entire aura was different. It was as if a Great Emperor had revived, exuding an endless aura.","Lu Qi’s eyes involuntarily turned cold. Though Ling Han’s attack was aimed at the ice tiger, it still gave him tremendous pressure.","If Ling Han’s punch was aimed at him, would he be able to block it?","-He had to use the power of his bloodline, or he would definitely be severely injured.","He inhaled sharply. As powerful as he was, he was actually forced to use his Natural Mystical Power to oppose a fist technique. Just how inconceivable was this?","Then how many more punches would his opponent throw?","No, no, no. With such a terrifying fist technique, Ling Han definitely wouldn’t be able to -channel more than a few punches.","Boom!","This punch landed on the ice tiger, and directly sent the ice tiger flying, showing an incomparably terrifying might.","However, after this punch, the ice tiger immediately got up and shook its body, as if it had not sustained any injuries.","F***, this was really too hard to deal with. He had already used an Imperial Technique and a Natural Mystical Power was also used, yet this guy was still completely unscathed.","However, what could he do? He could only continue.","Everyone continued to attack, blasting madly at the ice tiger, wanting to exhaust this fierce beast to death with the advantage of numbers.","Hu! Hu! Hu!","Cold winds swept over, and the ice tiger was extremely impressive. As long as anyone was hit by its cold currents, they would definitely be frozen solid. They had to save the person at the first instant, or they would definitely die.","Thankfully, this was not a fatal blow, so everyone was able to hold on, and there was no serious loss of members. A great many people had their ice melted, and continued to join the battle.","Li Zisuan took the position of battle commander again. He distributed the manpower, and had everyone split into several groups to charge. The people with the weakest abilities was responsible for thawing the ice. Otherwise, they might be frozen the moment they advanced. Not only would they not be able to help, they would even be a hindrance.","-If it was someone else commanding, who would listen? Who here was not proud and arrogant?","However, Li Zisuan was an existence that was superior to Lu Qi, so his words naturally convinced the masses.","Hu!","A cold breeze swept by. Though Ling Han had the Starlight Screen protecting him, it instantly shattered in front of the cold breeze. He could clearly sense that the blood in his body was instantly frozen.","He immediately channelled the Heavenly Dao Flames. Boom, a flame swept past, and the blood in his body revived, beginning to flow again.","It took him at least ten seconds to completely recover.","Sigh, the attacks of a Core Formation Tier were truly terrifying.","“Ling Han, hurry up and block him!” Lu Qi urged. He had actually managed to block him for","ten seconds all by himself, and he had almost died.","“It’s only a mere ten seconds, and you can’t hold up to it?” Ling Han asked calmly.","“Of course, why don’t you try blocking ten seconds?” Lu Qi humphed.","That was a Core Formation Tier, not some random nobody.","Ling Han smiled and summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to greet the ice tiger.","One, two, three... ten, eleven, twelve.","Ling Han easily survived 10 seconds. With the protection of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, as well as the second layer of defense from the Starlight Screen, it was no big deal for Ling Han to last for more than 10 seconds under the attack of the ice tiger.","Lu Qi was rendered speechless. Who asked Ling Han to possess such a precious tool, while he did not?","Everyone gritted their teeth and fought a tough battle. Though there was only one opponent, he was too strong.","Half a day, one day, two days!","Everyone was persisting, and by the second day, they could clearly feel that the power of the ice tiger was waning. Compared to the first day, it was much weaker.","However, because they had taken turns fighting, they had a certain amount of time to recover their mystical power. Thus, the situation was naturally much better.","The key was Ling Han and Lu Qi.","That was because neither of them could be missing. They would definitely have to be on the front lines. Whichever one of them could not hold on, it would cause the entire team to","crur","in instant.","The problem was, they didn’t have the time to rest.","Ling Han was unconcerned. His mystical power was endless. To say nothing of a day, even a year and a half wouldn’t be a problem, but it was a different story for Lu Qi. Though he was the super genius ranked 19th in the Galaxy Network, with mystical power that definitely surpassed the average Cauldron Forging Tier, in a high-intensity confrontation with a vicious beast of Core Formation Tier, the expenditure of mystical power was also astonishing..","He could barely hold on any longer.","Sure enough, after battling for a while longer, Lu Qi retreated to the side. If he continued to fight, that would simply be courting death.","F***.","Ling Han couldn’t help but curse. He could retreat, but he would have to inform him in advance. Now, the ice tiger’s attack was instantly pressing down on him, and he almost","couldn’t withstand it.","What a vile character, not forgetting to screw him over even at a time like this.","-If he could use this ice tiger to kill Ling Han, that would be a great thing for Lu Qi.","Ling Han resisted with all his might. With the boost from the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, he had a certain amount of capital to resist this fierce beast. After all, there were still 200 people behind him. Furthermore, the battle prowess of the ice tiger had also decreased","greatly.","However, he would not allow Lu Qi to be so at ease either. He drew the ice tiger closer and closer to Lu Qi, wanting to drag the latter into the battle as well.","In this manner, Lu Qi naturally did not have the time to recover properly. He had no choice but to move, and continuously dodged.","Thankfully, the pressure on this ice tiger was even greater. It had been madly bombarded by over 200 Cauldron Forging Tiers all this while. So what if it was a Core Formation Tier? It was riddled with wounds, and blood had dyed its white fur red.","After battling for a while longer, this fierce beast finally collapsed loudly, and could no longer stand up.","Everyone breathed a long sigh of relief. This fierce battle was really arduous, but in the end, it","ended with their victory.","Ling Han’s eyes suddenly turned, and focused on Lu Qi.","‘Die!’","He leaped out, and charged towards Lu Qi.","“Ling Han, are you planning on kicking me to the curb after I’ve outlived my usefulness?” Lu","Qi was both shocked and furious.","“Hehe, you have the face to say these words?” Ling Han smirked coldly, and punched out","furiously with both fists.","Lu Qi hurriedly parried, but he had been continuously disturbed by Ling Han previously, and had not been able to recover much at all. Very soon, he was on the back foot.","He was both furious and shocked. They had both experienced a bloody battle, so why was Ling Han’s battle prowess still so powerful? It didn’t seem like it had weakened at all.","How was this possible?","However, under Ling Han’s barrage of attacks, it was becoming more and more difficult for","him to rival Ling Han.","If this continued, he would definitely be blasted into smithereens. “What are you all standing around for? Come and help me!” Lu Qi roared furiously at the","masses. They had worked together to kill a vicious beast of the Core Formation Tier, so there","was naturally no problem for them to defeat Ling Han as well. “No one is allowed to make a move!” Li Zisuan suddenly spoke up."]},{"number":3874,"title":"Chapter 3874: Splitting up","paragraphs":["Chapter 3874: Splitting up","The present Li Zisuan had astonishingly high prestige.","Thus, once he spoke, who would dare make a move?","Lu Qi was practically mad with fury. This guy, who in his eyes was only an ant, had actually become the last straw that would crush him to death!","This was practically a great humiliation.","Li Zisuan looked at Lu Qi, his heart beating wildly. There was a kind of fear in his heart, as well as an indescribable excitement.","Though he had been boasting all this while, saying that the battle in which he was disfigured had been so glorious, in truth, he naturally hated Lu Qi in his heart. Who would want a handsome face to become so hideous? However, he had previously known that he and Lu Qi were from two completely different worlds, and there was not the slightest possibility that he could get his revenge, so he could only suppress his fury at the bottom of his heart.","But now that the opportunity had come, he resolutely grabbed it, and it had become the last straw that broke the camel’s back.","He looked at Lu Qi, completely unconcerned about the murderous look in his eyes, and felt a kind of pleasure from revenge.","Lu Qi was truly filled with grief. He was one of the top five prodigies in the Cauldron Forging Tier in the North Heavenly Realm. However, he hadn’t even completed the first stage, and he would already be giving up?","But if he didn’t give up, how could it be that he would lose his life here?","Lu Qi was also a resolute person. He stared at Ling Han and said, “I’ll remember this!”","He crushed the token, and instantly, a ray of light wrapped around him, disappearing in a flash.","He was gone.","-He had been teleported out of the Mystery Realm.","Unfortunately, he had not managed to kill him.","Ling Han sighed upon seeing this. However, this didn’t matter. He had ruined a great opportunity for Lu Qi this time, so he would let him stew in his depression for a while. When he left this place in the future, he would just kill him.","Everyone looked at Ling Han with reverence.","This was a fair battle. In fact, Ling Han and the ice tiger had battled for a longer time, and Lu Qi was outmatched. There was no excuse at all.","Of course, if Li Zisuan had not interfered, and there was someone who could help Lu Qi, the situation would definitely be different. At the very least, it would not be difficult for him to act as cover for Lu Qi’s retreat.","However, it was too late to talk about this now. The result was that Ling Han was still here, and Lu Qi had already been sent out of the Mystery Realm.","“Let’s go.”","Everyone continued onwards, and very soon, the matter of Lu Qi had been pushed to the back of their minds. Everyone was naturally concerned about themselves.","Behind the ice valley was the Weapon Mountains.","This was a mountain range that was filled with weapons, and after crossing this mountain range, one would be able to enter into the true White Lotus Mystery Realm, and seek out the heaven-defying great fortune.","Everyone began to climb the mountain. This naturally wasn’t difficult. Although there was a super gravity field here that prevented flight, climbing the mountain was naturally no problem at all.","Weng, right at this moment, everyone felt the mountain tremble slightly, and then all the weapons were shaking.","This time, everyone did not dare move, and looked guarded.","In this Mystery Realm, where was it safe?","Xiu, a broken sword suddenly broke away from the mountain, and slashed towards the person beside it.","What, a weapon that had no one controlling it could still kill on its own?","That person hurriedly brandished his weapon to parry. With a ding, he was instantly sent backwards. At first, his face was flushed red, which quickly turned pale.","Xiu, even more weapons left the mountain, and began a massacre.","At this moment, everyone could barely take care of themselves.","“Don’t panic. Everyone, stand together,” Li Zisuan said loudly. By now, he was getting more and more accustomed to his new role.","Everyone approached each other. In this way, only those in the outermost circle needed to battle, while the others could rest, and then take their turns.","They advanced slowly. These weapons seemed to want to throw them off the mountain, making every step forward extremely difficult for them.","Ling Han walked in front. He didn’t need to go all out. These weapons didn’t pose much of a threat to him, and what interested him was the formations here. They could actually control weapons to kill.","Oh, that’s right. The ice tiger from before was indeed not a fierce beast, but rather a mechanical beast that had been constructed from formations. However, it was too life-like, and no flaw could be seen from its appearance at all. In fact, it had flesh and blood. Everyone slowly advanced. Originally, these people were all proud prodigies, so they were naturally unruly and intractable, but now under the leadership of Li Zisuan, they had all united and faced the difficulties together.","This stage was not too difficult. Half a day later, they finally walked out of this area. Ahead of them, there was a massive plain. The grass was light, and just barely reached the instep of their feet.","Finally, they had entered the second stage of the White Lotus Mystery Realm.","Everyone was overjoyed. This meant that an astonishing opportunity could appear at any time, allowing their strength to increase several times in an instant.","“Thank you for taking care of me all the way, Brother Li. However, now that we’re here, it’s time for us to part ways.”","“Brother Li, the green mountains never change, and the waters flow forever. We’ll meet again","in the future.”","“Brother Li, farewell.”","Everyone left one after another. If they stayed together, who would the fateful opportunity that appeared belong to? Who would be able to compete with Li Zisuan?","Li Zisuan also breathed a sigh of relief. He was really afraid that he would reach a point that he could not resolve in future because of his boasting.","Thus, everyone could be considered to have broken up peacefully.","“Brother Ling, you’re leaving too?” Li Zisuan saw that Ling Han was also walking forwards,","and couldn’t help but speak up.","Ling Han smiled, “What is it? Do you still want me to continue being your lackey?”","“I wouldn’t dare! I wouldn’t dare!” Li Zisuan hurriedly smiled apologetically. This person was","the real fierce one, who had sent Lu Qi out of the Mystery Realm.","At first, he had wanted to bask in Ling Han’s glory again, but when he thought about it, it was indeed embarrassing enough.","“Brother Ling, I’ll remember your kindness. I’ll definitely repay you in the future,” he said","seriously.","Ling Han nodded, and said, “All right.”","Who knows, Li Zisuan might surprise him in the future.","Ling Han smiled, and strode off.","After walking for a short while, Ling Han discovered that this place was brimming with life.","There were herds of cows, goats, and deer grazing, as well as lions, panthers, and wild dogs hunting here. Goshawks flew by in the skies, also looking for prey.","After walking for a while, a village appeared ahead of him.","Yi?","Ling Han strode over, and saw that a wall made of wood had been built outside the village, and there were also a great many sharpened pieces of wood stabbed into the wall. This should be used to resist the invasion of wild beasts.","When Ling Han came closer, he saw multiple people emerge above the wall. They were all holding bows and arrows, aimed straight at him.","Ling Han smiled, raised his hands, and said, “I have no malicious intent.”","“Who are you, and where have you come from?” someone asked. This was an old man, and only he did not wield a bow and arrow. Instead, he was holding onto a walking stick. Ling Han was just about to speak, yet he suddenly paused and turned around to look behind","him.","In a short while, a large group of wild dogs came in a pack, and there were at least over a hundred of them.","This kind of scale was very frightening. Probably, any lion that was left alone would have to turn around and run when it saw them, and only a pride of lions could stand against them.","“Not good, the wild dogs are here!”","“Prepare for defense!”","The people in this village appeared very nervous, as if a great calamity was about to befall","them.","The herd of wild dogs had already rushed over, and targeted Ling Han at the first instant.","He was really too conspicuous."]},{"number":3875,"title":"Chapter 3875: Lightning High Priest","paragraphs":["Chapter 3875: Lightning High Priest","Over a hundred wild dogs rushed forwards, all of them baring their teeth, drooling, appearing very malevolent.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and an aura swept out. Pa, pa, pa! Over a hundred wild dogs all collapsed.","What, it was settled?","The people on the wall all looked stunned, finding it hard to believe.","This was too shocking. The wild dogs that were like demons in their eyes actually collapsed all","at once.","What had happened?","They looked at Ling Han. Though they did not know exactly what had happened, no matter how they thought about it, it must be related to this man.","Someone mustered up the courage to come out, and circled around the herd of wild dogs. Then, they became even more stunned.","“They’re all dead,” he said.","It wasn’t long before the villagers all rushed over and surrounded Ling Han. It was as if they were looking at a god.","“Lord!” These villagers all fell to their knees, “How could it be that you are the Priest from Karish?”","What the hell?","Ling Han pretended to be profound. With a wave of his hand, he led the way into the village.","Everyone hurriedly followed, falling behind by three to four positions, appearing to be extremely reverent.","After entering the village, Ling Han discovered that there was a flight of steps on the inside of the wall. These people were standing on the steps just now.","However, everything was too primitive. Previously, the wild dogs were not vicious beasts, but rather wild beasts that could not be any more ordinary. Furthermore, not one of the villagers here was a cultivator, so they could not even defeat ordinary wild dogs.","Ling Han began to probe for information, and soon found out what he needed to know.","The villagers here had lived here for generations, and their main livelihood was hunting and rearing livestock, and their greatest enemy was the carnivores on the grassland.","There were many other villages like theirs on this large grassy plain, but there were territories demarcated among them. Unless they encountered an especially great calamity, they would not enter into each other’s territory.","Every once in a while, they would go to Karish to trade for some salt and medicine.","Karish, a town. There was a powerful Priest there, who could stimulate the lightning in the skies to execute evil people. It was also because of this that Karish had also developed from a small village into a small town, a trading platform for exchanging resources for various villages. It was also the Holy Land in the hearts of all the villagers.","To the villagers, if they could migrate to Karish, they would not have to live in fear every day, because with a large-scale invasion of wild beasts, it was possible that their homes would be gone.","A thought suddenly flashed in Ling Han’s head. To stimulate the lightning in the skies to kill? Was that a cultivator?","After he understood the situation in more detail, he set out towards Karish.","In a mere two hours, Ling Han arrived at the Holy Land in the hearts of the people of this grassy plain.","The structures were built next to the water, forming a small town. It was really not very big, and looked to contain only a few hundred households.","However, compared to the village, this place could already be considered a large place. Ling Han had already changed into the attire of a villager from the plains. He quietly blended in, planning to first test out the strength of that High Priest, not wanting to alert him.","That high priest was respectfully addressed as the Lightning High Priest. His real name could not be distinguished. It had been almost twenty years since he had become the High Priest, and he was living in the most luxurious manor in the town.","Of course, this mansion was only in relative terms. In this place, it could be called a mansion, but in the outside world, it could only be considered ordinary.","He released his divine sense and scanned the mansion.","Yi, he did not discover any cultivators. Everyone’s life force was very weak, as if they were ordinary people.","Could it be that the High Priest was not here?","Or could it be that the other was too strong, that he could not sense him at all?","Ling Han thought for a moment, then decided to be more cautious. He took out the Void Beast","hide and put it on, concealing his figure. Then, he snuck into the mansion.","He soon discovered a middle-aged man who was almost fifty years old. He had a big belly,","and he was dressed in colorful clothes, appearing extremely exaggerated.","In the manor, everyone was incredibly respectful towards this middle-aged man. In fact, they were extremely reverent towards him.","Yi, could it be that he was the Lightning High Priest?","Ling Han activated his eye technique to take a closer look. This was clearly a mortal.","How could a mortal stimulate lightning to kill?","Ling Han put away the Void Beast hide, and strode towards the middle-aged man.","“Who are you?”","“How did you get in?”","There were many servants here, and when they saw Ling Han suddenly appear, they were all shocked, and began to question him. However, though they were shocked, not one of them","was afraid.","That was because their Master was the Lightning High Priest, and was the representative of the gods in this world.","“So you are the Lightning High Priest?” Ling Han looked at the middle-aged man.","“Since you know who I am, hurry up and kneel!” the middle-aged man shouted, a hint of displeasure on his face.","Yi, this guy was really the Lightning High Priest?","Ling Han smiled faintly, “What right does a mere mortal have to be called an envoy of gods?”","The middle-aged man was furious, and pointed a finger at Ling Han. Zi, instantly, a bolt of lightning shot out, like a divine light, blasting towards Ling Han.","Interesting.","Ling Han stretched out a hand to grab it, and this bolt of lightning fell into his hand. After flickering for a while, it completely lost its lustre.","Pu!","The middle-aged man looked as if he had seen a ghost. How was this possible?","The surefire lightning was actually grabbed in someone’s hand, and the other party was","completely unscathed!","Ling Han was also curious, and said, “You’re only a mortal, yet you’re able to unleash Cauldron Forging Tier-level lightning energy. It’s clear that you possess a precious tool. However, what kind of Spirit Tool can actually be controlled by a mortal?”","The middle-aged man didn’t completely understand Ling Han’s words, but he knew what he meant. Ling Han had seen through him.","He couldn’t help but touch the ring on his finger, then pointed at Ling Han, “Those who disrespect the gods, I shall sentence you to extreme punishment!”","Zi, another bolt of lightning struck over.","Ling Han casually grabbed it, and extinguished the lightning again.","He strode forward, closing in on the middle-aged man.","This time, to say nothing of the middle-aged man, all the servants were also shocked beyond","belief.","Was this a demon that walked on the mortal plane? Otherwise, how could it be that even the envoy of the gods and the Lightning High Priest could do nothing against him?","The middle-aged man pointed repeatedly at Ling Han. One after another, bolts of lightning shot out, but their might was getting weaker and weaker.","Ling Han walked over and grabbed the middle-aged man in a single move. Then, he removed","the ring.","However, this ring was very ordinary.","With a thought from Ling Han, he opened the ornamental bead on the ring, and saw that there","was a stone the size of a grain of rice inside. It was completely dark blue in colour, and was entwined with the light of lightning.","Zi, the power of lightning struck over, causing Ling Han’s palm to go numb. He almost couldn’t hold this small rock.","However, after he activated the Starlight Screen, the power of lightning couldn’t affect him","anymore.","It was this thing that allowed the middle-aged man to unleash the power of lightning.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “Come, explain this to me.”"]},{"number":3876,"title":"Chapter 3876: Celestial light?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3876: Celestial light?","Seeing that Ling Han could hold that peculiar stone in his hand, the so-called Lightning High Priest was already dumbfounded, astounded.","He knew that he was an imposter, but Ling Han’s performance completely matched the characteristics of a god.","He hurriedly said, “Exalted Immortal, I’ll tell you everything you want to know.”","As expected, he revealed all his secrets without reservations.","More than 20 years ago, he was still an ordinary villager, living the same life as the others. However, he was a very ambitious person, and was unwilling to accept this kind of mediocre lifestyle. Thus, he left the village, wanting to take a look at the end of the great grassy plain.","He walked out of the grassy plains and arrived at a valley. At night, he inadvertently saw the flicker of lightning. Driven by curiosity, he went over to check on the situation, and discovered that there were presently a great many people mining.","According to him, these people were all strong men. With a single hoe, they could forcefully peel off the mountain rock, and he had tried later. Even if he tried his best, he would still need half a day to dig off a corner.","He didn’t dare to move recklessly, and simply watched.","These people dug out the stones, loaded them onto carts, and pulled away one cart after another.","After dawn, he followed the tracks of those carts, and he discovered a rock that was imbued with the power of lightning.","This should have fallen off the cart, and was slightly smaller than a fist.","He unexpectedly discovered that there was a kind of thick leaf that could block the power of lightning. Thus, he wrapped this leaf around the rock. After a long period of study, he discovered that the power of lightning in this rock could be guided out through a special method. Hence, he knocked out a small bit and stored it in a ring.","Thus, in a transformation, he had become the Lightning High Priest, and could use the power of lightning to kill.","Ling Han was astonished. A lightning-aligned ore?","Was there such a thing?","He believed that this person had not lied. Thus, the Lightning Stone should be a specialty of this place.","Ling Han carefully examined the Lightning Stone. Because it had already been used for more than 20 years, the stone that was the size of a fist at that time was now less than the size of a finger the power of lightning was not endless.","He couldn’t help but think that if someone could stimulate all the power of lightning in here all at once, the might would probably be able to reach Four Cauldrons, Five Cauldrons or even stronger.","And this was only the size of a finger. What if it was the size of a human head, or even the size of a mountain?","If they were hit, then would even a True Self Tier collapse?","The miners that this “Lightning High Priest” had seen should be cultivators. Thus, it was not that there were no cultivators here, but the people here had not embarked on the path of cultivation.","Ling Han questioned the High Priest in detail, then set out.","At that time, the Lightning High Priest had walked for a whole half year’s time, but Ling Han had only run for over an hour, and he had already walked out of the grassy plains. A continuous stretch of green mountains appeared ahead of him.","So many years had passed, and the memories of the Lightning High Priest definitely had a certain degree of error. Thus, Ling Han was not in a rush either. He began to run in the mountains, searching for the location of that mine.","It shouldn’t be difficult to find, because the traces of mining were very obvious.","Half an hour later, Ling Han saw people digging rocks in the distance.","These people... were all only at the mortal level.","Ling Han did not go over. He began to study the stones here.","Indeed, this whole mountain was filled with the power of lightning. If he could guide it according to power of heaven and earth, then constructing a killing formation of lightning would not be difficult. It would not be difficult to kill even a Core Formation Tier.","Ling Han dug out a few rocks to examine, and saw that though every rock carried the power of lightning, there was a difference in strength.","If it was weaker, it would probably take half a day, and the power of lightning would disappear completely. However, even the stronger stones were not as strong as the piece that the Lightning High Priest had obtained. Looks like that guy had really gotten lucky. Coincidentally, a high quality lightning-aligned ore had fallen, and he had picked it up.","How had these lightning-aligned ores been formed?","Ling Han was filled with curiosity. He began to dig a hole, heading towards the center of the mountain.","It was very easy to judge where the power of lightning was strongest, and where the core was.","He was too powerful, forcibly digging out a passage, and storing the stones he dug into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","He could not store them into a Spatial Spirit Tool. At the beginning, Ling Han had indeed done so, but the power of lightning immediately penetrated the Spatial Spirit Tool.","Yi, could this kind of ore be used as an energy source for the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, allowing the Imperial Weapon to explode with even greater might?","With this thought, Ling Han immediately wanted to carry out an experiment, but he hurriedly suppressed the urge. If he were to experiment here, it was possible that he would be buried alive, or even alert those miners.","The miners, on the other hand, did not take Ling Han to heart. More importantly, what level was the force behind them?","Ling Han continued to advance. He continued to venture deeper, but this vein of ore was astonishingly huge. Furthermore, it even guided Ling Han underground.","The source of the power of lightning came from underground?","Ling Han continued downwards. A whole two days had passed, and he had already penetrated more than 50km deep into the ground.","This was an ore layer, after all, and with the power of lightning wreaking havoc, Ling Han’s speed was naturally greatly affected.","Yi?","When Ling Han advanced a few more feet, his whole person suddenly dropped down.","He had actually entered into an underground river, and what was running in the underground","river was blazing white lightning.","Ling Han was shocked, and hurriedly used the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to expel streaks of Primal Chaos Qi. This power of lightning was too terrifying. At least, it was on the level of Core Formation Tier.","Zi!","Lightning flashed madly. Even with the protection of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, Ling Han’s skin was still charred and crisp from the lightning. He hurriedly leaped back into the tunnel from before.","With this one move, half of his body was charred black, exuding waves of meaty fragrance.","F***, he had almost been screwed over.","Ling Han stuck his head out of the hole, and observed this underground lightning river.","He would go upstream.","He immediately came to a decision, and put it into action.","Every time he advanced, he would dig through the rocks to see if the lightning river was","below. Just like that, Ling Han slowly dug forward. In the blink of an eye, five days had passed.","Five days later, he looked downwards as usual. Yi, he actually saw the end.","The source of the lightning river... was actually a streak of light!","A ray of light turned into a lightning river, and the lightning river affected the entire mountain, causing the rocks to be tainted with the power of lightning, turning into","lightning-aligned ores?","Hiss, this light was too powerful, wasn’t it?","Hold on.","Ling Han’s heart suddenly thumped against his chest. Could it be that this was the legendary","celestial light?","If this thing could be fused into the Celestial Cauldron, then with a strike, what would not be","severed?","But the problem was, with such terrifying celestial light – if this was really celestial light, how could it be stored into the Celestial Cauldron?","Merely the lightning river it manifested was already so terrifying, so how powerful would its","own destructive power be?","Even if he could absorb it into his body, wouldn’t that be like inviting a wolf into his house","and instantly killing him?","What should he do?","Should he take it or not?","If he was going to retrieve it, how could he do so?"]},{"number":3877,"title":"Chapter 3877: Refining the Light of Lightning","paragraphs":["Chapter 3877: Refining the Light of Lightning","Regardless of whether that streak of light was a celestial light or not, Ling Han was determined to get to the bottom of this.","He dug forward for a while longer, and just happened to be right above that streak of light.","In this place, he could sense the powerful power of lightning. Though there was still a distance between them, it caused even his soul to tremble, as if it was about to be shattered.","The power of lightning was indeed extraordinary.","Putting aside the question of whether he could refine it or not, the first question was, how was he supposed to retrieve it?","This thing was probably something that even Core Formation Tier elites didn’t dare to come into contact with, so how was he supposed to retrieve it?","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower!","This was Origin Gold, and it could even contain the Heavenly Dao Flames that could burn Saints to death. So, why couldn’t it absorb this light of lightning?","Ling Han unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, which enshrouded towards the light of lightning.","Unexpectedly, the reaction speed of that light was astonishingly fast. Shua, in a flash, it had left, following the couse of the lightning river, and there was no sign of it.","F***, was there any need to be so fast?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel gloomy. He wasn’t even given a chance to make an attempt. Shua, a flash of light streaked past, and a scene that surprised Ling Han appeared. That flash of lightning actually ran back on its own, and even circled around the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. It was like a child that had encountered a playmate, appearing to be very excited.","Ling Han faltered for a moment before coming to a realization.","This was the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, which had been nurtured in Primal Chaos and then baptized in the pool of lightning of heaven and earth. Thus, it had two elements, and from a certain aspect, it was a pool of lightning.","Thus, the light of lightning naturally felt an affinity towards it.","This was a good opportunity.","Ling Han controlled the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and in a flash, absorbed this light.","Success!","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face as he hurriedly retrieved the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. This was a wisp of his divine sense, and it was his personal Spirit Tool. Thus, he could naturally store it into his mind.","Now, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was floating in his mind, and what Ling Han needed to consider was how to refine this light of lightning.","He was 99% sure that this was the legendary celestial light, but how to refine it was a big problem.","If it was directly unleashed, he would probably be instantly corroded from the inside out. No matter how strong he was, he would not be able to match a barrage of attacks of Core Formation Tier, what more when the might of this light had perhaps reached the peak stage of Core Formation Tier.","What should he do?","Ling Han thought for a long time, and decided to use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to erase the air of violence in the light of lightning, leaving only the core.","This naturally decreased the might of the light of lightning greatly, but on the other hand, if Ling Han could completely grasp the core, as he grew, the light of lightning would return to its previous strength, or even become even stronger.","Fine, let’s do that.","Ling Han sat down in a cross-legged position and used the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to grind away at the light of lightning, so that it would disintegrate and he could analyze the core.","He could clearly sense that the might of this light was decreasing, but it itself was becoming purer. After an unknown amount of time, Ling Han discovered that the light of lightning had already turned from blazing white to brilliant blue. Furthermore, it was no longer light, but rather seals that were continuously evolving.","This was the core of the light of lightning, the essence.","Ling Han released the light of lightning from the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. He then opened a Celestial Cauldron and absorbed the light of lightning into it to nurture it. The light of lightning appeared extremely obedient, and also seemed to like the Celestial Cauldron very much. When it swam in the cauldron, it was like a fish.","Ling Han couldn’t help but be filled with anticipation. He had now captured a streak of celestial light, so what kind of attack could he deliver?","He hurriedly returned to the ground, and with a wave of his hand, the Celestial Cauldron stimulated the light of lightning. Pa, pa, pa! A bolt of lightning immediately shot out from his palm, striking the mountain opposite him, directly blasting out a cave that was 300 meters deep.","Hiss, that was awesome.","Ling Han switched to an ordinary fist technique. Boom, with a punch, the mountain trembled, but only a hole that was about three meters deep was created.","The gap was so wide?","Ling Han switched to using the Three Styles Styles of the God of War. He delivered three palm strikes, and a deep hole appeared on the mountain, measuring about 210 meters in depth. Hiss, even the Three Styles of the God of War was no match for the light of lightning!","Ling Han switched to using the Demonic Monkey Fists again. This time, there was another three hundred meter deep hole in the mountain.","Awesome, the light of lightning was actually capable of matching the Imperial Technique.","Ling Han was stunned. If the light of lightning possessed endless growth, then this would be equivalent to an Imperial Technique in the future.","“And this is only refining a streak of celestial light.”","“Theoretically speaking, a Celestial Cauldron would be able to absorb one streak of celestial light. Then wouldn’t the limit be nine streaks?”","“Hiss, nine flashes of divine light striking at the same time, what kind of destructive power is","that?”","Even with Ling Han’s strong willpower, his heart still beat faster. That would be equivalent to having nine Imperial Techniques attack at the same time. Then let’s ask, who in this world could match the combined attacks of nine young Great Emperors of the same cultivation level?","He immediately made up his mind. He would definitely gather all nine streaks of celestial light here, and cultivate a supreme Mystical Power.","“Who goes there!”","“To dare make noise here, don’t you know that this is an important place of the Zhou Clan?”","“Brat, tell me your name.”","Right at this moment, a team of soldiers rushed over, all of them aiming their spears at Ling Han.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over them, and couldn’t help but feel surprised. That was because these people were all Foundation Building Tiers, but they were too young. They were all only","in their twenties.","This world was so terrifying, and such young Foundation Building Tiers could only be guards?","It should be known that if one could set foot on the Celestial Path in his twenties, he would at least be worthy of the title of prodigy.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “I just happened to pass by, so I don’t know where this is. May I ask where the Zhou Clan is? Please allow me to pay my respects.”","“Enough with the nonsense. The fact that he dares to appear in the mine is most likely","because he wants to steal the Lightning Stone.”","“Capture him!”","This group of soldiers all shouted. Xiu, several flashes of lightning shot out from the tip of","their spears, blasting towards Ling Han.","So fast.","Ling Han was completely unguarded, and was actually struck by these few flashes of lightning. However, the power of lightning had just entered his body, and it was as if the light of lightning in the Celestial Cauldron had come to life. It immediately showed its might, and with a zi, absorbed all the power of lightning.","F***, he almost met with an unexpected failure.","Ling Han secretly reflected on himself. He had been too careless, and thought that these","people were all Foundation Building Tiers, and could not possibly pose a threat to him, so he was completely unguarded. However, he had never imagined that the Spirit Tool in their hands was extremely powerful, and the lightning they shot out was astonishingly fast. Probably 99% of Cauldron Forging Tier elites would be hit.","If he didn’t want to be hit, he could only maintain his high-speed movement and not be locked down by the soldiers.","Thankfully, the fact that these people’s spears could shoot out the light of lightning should","be because they used lightning-aligned ores as their energy source, and what was the light of","lightning in his Celestial Cauldron?","The source of all the lightning energy.","Thus, when these attacks landed on Ling Han, they were naturally like clay ox sinking into the","sea, completely ineffective.","This did not mean that Ling Han was immune to all lightning attacks, but at least in this","place, no Lightning Element Tool would be able to threaten him.","“Pu!”","“What!”","However, the soldiers didn’t know this, and when they saw that Ling Han was completely","unscathed even after facing the barrage of lightning, they couldn’t help but gape in shock. They were astounded to the extreme."]},{"number":3878,"title":"Chapter 3878: Thunder God","paragraphs":["Chapter 3878: Thunder God","“Who exactly are you?” A soldier mustered up the courage to ask.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s mind. He stood with his hands clasped behind his back, and said calmly, “I am the Thunder God!”","God!","All the soldiers were slightly doubtful. Did Immortals look like this? Why was he not much different from them? But if he was not a god, how could he allow them to attack him without being injured?","“Don’t believe him!” a soldier suddenly said. “Perhaps, he’s wearing an inner vest refined from a rubber tree.”","“En!”","The other soldiers all nodded, and there was no longer any reverence in their eyes as they looked at Ling Han.","Ling Han thought for a moment, and suddenly came to a realization.","The Lightning High Priest had said before that the reason why he had been able to collect the lightning ore was because there was a kind of tree leaf that was actually immune to lightning. Thus, extracting the essence of this kind of tree and forging it into an inner armor would naturally be able to defend against lightning strikes.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and stretched out his hands. With a thought, he stimulated the lightning within the Celestial Cauldron. Instantly, the spears in the hands of those soldiers crackled with lightning.","F***, what was going on?","This time, the soldiers were once again dumbfounded.","If Ling Han was immune to lightning attacks, it was possible that he was wearing a special internal armor. However, being able to remote control the weapons in their hands was definitely a miracle.","They no longer had any doubts. They all put down their weapons, and bowed.","“Greetings, Thunder God!”","“Long live the Thunder God!”","All of them were in fear and trepidation, incredibly reverent.","Ling Han raised his hand, and said, “Rise.”","“Yes, Lord Thunder God!”","“I’ve lived for a long time in the Nine Heavens, and I’ve only just descended to the mortal world. Thus, I’m not familiar with the matters of the mortal world. So, who wants to tell me?” Ling Han casually said.","“Me!”","“Me!”","“Me! Me!”","Those soldiers all scrambled over one another, wanting to perform well in front of the “god”. Who knows, they may be able to live forever.","Ling Han asked questions, and they answered. Those that didn’t manage to seize the opportunity would even supply additional information.","In this area, the Zhou Clan was the ruler.","The Zhou Clan was a Core Formation Tier-level force, and there were as many as four Core Formation Tier grand elders. They mined the Lightning Stones to accumulate power, planning to conquer the Heavenly Clouds Mountain in a single stroke, and expand their force to a farther range.","The Heavenly Clouds Mountain was the territory of wild beasts, which also halted the course of the Zhou Clan’s expansion westward.","Why didn’t they expand east, north, and south?","That was because north and south were boundless seas, with inconceivably powerful wild beasts, as well as terrifyingly harsh weather, and east was a large grassy plain, with few people. Furthermore, there were no precious Celestial medicines, ores, so what was the use of occupying it?","Thus, the Zhou Clan could only accumulate power, and prepare to launch an attack on the Heavenly Clouds Mountain. As long as they could take down this bridgehead, they would be able to expand towards the west.","Ling Han asked a crucial question. These people were so prodigious, but why were they willing to become guards?","However, these people’s answers stunned Ling Han. This was because there were many people here who had reached the Foundation Building Tier in their twenties. They couldn’t be considered prodigies at all.","Even for Cauldron Forging Tier, the fastest would be around thirty years old, while the slowest would be forty years old, those who could reach that level would definitely have reached it. If they couldn’t reach it, then when their life force dried up, it would be even more impossible to reach it.","Hold on!","“Your vitality dried up after forty years old?” Ling Han asked.","“That’s right.” All the soldiers nodded. What was so strange about that?","“Your lifespans... are roughly?” Ling Han asked again.","“Usually seventies. If they maintain themselves well, it will be in the eighties or nineties. There are also some people who can live to a hundred years old.”","“Sigh, there are too few hundred-year-olds.”","“En, it can’t be helped. We cultivate with great exhaustion, and with additional injuries, it","would be good enough if we can live to eighty.”","‘F*ck! Foundation Building cultivators can only live to 70 or 80 years old?’","No, no, no, everyone, including Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators, Core Formation Tier cultivators, could only live for seventy to eighty years?","How was this possible?","Ling Han asked again, but it was still the same. The people of this world cultivated extremely fact, the lifes of those who cultivated in truth was","quickly, but they also died very","usually inferior to that of ordinary people.","It was as if they had expended all of their lifespan on cultivating, and paid the price of sacrificing a great amount of their lifespan to welcome the high speed of cultivation.","Thus, it wouldn’t be strange for a large number of Foundation Building Tier cultivators in their twenties to appear.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. After a moment of silence, he decided to pay a visit to the","Zhou Clan.","He flew on his Tool, and instantly disappeared.","This caused the soldiers to revere him as if he was a god, and they all knelt down. In this place, there was no such thing as flying on a Tool.","Thus, how could one fly unless they were a Heavenly God?","After Ling Han flew over multiple mountain ranges, he descended, and once again travelled on foot. If he used the Imminent Skyline, this was actually even faster than flying on a Tool.","After walking for a while longer, a city appeared ahead of him.","This city was very simple and crude, and there were no city walls either. If it was attacked, it was practically defenseless.","In truth, there was no need to build the city wall either, because this was the territory of the Zhou Clan, and there were no external enemies, so what need was there for the city wall? Ling Han entered the city and casually asked around. He discovered that he wasn’t the first outsider to enter this place. Instead, others had already arrived half a month ago.","The Zhou Clan was very polite towards outsiders, and treated all of them as esteemed guests, receiving them with fine wine and good food.","As a matter of fact, the most outstanding Young Master of the Zhou Clan, Zhou Miyang, was presently entertaining the outsiders that had just arrived at the Celestial Crane Pavilion.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before deciding to head over to take a look.","The Celestial Crane Pavilion was very close. After all, this city was only so big, so Ling Han","quickly arrived.","With a thought, he altered his appearance slightly. Then, using the Soul Awakening Technique, even his soul underwent a slight change. Only then did he walk into the building.","“Milord, are you here to attend Young Master Zhou’s banquet?” A waiter immediately","approached.","Ling Han nodded.","“Then please come with me.” This waiter brought him through the pavilion. The Celestial","Crane Pavilion was definitely not just a single pavilion, but had multiple courtyards that occupied an extremely large area.","After walking for a while, they arrived at a large garden. At this moment, a great many tables had been set up here, and each table was filled with people. Cups of wine exchanged, and the atmosphere was incredibly lively.","Seeing Ling Han appear, everyone looked over. Seeing that he looked unfamiliar, they","withdrew their gazes.","Ling Han also swept an eye over them, feeling slightly disappointed. That was because he had","been thinking whether the empress, Lin Luo, and the others would appear here, but in the","end, there was only one person that he recognized.","-Song Lan.","No matter where this beauty ranked ninth on the Exquisite Leaderboard was, she would be","revered like the moon that was surrounded by stars. It was naturally no exception here, as countless people fought to gain her favour.","And beside her, there sat a handsome man. He was only in his early twenties, exuding a strong","heroic spirit.","Song Lan also cast a second look at Ling Han, because she felt that Ling Han looked very","familiar to her, but upon a closer look, not only was his looks not worthy of being remembered, even his spiritual fluctuations were completely unfamiliar to her. “Celestial maiden Song, what is it?” the man beside her asked, appearing extremely","concerned.","“Nothing.” Song Lan shook his head.","The young man looked towards Ling Han. Shua, his eyes were like blades, piercing painfully."]},{"number":3879,"title":"Chapter 3879: Banquet of the Zhou Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3879: Banquet of the Zhou Clan","This was truly an undeserved calamity.","Ling Han didn’t provoke anyone. In fact, he even changed his appearance and soul fluctuation, but he was still targeted at the first moment.","F***, was he really a man that had developed a halo of trouble?","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t back down. He glared back at the young man.","“Hehe, this newcomer, how should I address you?” the young man asked calmly.","Ling Han crossed his arms over his chest, pretending not to hear.","“Hey, my young master is asking you a question,” one of the servants couldn’t help but shout.","However, Ling Han still ignored him.","“Hehe, how dare you ignore even my words?” This young man already had a sliver of anger in him.","Only then did Ling Han say, “Before asking others, shouldn’t you introduce yourself first?”","A flash of killing intent appeared in the young man’s eyes, but he still suppressed it, and said, “I am Zhou Miyang.”","As expected, this guy was Zhou Miyang.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Han Lin.”","Song Lan’s beautiful eyes lit up. Not only was she astonishingly beautiful, she also had outstanding intelligence. Han Lin was Ling Han in reverse, and she felt that Ling Han gave off a familiar feeling. Thus, she was already somewhat certain that the person in front of her was Ling Han in disguise.","Zhou Miyang’s attention was completely focused on Song Lan. This woman was really too beautiful, causing his heart to throb wildly. The first time he set eyes on her, he had already made up his mind that he would definitely marry her.","Thus, when he discovered that Song Lan was actually paying attention to Ling Han, this naturally caused his jealousy to burn.","“If you want to sit down at this young master’s banquet, you have to first prove that you have that kind of ability,” Zhou Miyang said coldly. He wanted to humiliate Ling Han in public, and try as much as possible to tarnish the latter’s image.","The reason why Ling Han had come here was to see if the empress and the others were here. Since they weren’t here, what was the point of him staying?","He waved his hand, turned and left.","F***, chickened out?","Zhou Miyang’s killing intent blazed. This guy had come in to strut around, and in the end, he wanted to run the moment he flipped out. There was no way he would let him off so easily. He nodded at a large man in black by his side, and the latter immediately understood. “Brat, what kind of place do you think this is? Do you think you can come and go as you please?” The large man in black leaped out, and was already standing in front of Ling Han. “Are you born in the year of the dog?” Ling Han asked.","What was the meaning of this?","The large man in black subconsciously shook his head, “My zo-”","“Since you’re not a dog, why are you blocking the way?” Ling Han interrupted him. ‘F*ck!’","The large man in black faltered for a moment before coming to his senses. Ling Han was playing around with him, calling him a dog.","He flew into a thunderous rage, and with a single step, rushed towards Ling Han. Then, he threw out a punch.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and tapped out a finger.","The large black-robed man’s fist was the size of a clay bowl, and compared with Ling Han’s slender finger, its size was completely disproportionate. Furthermore, the aura of both sides were completely different. This punch from the large black-robed man condensed the endless power of heaven and earth, and his battle prowess was terrifying. Ling Han, on the other hand, was limp and without the slightest bit of force.","Many people had already closed their eyes, unable to bear the sight.","Peng!","There was a loud bang, and a person was already sent flying. Then, there was an endless series of loud bangs. As it turned out, a great many walls had been forcefully crashed through.","Yi?","Everyone could not believe it. The person that had been sent flying was actually not Ling Han, but rather the large man in black.","How was this possible?","Ling Han withdrew his finger. He was also slightly surprised, because this lackey was actually a Four Cauldrons.","Four Cauldrons, and he had become someone’s servant?","This could only appear in this kind of Mystery Realm, where the rapid increase of cultivation level was obtained through overdrafting one’s life force. In fact, one could even reach a height that only super geniuses could reach.","“Good, very good.” Zhou Miyang sat upright and still, but his eyes were cold, his killing intent blazing. “You have come to the territory of the Zhou Clan, and still dare to commit a crime. How impressive!”","This was naturally a sarcastic remark. Shua, a row of soldiers appeared. Though they were all Foundation Building Tier cultivators, all of them held spears in their hands.","Instantly, everyone’s expressions changed slightly.","They had witnessed the might of this spear before, and the attacks that it delivered were extraordinarily fast. There were not many in the Cauldron Forging Tier that could dodge this. Once they were hit, they would be numb to the point of losing all ability to resist, and at worst, they would be directly burnt into charcoal. Naturally, everyone would be wary.","The reason why everyone was willing to attend the banquet was firstly, because they wanted to further understand the situation here, and secondly, because they wanted to know the origins of this spear-type Spirit Tool. If they could bring it out of the Mystery Realm, it could easily help a force become stronger.","Ling Han was completely unconcerned. In fact, he didn’t even activate his movement technique, to stop the soldiers from locking onto him.","“Han Lin, don’t forget yourself in your conceit!” Song Lan spoke up, “There is no great enmity between you, just some minor misunderstandings. There is no need for you to become enemies like this.”","She was afraid that Ling Han would be too arrogant, and completely had no idea of the might of this spear. That was why she had opened her mouth to speak. On the surface, she was rebuking Ling Han, but in truth, she was trying to mediate.","However, Ling Han couldn’t possibly listen to her, and Zhou Miyang definitely wouldn’t let go of a suspected “rival in love”.","Instantly, zi, ten spears shot out blazing white lightning at the same time, incredibly fast.","Ling Han didn’t dodge, and he was instantly hit head-on.","Sigh.","Everyone shook their heads. Wasn’t this just asking for trouble?","They were all very clear that the lightning shot out by this spear was incredibly frightening, and could not be taken lightly just because the person controlling it was a Foundation","Building Tier.","See, he was too arrogant, wasn’t he? This was karma.","Hence, one should not show off too much, or else... f***!","The lightning dissipated, but everyone was shocked to see that Ling Han was still standing there perfectly fine. To say nothing of turning into charcoal, or his whole body turning numb,","not even a single strand of his hair was disheveled.","They had to be seeing things.","Are you a f****** monster?","Everyone’s mouths were wide open, big enough to fit a bun.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Is there anyone else that wants to stop me from leaving?”","Zhou Miyang’s expression was dark. He finally stood up.","He had no choice but to stand up. First, his lackeys had failed, and then the Spirit Tool had lost","its effect. If he still did not make a move, wouldn’t the reputation of the Zhou Clan be","completely ruined?","“You’re wearing that kind of armor, right?” Zhou Miyang said. He wouldn’t be as shocked as everyone else. Instead, he immediately guessed that Ling Han wasn’t immune to lightning attacks. Instead, he was wearing that kind of specially made armor.","Ling Han smiled, “I am the Thunder God, and can naturally control the power of lightning. Playing with lightning in front of me is really biting off more than you can chew.”","“Ha! Ha!” Zhou Miyang laughed it off. He naturally did not believe it the slightest bit.","Did he think he was an idiot?","“Continue shooting!” he said. “Even if you wear that kind of armor, after sustaining enough","attacks, it will still crumble.”","“Yes.” Those soldiers also pulled themselves together, and controlled their spears, launching","another attack at Ling Han.","Zi, zi, zi, lightning flashed madly.","Ling Han stood, arms crossed behind his back, and asked calmly, “Are you done yet?”","No one paid attention to him, and was still releasing lightning. Zi, zi, zi!","Did they really think that he was a living target? Ling Han humphed, and stretched out a hand."]},{"number":3880,"title":"Chapter 3880: Introduction","paragraphs":["Chapter 3880: Introduction","Ling Han stretched out his hand. With a thought, zi, a bolt of lightning shot out from the palm of his hand, striking back at those soldiers.","Pa! Pa! Pa!","Instantly, the spears in the hands of these soldiers exploded one after another.","Though the destructive power of this kind of spear was great, the material it was made of was not very high grade. With a sweep of the divine light of lightning, it naturally exploded. This time, everyone was dumbfounded.","Could it be that this guy was really the Thunder God? Otherwise, how could he have possibly shot out a bolt of lightning with a wave of his hand, which was even more terrifying than those spears?","“Interesting.” Zhou Miyang stared at Ling Han, “You seem to be hiding some kind of secret.” “You speak too much nonsense.” Ling Han shook his head.","“When I take you down, you will explain everything clearly.” Zhou Miyang strode over. Boom, his aura immediately changed, and his whole head of hair flew in the wind. There was even lightning flickering, crackling madly.","This guy was so terrifying.","The outsiders couldn’t help but feel apprehensive. Previously, they had completely looked down on the natives here. Even if they were wary, that was because of the Zhou Clan’s Core Formation Tier elites, as well as the spear-type Spirit Tool that released lightning.","However, now that they saw Zhou Miyang unleash his might, they suddenly realized that the natives here were extremely strong. In fact, they were stronger than the majority of them.","As Song Lan watched, her beautiful face was calm and unperturbed. It was unknown what she was thinking.","This woman was extremely subtle.","Zhou Miyang walked step by step towards Ling Han. With every step, his aura would become slightly stronger, and the lightning entwined around him would also become slightly more terrifying. When he was about three meters away from Ling Han, he had already turned into a bolt of lightning. His body had become transparent, and was completely entwined with lightning.","Was this a kind of physique, or had he cultivated some kind of lightning cultivation technique?","Ling Han was unconcerned. Even if he didn’t retrieve the light of lightning, he was confident that he could defeat all Cauldron Forging Tiers.","“Outsider, I’ll show you what true power of lightning is!” Zhou Miyang declared coldly. Zi, his whole person turned into a bolt of lightning that “slashed” towards Ling Han.","Ling Han casually raised his hand and grabbed the bolt of lightning.","“Haha, you’re seeking death!” Zhou Miyang turned back into human form, and sneered. He actually dared to catch him. Didn’t he know that he was a bolt of lightning now? Even Divine Metal would be pierced through if it took a hit from him.","However, no matter how much power he channeled, Ling Han was still completely unscathed.","In fact, he could even feel that Ling Han’s body had become a bottomless pit that was devouring his power of lightning.","This was not his misconception, but it was not completely right either. That was because it was not Ling Han that was engulfing his power of lightning, but rather the light of lightning from the Celestial Cauldron.","-The Zhou Clan’s cultivation technique was based on the light of lightning, and was formed by an incredibly outstanding ancestor of the Zhou Clan absorbing the power of the Lightning Ore. Thus, the members of the Zhou Clan could refine the Lightning Ore, rapidly increase their cultivation level, and possess the might of lightning.","However, this also led to all those who cultivated this technique to feel like a son that was facing his father in front of Ling Han.","This was an intrinsic restraint.","Zhou Miyang was scared now. At present, it was not him that was attacking Ling Han, but rather Ling Han wanted to suck him dry.","He wanted to flee, but Ling Han grabbed onto him. He was completely unable to break free, and could only watch helplessly as his power was endlessly sucked away. Even if he did not actively channel his power, it was as if a valve had been turned on in this mystical power. He could not shut it down at all.","Th-Thunder God.","This thought streaked through his mind. If it was not the Thunder God, how could Ling Han possibly suppress him like this?","“Lord Thunder God, spare me!” He lowered his head.","How could a human be a match for a god?","“Convinced?” Ling Han asked calmly.","“I concede.”","“Are you afraid now?”","“I am.”","Zhou Miyang appeared very humble, completely losing the domineering air he had previously.","Only then did Ling Han let go, and prepared to leave.","“Lord Thunder God, please wait!” Zhou Miyang hurriedly said, “My ancestor, my father and the others would definitely be very pleased to see you, and hope that Lord Thunder God can give our humble clan a chance.”","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han looked at Zhou Miyang with a faint smile, causing Zhou Miyang to involuntarily break out in a cold sweat.","“Sure,” he finally nodded.","Perhaps this was a trap, but if Ling Han used the Imminent Skyline, he was extremely confident that he could escape. If he was really forced into a corner, the Heavenly Dao Flames would definitely be no pushover either.","However, since the Zhou Clan was so determined to obtain the Heavenly Clouds Mountain, they must have studied it deeply. Thus, Ling Han wanted to obtain the information that they","possessed.","“Lord, please.” Zhou Miyang’s expression was respectful as he led the way ahead.","Ling Han ignored everyone else, and walked forwards with his hands clasped behind his back.","“Can I go with you?” A fragrant figure fluttered in the air, and Song Lan had already leaped over. She hummed softly and smiled faintly, and was indescribably beautiful.","Why was this woman joining in on the excitement?","Ling Han frowned slightly. He had never underestimated this woman’s intelligence. Now that","she had suddenly interfered, she must be scheming something.","“Since Celestial maiden Song is willing to grace us with her presence, I naturally clap my","hands in welcome.” Zhou Miyang was overjoyed.","The three of them left, leaving behind a group of guests who were extremely confused.","What was going on here? They were just left here like this?","What happened to the hospitality of a host?","Zhou Miyang led the way, and they soon arrived at the Zhou Clan Residence. Since they were the rulers of this place, the Zhou Clan naturally occupied a very large area, with continuous levels of buildings, looking ancient.","“Young Master.” Upon seeing Zhou Miyang, the guards at the entrance hurriedly paid their","respects.","Zhou Miyang waved his hand, his arrogant demeanor reappearing. He brought Ling Han and Song Lan through the doors, and arrived at the main hall. Then, he invited them to wait for a moment, before he himself left.","“We’re already old friends, so why don’t you show your true face?” Song Lan asked calmly.","Ling Han pretended to be surprised, “Yi, I remember that your hand was very fair and tender.","Where does the word ‘old’ come from?”","Shua, Song Lan instantly delivered a palm strike.","Ling Han slanted his head to the side, dodging the attack. This time, he was really shocked, because Song Lan’s strength had improved again.","Eight Cauldrons, right?","This woman really could not be underestimated. In a short few months, she had advanced","another step further.","“En?” Song Lan was also surprised. She had come across a fortuitous encounter in her adventures previously, and her cultivation level had soared from Seven Cauldrons to Eight Cauldrons. Even if it was Lu Qi, she would be able to fight him. She had not thought that Ling Han would have so easily dodge this blow.","“You’re not the only one who’s improved,” Ling Han said with a faint smile. He returned to his original appearance. After all, to constantly maintain his appearance was extremely","troublesome.","Song Lan was slightly displeased. After she had advanced into Eight Cauldrons, what she","wanted most was to thrash this lecherous Ling Han. Did he really think that her hand could be touched as he liked? But she had not expected that while she had improved, Ling Han had also","improved, and she was still unable to do anything against this guy.","Right at this moment, three people walked in, one after another.","Two of them were middle-aged men in their forties, while the third was Zhou Miyang.","“Let me introduce. This is my father, Zhou Mi, and this is my Second Uncle, Zhou Lou,” Zhou Miyang said with a smile, no longer having the previous fear.","That was because both Zhou Mi and Zhou Lou were in the Core Formation Tier."]},{"number":3881,"title":"Chapter 3881: Turning the tables","paragraphs":["Chapter 3881: Turning the tables","“These two young friends have come from afar, so it’s been hard on you,” he said with a smile. He was the current clan leader of the Zhou Clan.","Young friend?","Ling Han chuckled internally. Previously, he had still been Lord Thunder God, and now, his status had been degraded to that of ‘young friend’. This gap was really huge.","Song Lan bowed daintily, and said, “Greetings, Lords.”","She was well-versed in social relations, and travelled the world in the image of a celestial maiden. She would not deliberately offend anyone.","“Please rise.” Zhou Mi was all smiles, and stretched out a hand, motioning her to rise.","“Celestial maiden Song, we’re all a family, so there’s no need to stand on ceremony,” Zhou Miyang said in a timely manner.","Family?","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Little Zhou, this is my wife. Since when did she become a family member with you?”","These words caused a few people’s expressions to change at the same time.","“Nonsense, when did Celestial Maiden Song become your wife? Stop dreaming!” Zhou","Miyang immediately stood up, slightly flustered and exasperated.","Meanwhile, Song Lan rolled her eyes at Ling Han, and said in annoyance, “Brother Ling, don’t spout nonsense.”","“Brother Ling?” Zhou Mi carefully glanced at Ling Han’s, and said, “So it turns out that young friend’s surname isn’t Han.”","‘F*ck! Woman, you’re trying to undermine me!’","Ling Han smiled. He was impersonating the Thunder God, but the Zhou Clan were not idiots. They had only deduced from the subtle relationship between Ling Han and Song Lan that Ling Han should also be an outsider, and not some so-called Thunder God.","Thus, Zhou Miyang’s attitude immediately changed.","In the eyes of the Zhou Clan, Ling Han’s ability was far too astonishing. If they could obtain it, the Zhou Clan would definitely become even more powerful.","“My name is Ling Han.” With a thought, Ling Han’s appearance returned to normal.","“So it is Young Friend Ling.” Zhou Lou spoke up, “Let’s be frank. If Young Friend Ling is willing to hand over your technique of controlling lightning, the Zhou Clan would definitely satisfy Young Friend Ling.”","The secret behind Ling Han’s ability to control lightning was the light of lightning in the Celestial Cauldron. This was a supreme opportunity that could match an Imperial Technique, so how could Ling Han possibly surrender it to someone else?","He wouldn’t even trade for an Imperial Technique.","Ling Han shook his head, “Not interested.”","“Young friend, please reconsider,” Zhou Lou said with a smile. However, there was already a powerful threat in his voice.","Ling Han chuckled, “No need to consider.”","“Sigh, young friend, you are refusing a toast only to drink a forfeit,” Zhou Lou said balefully.","“Second Brother, don’t scare our guests,” Zhou Mi shouted, pretending to stop him.","Zhou Lou merely smiled, and stretched out a hand to grab Ling Han. Crackle, crackle, lightning flickered on his hand.","If it was another cultivator of the Core Formation Tier, even if they were also cultivating the power of lightning, Ling Han would definitely be outmatched. He would either immediately turn around and flee, or draw out the Heavenly Dao Flames, but in this place, the situation was too unique.","Ling Han did not move, and allowed Zhou Lou to grab onto him.","Song Lan was speechless as she watched. In her eyes, Ling Han’s intelligence was not inferior to hers at all. Thus, since Ling Han dared to come, he must have something to rely on, but now, he had fallen into Zhou Lou’s hands just like that, which really made her jaw drop.","Have you come to walk right into a trap?","“Young friend, can you reconsider now?” Zhou Lou asked with a smile.","“I said I’m not interested, so I’m not interested,” Ling Han said calmly.","“Stubborn!” Zhou Lou humphed, and the power of lightning surged, blasting out towards Ling Han’s body.","He controlled his power very well. He would make Ling Han suffer greatly, but would not really kill Ling Han.","However, when power surged out, it was like a clay ox entering the sea.","What was going on?","Though he had heard Zhou Miyang speak of Ling Han’s “strangeness”, but just think, with his cultivation level of Core Formation Tier, he was superior to Ling Han in terms of level of","being. This kind of thing naturally could not possibly happen to him.","However, there just so happened to be such a strange thing in this world. His power was actually completely absorbed by Ling Han, and he could not cause the slightest bit of damage.","They had to be seeing things.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Now, do you believe that I am the Thunder God?”","Zhou Lou naturally didn’t believe this. If the Thunder God had truly descended into the mortal","world, how could his cultivation level only be at the Cauldron Forging Tier?","He increased his power, but no matter how much power he activated, Ling Han was","completely unscathed.","“Haha, young friend’s ability is truly shocking!” Zhou Mi carefully mediated the situation, “Second Brother, don’t be rude to esteemed guests.”","Zhou Lou sheepishly withdrew his hand. A dignified Core Formation Tier elite was actually unable to do anything to a Cauldron Forging Tier, which made him feel very embarrassed.","Ling Han didn’t attack either. Firstly, he was only immune to the attacks of the Zhou Clan, but it didn’t mean that he could turn the tables and suppress a Core Formation Tier cultivator. Secondly, it wasn’t time yet.","“Young friend, name a price. What do you want in exchange for teaching this secret technique?” Zhou Mi asked with a serious expression.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “You guys can’t be the only ones to make a bid. It’s my turn.” He pondered for a moment, then said, “Give me the information on Heavenly Clouds Mountain.” Zhou Mi laughed in spite of itself, “Young friend, do you think you can threaten us? Though you have grasped a secret technique, and are immune to our attacks, you are only a Cauldron Forging Tier, after all.” He said disdainfully.","“Oh?” Ling Han smiled faintly. He stood up, and with a casual wave of his hand, a bolt of lightning shot out. With a pa, all the tables and chairs in his path were turned into dust, and his power did not decrease. A hole was blasted into the wall, and he continued to charge forwards, blasting out a passage that was several hundred meters long.","-The Zhou Clan Residence was not built from the Lightning Ore, so they were naturally no match for the might of lightning.","Song Lan couldn’t help but feel moved. This attack was too terrifying. Even she felt her heart palpitate, and felt that it was extremely troublesome, and difficult to parry.","And this was only something that Ling Han had done casually.","Ling Han shrugged and said, “I indeed can’t do anything to Core Formation Tier elites, but the Zhou Clan can’t all be Core Formation Tier elites, right?”","Zhou Mi and Zhou Lou’s expressions immediately changed drastically. Just as Ling Han had said, they were indeed unafraid of Ling Han, but what about the other members of the Zhou","Clan?","“Young friend, you’re not alone either. For example, Miss Song is beautiful, so it would be too unfortunate if her face was accidentally ruined, wouldn’t it?” Zhou Mi said in a deep","voice.","Song Lan hurriedly waved his hand, “Brother Ling and I have only met by chance.”","As she spoke, a light flickered on her body. It was indistinct, yet it caused both Zhou Mi and Zhou Lou’s expressions to change drastically. That light had the ability to threaten them.","They had miscalculated. This woman had a rare treasure to protect her, so it was impossible for them to use her to threaten Ling Han.","Ling Han was also surprised. He had not thought that Song Lan would actually possess such a","treasure?","This should be something that she had obtained later. Otherwise, if she would rather sit by and watch her companion be trapped than save him, wouldn’t that be too cold-blooded and","heartless?","Song Lan only showed off a little of her strength, and smiled beautifully, as if nothing had","happened.","She indeed had a rare treasure on her, but there was a limit to how many times she could use","it. Thus, if she could avoid using it, it was naturally best not to.","Ling Han clapped his hands, and said, “Now, can we talk?”","Zhou Mi was helpless, and asked, “Young friend, what do you want to know?”","“The distribution of wild beasts in the Heavenly Clouds Mountain, as well as... what is that place outside the Heavenly Clouds Mountain?” Ling Han asked."]},{"number":3882,"title":"Chapter 3882: Heaven Hunting Crossbow","paragraphs":["Chapter 3882: Heaven Hunting Crossbow","“Young friend Ling, this is information that our Zhou Clan has spent decades to gather. Who knows how much manpower and material resources we have sacrificed. Do you want to reap the rewards without so much as a scratch?” Zhou Mi said in a deep voice, still wanting to bargain.","“That’s right.” Ling Han nodded, honestly and without reservations.","Er!","Both Zhou Mi and Zhou Lou were rendered speechless. Who was this guy? Why did he not have the arrogance and haughtiness of a young man at all? He was astonishingly shameless, and he was not provoked at all.","“Hehe, there is no problem for you to want the information.” Zhou Mi suddenly smiled, “However, I can tell you very clearly that even if you were given the information, you would not be able to cross over Heavenly Clouds Mountain. There are a total of eight Demonic Beasts at the Core Formation Tier there, and each of them has blocked a path out of the mountains. Hence, at least, you would have to kill one first.”","“It’s not that I look down on you, young friend, but aside from being able to restrain lightning-element mystical power, could it be that you’re immune to other powers?”","Old fox.","Ling Han thought internally, but his expression did not change, “Oh, then does Clan Leader Zhou have any good suggestions?”","“Cooperate.” He smiled carefully, “If you help us clean up the Heavenly Clouds Mountain, then naturally, everyone would be happy.”","What the Zhou Clan wanted was to eternally pass through the passageway of the Heavenly Cloud Mountain, and not temporarily. Otherwise, they would be able to kill off one of the weaker vicious beasts of Core Formation Tier, but not too long after, a new Beast King would appear, and once again become a roadblock for them.","Thus, only by completely occupying the Heavenly Clouds Mountain would they be able to settle the matter once and for all.","Ling Han laughed in spite of himself, “Just now, Clan Leader Zhou has already said that I am no match for any beast king. Why is it that all of a sudden, you need my help again?”","Zhou Mi laughed loudly, “Then there is naturally a reason for it.”","Zhou Lou continued, “Our Zhou Clan has developed a weapon with astonishing might, capable of killing top grade Core Formation Tiers. However, that weapon needs an incredibly pure Lightning Ore to be able to channel. Going by the present rate of progress, it is possible that it would take another two to three hundred years to be successfully extracted. Thus, we need young friend to control this weapon.”","Ling Han had astonishing control over lightning. Who knows, he may be able to do something that was difficult for ordinary people to do.","Yi, the Zhou Clan actually had such a secret weapon?","“Furthermore, after leaving the Heavenly Clouds Mountains, that would be the Demonic Origin Realm. Elites are everywhere, and with your Cauldron Forging Tier cultivation level, you would not be able to claim a stand at all.” Very carefully, he continued, “However, if our Zhou Clan can pass through the Heavenly Clouds Mountains, and establish our own branch in the Demonic Origin Realm, we would be able to become your backer.”","“I’ll consider it.”","Ling Han paused slightly. He felt that it should not be too difficult for him to cross the Heavenly Clouds Mountain, because he had the Void Beast hide, but it was hard to say for the others.","More importantly, where exactly was the empress and the others?","Perhaps they were not in this area, or perhaps they were in this area. It was just that they had not rushed over yet.","Then if he left alone, wouldn’t he have trapped the empress and the others here?","Additionally, he also wanted to take a look at that deadly weapon. It was actually capable of killing an ultimate Core Formation Tier. If he could steal it while he was at it, he would have another trump card in the future.","“If that so-called deadly weapon really has such might, then let’s cooperate,” Ling Han said.","“All right!” Both Zhou Lou and Zhou Mi smiled at the same time.","Very soon, Ling Han saw this deadly weapon.","This was a crossbow, and it was only fitted with three arrows. Because whether it was the body of the crossbow or the arrow itself, the materials used to forge it were all rare treasures.","Ling Han could tell with a single glance that this was a Four Star Divine Metal.","Thus, merely forging this crossbow and the three arrows, the Zhou Clan should have spent innumerable time and effort.","The crossbow was a Spirit Tool, but it needed to be injected with energy to push the arrow to explode with terrifying destructive power.","And this energy source was the Lightning Ore – not the kind that had been mined, but rather purified. Because it required a short period of super-input, only then would it be able to kill a Core Formation Tier.","The requirement for the purity of this energy was too high, so even the Core Formation Tier elites such as Zhou Lou and the others couldn’t do it. Although they should have been the ones to control it when designing it, they discovered that they couldn’t activate it at all after forging it. In other words, the effects were far from what they expected.","In Ling Han’s mind, though his cultivation level was only at the Cauldron Forging Tier, his lightning energy was too pure, so perhaps it could be used.","This was natural, because that was not Ling Han’s power at all, but rather the light of lightning in the Celestial Cauldron, the source of all Lightning Ore.","If even Ling Han couldn’t do it, then there should be no one who could activate it.","Ling Han began to experiment. He mounted an arrow, then injected power into the crossbow. Bit by bit, there was a pool of energy in the crossbow, which was presently slowly filling up. Ten minutes later, the energy pool was filled to the brim.","Ling Han didn’t attack at the first instant. Instead, he waited for another five minutes, then aimed at the target in front of him and pressed the switch.","Boom, an arrow was shot out.","Fast, like the lightning in the skies, leaving behind traces of lightning behind it. Then, with a loud bang, a mountain ahead of them was directly gone.","All of a sudden, all the members of the Zhou Clan that had followed him here, including Zhou Lou, all had their mouths agape, completely rendered speechless.","This attack was practically world-shaking.","“It’s probably at the early stage of the True Self Tier,” Zhou Mi deduced. He hadn’t seen a True Self Tier before, so he could only speculate based on his cultivation level.","“Killing a top grade Core Formation Tier elite would be as easy as the turn of a palm.”","“Destroying the Heavenly Clouds Mountain would be as easy as blowing off dust.”","“Haha, who would be able to stand against our Zhou Clan now?”","The members of the Zhou Clan were all very excited. Of course, someone immediately charged out and retrieved the arrow. There were only a total of three arrows, so they naturally had to","be recycled.","Even Song Lan was extremely stunned.She had not thought that this Heaven Hunting","Crossbow would actually be able to unleash such terrifying might in Ling Han’s hands.","“Young friend Ling, let us have a pleasant cooperation.” With a smile, Zhou Mi stretched out","his hand.","Ling Han also stretched out his hand, and shook hands with the other.","He naturally wouldn’t work for them for nothing. Although he also wanted to cross the Heavenly Clouds Mountain, it was only natural that he would receive some benefits. He","couldn’t be soft-hearted.","The Zhou Clan also knew his value, and immediately delivered a great many Celestial medicines, and promised Ling Han that after conquering the Heavenly Clouds Mountain,","their gains would be shared equally with Ling Han.","-Not only were there fierce beasts in the Heavenly Clouds Mountain, there were also Celestial medicines. However, fierce beasts were too frightening. If one wanted to harvest Celestial medicines here, he would usually have to pay with his life.","The Zhou Clan began to contact those outsiders, hoping that everyone could cooperate. After passing through the Heavenly Cloud Mountain, the path ahead would still be wide.","This was beneficial for all of them. Thus, the outsiders also decided that they would flatten the Heavenly Clouds Mountain with the Zhou Clan.","“Brother Ling, do you really trust the Zhou Clan?” Song Lan came to pay him a visit, very","calm, looking ethereal.","However, Ling Han knew that even though this little girl looked as beautiful as a celestial maiden and unshackled by the mortal world, she was actually extremely scheming. She had a","lot of tricks up her sleeve.","He smiled, “Why not?”","“I heard that there are a great many Celestial medicines in Heavenly Clouds Mountain. In fact, they can even help a Core Formation Tier cultivator advance one step further. Do you think that the Zhou Clan would be willing to surrender such Celestial medicines to us?” Song Lan","asked calmly."]},{"number":3883,"title":"Chapter 3883: Insta-kill with a single arrow","paragraphs":["Chapter 3883: Insta-kill with a single arrow","According to the Zhou Clan, if they were willing to split the rewards of the Heavenly Cloud Mountain equally with Ling Han, then if it involved Core Formation Tier or even the True Self Tier-level Great Herbs, then it would naturally be divided equally.","The Zhou Clan was willing?","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Little Lan Lan, are you trying to drive a wedge between us?”","Song Lan’s pretty face involuntarily darkened. No one had ever been so bold, to actually dare call her Little Lan Lan.","This was blatant teasing!","“Brother Ling, with your strength and talent, is there any meaning to take advantage of me verbally?” she asked calmly, as if she did not take it to heart at all.","“So this is boring,” Ling Han said with a smile. “Then, Little Lan Lan, let’s discuss the true meaning of life.”","Shua, Song Lan delivered a palm strike.","Ling Han reached out to block it. Hehe, he liked to provoke this calm and two-faced celestial maiden into losing her cool.","“Let me give you a reminder. The Zhou Clan would definitely not be so generous that they would foolishly count money for others even after being betrayed.” Song Lan immediately regained her composure, as if she was a celestial maiden that would never lose her composure.","With that said, she left gracefully.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t trust the Zhou Clan, but cooperation was necessary. That Heaven Hunting Crossbow was practically tailor-made for him, and he wanted to possess it.","After preparing for a day, the Zhou Clan mobilized everyone to set out, heading towards Heavenly Clouds Mountain.","For the sake of this day, the Zhou Clan had already waited several hundred years. Generation after generation of hard work and struggle had become a long-cherished wish.","After walking for two days, they arrived at the foot of the Heavenly Clouds Mountain.","This mountain was tall enough to reach the skies, and there were clouds and mists curling around the waist of the mountain.","“Ang!”","“Ao!”","Before entering the mountains, they could already hear the roars of beasts, which directly penetrated into their souls, causing chills to run down their spines.","This was a great beast of Core Formation Tier.","“Be careful. Vicious beasts aren’t the only thing we need to guard against. There’s also the environment here,” Zhou Mi warned. “There are some plants here that look inconspicuous, but their stings are specialized in breaking through a shield of mystical power. Once pierced, the strong poison will turn people into mush in a short few seconds.”","Hearing these words, everyone shivered. Thankfully, everyone was prepared when they entered into the White Lotus Mystery Realm and wore armor. This would definitely be able to block any piercing stings.","Now, killing a Core Formation Tier great beast shouldn’t be too difficult. The problem was, how were they supposed to be found?","There were a total of eight Demonic Beasts in Heavenly Clouds Mountain, and three of them were at the peak stage of Core Formation Tier. Two were at the late stage of Core Formation Tier, one was at the middle stage of Core Formation Tier, and two were at the early stage of Core Formation Tier. The eight Demonic Beasts each occupied an area, and usually, they would mind their own business.","Though every beast king had its own area of activity, the Heavenly Clouds Mountain was too big. Even if it was divided into eight parts, it was still overwhelmingly huge.","Thus, the advantage of having more people showed itself at this time. Everyone moved separately to find the beast kings in this area.","The Zhou Clan had deliberately planned to conquer the Heavenly Clouds Mountain, so it was naturally impossible that they had not grasped the information about the Demonic Beasts. In this area, the Demonic Beast was an Iron Scaled Sheep, and was shockingly an existence at the late stage of Core Formation Tier.","Ordinarily, wild beasts of the same cultivation level would be stronger than cultivators. For example, it was very easy for four, five, or even seven or eight cauldrons to appear among wild beasts, but cultivators were basically three cauldrons. If they could break through to Four Cauldrons, their abilities would definitely leap into the top thousand.","Thus, even though this Iron Scaled Sheep was only in the late stage ofCore Formation Tier, even the combined forces of the four Core Formation Tier elites from the Zhou Clan would most likely only result in defeat.","Otherwise, in a situation when these beast kings did not ally together, would the Zhou Clan need to spend generations to forge a deadly weapon, and take such a big detour?","Everyone was cautious. The wild beasts and environment here were all filled with danger, so how could they not be careful?","As the secret weapon for killing the beast king, Ling Han naturally didn’t need to move. He only had to head over once they found the Iron Scale Sheep.","One day, two days, three days, right until the fourth day, they finally discovered the Iron Scaled Sheep.","In truth, it was this Iron Scale Sheep that had discovered them, and launched an attack. As a result, three of the Zhou Clan had died, while one of the outsiders had died, and two had escaped they had directly crushed their tokens, and left the Mystery Realm.","Then, the Iron Scaled Sheep flew into a thunderous rage, and began to search all over the mountains and plains, planning to start a massacre.","Someone had actually barged into its territory?","After receiving the news, Ling Han moved with the crossbow in hand, greeting the attack of","the Iron Scale Sheep.","Someone in front of them was drawing the Iron Scaled Sheep over. Of course, it was a Core Formation Tier elite from the Zhou Clan. Otherwise, the other people would be caught up with by a Core Formation Tier vicious beast in a few moves, and then crushed into dust.","It had appeared.","This Iron Scaled Sheep was over 30 meters tall, and its length was around 60 meters. What covered its whole body was not fur, but scales, exuding the coldness of metal, and on top of its head, there were two giant goat horns that were more than 30 meters long, as if they were","two heavenly spears.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The Iron Scaled Sheep charged past, and the mountain rocks that were touched by its aura were shattered into dust, turning into flying sand.","It rampaged all the way, and occasionally, a mountain peak would collapse.","Ling Han turned his head and said to Zhou Mi, “Make that Iron Scale Sheep stop, or I won’t be able to lock onto it easily.”","Zhou Mi frowned deeply. If he wanted the Iron Scale Sheep to stop, he would have to face the Iron Scale Sheep head-on. With the strength of this Beast King, it could easily severely injure the clan’s Core Formation Tier cultivator.","However, there was nothing that could be done. Ling Han was only a Cauldron Forging Tier, so it was normal that he couldn’t lock onto a Core Formation Tier. This, on the other hand, made him feel slightly relieved.","He immediately moved, wanting to force the Iron Scale Sheep to stop. The four Core Formation Tier elites had to work together.","Ling Han stood on the high ground, leisurely and relaxed, waiting patiently.","“You have it easy,” Song Lan said.","“Same to you,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Not long after, the Iron Scaled Sheep indeed stopped.","Ling Han raised the Heaven Hunting Crossbow and aimed. Previously, he had already started","to accumulate power, so he immediately pressed the trigger.","Boom, the arrow shot out. Pa, pa, pa! Lightning flashed, and it was extremely fast.","Its trajectory was practically untraceable. After jumping a few times in the air, it had already shot in front of that Iron Scaled Sheep, and then penetrated straight through. The incomparably sturdy scales of the Iron Scaled Sheep were completely useless. Peng, so what if it was in the late stage of Core Formation Tier? That Iron Scaled Sheep did not","even manage to release a wail before collapsing loudly.","And on the other side, the body of the arrow had already pierced through.","The destructive power of this arrow was truly terrifying. The entrance was very small, but the","exit formed a huge hole that was about three meters wide. The internal organs and bones","inside had all been shattered.","Otherwise, it would have been impossible to insta-kill this great beast with a single strike.","Instantly, everyone erupted in cheers. A King-level great beast had actually fallen so easily. Even Ling Han was slightly stunned. Although he had long since known that this arrow was extremely powerful, he was still filled with shock when he saw it with his own eyes. However, even though this battle had ended so quickly, in order to draw the Iron Scaled Sheep","over and slow it down, the Zhou Clan had still paid a certain price. A few clansmen had died, and even three of the four great Core Formation Tier elites had been wounded, and one of","them was severely wounded."]},{"number":3884,"title":"Chapter 3884: A narrow victory","paragraphs":["Chapter 3884: A narrow victory","The ideal situation was that they would discover the lair of the Iron Scaled Sheep, and then draw out the beast king. Then, they would deliver a fatal strike. In that way, there would be no casualties.","It could not be helped. Reality and expectations could not possibly be completely in sync.","At first, they had wanted to kill all eight of the beast kings in one go, but by the looks of it now, that was obviously impossible.","Thus, everyone could only rest and reorganize here.","This was good too. This area was now their territory, so they could go and find the Celestial medicine.","Ling Han was completely unscathed. He naturally couldn’t just sit there. He also went to look for Celestial medicines.","-That Heaven Hunting Crossbow and arrow had been taken back by the Zhou Clan. The reason was that they had to calibrate it. After all, the might of the arrow was too great. Every shot would affect the crossbow and arrow, so in order to ensure the accuracy of the next shot, they had to calibrate and maintain it.","Ling Han naturally knew that it was because the Zhou Clan was worried. After all, this powerful weapon was too terrifying.","He did not refuse. Now, it was the honeymoon period of their cooperation, so they both had to show their sincerity.","After two days, he had really found a few Two Star Celestial medicines, but he did not ingest them immediately. Instead, he wanted to refine them into alchemical pills, so as to increase the efficiency rate.","On the third day, Zhou Mi came to find Ling Han, informing him he could hunt down a second beast king.","All right, then let’s set out.","Everyone was even more careful. After entering the territory of the second beast king, they still split up and went off to find the lair of that beast king.","This time, it was surprisingly smooth. That was because someone had seen that the beast king just happened to return from a hunt, so naturally, the lair was exposed.","After arriving at their destination, the Zhou Clan handed the crossbow bolts over to Ling Han.","After Ling Han had accumulated enough power, he had the Zhou Clan go and lure out the beast king. In the end, the moment it appeared, he shot it dead.","Everyone cheered. This time, there were no casualties. This was practically a miracle. Continue.","They continued to search for the third beast king.","The reason why it was so smooth was also because the second Demonic Beast was only in the early stage of Core Formation Tier. Whether it was its abilities or sensory abilities, they were considerably inferior. However, if it was a peak stage Core Formation Tier, it was very possible that it would discover danger ahead of time.","And what followed was this kind of great test.","The third beast king was a great beast at the peak stage of the Core Formation Tier. If it really came down to it, the four elites of the Core Formation Tier from the Zhou Clan would probably be killed completely within a few minutes.","Thus, everyone was extremely careful. If they were the slightest bit careless, the entire team could possibly be wiped out in an instant.","However, they still continued their good luck and found the beast king’s lair very smoothly.","As per usual, Ling Han began to make preparations, and then had the Zhou Clan go and lure out the beast king.","This was a black wolf, but it was not very big in size. It was not much different from an ordinary wild wolf, but its eyes were terrifyingly ferocious. Even a single glance at it would make one’s heart shudder, or even lose all battle prowess directly.","Xiu, Ling Han didn’t hesitate at all. His mind was calm, and he was unafraid of any aura or viciousness.","This arrow was still as domineering as ever.","Boom!","The arrow shot over, directly shattering the black wolf along with the mountain behind it.","“Killed again!”","“So awesome!”","“Five more times, and we’ll be done.”","Everyone cheered. However, someone immediately let out a tragic cry, which then came to an","abrupt stop.","“Ah!” “Ah!” “Ah!”","Tragic wails rang out endlessly, as if they were playing a musical piece.","What was going on?","Amidst the dust and dirt, everyone was horrified to discover that there was a black shadow rapidly shuttling through, easily reaping human lives.","Hiss, it was that black wolf!","It did not die, but with the latter half of its body missing, it could be seen that the damaged intestines were still dragging out, which was both terrifying and disgusting.","However, it was an existence at the peak stage of the Core Formation Tier. Even with such heavy injuries, its battle prowess was still incredibly terrifying.","Without the slightest hesitation, Zhou Mi said to Ling Han, “We will detain it, and you fire the second arrow as soon as possible.”","“All right.” Ling Han nodded.","The four Core Formation Tier cultivators from the Zhou Clan charged forward. Apart from them, no one else could withstand a single strike from this black wolf, even if it was severely","wounded.","However, that black wolf had absolutely no intention of tangling with the four of them. It was just using its two forelegs to burst out with speed, and was still going on a killing spree in the","-crowd.","All of a sudden, blood flowed like a river.","The people who had died were basically all members of the Zhou Clan. When outsiders saw that the situation was dire, they would naturally immediately shatter their tokens and teleport out of the Mystery Realm to save their lives. Meanwhile, some people had powerful backgrounds, possessing life-saving rare treasures. In fact, the might of their counterattacks was extremely terrifying, and even the black wolf was wary, turning around to attack the","others.","Ling Han continued to observe as he accumulated power. Although this was an unexpected turn of events, it gave him a chance to check out everyone’s trump cards.","However, Song Lan was far too smart, and she immediately retreated from the battle. In fact, she hadn’t even come close to Ling Han before. Now, she could stay out of this battle and watch from the sidelines.","Yi, there were really crouching tigers and hidden dragons among them.","Ling Han saw that there were a few people who were quite extraordinary. They had probably reached Seven Cauldrons of even Eight Cauldrons in battle prowess. Though they were far from being a match for the black wolf, they all had rare treasures on them, which allowed them to stubbornly survive.","Thankfully, the black wold was severely injured after all. Though it had launched a counterattack in its fury, ignoring its injuries, after venting its anger, it was exhausted. Very soon, it was trapped by Zhou Mi and the others, and could no longer attack the others.","Seeing this, Ling Han naturally wasn’t in a hurry. After a whole fifteen minutes, he finally","fired an arrow.","Boom!","This time, it was no longer possible for the black wolf to escape. His head was directly blown off, and he was completely and utterly dead.","The vicious beast at the peak stage of the Core Formation Tier was truly terrifying. It couldn’t kill the sneak attacker, and instead counterattacked, killing at least a few dozen people.","A narrow victory.","The members of the Zhou Clan were all unable to feel happy. Initially, they thought that after they had obtained a deadly weapon, they would be able to sweep aside all opposition in the Heavenly Cloud Mountains. They had not thought that they would encounter a Core Formation Tier beast king, which immediately taught them a bloody lesson.","This time, their raid had to be postponed again. With so many casualties and injuries, they","naturally had to make some adjustments.","Thus, those who were still alive continued to search for Celestial medicines.","They were willing to take the risk, naturally for the sake of their gains.","A great many people were still thinking of supreme great opportunities. Aside from Celestial medicines, there was also the legendary celestial light here, which could be cultivated to become supreme divine light, destroying everything in the world. There was also divine substance, which could stimulate the evolution of Celestial Foundations, Celestial Cauldrons, and Celestial pills, so that they could charge towards a perfect level.","It had to be said that there were really people who had encountered great fortune.","“It’s Liu Chuang.”","“He obtained a divine substance, and raised the level of the Celestial Cauldron.”","“What? He was originally a golden cauldron, the strongest Celestial Cauldron in the world. If he advances another step further, how can he be any stronger?” “You don’t understand. The golden cauldron is not the strongest Celestial Cauldron. Impurities can be further removed, and it can become a special Celestial Cauldron like the platinum cauldron, crystal cauldron, golden jade cauldron, and so on, crushing the golden","cauldron.”","“Hiss, why have I never heard of it?”","“Hehe, that is because you are ignorant and ill-informed.”","When Ling Han heard about this, he was also slightly surprised. He had seen this Liu Chuang","before. Previously, when the black wolf wreaked havoc, this Liu Chuang was the one who had displayed Seven Cauldrons in battle prowess, ranking eighth in the Galaxy Network. Now that he had obtained the divine substance, allowing the Celestial Cauldron to evolve, his battle prowess would definitely increase greatly. However, whose Celestial Cauldron could evolve to his level?"]},{"number":3885,"title":"Chapter 3885: Divine Substance","paragraphs":["Chapter 3885: Divine Substance","The length of time that the sweep operation had been halted had exceeded Ling Han’s expectations.","Half a month had passed, and there was still no movement from the Zhou Clan.","Ling Han was in no hurry either. The Heavenly Clouds Mountain was too big, and there were opportunities everywhere. He had no plans to leave immediately.","He too wanted to obtain the divine substance. Who knew if he could still evolve his Celestial Cauldron.","When this luck came, there was no way to block it.","Ling Han entered into a valley, and found a Celestial medicine. Then, beside the Celestial medicine, he saw a rock that was like white jade. He could clearly see that there was a golden substance flowing within. There was no need to cut open the rock, and he could already sense a powerful activity.","This was... a divine substance.","Ling Han brought the Celestial medicine and stone back. Then, he sliced open a corner of the stone, and drew out the divine substance within. It took effect on the Celestial Cauldron in his mind.","Then, Ling Han immediately discovered that his Celestial Cauldron was completely ignoring this divine substance. Even the sixth cauldron that he had not completely cultivated had no intention of absorbing this divine substance to construct itself.","In other words, his Celestial Cauldron was far superior in quality, so the so-called divine substance had no effect on him at all.","Ling Han was both happy and depressed. What he was happy about was naturally how high the level of his Celestial Cauldron was. Even if someone had endless divine substance, they could not possibly improve the Celestial Foundation, Celestial Cauldron or Celestial pill to the level of being his equal. And what depressed him was the fact that the treasures that others fought over were completely useless to him. Wasn’t that a waste?","Yi?","He suddenly discovered that the divine substance in the rock was being lost. Though the rate was very slow, at this rate, it would completely dissipate in less than a day.","F***, this could only be naturally sealed?","What should he do?","If he used it on himself, it would be equivalent to a waste.","He could sell it.","Ling Han’s eyes lit up. If he wanted to sell it, he naturally had to sell it to someone rich and imposing. It would be best if he could auction it off. That way, the profits would definitely be maximized.","Unfortunately, there was no time now.","He had no option but to seek out Song Lan.","-In such a short amount of time, if he wanted to find someone familiar, and one that was rich and imposing at that, who else could it be but Song Lan?","He went to look for Song Lan. Unexpectedly, Liu Chuang was also there. The two of them talked about something, and the atmosphere was quite good.","“Lan Lan, I have something to tell you.” Ling Han spoke without thinking. He wanted to see how Song Lan would lose her composure but be unable to do anything to him.","However, this time, Liu Chuang’s face had already turned green before Song Lan had even lost her composure.","Ling Han did not give him the chance to show his anger, and beckoned Song Lan over, “Are you coming or not? Otherwise, if you regret it in future, don’t come looking for me.”","Song Lan only hesitated for less than half a second, then smiled apologetically at Liu Chuang, “Brother Liu, I’ll be right back.”","Hearing Song Lan’s words, Liu Chuang could only pretend to be gentlemanly as he clasped his hands and said, “Celestial maiden Song, please.”","Song Lan followed Ling Han to a small forest, then said, “Don’t pretend to be profound and mysterious. What’s the matter?”","“I’ll sell you something good,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“What is it?”","“Nutritious tonic for pregnancy.”","Shua, Song Lan delivered a palm strike, “Be serious.”","Ling Han took out the jade stone, and said, “Here, I accidentally obtained some divine substance, and plan to sell it. Are you interested? If not, I’ll find someone else.”","No kidding, of course I’m interested.","Song Lan’s eyes immediately lit up, but a puzzled expression appeared on her face, “Why do you not want it yourself?”","‘I’m too awesome. Even divine substances have no effect on me.’","Ling Han didn’t reply with such words that could garner jealousy. Instead, he said, “I’ll sell,","you buy, and if you don’t buy, I’ll find someone else.”","What he meant was to quickly make a bid, and stop blabbering nonsense.","Song Lan couldn’t help but feel enraged. She was the ninth beauty on the Exquisite Leaderboard, so what man would not curry her favour?","But what about Ling Han?","It was either that he was glib-tongued with her, or that he completely ignored her. In short,","he actually did not take her seriously.","How could this not infuriate her?","“What do you want?” she asked calmly, suppressing her fury. Divine substances were too important to her.","“Imperial Technique.” Ling Han made an exorbitant demand.","“Hehe.” Song Lan rolled her eyes.","What a joke. Just how awesome was the Imperial Technique? Even the resources of a Holy Land could not be exchanged for it.","Ai, it was clear that he would not be able to deceive her out of an Imperial Technique. However, Song Lan had only come from a Venerate Tier force. If she had really grasped an Imperial Technique, then her luck would be too nature-defying.","Even Ling Han had only mastered one style of the Demonic Monkey Fists, and the “An” character in the Six Characters Bright King Curse.","“Then, Saint Technique.” Ling Han settled for the next best thing. Though Song Lan did not come from the Holy Land, for a prodigy like herself, Ling Han would not find it strange if she had obtained a Saint Technique.","Song Lan shook her head, “I can teach you a palm technique of the fourth pinnacle level.”","“Hehe.” This time, it was Ling Han’s turn to roll his eyes. Though Venerate Tier-level palm techniques were also astonishingly valuable, they were clearly considerably inferior to divine","substances.","“Saint Technique,” he insisted.","“Impossible.” Song Lan did not give in either.","At this moment, it was naturally time to make an exorbitant bid, bargaining on the spot.","After a tug-of-war, Song Lan finally agreed to trade for an incomplete Saint Technique.","Ling Han also agreed, because it was impossible for him to drag things out for too long. Otherwise, if the divine substance was completely lost, he would not be able to get anything","out of it.","The two of them exchanged the goods. Ling Han obtained a jade piece, while Song Lan","obtained that stone.","Both sides immediately used their divine sense to scan the object in their hands, and both of","them smiled.","Very good, the other party had not played any tricks.","“Pleasure trading with you.” Song Lan smiled beautifully.","“Then give me a hug.” Ling Han spread open his arms.","Song Lan rolled her eyes at him before turning around to leave.","However, after taking a few steps, she stopped, turned around and glared harshly at Ling Han.","Then, she sped up and left.","Obviously, she had discovered the loss of divine substance, which made her feel regret. If she had known earlier, she could have ruthlessly bargained. The initiative was completely in her","hands.","Too bad, too unfortunate.","There was no time for her to argue with Ling Han. She had to refine the divine substance at the","first instant. Every second that passed was a massive waste.","Ling Han snickered, and he too turned around and left. However, he had just walked out of the small forest when he saw Liu Chuang.","This young prodigy’s expression was considerably ugly. Because he was worried, he had tailed","them, and thus waited outside the forest. In the end, not too long after, he saw Song Lan race","out, her expression sullen.","Obviously, Ling Han must have greatly offended this Celestial maiden, or even made some","inappropriate request.","This was really too despicable.","“Ling Han, you actually dare to blaspheme Fairy Song. Today, I will definitely not spare you,”","he said balefully.","Yi, what was he talking about?","Ling Han shook his head, “Has your brain gone muddled from fever?”","“Kneel!” Liu Chuang charged over, every move swift and fierce. He was going to beat Ling","Han to the ground.","He was extremely extraordinary. Before entering into the Mystery Realm, he had already ranked in the top 80 or so on the Galaxy Network. Now that the quality of the Celestial Cauldron had increased greatly, his battle prowess had naturally improved further. Perhaps, he could reach the top 60, or even the top 50."]},{"number":3886,"title":"Chapter 3886: Wind God Kick","paragraphs":["Chapter 3886: Wind God Kick","However, it was a shame that even Lu Qi, the elite ranked 19th in the Galaxy Network, was no match for Ling Han, much less Liu Chuang.","That’s right. Galaxy Network battles and real-life battles were two different things.","The Galaxy Network Battles disregarded all external factors, such as Spirit Tool, Talisman Weapon, and so on. Thus, in a real battle, those who were ranked lower might be able to win against those who were ranked higher. However, the ranking of the former wouldn’t be too low either, especially when one had reached the level of Liu Chuang. The gap between them was definitely withing the range of ten rankings.","-Unless it was someone like Lin Qi, who could combust his Imperial Blood. That was too unique.","At the very least, Liu Chuang wasn’t from an Imperial Clan.","Thus, even if his abilities had improved greatly, he would still be helpless against Ling Han. He would not be able to use his full abilities at all, and very soon, Ling Han would be beating him down.","“Go!” Liu Chuang made his final struggle. He summoned the Celestial Cauldron, wanting to use the Celestial Cauldron to suppress Ling Han.","However, this was completely useless.","It was already enough that Ling Han didn’t use the Celestial Cauldron to suppress him. He still wanted to suppress Ling Han? What a joke!","Ling Han gave Liu Chuang a good beating, but did not intend to take his life. After all, there was no deep hatred between them. Furthermore, if he really showed killing intent, Liu Chuang would also be able to shatter his token and escape from the Mystery Realm.","But it was this kind of indifference that made Liu Chuang even more furious.","“I will definitely get my revenge!”","He was presently at Seven Cauldrons, and was only a sliver away from Eight Cauldrons. He was sure that when he advanced into Eight Cauldrons, with his Celestial Cauldron that surpassed the Golden Celestial Cauldron, he would definitely be able to suppress Ling Han.","...","Yet Ling Han did not take it to heart at all. After he returned to his tent, he began to study the Saint Technique that Song Lan had given him.","This was called Wind God Kick, and as the name implies, it was naturally a kicking technique. If one cultivated it to an absolute high level, he would be able to destroy planets with a single kick.","However, this Wind God Kick was an incomplete version, and was inferior to a Saint Technique by a whole lot, but it was much stronger than a technique of the fourth pinnacle level.","Ling Han began to study it.","A Saint Technique was a Saint Technique, and it was extraordinarily difficult to cultivate it. Furthermore, this was only an incomplete version. Its might was weaker, but it was even more difficult to understand, because there were a great many gaps that needed to be filled in with one’s own understanding.","But how could a Cauldron Forging Tier compare to the martial arts comprehension of a Saint?","Thus, cultivating this cultivation technique was extremely slow, and its might was even inferior.","However, as Ling Han’s cultivation level increased, he would naturally be able to repair the shortcomings of this Saint Technique, turning it into a true Saint Technique.","After spending a total of seven days, Ling Han finally grasped the basics.","With a thought, he began to study the Demonic Monkey Fists again.","There were a total of nine styles in the Demonic Monkey Fists, and he had only mastered one style. Moreover, he had only mastered it when he had been in the Foundation Building Tier. Now, not only had he advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier, he had already stood at the height of Six Cauldrons. Could he cultivate another style, or even two styles?","Ling Han began to comprehend. Imperial Techniques were definitely not something that could be attained through hard work. One could only comprehend them through hard work.","If he understood, he understood, and if he didn’t, he didn’t.","This was incredibly difficult. Ling Han’s advancement through the levels of the Demonic Monkey Fists was slow, but he revealed a joyful expression, because in the past, he did not have the slightest bit of hope. Now, though it was still slow, but he had a very high chance of cultivating the second form of the Demonic Monkey Fists.","Ling Han was filled with anticipation. This was an Imperial Technique.","He cultivated diligently for another three days, and decided to go out and relax. That was because he had encountered a bottleneck. It did not mean that he would definitely be able to comprehend it through hard cultivation. Thus, he might as well change his mood, and come back to comprehend it. Who knows, he would be able to comprehend it.","He had not taken too many steps, when he saw Song Lan.","Yi, he immediately discovered that the present Song Lan had changed. It was not in terms of appearance, but rather in terms of bearing.","She appeared even more ethereal. In layman’s terms, her Celestial Qi had become even heavier.","Obviously, not only had she refined the divine substance, she had also greatly improved the Celestial Cauldron, which was why there was such an obvious change in her bearing.","“Yo, my Little Lan Lan has become even more beautiful,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Song Lan merely looked at him quietly, and couldn’t even be bothered to bicker with him. This would greatly lower her class.","“Let’s spar for a while,” Song Lan said, appearing to be filled with confidence.","Her cultivation level had not changed much, but the quality of the Celestial Cauldron had increased greatly, which made her eager to give it a try.","“Sure.”","Ling Han nodded in understanding. He also wanted to test out the might of the Wind God Kick.","The two of them battled, and Ling Han immediately discovered that Song Lan’s strength had improved greatly. The quality of this Celestial Cauldron had increased, and the effect on her battle prowess was also immediately apparent.","However, Song Lan was even more stunned.","She was the one who had taught the Wind God Kick to Ling Han. Thus, she naturally knew it as well. With a comparison, she was very clear that Ling Han’s accomplishment in the Wind God Kick was already very, very high, and was not inferior to her at all.","This guy’s comprehension ability was also terrifying, wasn’t it?","In the past, when she had obtained this Saint Technique, she had spent a whole three months to master it. It could not be helped. The incomplete version was too difficult to learn, and this was already considered fast enough. In the Song Clan, the person with the second highest natural talent had spent a whole two years to be able to learn it.","However, compared to Ling Han, they were all trash.","This guy’s comprehension ability was practically freakish.","The two of them battled for a while, and then both of them stopped.","Ling Han had a whole new respect for this woman who was as beautiful as a fairy. Previously,","he had only thought that she was two-faced, but now, there was another impression, and that","she was an elite.","With a gap of two cauldrons, Song Lan was not inferior to him at all. Her battle prowess could be considered extremely shocking.","“Brother Ling’s strength and comprehension ability is truly astonishing,” Song Lan said with","a serious expression.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Little Lan Lan, have you been charmed by me? Decided that you","are not going to marry anyone but me?”","Yet Song Lan looked up at the skies, and said calmly, “My ideal husband would be like ‘Number One in the Galaxy’, breaking the records of all eternity, looking down on all past and","present.”","This!","Ling Han rubbed his nose. If it wasn’t for the fact that he had protected his own secrets very well, he would have suspected that this woman was deliberately expressing her affection for","him.","“Sigh, I really didn’t expect that you would actually have a crush on me.”","Song Lan chuckled, and couldn’t be bothered with a narcissistic guy like him. “To be honest with you, I’m Number One in the Galaxy,” Ling Han said with a smile.","If he hadn’t been so cheeky, perhaps Song Lan would have believed him a little. Now, however, she naturally felt that Ling Han was deliberately taking advantage of her.","Oh, I say, I admire this kind of man, and you say that you are Number One in the Galaxy. That would be too deliberate, too obvious, and too low-level.","Right at this moment, a member of the Zhou Clan walked over and said, “Young Master Ling,","the clan leader invites you over.”","Very simple, the Zhou Clan had mostly recovered, and could continue to sweep through the","Heavenly Clouds Mountains.","Fine, then let’s continue.","This time, their target was still a Beast King at the peak stage of the Core Formation Tier. This","was a large gorilla, but it also had a pair of wings on its back.","Tough to deal with.","In this place, Foundation Building Tiers, Cauldron Forging Tiers couldn’t fly on their weapons, and Core Formation Tiers couldn’t roam the heaven and earth with their physical bodies, as if there was something; lacking. However, those with wings weren’t included. This Gorilla King could fly, and this “gave it a boost”, making it even harder to deal with. This time, they didn’t dare to be careless anymore. Even outsiders were equipped with lightning spears. Although this wasn’t as powerful as the Heaven Hunting Crossbow, if many people attacked at the same time, its might would still be considerable.","Two days later, they found the lair of the Gorilla King."]},{"number":3887,"title":"Chapter 3887: Tide of breakthroughs","paragraphs":["Chapter 3887: Tide of breakthroughs","This time, everyone was naturally even more careful.","If one didn’t learn his lesson after suffering once, how could such a person be worthy of living in such a dangerous world?","After the Gorilla King was drawn out, Ling Han shot out an arrow from his bow, directly exploding the left side of the large gorilla’s body. Then, everyone simultaneously used their lightning spears to attack, and added with the four Core Formation Tier cultivators restraining it, they actually managed to kill the Gorilla King at the price of the deaths of a mere three people.","This battle merit was truly astonishing, causing everyone to cheer endlessly.","After a short rest and reorganization, they began to search for the third Core Formation Tier Beast King these three Beast Kings occupied the most essence part of the Heavenly Cloud Mountain. Here, there were the largest number of Celestial medicines, and power of heaven and earth was the most concentrated, so they also grew near to one another.","The last Core Formation Tier Beast King was a giant python that was snow-white all over and several hundred meters long.","The hearing of snakes was extremely sharp, and this python was no exception. Before they surrounded it completely, it had already charged out, and began a massacre.","This python king was so colossal, so it naturally didn’t have any weaknesses. Ling Han aimed directly for its head, and shot out an arrow. Peng, the python’s head immediately exploded, but like a centipede, even if it was dead, it didn’t become stiff, what more when it was a vicious beast of the Core Formation Tier. The python’s eyes had turned into bloody holes, but it was still in a great killing spree, its temperament terrifyingly enduring.","Thankfully, its eyes were blind, and its ears were gone. At present, the python could only rely on its divine sense to sense the location of every single person. However, in a state of fury, its judgement would definitely be affected.","Everyone went all out. This giant python was too terrifying. One whiplash from its tail was enough to break a mountain rock, and if it was wrapped around a mountain, it would be able to forcibly shatter the mountain. If one was not careful, he would die.","After battling for two hours, the battle finally ended.","Unlike before, when the Beast King had been killed, and there was practically nothing left behind, the python’s damaged part was only its head, and the majority of its body was still unscathed. Thus, there was a large amount of vicious beast meat to be used.","The meat of a Core Formation Tier beast would definitely be extremely nutritious.","At night, everyone feasted to their heart’s content, and a full snake feast was held. With a bite of snake meat, they felt warm all over, and vitality diffused. It was indescribably refreshing.","On the spot, a few members of the Zhou Clan completed their breakthrough, leaping from the Foundation Building Tier to the Cauldron Forging Tier, and there was a “veteran” Cauldron Forging Tier whose cultivation level had loosened, probably breaking through to the Core Formation Tier in a few days’ time.","It couldn’t be helped. The people of this world simply cultivated faster.","The outsiders were all extremely envious, but when they thought about how the advancement of this kind of cultivation level would consume one’s life, it was enough to scare them off.","Right at this moment, a terrifying aura surged from one of them, causing the people in the surroundings to hurriedly leave.","Liu Chuang.","“Hiss, this guy is about to break through.”","“I heard that this guy has long since reached Seven Cauldrons. If he wants to break through again, then it would either be Eight Cauldrons, or it would be the Core Formation Tier.”","“It shouldn’t be the Core Formation Tier. Stepping into the Core Formation Tier is a qualitative leap, and although his aura is terrifying now, he still hasn’t crossed that line.” “En, he should be about to advance into Eight Cauldrons.”","“Actually, this is even more terrifying, because it is a sure bet that a prodigy like him would be able to break through to the Core Formation Tier. Then, breaking through from Seven Cauldrons is a completely different concept than breaking through from Eight Cauldrons.” “That’s right. In future, among the top prodigies, there should be a place for him.”","“Sigh, obtaining divine substance to improve the quality of the Celestial Cauldron is already a great fortune. And now, he has actually advanced into Eight Cauldrons. How am I supposed to live?”","Everyone was exclaiming in shock, and some people’s eyes were flickering. Should they secretly make a move to ruin Liu Chuang’s breakthrough this time? Then, even if Liu Chuang could still find an opportunity in future, that could possibly be a matter of a few years later. For top-notch prodigies, could they afford a few years of difference?","Xiu, Liu Chuang’s figure flashed, and instantly disappeared into the horizon.","He wasn’t stupid, so how could he possibly break through here? Previously, after consuming the python’s meat, his cultivation that had already reached the critical point had obtained an opportunity to break through. Now that he had grasped this opportunity, he naturally had to find an uninhabited place to break through.","No one pursued him. That would be too obvious.","Meanwhile, Ling Han asked for a large amount of python meat from the Zhou Clan. He wanted to concoct the Spiritual Movement Pill.","This could increase one’s cultivation level, and the raw ingredients were the meat of a vicious beast and Celestial medicine. The combination was a little casual, and different grades of Vicious Beast Meat and Celestial medicine would affect the effects of the alchemical pill. A beast king of the Core Formation Tier, wasn’t it awesome? Of course it was. Add to that the Celestial medicines that he had harvested a few days ago, and there just happened to be a few that were suitable for concoction. Thus, Ling Han immediately began concocting alchemical pills.","He had only failed once, and Ling Han had concocted three cauldrons of Spiritual Movement Pills in a single go.","He took out a pill and ingested it. Instantly, the energy in his body surged like the tide.","Ling Han smiled. In the first place, he was only a sliver away from the peak stage of Six Cauldrons. If he ingested the Spiritual Movement Pill every day, he would probably only need three to four days to cultivate to the consummate level of Six Cauldrons.","It just so happened that the team also needed to rest and reorganize. Furthermore, the three most troublesome peak stage Core Formation Tier Demonic Beasts had already been killed, and the remaining three Demonic Beasts would definitely be much easier to deal with. Ling Han ingested a Spiritual Movement Pill every day, and by the fourth day, he had already reached consummate level of Six Cauldrons.","All right, he began to charge towards Seven Cauldrons.","Ling Han left quietly, finding a cave. Then, he sealed the cave entrance, sat cross-legged inside, and began to charge towards Seven Cauldrons.","He still didn’t feel like he had reached a bottleneck. Everything went smoothly, and two days later, he found the trigger for his breakthrough. He ingested a few drops of Earth Spirit Milk, then began to condense the Celestial Cauldron’s core.","At this moment, he finally felt pressure.","-The other six cauldrons had developed a repelling effect on the new Celestial Cauldron, but the repelling effect was not strong. Thus, he still managed to form the core of the seventh","cauldron very smoothly.","However, if he wanted to condense the eighth cauldron, the pressure would probably increase considerably, and the ninth cauldron would undoubtedly be even more difficult.","He had to hurry up and obtain the celestial light. Otherwise, when he advanced into the Core Formation Tier, he would no longer be able to absorb the celestial light, and cultivate divine","light.","Another two hours later, the seventh cauldron was completed. It floated in his mind. It had clearly just formed, but it had an ancient feel to it, as if it could connect the past, present, and","future.","Peng, Ling Han blasted open the rock, and strode out.","He was Seven Cauldrons now; what other Cauldron Forging Tier in the world was a match for","him?","He returned to the camp, only to see two people calling out at the same time.","“Ling Han, hurry up and leave. Liu Chuang is here to challenge you to a duel!” “Young Master Ling, hurry up and meet the clan leader. He’s been looking for you for several","days.”","Huh, one wanted him to leave, and the other told him not to leave. Who would he listen to? Ling Han naturally wouldn’t listen to either of them. He had his own ideas.","Liu Chuang?","Oh, he had broken through to Eight Cauldrons, and thought that he could be invincible now.","Hehe.","Ling Han was completely unconcerned, and said to the members of the Zhou Clan, “I need to take a bath first, and after I’m done, I’ll go back to see Zhou Mi.”","That member of the Zhou Clan opened his mouth to speak, but could not speak. Now, they still had to depend on Ling Han, so he definitely could not afford to offend him."]},{"number":3888,"title":"Chapter 3888: Merely a single strike","paragraphs":["Chapter 3888: Merely a single strike","Ling Han leisurely took a bath, then changed into clean clothes, and only then did he walk out of the tent.","However, Liu Chuang was waiting outside, and there were still some outsiders behind him.","‘Heh, are you here to watch the excitement?’","Liu Chuang was proud, and the haze of his previous defeat to Ling Han was swept away. This was natural. He had broken through to Eight Cauldrons, and added with the fact that the Celestial Cauldron had surpassed the level of Gold, he naturally had explosive confidence, and thought that he was invincible in this world.","“Ling Han, kneel!” he shouted coldly.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. “You’ve only broken through to Eight Cauldrons. What, you think you’re invincible in this world?”","Everyone shook their heads, thinking that Ling Han was too confident.","Just how wide was the gap between Seven Cauldrons and Eight Cauldrons?","In terms of the Galaxy Network’s ranking, a Seven Cauldrons was roughly between 50 and 100, while an Eight Cauldrons was between 10 and 50-only supreme prodigies who had formed nine cauldrons could squeeze into the top 10.","Unfortunately, no one in the North Heavenly Realm managed to form nine cauldrons, so naturally, no one managed to squeeze into the top ten.","It was said that after attaining Nine Cauldrons, when battling, the nine Celestial Cauldrons would appear at the same time, possessing great might. There was no need for them to make a move at all, and they would be able to make elites of Eight Cauldrons fall to the ground.","This was a digression.","Since the North Heavenly Realm didn’t have supreme elites with nine cauldrons, then Eight Cauldrons was the highest grade. At least in the area of the North Heavenly Realm, that was indeed invincible in their cultivation level.","Liu Chuang laughed in spite of himself. He shook his head, “You are just an ant, so how would you know how strong Eight Cauldrons is!”","Ling Han crooked a finger at him, “Come, I will teach you how to behave!”","“Ling Han, you are too arrogant!” Liu Chuang strode towards Ling Han. One after another, the Celestial Cauldrons channelled out. It looked like pure gold, yet had a kind of jade-like halo, which was extremely beautiful.","However, as the Celestial Cauldron shook lightly, everyone’s expressions changed.","This was too terrifying. One after another, vicious auras surged out, causing a chill to rise up from the bottom of one’s heart.","This was the Celestial Cauldron that had surpassed the Golden Celestial Cauldron. Furthermore, it was eight cauldrons at that. With the two added together, it was as if Liu Chuang had become an invincible god.","“The current Liu Chuang, what position can he charge up to on the Galaxy Network rankings?”","“I think that even Lu Qi is not that strong.”","“Hiss, then wouldn’t that be in the top twenty, at least?”","“Naturally. Eight Cauldrons is already not inferior to Lu Qi, what more when Liu Chuang’s Celestial Cauldron has advanced another step further?”","“Golden Jade Celestial Cauldron, he has advanced to a higher level!”","Everyone sighed ruefully. Even those who had personally witnessed Ling Han defeat Lu Qi felt that he did not have much of a chance of winning.","That was because Liu Chuang was really too strong.","Liu Chuang walked very slowly, like a cat toying with a mouse. He wanted Ling Han to","experience that deep chill, and only then would he be defeated by him in public, and be looked at with disdain by everyone.","“Submit!” he declared proudly.","Ling Han smiled, and raised his right hand, “To defeat you, I only need one move.”","Arrogant, he was really too arrogant.","Liu Chuang took a deep breath. He planned to use his strongest ultimate move to defeat Ling Han in a single strike.","Right at this moment, Ling Han tapped him lightly.","Zi!","A flash of lightning shot out, its speed ridiculously fast.","Then, Liu Chuang was sent flying. Peng, he blasted a hole into a mountain in the distance, and then disappeared within.","Sand and rocks filled the air, and dust flew into the sky.","Everyone was dumbfounded, staring numbly at Ling Han’s right hand.","With just a snap of his fingers, Liu Chuang was sent flying.","F***, you are too freakish, aren’t you?","That was Eight Cauldrons!","Even Eight Cauldrons was no match for Ling Han. Hiss, could it be that Ling Han was Nine Cauldrons?","—Just think, when Ling Han was still at Six Cauldrons, he was already capable of fighting Lu Qi, who was at Eight Cauldrons, to a tie. Now, not only had he advanced into Seven Cauldrons, the divine light of lightning could match an Imperial Technique.","Thus, even though Ling Han had only snapped his fingers lightly, it was no different from using his full strength to blast out the Demonic Monkey Fists. How difficult would it be to defeat Liu Chuang with a single move?","‘That’s right!’","Thinking of the Demonic Monkey Fists, Ling Han suddenly came to a realization. He turned around and returned to his tent to begin comprehending.","This...","Everyone was speechless. He had defeated an Eight Cauldrons, and actually returned to his tent as if nothing had happened. Just how much did he not take Liu Chuang to heart?","This time, Liu Chuang was truly asking for his own humiliation. Not only had he failed to defeat Ling Han, he had instead been ruthlessly humiliated.","He did not even treat him as a rival!","Only an hour later, Ling Han suddenly erupted into loud laughter.","He had finally grasped the second form of the Demonic Monkey Fists!","This made him very excited, because this was an Imperial Technique.","He mulled over it carefully. The two styles of Demonic Monkey Fists were connected from the beginning to the end. If they were used separately, then the might of the first style and the second style would not be much different. However, if they were used together, the might of the second style would be double that of the first style.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel expectant. Then what if he used three or four styles consecutively, or even nine styles in fact? Could the might still be stacked like this?","“Ling Han!” At this moment, an impatient shout was heard from outside.","Ling Han opened his tent and saw that it was Zhou Miyang who was standing outside.","“Why aren’t you calling me uncle?” Ling Han asked calmly.","His relationship with Zhou Mi was one of equals, so it was disrespectful for Zhou Miyang to address him directly by name.","Zhou Miyang humphed, naturally extremely displeased, but when he recalled his father’s instructions, he still lowered his head, and said, “My father has been waiting for you for a","very long time.”","“Oh.”","Ling Han nodded, and did not explain, nor did he say anything to apologize, which made Zhou","Miyang even more furious.","They went to see Zhou Mi. In truth, it was not a big deal. The Zhou Clan had already reorganized themselves, and they could continue to sweep through the remaining three","Demonic Beasts.","The sixth beast king was a late stage Core Formation Tier great beast. Of course, it wasn’t easy","to deal with either. More importantly, it would also summon its lackeys, attracting beast tides all over the mountains and plains.","Though this beast king was very quickly killed, the beast tide had already formed, and still caused great damage.","Right, this time, they needed more time to recover.","Ling Han walked in the mountains. He was searching for divine substance. This time, he definitely wouldn’t open it again. Instead, he would store it away for the empress, Hu Niu,","and the others.","Of course, he wouldn’t complain about having too much of such good stuff.","Don’t say, Ling Han’s luck was really not bad. After roaming around in the mountains for","three days, he actually found two portions of divine substance. If this was known to others, they would definitely die of envy.","Everyone more or less had some gains. Some had obtained Celestial medicines, while others had obtained divine substances, but no one had obtained the even more precious celestial light aside from Ling Han, but this had not been obtained from the Heavenly Clouds","Mountain.","After resting for a few days, the sweep continued.","After a battle, everyone practically did not expend any energy.","“Continue, kill the last beast king, and the Heavenly Clouds Mountains will be completely cleared,” Zhou Mi said. This was the long-cherished wish of more than ten generations of the Zhou Clan. Now, it was only a sliver away from being fulfilled, which naturally excited the members of the Zhou Clan, though they had also paid the price of several hundred lives for it. Zhou Miyang glanced at Ling Han, and a smile appeared at the corners of his lips. However, it was filled with killing intent. Thus, he quickly withdrew his smile. Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I’ll leave the final beast king to you guys.”"]},{"number":3889,"title":"Chapter 3889: Showdown","paragraphs":["Chapter 3889: Showdown","“Young friend Ling, what is the meaning of this?” Zhou Mi frowned.","Ling Han spread his hands and said, “The last Beast King is the weakest in terms of abilities. It’s at the early stage of Core Formation Tier, and its battle prowess is only at the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, at most. With the strength of Clan leader Zhou and the others, taking it down is absolutely no problem.”","“Hehe, young friend’s words are incorrect. Ferocious beasts have no intelligence, and under a life-or-death counterattack, even we would inevitably be injured. Hence, we still have to depend on young friend’s help,” Zhou Mi said with a smile.","“So that’s how it is.” Ling Han nodded.","“Young friend, there is only one last step left. Please continue.” Zhou Mi said seriously.","Ling Han nodded, “Alright, bring the Heaven Hunting Crossbow over.”","Instantly, the members of the Zhou Clan all fell silent.","After a while, after careful consideration, he forced a smile and said, “The Heaven Hunting Crossbow is currently being calibrated. There’s no hurry, right?”","“I’m not in a rush either,” Ling Han said with a nod. “I’ll move out whenever the crossbow is delivered.”","“Ling Han, what’s the meaning of this!” Zhou Miyang couldn’t help but rebuke.","“Nephew, you have to be respectful to your elders.” Ling Han looked towards Zhou Miyang. Zhou Miyang trembled in anger. Brat, do you really think that you are some mighty figure? “Young friend, it would be better for you to set out first. In any case, searching for beast kings would need time,” he advised carefully.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I fear that if I set out now, I would really be on my way!”","“Young friend, why do you say such words?” Zhou Mi was surprised, as if he had suffered a great shock.","Ling Han shook his head, “Clan leader Zhou, your words are meaningless.”","He suddenly lashed out with his palm. Pa! Zhou Miyang was instantly sent flying.","This was too sudden, and no one had expected it. However, after the slap, all the members of the Zhou Clan stood up angrily, and glared furiously at Ling Han.","“What is the meaning of this, young friend?” Zhou Mi was still very calm, but the veins throbbing on his hands showed that his heart was actually not as calm as his expression.","Ling Han chuckled, and said, “I was thinking that if the Beast King appeared when I went to hunt down the last Demonic Beast, but you people didn’t give me the Heaven Hunting Crossbow, then wouldn’t I have died at the fangs of a Demonic Beast?”","When these words fell, the expressions of all the members of the Zhou Clan changed.","Zhou Mi carefully forced out a smile, “Young friend, you really know how to make wild guesses. How is this possible?”","“Thus, it would be best to give the Heaven Hunting Crossbow to me first, so as to calm my heart,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Young friend, please believe us!” Zhou Mi advised earnestly, his expression sincere. Ling Han’s expression was also sincere, “Clan leader Zhou, please believe me as well.”","Zhou Mi didn’t know how to continue. This brat was so young, but how could he be so slick? He would not accept gentle persuasion, nor did he fear threats; he was too hard to deal with. Ling Han smiled and said, “Previously, someone reminded me not to count money for others after being sold. I thought about it, and it made sense. For an upright and pure young man like me, it’s too easy to be deceived. I have to be more careful.”","Hearing these words, the members of the Zhou Clan all wanted to slap him.","And you call yourself upright and pure?","This was practically insulting to the words.","Ling Han, meanwhile, was completely unconcerned, and continued, “The Zhou Clan has Core Formation Tier martial artists, and as long as the wild beasts are all eliminated, you guys would be the masters. However, I am an exception, and am completely immune to your attacks. Thus, you guys are naturally very wary of me. Furthermore, hoho, half of the outputs from the Heavenly Clouds Mountain, so how could you surrender such a colossal wealth to someone else?”","“If it was me, my heart would also ache. I have to think of some way to kill this person.” “That’s simple. Even if you guys can’t kill them, aren’t there still ferocious beasts?”","“Am I right? I’m only a Cauldron Forging Tier. As long as a vicious beast of the Core Formation Tier comes, it’ll be able to easily kill me. Then, you guys can kill that final beast king. Perfect.”","“That’s why you placed the weakest beast king at the end and decided to use it to kill me. Even if you didn’t have the Heaven Hunting Crossbow, it wouldn’t be difficult for you to kill that beast king, right?”","When they heard Ling Han’s words, the members of the Zhou Clan all looked as if they had seen a ghost.","Could it be that it was a traitor that had told Ling Han about their plans? Otherwise, how could it be that Ling Han was not wrong at all?","However, how could they know that Ling Han had lived for so many years, and had seen all kinds of schemes and plots?","Conversely, though the Zhou Clan had four Core Formation Tier elites, they were limited by their hundred years of lifespan. With merely a few dozen years of experience, they still wanted to deceive Ling Han?","What a joke.","Since things had already come to this, there was no point in explaining any further.","Zhou Mi laughed loudly, “Young friend, you are really smart. That’s right, this is indeed our plan. Now, even if you know, so what? Seven beast kings have already fallen, and even without your help, we would still be able to kill the last one.”","“That’s right. I indeed can’t change the general trend.” Ling Han nodded, not angered at all, “However, if I want to beat up some people, or even kill some people in fact, who would be","able to stop me?”","Ling Han glared at Zhou Miyang, his killing intent on full display.","Zhou Mi carefully leaped out at the first instant, holding Zhou Miyang under his ribs. With his cultivation level of the Core Formation Tier, it was enough to protect his son.","Ling Han broke into a smile, “Does Clan leader Zhou intend to keep your son in your arms from now onwards? Furthermore, your son has not had a child yet, and Clan leader Zhou wants to watch from the sidelines when your son consummates his marriage?”","F***, so ruthless!","He couldn’t help but tremble slightly. One could only be a thief for a thousand days, but how could he be on guard for a thousand days?","There would always come times of carelessness. Could it be that he would have to be a conjoined infant with his son for the rest of his life?","Moreover, Zhou Miyang was not the only junior in the Zhou Clan. What about the others?","If there was anyone to blame, it would be Ling Han’s ability that was too strange, that even the four of them, the Core Formation Tier cultivators, could do nothing against him. Otherwise, there would have been no need to use the move of borrowing a wild beast to kill","him.","“I can’t possibly give the Heaven Hunting Crossbow to you,” Zhou Mi said after a moment of silence. Otherwise, Ling Han would have the ability to destroy the entire Zhou Clan.","He pondered for a moment, then continued, “I can give you 10% of the gains from the","Heavenly Clouds Mountain.”","10%?","Ling Han shook his head. “50%.”","“Impossible.” Zhou Mi shook his head, “There are so many people in our Zhou Clan, so how","could we possibly share half with you?”","Ling Han immediately moved. Zi, lightning flashed, and a junior of the Zhou Clan was directly","killed.","“You!” The members of the Zhou Clan all pointed angrily at Ling Han.","“Heh, to you people who want to kill me, it’s already very kind of me to be able to calmly","converse with you people here, and you still want to renege on what you rightfully owe me?” Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “One has to have integrity. If it’s your own words, you have","to do it even if you have to kneel!”","The members of the Zhou Clan were all enraged, yet were rendered speechless.","Could they do anything against Ling Han?","They couldn’t do anything to him.","And what about Ling Han?","Aside from the four Core Formation Tier elites of the Zhou Clan, no one else was a match for","him.","Thus, the Zhou Clan had to bow their heads.","“All right, I’ll give you half the profits!” Zhou Mi made a prompt decision.","Ling Han cracked a smile, then waved his hand, “Then, you guys have worked hard. Work","hard, I’m rooting for you!”","As for the last beast king, he would leave it to the Zhou Clan."]},{"number":3890,"title":"Chapter 3890: Black Heaven Temple","paragraphs":["Chapter 3890: Black Heaven Temple","Ling Han continued to roam around the Heavenly Clouds Mountain, searching for opportunities.","Unfortunately, though the Heavenly Clouds Mountain was huge, there was no trace of the celestial light anywhere.","Several days later, Ling Han returned to the Zhou Clan.","At this time, of course, all the beast kings had been cleaned out. Though the Zhou Clan had paid an exorbitant price, their gains were also very shocking. There were Celestial medicines, and a large number of dead beasts. These were all cultivation resources.","Ling Han directly took half. This made the Zhou Clan furious, but there was nothing they could do.","The outsiders were also envious, but even Li Chuang, an Eight Cauldrons, was no match for Ling Han. Which of them was a match for Ling Han?","Ling Han waited for a few more days, wanting to see if the empress and the others would come over, but ten days later, there was still no sign of the empress, Hu Niu, or the large black dog.","Helpless, he could only leave. He could still overlook the divine substance and Celestial medicine, but he was determined to get the celestial light.","He was sure that there were not many such treasures in the whole Mystery Realm, so he had to hurry.","Ling Han crossed over the Heavenly Clouds Mountain and entered into the Demonic Origin Region.","This was a vast place, and there were even more elites of martial arts here. The Zhou Clan wasn’t the only force with Core Formation Tier elites.","Ling Han kept a very low profile. Two days later, he arrived at a small town.","The members of the Zhou Clan had already fought their way here, and successfully occupied this place. Next, the Zhou Clan would first slow down, and use this as a stronghold to step onto the stage of the Demonic Origin Realm.","Ling Han first went to gather information about the Demonic Origin Realm. Where was it possible that a celestial light would appear?","The dissemination of information here was quite fast. A force would release a book on important current events every three days, describing the major events that had happened recently.","Ling Han bought a book, and flipped through it. He discovered that recently, a great many outsiders had entered into the Demonic Origin Realm. Of course, they did not just pass through the Heavenly Clouds Mountains, but also border areas like this.","Sure enough, the Heavenly Clouds Mountain wasn’t the only entrance.","Ling Han looked carefully again, searching for any traces of the celestial light.","Yi, there really was.","The mysterious Black Heaven Temple appeared once more, and according to legends, there was a blazing light of death in the temple. Any living creature that approached would be turned into a dried corpse.","What kind of place was the Black Heaven Temple?","Ling Han rummaged through the information again. He had really found it. This Black Heaven Temple had always belonged to the category of legends. Everyone thought that it was a fabrication, because no one in history had ever seen it before. It was said that it represented death, but there was also a Black Divine Willow that would bear a Divine Tree Heart. If one ate it, it could extend one’s lifespan by a hundred years.","A hundred years of lifespan was completely negligible to outsiders.","Because Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators theoretically possessed a lifespan of as long as two thousand years, extending their lifespan by a hundred years only increased it by five percent. Moreover, those who entered this space were mostly young people, so they were far from worrying about their lifespans running out. Thus, being able to extend their lifespan by a hundred years was naturally a good thing, but it wasn’t so urgent that they would risk their lives for it.","However, for natives, extending their lifespan by a hundred years was enough to drive anyone crazy.","That was because everyone here only had a lifespan of about a hundred years. If they could eat the Divine Tree Heart, it was equivalent to being able to live another life. Who would not be tempted?","“Extending one’s lifespan by a hundred years isn’t important to me. What’s important is the light of death. Is it some kind of celestial light?” Ling Han murmured to himself. “However, when I go to the Black Heaven Temple, I’ll definitely encounter the natives here. Extending one’s lifespan by a hundred years is too important to them. There’ll definitely be a huge battle.”","There was no shortage of elites of the Core Formation Tier here. Though Ling Han had forced the Core Formation Tier elites of the Zhou Clan to the points that they could only watch helplessly, that was a special circumstance.","“If I reach the Nine Cauldrons, who knows, I might be able to fight an early stage Core Formation Tier cultivator, but I definitely won’t be able to now.”","“Even so, I have to make this trip.”","The celestial light was too important. After refining them, it could form divine light, and their might was comparable to an Imperial Technique. This definitely could not be missed.","“The Black Heaven Temple is... over 350 km north of here.” Ling Han continued to look through the information, “That place was originally a swamp, but four days ago, a completely black temple appeared. There was a black-colored light shining, and then someone discovered a large black temple.”","“This is very similar to the legendary Black Heaven Temple, so it caused a commotion.”","Ling Han set out in a flash, heading towards the Black Heaven Temple. He was sure that whether it was the local cultivators or outsider adventurers, the number of people going would be considerably shocking. Thus, he had to hurry. Furthermore, a great battle was definitely inevitable.","After only half an hour, Ling Han arrived at the swamp. However, the following journey was extremely difficult.","Because there would occasionally be terrifying winds blowing over the swamp, possessing boundless destructive power, even those in the Core Formation Tier could only be easily torn apart. Thus, even if Ling Han could fly on his Tool, he could only travel on foot here. However, the ground was not necessarily safe either, because there were fierce beasts hidden in the swamp. Occasionally, they would break through the mud and rush out to attack.","Ling Han had not yet entered into the swamp, when he saw a ship sailing over. This ship was not driven in the swamp, but had rather sailed over from behind. It was not a warship, but was rather sailing on the ground. Strangely, this ship should have been astonishingly heavy, but as it made its way here, there was not the slightest trace left behind.","The ship was nine meters tall, and at this moment, there were two young people standing at the bow of the ship. They were both men. After discovering Ling Han, they pointed in Ling Han’s direction, and saw that the large ship had actually changed direction, crashing towards","Ling Han.","F***.","Ling Han was astonished. ‘There’s no animosity between us, so what’s the meaning of this?’ He had seen a considerable number of profligate young masters, and quite a few of them had been tyrannical and domineering, but he had never encountered one as deranged as this.","He was not the type to be willing to take a loss. Immediately, he raised his fist and threw a","punch.","“How dare you!” A furious roar rang out from the ship, and a figure leaped out of the ship. With a sweep of his palm, the force of Ling Han’s punch was instantly dispersed. That person did not stop because of this. Instead, he charged towards Ling Han again.","“What a vicious evil brat, die!” That person waved his palm again, and an incredibly deep","palm strike surged over, like a vast ocean.","This was a Core Formation Tier cultivator.","As expected, they were all in the same family. These two despicable young masters were completely condescending. As an elder, he was not afraid to give way at all. He did not even ask about the injustice, and immediately came up to commit murder.","Ling Han used Imminent Skyline, and dodged this palm strike.","After advancing into Seven Cauldrons, his speed increased to another level, and he was","already capable of matching Core Formation Tier.","“Yi, what a fast movement technique!” That person appeared slightly surprised. He had never imagined that a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator would actually be able to burst out with such speed, but this naturally could not possibly scare him off.","“However, if you want to escape from me, Tong Yongning, you’re dreaming!”","That person was a tall and sturdy man who looked to be in his early forties. His face was","rough, and his eyes were like copper bells, exuding a strong murderous aura.","He set off in quick pursuit of Ling Han.","Ling Han humphed. Did they really think that he was an easy target to bully?","He pointed at the large ship, and instantly, the power of lightning was activated. Zi, a bolt of","lightning shot out at an indescribable speed."]},{"number":3891,"title":"Chapter 3891: Counterattack of a minor character","paragraphs":["Chapter 3891: Counterattack of a minor character","This bolt of lightning was so fast that even Tong Yongning couldn’t stop it in time.","Zi, lightning flashed past, and struck the hull. Suddenly, a shield of light appeared on the hull, blocking this attack.","Though it did not cause any substantial damage, Tong Yongning and the two young men on the ship were both given a scare. This guy was really too tough, wasn’t he? He was being hunted down by an elite of the Core Formation Tier, and actually thought of counterattacking. In fact, he even managed to counterattack successfully.","If it wasn’t for the fact that their ship had a defensive formation, would they have directly exploded after sustaining such a blow?","“Junior, how dare you!” Tong Yongning was furious. Under his pursuit, Ling Han actually still had the spare energy to counterattack. Just how much was he looking down on him?","This was intolerable!","He pounced towards Ling Han again, wanting to catch up to this brat and blast him into smithereens.","However, Ling Han was no slower than him when he unleashed his Imminent Skyline, causing his hopes of killing Ling Han to fail time and time again.","Ling Han remained calm and collected, continuing to attack the ship as he dodged.","He didn’t believe that an Imperial Technique wouldn’t be able to break through the shield. -With his present cultivation level, if he activated the Imperial Technique, its destructive power would definitely be comparable to the early stage of Core Formation Tier.","If one attack couldn’t break through, then he would use two. If two didn’t work, then he would use three. Under the endless barrage of attacks, there would eventually come a moment when it would be destroyed.","Zi, zi, zi, the light of lightning blazed, dazzling to the eyes.","More and more people appeared on the ship. This large ship had been attacked, and they thought that it had crashed into some powerful force, but when they came out, their","opponent was actually just a mere Cauldron Forging Tier.","At the beginning, everyone was disdainful, but they soon discovered that Tong Yongning actually couldn’t do anything to this Cauldron Forging Tier.","This was practically a joke.","Furthermore, under the continuous attacks of this Cauldron Forging Tier, the defensive energy of the ship was declining. If this continued, its defenses would really be penetrated by the latter.","This was inconceivable. That was Tong Yongning, one of the three great elites of the Tong Clan, a middle stage Core Formation Tier, and he had actually been unable to take down a mere Cauldron Forging Tier for so long.","“This brat is strange.”","“Second, you help Third.”","“All right.”","Immediately, another person leaped down from the ship. However, this person was slightly older than Tong Yongning, and should be over fifty years old. However, he was energetic, and had an absolutely powerful aura that would make one shiver.","His name was Tong Shuhua, and he was also a cultivator of the Core Formation Tier. He was slightly more powerful than Tong Yongning, but he was also in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier.","Seeing Tong Shuhua leap down, Tong Yongning felt embarrassed, and said, “Second Brother, I can deal with him!”","“Humph, a mere ant dares to provoke our Tong Clan, what need is there for rules?” Tong Shuhua said coldly, “Furthermore, our time is limited, and we cannot waste it on him.”","Hearing his words, Tong Yongning did not object further.","Tong Shuhua charged out. By now, it had become two great Core Formation Tier cultivators joining forces against a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator.","Under normal circumstances, this wouldn’t be realistic. However, Ling Han didn’t face the two members of the Tong Clan head-on at all. He simply circled around with the Imminent Skyline and then launched a sneak attack at the ship.","However, how could the two great Core Formation Tier elites be to be trifled with? Under their combined attacks, Ling Han couldn’t help but be in a perilous situation.","He was like a raft in the sea, and could capsize at any moment. However, he was just a sliver away from capsizing. His ship did not capsize nor did he die. On the other hand, the shield of light on that large ship was already on the verge of collapse.","Was this a fantasy story?","How could Ling Han still have the spare energy to overturn their large ship when he was being ganged up on by two Core Formation Tier elites?","On the ship, everyone looked stunned. Those Cauldron Forging Tiers were even more shocked. If they were asked to exchange blows with Ling Han, then wouldn’t they not be able to survive","a single move, and be directly blasted into smithereens?","This was natural. Ling Han’s seven cauldrons were definitely comparable to the nine cauldrons of a supreme prodigy, and added with an Imperial Technique that could practically be used indefinitely, how could his destructive power not be terrifying?","Just ask the world, what other Cauldron Forging Tier could use Imperial Techniques to attack continuously?","Of course, there was actually an interval between these consecutive attacks, but compared with the Demonic Monkey Fists that could only be fired once every half day, this was practically a chain of attacks. At most, it would only take one minute for the light of lightning to complete the energy accumulation, and then deliver a grand attack.","The last Core Formation Tier cultivator of the Tong Clan, Tong Xiao, could no longer sit still. If this continued, it was really possible that their ship would be blown up by Ling Han.","If that really happened, the Tong Clan would become the laughing stock of the whole world.","Three Core Formation Tier cultivators were standing guard, and a mere Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator had destroyed the ship. In that case, they might as well slit their own necks and commit suicide rather than endure the embarrassment.","Tong Xiao wasn’t at the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, but rather at the late stage of the Core Formation Tier. Once he joined, the pressure on Ling Han was naturally even","greater.","It should be known that he actually did not have the power to oppose Core Formation Tier. He was merely relying on the Imminent Skyline to deal with them. This naturally made his circumstances extremely dangerous. He only had to take one hit, and he would definitely be","done for.","But the more he was under such circumstances, the calmer Ling Han became, and the more rebound there would be.","‘F*ck! I’m standing here, doing nothing! Who did I offend?’","But what about the Tong Clan? They deliberately turned the ship around to crash towards him, and in fact, three Core Formation Tier cultivators jumped out to gang up on him.","Was there any law in this world?","No, this was a world where strength was respected. Thus, elites could do as they pleased.","Since that was the case, he would use his own power to create his own expanse of sky. At the very least, he had to let others know that the weak were not easily bullied, and could also","counterattack.","The fury of even an ordinary man could spill blood in all directions!","Ling Han gritted his teeth. His mind channelled at high speed, and he activated his Eye Technique, taking in all the attacks of the three elites. Then, he analyzed them, finding the weak points within, and made a move to dodge in advance.","He could be killed at any moment, but he was just a sliver away. He continued to jump and flash, and then shot out bolts of lightning that blasted onto the ship.","How could there be such a freak?","He was clearly just a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, so how could he hold on for so long under the combined attacks of three Core Formation Tier cultivators? In fact, he could even","counterattack?","“Beat him to death!”","“This freakish person definitely can’t be allowed to continue living.”","“If he really broke through to the Core Formation Tier, then who would be able to deal with","him?”","On the ship, the members of the Tong Clan all shouted loudly. Not one of them reflected that","it was they who had attacked Ling Han first for no reason. Instead, they felt that Ling Han had terrifying potential, and had to be eliminated now.","Ling Han’s killing intent blazed. He really wanted to use Heavenly Dao Flames to burn all these people to death.","However, if they were allowed to die so easily, that would be letting these people off too","lightly. Pu!","Ling Han was scraped by a gust of wind from Tong Xiao’s fist. It clearly hadn’t hit him, but the","late stage of Core Formation Tier was really too powerful. Just a single strike was enough to make him throw up blood madly.","However, in return for taking the risk, Ling Han shot out another divine light of lightning at","the ship, and finally destroyed the shield.","He roared loudly, and his whole person rushed towards the ship.","Then, he threw a punch.","Demonic Monkey Fists!","He focused all his anger on this punch. Peng, with this strike, a crack actually appeared on the","large ship. However, in the end, it did not break through.","Ling Han threw another punch. This was the second move of the Demonic Monkey Fists."]},{"number":3892,"title":"Chapter 3892: Leaving Calmly","paragraphs":["Chapter 3892: Leaving Calmly","On the ship, everyone was shocked.","Under the pursuit of the three elites of the clan, Ling Han was actually still able to deliver a furious punch, almost blowing up the ship, causing them to break out in a cold sweat.","Thankfully, this guy was only a Cauldron Forging Tier, after all, and had not been able to break the large ship, though he had still managed to create a crack in it.","However, right at this moment, Ling Han’s second punch arrived.","This was the second move of the Demonic Monkey Fists.","If this was channeled alone, its might would not be much different from the first form, but if it was used continuously, it would be completely different.","Its might had doubled.","Peng!","The punch landed, and the entire ship trembled greatly. Then, even more cracks appeared, densely covering the ship.","Boom! In an instant, the entire ship was obliterated.","Members of the Tong Clan flew through the sky, all of them wearing expressions of astonishment and disbelief.","-Under the combined attacks of three Core Formation Tier elites, Ling Han actually still destroyed their vessel?","Behind them, the three Core Formation Tiers of the Tong Clan that were pursuing them were all in a towering rage. This was equivalent to a heavy slap to their faces, causing their expressions to become as cold as water. They were so furious that they wanted to commit murder.","Ling Han exited through the hole of the ship in a flash. He set his eyes on two people.","Those were the vicious young men who had commanded the large ship to crash towards him. The ship had already exploded, so Ling Han naturally had to leave. However, before he left, he still had to collect some more interest.","Peng, he shot out a punch. How could a mere Foundation Building cultivator block it? A young man was instantly blasted into a shower of blood.","However, just as Ling Han was about to kill the other person, Tong Yongning and the others had already caught up to him. They used great power, covering the surrounding air with mystical power, causing this space to become incredibly dense, and movement was extremely difficult.","He couldn’t continue fighting, or he would be in trouble.","Ling Han thought internally. Previously, it was still Tong Yongning and the others that had underestimated him, and had not used moves that would greatly exhaust mystical power, because this was too much of a waste.","However, the hull of the Tong Clan’s ship had been obliterated, and one of their clansmen had also been killed. Under such circumstances, could these three people still hold back?","“I’ll collect some interest first. This person’s head will be left temporarily, and I will eventually pluck it off!” Ling Han said calmly, and charged forwards without even turning his head.","Tong Yongning and the others hurriedly set off in pursuit. By now, all of them had the intention to devour Ling Han.","However, Ling Han flew on his Tool, directly piercing through the skies. So what if they were Core Formation Tier cultivators? They could only watch helplessly.","The cultivators in this world could not fly – unless they were born with wings.","“Ah!” The three Core Formation Tier elites of the Tong Clan were all driven mad, and blasted madly at their surroundings, venting all their fury on the innocent ground.","However, no matter how they attacked, the ground would not be injured.","Where the ship had been, the members of the Tong Clan were still yet to come to their senses. What was going on? They were actually forced to this extent by a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator?","At this time, Tong Yongning and the others also walked back with dark expressions. “Eldest Uncle, Second Uncle, Father, you must protect me!” That profligate young master that had not been killed said in a trembling voice. His name was Tong Bi, and the person who had died previously was his cousin, and also Tong Xiao’s son.","Pa, Tong Yongning immediately slapped him across the face, “It’s all your fault, trash, that caused such trouble.”","Meanwhile, Tong Xiao’s expression was livid, and he said, “Since that brat dares to trifle with our Tong Clan, he should be prepared to be smashed into pieces.”","“Big Brother, what do we do now?”","“The others return to the clan, and the three of us will go to the Black Heaven Temple. We must seize that supreme opportunity.”","“All right!”","...","Ling Han flew on his Tool. After circling around, he descended and entered from the other side of the swamp.","Pop, pop, pop! Black bubbles continuously bubbled in the swamp, and every time the bubbles burst, they would emit a foul stench that would make one want to vomit.","But it was in this kind of environment that there were actually living beings.","Ling Han had not walked too far, when his heart suddenly throbbed. Then, he saw the water in front of him split open, and saw a figure leap out of the water. However, upon a closer look, though his upper body was human, his lower body was a fish tail.","A mermaid?","This was Ling Han’s first reaction, but he immediately shook his head. In such a smelly swamp, would there be mermaids?","Just as his thoughts were flying wildly, that creature had already launched an attack at Ling Han. It opened its mouth and spat out a black pillar of water, which was extraordinarily","smelly.","Ling Han smiled faintly, stretched out his hand, and hong, stimulated the Heavenly Dao Flames. The water pillars that hit him were immediately evaporated, but it was not completely vaporized. Instead, there was a black-colored smoke wafting.","From this, it could be seen how dirty this pillar of water was.","It was actually spat out from his mouth?","Ling Han felt disgusted just thinking about it, and this “mermaid”‘s appearance was even more disgusting. Its head was bald, and there were signs of decay everywhere. More than half of the fish scales on its lower body had fallen off, revealing rotten flesh.","This wasn’t a mermaid, but rather a zombie fish.","Die!","Ling Han unleashed a palm strike, and the Heavenly Dao Flames instantly engulfed the corpse fish and incinerated it.","In the process of burning, Ling Han smelt an extraordinarily stinky smell, and there was not the slightest fragrance of meat.","He swore that as long as it was something from this swamp, he would not eat it, even if it was","Celestial medicine.","Ling Han continued to advance. He hadn’t expected that there would be so many rotten creatures here. There were five-legged crocodiles, toads with their stomachs turned upside down, and lizards with only half their bodies left. In short, there was nothing complete here.","These living beings should all be fierce beasts, and had no intelligence at all. They were only instinctively attacking the intruders, wanting to devour them.","Thankfully, there weren’t any powerful vicious beasts here, or Ling Han was lucky enough not to encounter them. Two days later, a stretch of darkness appeared in front of Ling Han.","This was like a cloud, but very low.","He headed in this direction, and after walking for half a day, he saw that there was a massive","black temple beneath this black cloud.","Black Heaven Temple!","Ling Han looked from afar. Occasionally, a streak of black light would soar into the sky from this temple, entering into the clouds. It was as if it was this black light that had condensed into the black clouds. From afar, it looked like a demon’s den.","Temples were not the “specialty” of the Buddhist Race. In truth, any larger force would have a","temple to worship their ancestors.","However, no matter how he looked at it, this black temple exuded a feeling of evil. It did not seem like it was a place for offering sacrifices to ancestors, but had instead suppressed countless demons. Now, it could no longer be suppressed, so its evil aura soared sky-high.","Xiu, another streak of black light shot into the skies.","Was that celestial light?","Ling Han thought internally. Merely this suspicion made him decide to take a risk.","He continued onwards, and soon arrived in front of the black temple.","This was not the main doors of the black temple, but rather a wall. It was slightly mottled,","and looked to be extremely old.","The wall wasn’t tall, and Ling Han wanted to climb over it. However, he had just leaped up,","when he saw multiple black seals appear on the wall, causing his heart to feel cold. He hurriedly turned around and retreated continuously.","He had a feeling that this seal was incredibly terrifying, and could easily kill him."]},{"number":3893,"title":"Chapter 3893: Subduing Dragons and Subduing Tigers","paragraphs":["Chapter 3893: Subduing Dragons and Subduing Tigers","He couldn’t barge in by force.","Ling Han immediately came to a conclusion. Now, he could only circle around to the main doors.","The black temple was huge, so it took Ling Han almost half an hour to finally arrive at the main doors.","There were two stone statues standing guard at the entrance, and each stone statue looked ferocious. One had a dragon in his hand, while the other had a tiger between his legs.","Subduing Dragons Arhat, Subduing Tigers Arhat?","Aside from these two stone statues, there were also some people watching from the entrance. What was there to watch about the stone statues?","Ling Han was still mumbling, when he saw someone walk out, heading towards the main doors.","After taking a few steps, he saw the stone statue subduing a tiger suddenly come back to life. The ferocious tiger that it had been suppressing charged out, pouncing towards that person.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two sides immediately broke out into a fierce battle. This fierce tiger was shockingly a Cauldron Forging Tier fierce beast, and its battle prowess definitely surpassed Four Cauldrons. As it pounced and bit, it gave that person a huge headache.","The battle had only lasted for a dozen over moves, and with a sweep of the tiger’s tail, its whip-like tail lashed out. Pa, that person was sent flying, throwing up blood continuously.","The ferocious tiger didn’t follow up on its attack. Instead, it returned to where the Subduing Tigers Stone Statue was, transforming back into a stone statue.","No wonder there were so many people watching. As it turned out, no one had the ability to","enter.","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han turned around, only to see three people rapidly approaching from the distance. Who else could it be but the Tong Clan’s three Core Formation Tiers!?","Dodge for a while?","This thought flashed through his mind, and Ling Han immediately rejected it.","No, what if one of the three members of the Tong Clan stayed at the entrance to ambush him? Then wouldn’t he be unable to enter the temple?","He had seen the three members of the Tong Clan, so how could the three members of the Tong Clan not have noticed him?","Thus, Ling Han didn’t hesitate at all as he immediately charged toward the door.","He wanted to enter the temple first.","Immediately, the ferocious tiger from the Subduing Tigers Statue came back to life, and pounced towards Ling Han.","Peng!","Ling Han shot out a punch, and that fierce tiger was instantly sent flying. It was completely unable to block the might of his attack.","Pu!","Everyone spluttered in astonishment. This battle prowess was far too terrifying!","After the ferocious tiger, there were no more obstructions. Ling Han’s figure flashed, and he had already entered into the temple.","Meanwhile, the three members of the Tong Clan also arrived, wanting to pursue and enter. However, the Subduing Dragon Statue also immediately awakened. Not only did the dragon charge out, but even the golem strode out and delivered a palm strike.","‘F*ck! True Self Tier!’","The three members of the Tong Clan were astounded, and hurriedly retreated.","Thankfully, the stone statue didn’t follow up on its victory. The dragon and golem both returned, and then turned back into the Subduing Dragon Statue.","What the hell was this?","“Seniors, this is only a solo challenge here. The stone tiger corresponds to the Cauldron Forging Tier, and the stone dragon corresponds to the Core Formation Tier, and if there are many people attacking at the same time, it will be the Core Formation Tier or even the True Self Tier golem that would be making a move,” one of them explained, wanting to curry the favour of the three members of the Tong Clan.","The three members of the Tong Clan had gotten their answer, yet were completely disdainful of that person. A mere Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator wanted them to have a higher opinion of him?","“I’ll go first,” Tong Xiao said.","“Yes.” Tong Yongning and Tong Shuhua both nodded.","Tong Xiao stepped forward. True enough, only the stone dragon had awakened, and was charging towards him.","However, the battle prowess of this stone dragon was unexpectedly powerful. Tong Xiao was completely outmatched. In just over twenty moves, he had already fled back in a sorry state. There were a considerable number of places on his body that had been wounded.","The three members of the Tong Clan all wore dark expressions.","Ling Han had passed with a single strike, but even with Tong Xiao going all out, he had just barely managed to escape. Just what kind of gap was there between them?","It could not be denied that at the same cultivation level, that despicable brat’s strength was strong to the extreme.","What should they do?","They had come with great ambitions, yet were not even able to enter through the main doors. What was the point of doing this then?","“We can only wait for more Core Formation Tier elites to arrive, and work together to defeat that golem.” The three of them exchanged looks, and came to a conclusion.","...","The moment Ling Han entered the temple, he immediately discovered that the sky had darkened.","There were dark clouds enshrouding the sky, and it was indeed very dark outside. However, it was definitely not as dark as this. That was not the darkness from absence of light, but rather the darkness originating from an Intent Realm, with a bone-chilling coldness.","In fact, Ling Han could even see multiple black shadows floating in the air, as if they were vengeful ghosts.","“An!” he immediately shouted loudly. The Buddhist Race’s Six Characters Bright King Curse was specifically used to subdue evil beasts.","With this shout, his whole person was glowing, as if he was an enlightened monk.","Boom, the word ‘An’ was shouted, and turned into a flash of Buddha’s light, surging forwards. Instantly, the darkness on this path was completely expelled. Even those vengeful ghosts were like snow that had encountered flames, instantly turning into dust. However, after he shouted, endless darkness corroded over again, rapidly engulfing the path of light, and the black shadows in the distance were like a shark that had smelt blood, scrambling to float over.","This was just like how he had initially been a passerby, and no one had paid much attention to him, but all of a sudden, he was shining brightly, and had become incredibly dazzling. The Buddhist Race’s Six Characters Bright King Curse could overcome evil beasts, but on the other hand, for evil beasts, this was also extremely aggravating.","Water could extinguish fire, but if they encountered Incinerating Heaven Raging Flames,","what could they do even if they emptied all the water in the river?","Ling Han didn’t use the Six Characters Bright King Curse anymore. Instead, he threw a punch.","He wanted to see how powerful these black shadow figures were.","However, when he shot out a punch, those black shadows were completely unscathed.","Instead, they pounced towards him.","Ling Han channeled the Heavenly Dao Flames again, and the effects immediately changed.","Originally, these black shadows didn’t seem to have a physical body, so no matter how strong your power was, it was useless when you threw a punch. Now, however, it was as if a portion of their physical body had been exposed, and they could be hit.","Peng! His powerful strength exploded, and he threw a punch. Instantly, a few black shadows twisted, and he tore them apart.","However, there were astonishingly many black shadows. So what if a few of them were shattered? Even more black shadows were still pouncing over.","F***, Ling Han hurriedly turned around. A great number of ants could bite an elephant to death. He had no wish to be surrounded by these things.","Thankfully, though this place was enshrouded in darkness, it was not every place that had black shadows. Furthermore, the movement speed of the black shadows was not very fast. After a few steps, he had thrown off the main troops behind him.","Yi, why was this somewhat similar to the Buddhist Race’s Divine Temple on Moonlight","Planet?","Did this have anything to do with the Buddhist Race?","Ling Han saw a tree, but it was not a Bodhi tree. Instead, it was a willow tree. However, unlike","ordinary willow trees, this willow tree was completely black, as if it had been tainted with demonic power.","He looked closely, and there was actually not a single leaf on this willow tree that was the","same.","Interesting.","However, though this willow tree was filled with vitality, it was definitely not the Celestial Tree that could nurture a Divine Tree Heart that could greatly increase one’s lifespan.","True, if this was really that Black Divine Willow, would he be the only one here? Ling Han refused to believe that no one had been able to enter before.","He continued to advance. This Black Heaven Temple was astonishingly huge, and it was","possible that there was other spaces. This could accommodate tens of thousands of people.","Yi, wasn’t it said that there was a blazing light of death here, that a mere touch would cause living beings to immediately lose their vitality?","Ling Han guessed that it was celestial light. Previously, the light of lightning was also extremely frightening before it was absorbed, and could kill even a Core Formation Tier. And","the Demonic Origin Realm was only at the level of Core Formation Tier and the True Self Tier,","and that was why the legend of the light of death was left behind.","The problem was, where was that light?"]},{"number":3894,"title":"Chapter 3894: Oil lamp","paragraphs":["Chapter 3894: Oil lamp","Ling Han continued to advance. Where were the people here? Why couldn’t he see a single one?","Ahead of him, a great hall appeared.","There was a fierce stone statue in front of the palace, its eyes wide with anger. One of its hands was raised high, and the other was lowered. Even if it was only a stone statue, one could still see the flames of fury that were gushing out, as if it wanted to smack someone to death.","Would it come back to life?","Ling Han strode forward, already prepared to make a move.","Sure enough, the stone statue immediately came to life. Weng! Its divine sense rippled out, sweeping toward Ling Han.","This was extremely terrifying. Ling Han was certain that for anyone under Four Cauldrons, his mind would definitely immediately shatter, and even if it was Four Cauldrons or Five Cauldrons, his mind would still be shaken, and he would have a splitting headache.","However, he had seven cauldrons, and they were the cauldrons of the Primitive Celestial Gate.","Weng, his Celestial Cauldron also trembled slightly, greeting this divine sense.","The two collided, creating a terrifying shockwave that was visible to the naked eye.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and charged towards the stone statue.","Peng!","He threw a punch, and the stone statue slammed down with its palm. A shockwave instantly surged into the surroundings, with the two of them at the center.","Ling Han stumbled slightly, but the stone statue wasn’t much better. Rings of ripples flickered on its body.","“Haha, again!” Ling Han laughed loudly. He had never encountered a decent opponent in Cauldron Forging Tier. Even those as strong as Lu Qi and Liu Chuang were no match for him at this moment.","He charged forwards, his fist wrapped with the Heavenly Dao Flames, increasing its destructive power.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","He exchanged a fierce blow with the stone statue, and he felt like his bones would tremble and groan with each clash. However, his fighting spirit was also becoming more and more intense. This kind of opponent would allow him to unleash his full power. This was far too satisfying. Let’s try out the Wind God Kick.","Ling Han’s legs danced rapidly. Pa, pa, pa! He delivered a series of kicks, and every gust of wind created by his kicks was incredibly fierce, especially when it was wrapped with the Heavenly Dao Flames. If it was any ordinary Seven Cauldrons, he would probably be kicked to death with a single kick.","Even as powerful as the stone statue was, it could only parry. It raised its right hand in front of it, blocking Ling Han’s kicks.","Ling Han kicked sixteen times in a row, and cracks appeared on the right arm of the stone statue. Then, they gradually widened, and covered the entire right arm. With a pa, this arm instantly exploded, turning into countless small rocks.","If it were an ordinary person, they would definitely be severely wounded. Perhaps they would abandon the battle and flee, but how could the stone statue possibly abandon the battle?","It opened its mouth, and shouted loudly, “Appear!”","Weng, this was not a sound, but rather divine sense. It turned into the word ‘appear’, and appeared in Ling Han’s mind, exuding a terrifying might, wanting to shake even Ling Han’s mind.","This was... the Nine Figures of Truth!","It was common knowledge that the Buddhist Race possessed two ultimate techniques. One was the Six Characters Bright King Curse, which could chase away evil beasts and enlighten one’s mind. The other was the Nine Figures of Truth, which was used to subdue and slaughter demons, possessing extremely terrifying destructive power.","The Nine Figures of Truth were Appear, Soldier, Fight, All, Formation, Column, Present, and Formation respectively.","Like the Six Characters Bright King Curse, it was known to all, but no one could unleash its true might, because this needed the secret technique unique to the Buddhist Race to activate.","Otherwise, these six characters and nine figures would be just like the normal ‘you’, ‘me’ and ‘he’, ordinary and conventional.","The problem was, one of the stone statues in the Black Heaven Temple actually roared out the Nine Figures of Truth, its might terrifying.","Boom, all of a sudden, a howl rang out in Ling Han’s mind. The Appear figure exuded a terrifying might, wanting to blast his mind into pieces.","“Humph!” Ling Han was calm and unhurried. The Celestial Cauldron trembled slightly, and the ancient aura circulated, resisting the Appear figure.","Peng! He counterattacked with all his might, and countless cracks instantly appeared on the Appear figure before it shattered.","It was not that the Imperial Technique could not even withstand a single blow. If it was another person, his mind would probably have exploded long ago, but rather that Ling Han’s Celestial Cauldron was too strong, and that was why it could stand against an Imperial","Technique.","Moreover, this was only a stone statue, after all. How could he hope to develop the Imperial Technique to the pinnacle?","How could the Nine Figures of Truth that the stone statue had grasped compare to the Buddha Son and Holy Daughter of the Buddha Race?","Ling Han wanted to see how many Nine Figures of Truth the stone statue had mastered. Thus, he only defended and didn’t attack.","However, he was disappointed. The stone statue merely repeated the figure “appear”, and he hadn’t mastered any more of the Nine Truths Figures of Truth.","He attempted to learn secretly, but without the unique cultivation technique of the Buddhist Race, how could he possibly glimpse the true essence?","Sigh.","He shook his head as he unleashed a flurry of kicks with his Wind God Kick. Pa, pa, pa, pa! The stone statue’s head, neck, and chest were all struck by Ling Han’s kicks. Cracks appeared on its body, and when these cracks reached a critical point, pa! The entire stone statue instantly transformed into a pile of rubble.","It was done.","Ling Han felt that it was a pity that he hadn’t been able to obtain the Nine Figures of Truth.","He shook his head, and strode into the main hall.","The great hall was not dark, because there was an oil lamp glowing. However, what surprised Ling Han was that when he was illuminated by this light, he actually felt as if his physique","was improving in all aspects.","How was this possible?","What kind of light was this? It was actually comparable to a Celestial medicine, and it definitely had to be a Six or Seven Stars Great Herb at that.","There was only a single lamp in the entire great hall, but it was precisely this lamp that allowed this great hall to be spared from the invasion of darkness.","Ling Han walked towards the oil lamp, but after a few steps, he was shocked, because the","pressure was too great.","That did not seem to be a lamp, but rather an incomparably powerful existence, whose might","was incredibly terrifying.","Ling Han had no choice but to stop. Then, he activated his eye technique and looked at the oil","lamp.","Hiss, what had he seen?","Planets crumbled, and rivers of blood flowed.","How could a mere lamp cause such a terrifying scene to appear in his mind?","Unfortunately, he couldn’t get close. Otherwise, if he could take this oil lamp, it would definitely be incredible.","Ling Han sighed, and decided to search again to see if there were any other treasures.","However, he had not even begun his search, when he immediately turned around, and saw two people walk in together at the main doors. They were a man and a woman respectively.","The man looked to be about twenty-three or twenty-four years old. He was tall and slender, and was extremely handsome. He also had an air of arrogance about him. That was an expression of incomparable confidence.","And the woman looked slightly younger. She was twenty years old, and was dressed in snow-","white monk robes. There was not the slightest bit of adornment on her, and she was","extremely plain.","However, anyone who looked at her would think that no ornament was worthy of her.","She was too beautiful, exquisitely beautiful, as if she did not belong to this world.","“Yi, I never thought that there would be another person here!” The man was slightly","surprised.","Meanwhile, the woman didn’t pay any attention to Ling Han. Instead, her eyes swept over the surroundings, and turned to look at the lamp.","This could improve one’s physique, and top-notch prodigies could naturally see this with a","single glance.","“Celestial maiden, I’ll help you retrieve the lamp,” the man immediately said, judging her expression. He then glanced at Ling Han, and said, “You, go and bring that lamp over.”","Heh, if I could bring it over, would it be your turn to spout nonsense here?","Ling Han completely ignored him. Since he couldn’t take out the light, he could only enjoy the","benefits brought by the light.","And in this great hall, aside from the oil lamp, was there any other treasure?","“What an arrogant brat!” the man said coldly."]},{"number":3895,"title":"Chapter 3895: Saint’s Corpse Oil?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3895: Saint’s Corpse Oil?","This man was called Kang Xinghai, and he had a powerful background. He was ranked thirtieth on the Cauldron Forging Tier Leaderboard of the Galaxy Network. In the North Heavenly Realm, he could definitely squeeze into the top ten.","Such a prodigy naturally could be arrogant, haughty, and condescending.","It should be known that with just a casual word from him, how many people would be willing to fight tooth and nail to do his bidding?","With such a prodigy, it was a sure bet that he would become a Venerate Tier elite in the future. In fact, it was even possible that he would become a Saint.","But now? He had already told Ling Han to retrieve the oil lamp, yet Ling Han only acted as if he had not heard anything, so how could he not be furious? More importantly, the goddess he was courting was just beside him, so how could he swallow this anger?","“Very good. You even dare to look down on me, Kang Xinghai. You are really bold!” he stated calmly, but his fury was already soaring.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh, “There’s really something wrong with you. Don’t you have any arms or legs yourself? Even if you don’t have any arms or legs, you still have to be polite when asking for help. What is it? Do you think everyone owes you something?”","Kang Xinghai was instantly enraged. Who would dare speak to him in this manner? They were really courting death!","“Humph, looks like your eyes have grown for nothing!” he said coldly, his killing intent already on full display.","“Brother Kang and this brother!” The woman in monk robes spoke up, her voice slow and unhurried, having an indescribable charm to it, as if it was the voice of Dao and the voice of Buddha. “We are all prodigies of the Human Race, so please work together, and don’t cause internal strife.”","Ling Han instantly felt a sense of calm, as if the disputes in the world no longer had anything to do with him.","His heart clenched. Was this some kind of cultivation technique that could actually affect his mind?","Yi!","He felt a sense of familiarity, and felt that this was similar to the Six Characters Bright King Curse.","Could it be that this woman came from the Buddhist Race?","Kang Xinghai’s killing intent immediately dissipated. He smiled slightly, “Since Celestial maiden has said so, I have no objections.”","Impressive, such heavy killing intent could be immediately dispersed. It had to be said that the Buddhist Race had a terrifying ability to affect the hearts of people. No wonder the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire resisted the Buddhist Race’s teachings so much; that was indeed too dangerous.","Ling Han looked at the woman in monk robes, and asked calmly, “May I ask how should I address you, Miss?”","“How dare you!” Kang Xinghai immediately rebuked.","Yet the woman in monk robes was completely calm, and said, “My religious name is Prosperous Heaven.”","Religious name?","She was indeed a successor of the Buddhist Race.","“Celestial maiden Prosperous Heaven is the Buddhist Race’s Holy Daughter!” Kang Xinghai introduced, “And she’s a celestial beauty ranked tenth on the Exquisite Beauty Leaderboard.”","This woman was indeed beautiful, not inferior to Song Lan in any way.","However, could the Holy Daughter of the Buddhist Race marry?","Prosperous Heaven recited a Buddhist proclamation, “Monks don’t get involved in the mortal world. The so-called Exquisite Leaderboard is just a joke.”","Ling Han’s eyes narrowed slightly. Though this Buddhist Race’s Holy Daughter called herself a monk, she still kept her hair. She said that the Exquisite Leaderboard was a joke, but he didn’t see her protesting on the Galaxy Network, rejecting this ranking.","Hehe, this Buddhist Race’s Holy Daughter was the same as Song Lan. She was definitely not as pure as she looked, and was extremely scheming.","“I am Ling Han.” Ling Han introduced himself first, “May I know what the Holy Daughter knows about this Black Heaven Temple?”","“Nothing at all,” Prosperous Heaven shook her head, “Our Buddhist Race is enlightening all living beings, but the murderous aura here is extremely strong. It is definitely not a peaceful place of our Buddhist Race.”","She pointed at the oil lamp. Her slender hand was like beautiful jade, causing one’s heart to beat wildly, “Just like that oil lamp. If I have not guessed wrongly, that is corpse oil that has been refined from the corpse of a saint.”","F***!","Ling Han couldn’t help but grit his teeth. This was really a hardcore taste, but it was no wonder that the effects of this light were so great. It could actually improve one’s physique.","Those were Saint-level “materials”.","“That’s right. This can improve one’s physique, but Saints are already close to Dao. Absorbing this kind of benefit would inevitably contaminate one’s physique with heaven and earth’s karma, which is not a good thing,” Prosperous Heaven said seriously.","Ling Han nodded in understanding. Saints were far too powerful, and in fact, they were already close to achieving Dao. Yet, they had still been refined into corpse oil. This naturally went against heaven and earth, and absorbing such benefits would naturally lead to them being targeted by heaven and earth as well.","In fact, he would even be treated like a demon. The heaven and earth would descend supreme divine lightning, and directly kill him.","“What kind of place is this? Even a Saint can be killed, adn refined into corpse oil?” Kang Xinghai was slightly distracted. Even for someone as talented as he was, he only had the confidence to charge towards Venerate Tier. To become a Saint? It was too, too difficult. It was not something that could be done just by having enough talent.","But now, the Saint sitting high above the Nine Heavens had been refined into corpse oil. This naturally caused him to lose his composure.","“Celestial maiden, could you have seen wrongly?” he asked.","Prosperous Heaven shook her head, “Buddha saves all sentient beings. I am the most familiar","with this evil beast. I naturally have not seen wrongly.”","She paused for a moment, before continuing, “However, refining the corpse of a Saint into corpse oil doesn’t necessarily require one to possess the ability to kill Saints.”","Indeed, the corpses of Saints could either be killed, or... dug out.","However, did this woman really not have the slightest understanding of the Black Heaven","Temple?","“Let me study it,” Kang Xinghai said, as he walked towards the oil lamp. He spoke nicely, but the greed in his eyes could not be concealed.","This was oil refined from a Saint, so it didn’t matter whether it was corpse oil or not. The","effects were clear for all to see. If he could take away oil that could improve his physique, he would be able to cultivate under the light of an oil lamp every day. Just how much benefits","would that bring?","Perhaps the pinnacle he could reach was not Venerate Tier, but rather Saint Tier.","As for the karma of heaven and earth, as long as he was strong enough, what need was there","for him to care?","However, he had only taken a few steps, when his face immediately turned pale.","The pressure was like a mountain.","He couldn’t take another step, or he would definitely be crushed by the terrifying aura.","This was saintly might, and for Cauldron Forging Tiers like them, there was no solution to it. They were completely no match for it.","Only now did he know why Ling Han hadn’t taken the oil lamp even though he had clearly entered first. It wasn’t that he was stupid, but that it was simply impossible for him to do so.","After figuring this out, he became furious.","‘You clearly know this, so why didn’t you tell me? Are you deliberately watching me make a","fool of myself?’","“Ling Han, I won’t call you to account for your previous rudeness, but you actually tricked me on purpose. Even with Celestial maiden Prosperous Heaven’s words, I can’t tolerate you!” Kang Xinghai said balefully, turning around to press down on Ling Han.","Hu, right at this moment, a cold wind blew past. The light and darkness of the oil lamp changed for a while, before it was suddenly extinguished.","Instantly, a powerful chill rose up from the bottom of Ling Han’s heart. He hurriedly broke","into a run and fled outside.","Prosperous Heaven’s reaction was even faster. When Ling Han leaped out of the great hall, he saw that the latter was actually a step faster than him. Only Kang Xinghai, that idiot, was too proud, and was even less willing to appear cowardly in front of a beauty. He actually did not","flee at the first instant.","Ling Han looked towards Prosperous Heaven, and couldn’t help but inhale sharply. That was because there was a shocking ring of finger marks on the other’s jade-like neck, as if someone was strangling her; it was black and blue.","Seeing Ling Han stare fixedly at her neck, Prosperous Heaven couldn’t help but reveal a hint of","anger.","Even monks didn’t like being stared at like this."]},{"number":3896,"title":"Chapter 3896: Evil Intent","paragraphs":["Chapter 3896: Evil Intent","“Don’t misunderstand.” Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, “Look at your own neck first.”","Prosperous Heaven condensed an ice mirror, and as her eyes swept over it, her pretty face couldn’t help but pale.","This marks must have come from someone strangling her, but she was completely unaware of it, which naturally made her feel shocked.","Ling Han was also apprehensive. This woman was the Holy Daughter of the Buddhist Race, and her abilities were definitely out of the ordinary. In fact, she had even grasped the complete Six Characters Bright King Curse, yet she had actually been silently strangled by a “ghost”. This was too inconceivable.","He turned around and looked towards the great hall, wanting to know how Kang Xinghai was doing.","He was naturally not worried, but merely curious.","“On your back!” Prosperous Heaven suddenly exclaimed, her tone carrying a chill.","Could it be?","Ling Han released his divine sense, and saw that there was shockingly a palm print on his back. It had torn his clothes into shreds, including his inner armor, and left a jet-black palm print on his back.","Upon a closer look, the length of the fingers was astonishing. It did not look human at all.","F***, was this place really haunted?","Ling Han looked at Prosperous Heaven, and Prosperous Heaven also looked at him, both of them filled with deep wariness.","To be able to cause two great prodigies to be hit while they themselves were completely unaware, just how powerful was the “mastermind” behind all this?","Now, Ling Han wanted even more to know how Kang Xinghai was doing. This guy still hadn’t appeared. If it was really haunted, what would he be like now?","Tap, tap, tap... The sound of footsteps was heard.","At present, Kang Xinghai was the only one in the great hall. Then, the sound of footsteps could be heard, so it must be him.","Both he and Prosperous Heaven took a few steps back. This was a kind of vigilance against the unknown.","Not long after, a figure walked out of the great hall.","It was Kang Xinghai.","Hiss!","Ling Han and Prosperous Heaven both inhaled sharply. Kang Xinghai had initially been filled with vigor and vitality. Now, however, it was as if he had fallen ill and was extremely dispirited.","Furthermore, his face was covered with palm imprints, black and blue.","Looking at his eyes again, there was no focal point at all. They were extremely lifeless, as if he had become a walking corpse.","“I’m going to kill you!” Kang Xinghai looked at Ling Han, and his eyes immediately lit up. Then, he looked back at Prosperous Heaven, and involuntarily, he couldn’t help but reveal a strong longing, “I want you to be my woman!”","Yi, had this guy been bewitched?","Kang Xinghai said that he wanted to kill him. Ling Han didn’t find this strange. Kang Xinghai had already wanted to make a move on him before. However, Kang Xinghai was blatantly saying that he wanted Prosperous Heaven to become his woman, and that wasn’t right.","This was a desire from the depths of his heart. No matter how filthy his thoughts were, it was fine, but could he say it out loud?","But Kang Xinghai actually said it out loud. What else could it be but that he was bewitched? Not only did this guy become dispirited, his vitality dropped drastically, and even his mind had become chaotic?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel a lingering fear. Thankfully, he had ran out earlier. Otherwise, it wouldn’t have just been a palm print on his back, but would have greatly exhausted his vitality, and even caused his mind to become confused.","“Die!”","Kang Xinghai immediately charged out, and attacked Ling Han.","He was the prodigy ranked 30th on the Galaxy Network, so his abilities were indeed extraordinary. As he shot out his attack, multiple seals exploded, and brilliance filled the skies.","However, he had clearly chosen the wrong opponent.","Ling Han shot out a murderous aura. Even if Kang Xinghai was in an extremely chaotic state, his body couldn’t help but tremble, and a look of fear appeared on his face.","At first, Prosperous Heaven wanted to stop him, but when she saw this scene, she couldn’t help but stop abruptly. She turned to look at Ling Han, her beautiful eyes filled with surprise. This kind of intimidating technique was the specialty of the Buddhist Race. As the Buddhist saying goes, enlightening all sentient beings, it was actually influencing others mentally. Ling Han actually could as well. Though the method was slightly different, it had the same effect.","Kang Xinghai was a prodigy among prodigies, after all. After being startled for a moment, he returned to normal, and continued to charge towards Ling Han.","Another strike.","Kang Xinghai faltered for a moment before charging over.","Again, again, again.","Prosperous Heaven couldn’t help but be rendered speechless. Ling Han was practically toying with him, causing Kang Xinghai to ceaselessly pause in his movements. In truth, he only had to grab a single chance, and he would be able to send Kang Xinghai flying.","After playing for quite a while, Ling Han delivered a palm strike, knocking Kang Xinghai onto","the ground.","He examined closely. Kang Xinghai’s life force had been greatly expended, and there was also an incredibly evil intent entrenched in his mind. There was only a fragment, but it was extremely powerful, causing even Ling Han to feel apprehensive.","However, this streak of intent seemed to be in a deep slumber, and did not move at all.","Ling Han was astonished. This intent was only entrenched in Kang Xinghai’s mind, and it wasn’t even actively channeled yet. Yet, Kang Xinghai’s mind had already been affected. If this intent truly awakened, wouldn’t it be able to replace Kang Xinghai?","“Er, Holy Daughter, you are the expert at exorcising evil.” He stepped aside.","Prosperous Heaven walked over, and placed a hand on the top of Kang Xinghai’s head. Scanning it with her divine sense, she couldn’t help but pale, as if she had received a scare.","This woman must be hiding something.","That was because this was clearly a temple of the Buddhist Race. Previously, the stone statue had even in fact used the Nine Figures of Truth, yet she said that it had nothing to do with the Buddhist Race. This was naturally a lie.","And to be able to make a Buddhist Race’s Holy Daughter lie, there must be too much involved.","“Say, Holy Daughter, do you know something?” he asked.","At first, Prosperous Heaven was thinking of something else, but when she heard this, the corners of her mouth involuntarily twitched, and a dark line appeared on her forehead.","Say, Holy Daughter?","She had a name, all right?","“I don’t know what you’re talking about.” She shook her head, then withdrew her hand. She focused slightly, and pressed another finger on Kang Xinghai’s forehead. At the same time,","she shouted, “An!”","Six Characters Bright King Curse!","Ling Han couldn’t help but compare it with what he had learnt, yet discovered that there was a","great difference between the two.","In essence, it was the same. It was similar, but in terms of might, the Six Characters Bright King Curse of Prosperous Heaven was much stronger than him.","Was this the genuine Imperial Technique?","Ling Han nodded internally. How could the Imperial Technique be easily taught?","Thus, in the ancient site of the Buddhist Race on the Moonlight Planet, the Six Characters","Bright King Curse that had been passed down was not only incomplete, but also a castrated version of the Six Characters Bright King Curse. Otherwise, aside from Brother Monkey, who considered brotherhood to be higher than the heavens, who would teach an Imperial","Technique?","Even among the Imperial Clans, only core members could cultivate the true Imperial","Technique.","Ling Han remained calm and collected, carefully comparing the parts of the other party’s Six Characters Bright King Curse, analyzing which parts of the latter’s were superior, and whether","he could learn it secretly.","He had a foundation, and did not start from scratch, so there was a sliver of a chance. “Ma!” Prosperous Heaven called out the second word of the Six Characters Bright King Curse. Obviously, merely the word “An” was not enough to drive away the foreign intent entrenched","in Kang Xinghai’s mind.","“Ne!”","“Pa!”","“Mi!”","“Hong!”","She chanted word by word, and a Buddhist circle actually appeared behind her head. Her whole body was shining with golden light, as if she had transformed into a female","Bodhisattva. However, after the chant of the six words, not only did Kang Xinghai not recover, his eyes","suddenly snapped open. His gaze was extremely terrifying, as if he was an executioner that had slaughtered millions and millions of living beings.","“Ah Han’s heir!” he said balefully."]},{"number":3897,"title":"Chapter 3897: Ancestral Buddha, Ah Han","paragraphs":["Chapter 3897: Ancestral Buddha, Ah Han","“You are Ah Han’s heir!” Kang Xinghai suddenly exclaimed. Then, he stretched out his right hand, and grabbed out at Prosperous Heaven’s neck.","This was unexpected, because he should have been restrained by Ling Han, and could not move at all.","However, the strength of Prosperous Heaven could also be seen at this time. She chanted a Buddhist chant softly, and a golden light shield immediately formed on her body.","Peng!","Kang Xinghai’s palm strike arrived, yet was blocked by the golden shield.","He faltered upon hearing this. It was as if he hadn’t imagined that he would be so weak. There was a look of astonishment on his face.","“Who am I?” It was as if he had suddenly transformed into a philosopher, and asked this eternal question.","Ling Han moved, and delivered a palm strike to his forehead. A powerful force surged out, and peng, Kang Xinghai instantly collapsed, falling directly into a state of unconsciousness.","However, before he closed his eyes, he still swept an eye over Ling Han.","That gaze... was indescribable, as if it could penetrate deep into one’s soul.","F***, it seemed like he had been targeted by some powerful being.","Ling Han sighed. Why did he have to deliver this slap?","“Oh, that’s right, who is Ah Han?” he asked Prosperous Heaven.","At first, Prosperous Heaven did not speak, as if she herself was also in a state of shock. After a while, she said, “The Ancestral Buddha’s religious name is Ah Han.”","Yi, Ah Han was the Ancestral Buddha, the founder of the Buddhist Race, a supreme elite that had become an Ancestral King, invincible for an era.","Hold on, what era was Ancestral Buddha from? And looking at Kang Xinghai’s expression just now, it seemed like he was acquainted with Ancestral Buddha. Then what kind of old monster did he have to be?","“This is clearly a Buddhist temple. Furthermore, the intent in Kang Xinghai recognizes Ancestral Buddha. You must know something!” Ling Han looked towards Prosperous Heaven.","Prosperous Heaven’s expression remained unchanged, and she said calmly, “I indeed don’t know anything.”","“Hey, I say, miss, monks can’t tell lies. Otherwise, if you’re disliked by Buddha, you can only renounce asceticism, marry, and have children,” Ling Han deliberately mocked.","However, the tolerance of this Buddhist Race’s Holy Daughter was clearly far beyond his imagination. She was completely unmoved, and even ignored him completely. Instead, she continued to cast the Six Characters Bright King Curse at Kang Xinghai.","She treated Kang Xinghai like a departed soul that she had to perform religious ceremonies for so he could find peace. Over and over again, and after at least a few dozen times, Kang Xinghai finally opened his eyes weakly, his gaze very blank, “Yi, why am I here? My head hurts!”","He got to his feet and rubbed the back of his head. To his shock, he discovered that there was a large lump on his head.","Who had done this?","Previously, when he was in the great hall, the oil lamp suddenly extinguished, and then a cold wind blew over, causing him to lose consciousness.","It shouldn’t be Ling Han.","He glanced at Ling Han, and there was still some suspicion in his heart. He kept feeling that this kind of style was very similar to Ling Han.","Ling Han couldn’t be bothered to pay him any heed. He did not have the slightest interest in Kang Xinghai. What piqued his curiosity was Prosperous Heaven. This woman definitely had no lack of knowledge about the Black Heaven Temple, but her mouth was too tight, and she was completely unwilling to reveal even the slightest bit.","Yet Prosperous Heaven explained that previously, something strange had happened in the palace, and she and Ling Han had managed to escape in time. Kang Xinghai, on the other hand, had unfortunately fallen victim to it, and was possessed by an evil spirit. Thankfully, she had dispersed it.","“Hiss!” Kang Xinghai gritted his teeth. Only now did he realize that he had lost a great deal of his life force and Source Power. He wanted to cry but had no tears. Though he had absorbed the benefits of the Saint’s oil lamp and improved his physique, he had still expended a great deal of his life force and Source Power. It was still a massive loss.","“No wonder it is rumored that there is a brilliant light flickering in the Black Heaven Temple, that would cause the death of living beings,” Prosperous Heaven said slowly, “Looks like it is precisely this evil spirit.”","Ling Han listened quietly from the sidelines.","Was this just an evil spirit?","That was clearly an old monster that he had met with Ancestral Buddha. He had touched its intent before, and although it was still in a state of slumber, and even though it was only a fragment, it was definitely inconceivably powerful. If it was an evil spirit, it was far from something that Prosperous Heaven could expel.","However, she was brimming with confidence, and this confused Ling Han greatly.","The other party was definitely not that stupid.","Thus, this woman must have grasped some core secret, and that was why she was so","confident.","“Heh, then I’ll take my leave.” Ling Han waved his hand at Prosperous Heaven. This Buddhist Race Holy Daughter was also extremely scheming, and it was possible that she would betray him at any moment. Thus, it would be better for them to part ways.","“You want to flee?” Yet Kang Xinghai was unwilling to give up. Previously, he had wanted to make a move on Ling Han, but a sudden change had taken place, so he had not been able to","make a move.","However, this did not mean that he would let it go.","Ling Han glanced at him, his eyes filled with pity.","-This guy had absolutely no idea that he had already dealt with him just now.","Ling Han turned around and left. With his back facing Prosperous Heaven and Kang Xinghai,","The waved them off.","Kang Xinghai wanted to give chase, but was stopped by Prosperous Heaven.","Ling Han continued to walk around. There were many large halls here, with more than a dozen side by side, and there were hundreds of them.","He took a look. There was an oil lamp in every hall, and its effects were the same. It could improve one’s physique, but it could not be maintained for long. Very soon, it would be extinguished, and then something strange would happen.","Even if Ling Han had reacted at the first instant, he had still suffered a “sneak attack”, and","there were palm imprints on his body.","Once or twice was fine, but once the number of times increased, he discoveredYin Qi in his body, causing even his blood to become cold.","He hurriedly used the Six Characters Bright King Curse and shouted inside his body, expelling","and chasing away evil.","After shouting dozens of times, Ling Han finally felt his body become a little warmer.","What kind of existence was buried in this temple? Refining oil from the corpse of a Saint, and even knowing the Ancestral Buddha from the ancient era? Their background was frighteningly","powerful.","The waters were very deep.","Ling Han felt a sense of urgency. He did not care about the Black Divine Willow. Once he found","the celestial light here, he would flee.","After circling around, he finally discovered others. However, many of them were dispirited, and their faces and hands were covered with dark green palm imprints. Just the sight of them","was harrowing.","Boom!","A great battle broke out in the distance. With a thought from Ling Han, he immediately","rushed over.","At first, he had thought that a celestial light would appear, but he had not thought that it would be five people fighting over a mat.","It was just a mat, so what was there to fight over?","Ling Han activated his eye technique and couldn’t help but feel surprised. This mat wasn’t","ordinary. It looked like it was woven from bamboo, but there were flashes of divine light flickering on it. There were also astonishing seals appearing, as if they corresponded to some kind of true meaning of great dao.","If he could sit on the mat and cultivate, he would definitely be able to help him comprehend","Dao. It would be half the work, but double the effect.","No wonder those five people wanted to fight over it.","Without any reservations, Ling Han also charged out.","“Scram!” In the first place, the five of them were already locked in a fierce battle, and were","just worrying about how they were going to sweep aside all their opponents and take the treasure for themselves. Yet Ling Han still wanted to interfere, so they had to unite to deal with him at the first instant.","Ling Han laughed loudly as he unleashed his murderous aura. Pa, pa, pa, pa! The eyes of the five people instantly rolled back, and they collapsed to the ground, unconscious.","Unless his cultivation level surpassed Ling Han’s, his murderous aura would be able to deal","with everything.","Ling Han easily picked up the mat. The moment he touched it, his mind calmed down, and","multiple flashes of enlightenment arose.","This was indeed a treasure, and was too helpful in comprehending Dao."]},{"number":3898,"title":"Chapter 3898: Meeting Hong Tianbu again","paragraphs":["Chapter 3898: Meeting Hong Tianbu again","“Put down what you’re holding!” A woman’s voice rang out. It wasn’t loud, but it was very proud and clear.","Ling Han turned around, only to see a man and woman standing behind him.","It was clear that the speaker was the woman, but Ling Han didn’t look at her. Instead, he looked at the man in surprise.","F***, this was too coincidental, wasn’t it?","Hong Tianbu!","Ling Han had really not foreseen that he would encounter Hong Tianbu here.","Since the parting at the Holy Land of Metal Element, Hong Tianbu had completely disappeared, and there was no further news of him.","Afterwards, no matter what ancient site opened, or even when the Nine Suns Holy Land opened its doors, Hong Tianbu still didn’t appear, making Ling Han think that this guy had died in some corner of the universe.","After all, there were really too many prodigies that had died halfway in the world. They were not inferior to Hong Tianbu.","But now, Hong Tianbu had actually appeared.","Hong Tianbu naturally saw Ling Han as well, and his eyes involuntarily narrowed, exuding a strong killing intent.","To him, there was a very good reason for him to hate Ling Han.","However, the woman beside him was enraged. What kind of existence was she? Her words were no less than an imperial decree, and Ling Han actually dared to ignore her completely. Furthermore, he did not even cast a second look at such an exquisite beauty like herself, and actually stared at Hong Tianbu. Have you gone blind?","“How dare you!” she shouted coldly.","Hong Tianbu smiled, and said, “Hai Lan, let me introduce you. This is Ling Han.”","“So you’re Ling Han?” The woman showed a hint of arrogance. She crossed her arms over her chest, appearing very disdainful, “Lowly commoner, you actually dare to oppose Tianbu. Kneel down!”","Hehe, what arrogance.","Ling Han looked at Hong Tianbu and said with a smile, “Is there something wrong with this woman?”","“You’re seeking death!” the woman roared.","Xiu, xiu, two figures suddenly appeared, sweeping towards Ling Han.","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han was astounded. These two people were originally outside the wall, and it was only after the woman shouted that they charged out.","Strange. After entering this space, everyone should have been separated, but this woman obviously had two lackeys. In fact, she and Hong Tianbu should have known each other since long ago, so why hadn’t they separated?","Was this heaven-defying luck, or did he have some other trick up his sleeve?","Just as he was pondering, the two of them had already arrived.","They were both men in their thirties, expressionless, but their cultivation level was early stage Core Formation Tier. They shot out a palm strike, and the image of a dragon and tiger blasted out. Symbols circulated, terrifying without bounds.","Ling Han used the Imminent Skyline to dodge. He was extremely surprised. That woman was clearly only a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, so what right did she have to command two Core Formation Tier cultivators?","This could only mean one thing, and that was there was a powerful force behind this woman.","“Hong Tianbu, I don’t remember that you needed women to stand up for you in the past,” Ling Han said with a smile as he mocked him.","However, Hong Tianbu weren’t provoked at all, and they said calmly, “You can’t find a noble daughter like Hai Lan because you’re incompetent, while I’m more fortunate than you.”","These words instantly caused the woman to feel elated, and she smiled sweetly at Hong Tianbu.","F***, being a pretty boy, he still had to be so high-profile, and so self-righteous?","Ling Han’s heart clenched. With Hong Tianbu’s pride, how could he deliberately curry the favour of an ordinary woman?","As if seeing Ling Han’s confusion, Hong Tianxing smiled faintly, and said, “I forgot to introduce you. Hai Lan’s surname is Di.”","Di Hailan.","There was actually someone with the surname of Dio?","A person’s name suddenly flashed through Ling Han’s mind: Di Shitian!","Some Ancestral Kings only left their titles. For example, Ancestral Buddha, Ah Han. Did anyone else know his name before he became Ancestral Buddha? There was also Ancestral King Pan Shi, who had ascended Dao from his beginnings as a rock. Who would know his real name?","However, there were also some Ancestral Kings whose names were unknown, but their surnames were widely known.","For example, the Four Directions Great Emperor. His surname was Chang, and the present Chang Clan was also boundlessly powerful, and was one of the strongest forces in the","universe.","Or... the Wolf Tribe’s Great Emperor, the Demon Emperor, Di Shitian.","This was probably the only clan in the world that dared to take the surname of Di.","It was no wonder that even with Hong Tianbu’s pride, he would put down his airs. As it turned out, this woman was a member of an Imperial Clan, so everything could be explained.","“Heh, you’ve married into the Wolf Tribe?” Ling Han said with a chuckle.","This naturally was also a mockery. Just ask the men of this world, how many of them would be willing to marry into the family of his wife?","Hong Tianbu was extremely shrewd, and he wasn’t angered or shocked at all. He simply gazed at Di Hailan with deep affection.","The meaning could not be clearer. He had not taken a fancy to Di Hailan’s background at all, but merely liked this woman.","F***, what an eyesore.","Ling Han shook his head. Hong Tianbu was truly impressive, playing the role of a pretty boy with deep feelings for his beloved.","“You two trash, it’s been so long, and you still haven’t taken down a mere Cauldron Forging Tier?” Di Hailan rebuked delicately. Her slender brows slanted. The two great elites of Core Formation Tier had joined forces, yet were still unable to take down Ling Han even after so long, which made her feel embarrassed.","“There’s no need to rush,” Hong Tianbu said in comfort. “This Ling Han isn’t so simple. The Imminent Skyline is also an ancient ultimate technique, allowing cultivators to exert speed that surpasses cultivation level. However, the Imminent Skyline places an extremely heavy burden on the body, and the expenditure on mystical power is also extremely shocking. Thus, it’s impossible for him to last long.”","This kind of judgement was very logical, and it could also be seen that Hong Tianbu was very experienced. He did not look like a young man in his twenties at all.","Di Hailan nodded. She liked Hong Tianbu’s confidence as if everything was under his control, which enchanted her and made her withdraw the pride of a member of an Imperial Clan,","willing to become a little woman.","However, Ling Han’s actions didn’t make sense.","He had cultivated the mortal level to perfection, and the toughness of his physique was not inferior to even Wu Qiyuan, who specialized in cultivating his physique. Furthermore, his reserves of mystical power were endless, enough to compare with the level of Sect Master. To wait until he was no match for the burden of Imminent Skyline?","Hehe, this was not something that could be done in a short while.","Ling Han was preparing to counterattack. Being on the back foot had never been his style.","After being unable to capture Ling Han for a long time, even Hong Tianbu’s expression","changed slightly.","Although he hadn’t mastered the Imminent Skyline, he had been the first to obtain this secret technique. Thus, he still had some understanding of it. He knew that channeling this movement technique was extremely taxing on oneself.","Thus, Ling Han was still able to channel the Imminent Skyline even now, which surprised him","and made him unable to understand.","Ling Han suddenly shot out a palm strike. Zi, lightning flashed, and a bolt of lightning","instantly shot towards a Core Formation Tier cultivator.","One of the two Core Formation Tier cultivators had long hair, while the other’s was slightly shorter. The one Ling Han was attacking now was precisely the short-haired one.","Pa!","The short-haired man had not expected that Ling Han would be able to deliver such an attack","either. This was too unexpected. Thus, even he did not manage to dodge, and could only forcefully stretch out a hand to parry the blow before his chest.","The lightning dissipated, and a large area of charred flesh appeared on the short-haired","man’s arm.","Unfortunately, he was still unable to kill him.","Ling Han sighed internally. After all, his opponent was early stage Core Formation Tier. Even","if he blasted out an Imperial Technique, he would just barely be able to reach this kind of might, and in a battle of equal battle prowess, who would be able to insta-kill his opponent in","a single move? However, if he took another step further, and reached Eight Cauldrons?"]},{"number":3899,"title":"Chapter 3899: Final Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 3899: Final Battle","If Ling Han only felt that it was a pity, then Hong Tianbu, Di Hailan, and the others were all stunned.","Under the combined attacks of two Core Formation Tier cultivators, not only did a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator not die, but he even launched a counterattack, wounding one of them!","F***, this was a fantasy story.","Hong Tianbu frowned slightly, revealing a hint of wariness.","After the battle at the Holy Land of Metal Element, he coincidentally met Di Hailan and successfully won her heart. From then on, he stepped into the Imperial Clan, enjoying the resources provided by the Imperial Clan.","In this way, his cultivation level instantly soared, successfully reaching Cauldron Forging Tier.","With his freakish talent, Heaven Cauldron was naturally not the end. By now, he was already at Eight Cauldrons. Even in the Di Clan, he was still quite valued, and was promised the position of a general in the future.","He no longer took Ling Han seriously. The two of them were no longer from the same world. When they had encountered each other just now, he was also calm and composed. He looked down on Ling Han with a lofty attitude, thinking that Ling Han was only able to survive because of the Imminent Skyline, which he had stolen from him.","In terms of mentality, Hong Tianbu felt extremely superior.","But now, Ling Han’s counterattack was absolutely shocking, causing even a Core Formation Tier elite to suffer minor injuries. This was too terrifying.","Hong Tianbu asked himself, could he do it?","No!","He shook his head internally. Even if he was Eight Cauldrons, and had fused with the eye of a Primordial Vicious Beast, he still had no power to fight back against a Core Formation Tier cultivator.","How was this possible?","He had already entered into the Imperial Clan, and could casually browse through all the cultivation techniques and secret techniques below Saint Tier. How could Ling Han possibly have the good fortune that he had?","But why was Ling Han still not the slightest bit inferior to him?","His hands clenched into fists. Previously, his cultivation level had far surpassed Ling Han’s, yet he had still lost to Ling Han in their repeated clashes. Now, he had already entered into the Imperial Clan, and it could be said that his conditions were already extremely good. If he was still unable to suppress Ling Han, what else could he do?","“Good one, brat!” the short-haired Core Formation Tier cultivator exclaimed softly. Though his arm had been charred by the lightning, merely channeling his mystical power was enough to suppress his injuries, and the injury was still continuously improving.","Only after a while, he returned to normal.","A Core Formation Tier elite was a Core Formation Tier elite, after all, and had the advantage of a major tier in cultivation level. The suppression was too obvious.","Ling Han frowned. His ambition was higher than the heavens, and he directly wanted to injure or even kill a Core Formation Tier cultivator. However, reality proved that even if he was caught off guard, he could only slightly wound a Core Formation Tier cultivator. Moreover, it was only one in the early stage at that.","In that case, he could only settle for the next best thing.","Ling Han’s killing intent flickered as he stared at Hong Tianbu.","Hong Tianbu wanted to kill him, and he also wanted to kill Hong Tianbu. This was something that both sides were well aware of.","“Seniors, leave this opponent to me,” Hong Tianbu said loudly.","-Di Hailan could order the Core Formation Tier cultivators around as she liked, but he could not. After all, he was still an outsider, and had to adhere to the necessary etiquette of superiority and inferiority in cultivation.","The two Core Formation Tier cultivators gave him face and stepped back.","“Tianbu!” Di Hailan was slightly worried. This opponent was too freakish. He could even wound a cultivator at the Core Formation Tier. She was worried that Hong Tianbu would be outmatched.","“Believe me!” Hong Tianbu smiled faintly, his pride soaring sky-high.","The present Ling Han was indeed strong, but he was not weak either.","That was because he was Hong Tianbu!","Di Hailan couldn’t help but look dazed, and couldn’t help but nod. She was completely besotted with Hong Tianbu in this kind of temperament.","Hong Tianbu strode out to greet Ling Han.","“Hong Tianbu, long time no see!” Ling Han said calmly. His tone was as if he had seen an old friend that he had not seen for a long time, but his killing intent was incredibly resolute.","This time, he would completely sever this link of karma.","“From today onwards, there will no longer be a person like Ling Han in this world,” Hong Tianbu said, similarly extremely resolute.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Where do you get such confidence from?”","“Because I am Hong Tianbu!”","Shua, Hong Tianbu charged out, his hands spread open, one yin and one yang, as if he was embracing Taiji.","Ling Han merely smiled, and merely shot out a punch, aimed directly for the middle.","Peng!","He shot out a punch, and the Tai Ji immediately shattered. Hong Tianbu gave a muffled humph, and retreated backwards seven steps.","No matter what secret technique you use, I will destroy it with a single punch.","Hong Tianbu frowned slightly. Ling Han’s mystical power was far too profound. Thus, even if they were both at Seven Cauldrons or Eight Cauldrons, the power that he unleashed would be more concentrated and more powerful.","But the problem here was that he had forged a Golden Celestial Cauldron. Furthermore, he had previously obtained a great opportunity, and had used a divine substance to further temper it, and it had evolved into a Tricolor Glass Cauldron.","The quality of the Celestial Cauldron was closely related to the purity of the mystical power. This was because the Celestial Cauldron could filter the mystical power and remove impurities. The higher the level of the Celestial Cauldron, the better the effects of the","mystical power.","Therefore, logically speaking, among those at the same cultivation level, his mystical power should be the most profound. At most, there would only be others that could match him, and there was no way to surpass him.","What grade was the Celestial Cauldron that Ling Han had forged? Could it be five-colored or even seven-colored?","“Tianbu!” Di Hailan was extremely worried. She signaled with her eyes at the two Core Formation Tier cultivators, signaling them to make a move at the first instant when Hong","Tianbu was in danger.","The two of them nodded. Though Di Hailan was not the princess with the highest status in the Di Clan, she was still from the main clan, after all. Furthermore, Hong Tianbu was indeed very favoured, and they were duty-bound to do so.","Only then did Di Hailan feel relieved. She looked at the battle without blinking an eye, her","fingers gripped tightly.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Hong Tianbu immediately launched a counterattack. He was an extremely extraordinary person, and was born with great fortune. Afterward, he entered into the Imperial Clan, and could even freely flip through the precious techniques below Saint-level.","For others, biting off more than one can chew. Rather than learning everything, it would be","better to choose the best.","However, he was different.","Because he had fused with the eye of a Primordial Vicious Beast, ordinary precious techniques could be seen clearly with a single glance. Thus, the number of precious techniques he had grasped was astonishing, and they had all reached the level of proficiency.","They had only exchanged over twenty moves, and Hong Tianbu had already channeled seven","different techniques, one after the other. Each technique was at the pinnacle level. If it was any other opponent, they would have long since been defeated and killed by his myriad of","techniques.","But for Ling Han, he had too many ways to resolve this.","– Merely Starlight Screen was enough to cause Hong Tianbu to blast it for a long time, and he","also had an eye technique. When he activated it, what change of moves would be able to","deceive him?","However, Ling Han was using a precious technique against a precious technique. The Great Overarching Heaven Technique, Wind God Kick, Celestial Crossing Finger. There were some precious techniques that were inferior to Hong Tianbu, but with his powerful strength, he was able to forcefully make up for his shortcomings, while there were some that were far superior, forcing Hong Tianbu to retreat continuously.","However, Ling Han didn’t use the Imperial Technique all this while, nor did he use the divine light of lightning. This was because he knew that if Hong Tianbu encountered a life- threatening danger, the two Core Formation Tier cultivators definitely wouldn’t sit by and","watch.","Thus, he needed a chance to deal a fatal blow.","“Ling Han, you truly astonish me!” Hong Tianbu laughed loudly, and the space between his brows suddenly split apart, revealing an eye.","This was definitely not a human eye, and was filled with a murderous aura. The moment it","opened, it would cause a chill to run down one’s spine, as if one had fallen into an ice cave.","The eye of the Primordial Vicious Beast! Hong Tianbu finally unleashed his trump card."]},{"number":3900,"title":"Chapter 3900: Killed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3900: Killed","Though he had entered into the Imperial Clan, to say nothing of the fact that Hong Tianbu was still the son-in-law of the Imperial Clan, even if it was him that had married into the clan, he may not be able to learn the Imperial Technique.","Imperial Technique was the greatest trump card of an Imperial Clan, aside from the Imperial Weapon. How could it be easily taught to others?","Only a bold, boundlessly heroic person like Brother Monkey would be so generous. On the other hand, Brother Monkey’s Imperial Clan was really quite shabby. He was the only descendant left, and had not formed a powerful force at all.","Otherwise, even if the Battle Saint Emperor had died, how could he have been suppressed by a Venerate Tier-level force for two thousand years?","The Imperial Clan was not to be trifled with!","Thus, Hong Tianbu’s greatest trump card, and strongest ultimate move was still the eye of the Primordial Vicious Beast that he had fused with.","When the eye opened, the murderous aura was boiling, and a death ray shot out. Ling Han’s whole body instantly stiffened, and he couldn’t even move a single finger.","However, Ling Han was neither anxious nor alarmed. A murderous aura shot out, blasting towards Hong Tianbu.","Hong Tianbu couldn’t help but grunt, a pained expression appearing on his face.","This time, it almost caused his mind to explode.","He couldn’t help but feel shocked. Ling Han’s technique seemed to have improved as well. Ling Han trembled slightly, and his body had already regained mobility.","Hong Tianbu frowned. Even the might of the death ray was unable to suppress Ling Han, causing him to completely miscalculate.","As he saw it, this move was time-tested. Even a cultivator of the Core Formation Tier would be frozen by his glare, winning him the chance to escape.","However, Ling Han actually recovered after only a slight pause. His speed was comparable to a Core Formation Tier cultivator, which was unacceptable to him.","He humphed, and the vicious eye opened once more, shooting out death rays.","The speed of this streak of light was so fast that even Ling Han was unable to dodge it. It was like the barrage of murderous aura, which actually belonged to the level of divine sense, and defense also had to be done on the level of divine sense.","Weng!","Ling Han’s Celestial Cauldron shook slightly, and waves appeared in his mind. Ripples surged out, instantly expelling the might of the Vicious Eye.","It would be indecent to not reciprocate.","Ling Han charged forward, unleashing a murderous aura that instantly caused Hong Tianbu to pause for a moment. He then unleashed a deadly attack.","Demonic Monkey Fists!","This was the Imperial Technique, and once it was channelled, a powerful pressure overflowed, causing Di Hailan and the two Core Formation Tier elites to feel their hair stand on end.","They came from the Imperial Clan, and even if they had never learnt the Imperial Technique, how could it be that they had never seen the Imperial Technique before?","What, this guy that was only an ant in their eyes was actually capable of using the Imperial Technique!","How was this some minor character? He was clearly the heir of an Imperial Clan.","“Sh*t!” The two Core Formation Tier elites pounced at the same time. Although Hong Tianbu was strong, he was definitely no match for the Imperial Technique. He would be severely wounded after this attack, so they had to charge out immediately to prevent Ling Han from launching another powerful attack and killing Hong Tianbu.","Hong Tianbu naturally went all out as well. He crossed his arms in front of him, forming a complicated seal that turned into a shield of light.","Peng!","The Demonic Monkey Fists arrived, and how could a mere shield of light withstand it? Instantly, it was shattered into pieces.","However, this also removed a portion of the power of the Demonic Monkey Fists, winning Hong Tianbu a sliver of life.","As long as he wasn’t killed with a single punch, the two Core Formation Tier cultivators would naturally be able to save him.","However, how could it be that Ling Han did not know this?","What was a fatal strike?","Ling Han raised his right hand, and the light of lightning surged out, striking towards Hong Tianbu.","What!","This time, Hong Tianbu’s expression changed drastically, as if he was ashen.","How was this possible? Two Imperial Techniques could actually be cast at the same time; how could there be such a freak in this world?","This was equivalent to the combined attack of two young Great Emperors. Who in the world could block this attack at the same cultivation level?","At least, Hong Tianbu couldn’t compare. No matter how freakish he was, there was no way he could compare to a young Great Emperor.","Zi, the light of lightning struck, and Hong Tianbu was instantly sliced into two.","Ling Han didn’t even turn his head as he unleashed the Imminent Skyline. He left after a single strike, as if he were an assassin.","“Tianbu—” Di Hailan released a wail of grief, and at the same time, there was boundless fury, “Kill him! Kill him!”","The two Core Formation Tier cultivators gave chase. Their faces were also filled with fury. Right in front of them, Ling Han actually blasted Hong Tianbu into two halves. Even if he didn’t die, without the Saintly medicine, Hong Tianbu would definitely be done for in this","lifetime.","But even in the Imperial Clan, Saintly medicine was still incredibly valuable, and needed to be used to extend the lifespan of Saints. How could they be wasted on an outsider like Hong","Tianbu?","Kill, they definitely had to kill this main culprit, or they would not be spared either. However, Ling Han used the Imminent Skyline, and his speed was not the slightest bit inferior to theirs. Furthermore, there were black shadows floating everywhere here, unafraid of the attacks of power, directly attacking the soul, which was very hard to deal with.","Ling Han made use of this special terrain to continuously circle around, and in a few moments, he had thrown off his pursuers.","Hong Tianbu should have died by now, right? He had already been severed into two halves. If","he could still survive this, he would really be too lucky.","Ling Han wasn’t very excited. In his eyes, killing Hong Tianbu was a matter of course, so how could there be any emotional fluctuations?","The great halls here connected to each other, continuous and unbroken.","Ling Han only wanted the celestial light. He leaped onto the top of the palace hall to check on the situation, but he had just set foot on the top of the palace hall, when he was forcefully shaken down by a deep power.","It was as if the great hall was sacred and could not be tarnished.","Ling Han was exasperated, so he could only continue to enter the main hall to investigate.","He finally encountered those who had entered here earlier, blocked at a plaza.","The plaza wasn’t empty. Instead, it was filled with bronze statues that were densely packed together like an army.","Someone barged in, and those bronze statues immediately came back to life. Peng, peng, peng! With three punches and two kicks, they sent that person backwards.","He couldn’t win.","Ling Han also shook his head. He could see clearly that these bronze statues were all in the Core Formation Tier, and their numbers numbered in the tens of thousands. How could they","possibly pass?","He didn’t know if he could sneak over using the Void Beast hide.","Ling Han thought to himself. He took out the beast hide to wrap around himself, and quietly walked over. However, he had just stepped onto the plaza, when his hair stood on end, because the bronze statue closest to him had already awakened, and a palm struck out at him.","F***","Ling Han hurriedly retreated with all his might, but he was still scraped by the force from the palm strike. Instantly, he felt a burning sensation, and an extraordinary pain pierced into his","heart.","What was he supposed to do now?","Boom!","All of a sudden, he felt a powerful fluctuation in the air. This should be the eruption of a great","battle in the distance. He carefully sensed the energy that was seeping out of the air, and couldn’t help but frown. This was a battle between elites of Core Formation Tier, and there were quite a few of them at that. The energy in the air was extremely mixed. Could it be that a large number of Core Formation Tier cultivators were going to charge in? This was good as well. It would be a good opportunity for them to break through the formation.","Ling Han used the hide of the Void Beast to hide himself. As expected, it wasn’t long before a","large group of people charged over, and the Tong Clan’s three Core Formation Tiers were shockingly among them.","These people were all injured. Obviously, though they had defeated the True Self Tier-level Subduing Dragon Stone Statue at the main gate, they had also paid a considerable price. There were at least 200 Core Formation Tier elites. The scale of this was a little frightening, and the people on the plaza all gave in. By now, probably even the descendants of an Imperial Clan would not dare act arrogantly, because even the hands of an Imperial Clan would not be","able to reach here."]}]);
